---
Kālidāsa's Kumārasambhava, with
Vallabhadeva's commentary.
Text based on the edition by M.S. Narayana Murti
Wiesbaden 1980. VŏHD Supplementband 20,1.
---

yasya bhṛṅgāvaliḥ kaṇṭhe srutadānāmbubhūṣitā|
bhāti rudrākṣamāleva sa vaḥ pāyādgaṇādhipaḥ|| 1||

kālidāsoktayaḥ kutra vyākhyātāro vayaṃ kva ca|
tadidaṃ mandadīpena nāṭyaveśmapraveśanam|| 2||

unnatāśrayamāhātmyaṃ syātsvaprakhyātilālasaiḥ|
tathāpi kriyate 'smābhiḥ pañjikā skandasambhave|| 3||

iha hi prekṣāpūrvakāriṇāṃ mahākavīnāṃ kāvyārambhe yathaivābhīṣṭadevatāsaṃstavanamabhyudayanidānaṃ tathaivotkṛṣṭavastusaṃkīrtanamapīti manasi kṛtvā kaviḥ śrīkālidāsa āha---

astyuttarasyāṃ diśi devatātmā himālayo nāma nagādhirājaḥ|
pūrvāparau vārinidhī vigāhya sthitaḥ pṛthivyā iva mānadaṇḍaḥ|| 1||

kauberyāṃ hariti himālayo nāma nagādhirājo mahībhṛnnātho 'sti|
adyāpi vidyate| 
parvatānāṃ sthāvararūpatayaiva prasiddhatvādetāṃ bhrāntiṃ nirasyannāha---devatātmā| 
devatārūpa ātmā yasya jaṅgamarūpasya| 
yaśca prācyapratīcyāvudadhī vigāhyātikramya sthita iti garīyastvoktiḥ|
ataścotprekṣyate---pṛthivyā mānadaṇḍa iva| 
samudradvayavyāptyā hi tenorvī miteva bhavati| mitirmānaṃ tadarthaṃ daṇḍa iti| 
atra ca ivaśabdasya bhinnakramatāṃ niṣedhadbhiḥ prājñaṃmanyairvṛthaiva prayāso vyadhāyi yato 'sau bhinnakramo 'stu mā vā bhūt| 
naitāvatā vastuni kācidapi kṣatiḥ| 
mahākavayo hyupamādivākye yena kenacitpadena ivādīnprayuñjānā dṛśyante| 
yathā
`paurastyastoyadartoḥ pavana iva'
atra hi kvacitprathamāntena
sahevaśabdaḥ prayuktaḥ kvacitṣaṣṭhyantena kvacit
`sandhyānṛttotsavecchoriva'
iti viśeṣaṇapadena iti na kiṃcidarthānyathātvam|
pṛthivyā sahevaśabdasya sambandhe utprekṣā mānadaṇḍenopameti viṣayavibhāgo 'yaṃ nirmūla eveti
sarvathotprekṣaivāyamalaṅkāraḥ| 
na cevaśabdasya bhinnakramatā lakṣaṇavirodhinī yata ivena samāsapakṣe vibhakteralugarthaṃ svarārthaṃ ca na tu nityasamānārtham| 
evaṃ hi bahutaralakṣyadarśanam| yathā `kacācitau viṣvagivāgajau gajau'
iti| `haritapatramayīva marudgaṇaiḥ sragiva naddhamanoramapallavā'
ityādi ca| ityalamatiprasaṅgena| adhirājata ityadhirājaḥ prabhuḥ|
padyādac|
adhiraiśvarye| ṣaṣṭhīsamāsaḥ| yadi vā adhikaścāsau rājā
adhirājaḥ| `rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ ṭac'|
nāmaśabdaḥ pratītidyotako nipātaḥ| na tu saṃjñārthas,
avācakatvāpatteḥ|
sarge 'tra vṛttamupajātiḥ| 
kvacidindravajrā kvacidupendravajrā kvacidākhyānikā kvacidviparītā| 
yataḥ sarvatra prathamākṣaravarjamanyapadacatuṣṭaye 'pi gurulaghusārūpyam| 
tatra yadādye varṇe caturṣvapi padeṣu gururbhavati tadindravajrā|
yathā `āmekhalam' ityādau|
yadā laghustadupendravajrā yathā `vanecarāṇām' ityādau|
tayoḥ saṃyoge caturdaśabhedā upajātayo bhavanti| 
tatra yadā prathamatṛtīyayoḥ padayorādye varṇe gururbhavati dvitīyacaturthayośca laghustadākhyānikā nāma| 
yathāyameva ślokaḥ| etadviparyaye tu viparītākhyānikā| yathā `padaṃ
tuṣārasruti' ityādi|
anyatra pariśiṣṭā dvādaśabhedā upajātayaḥ| yathā
`yaṃ sarvaśailāḥ' ityādi|
evaṃ sūkṣmekṣikāṃ kurvadbhiranyairavādi upajātaya uttaratreti
sarvaṃ samīcīnameva|| 1||

yaṃ sarvaśailāḥ parikalpya vatsaṃ merau sthite dogdhari dohadakṣe|
bhāsvanti ratnāni mahauṣadhīśca pṛthūpadiṣṭāṃ duduhurdharitrīm|| 2||

yaṃ himavantaṃ vatsaṃ parikalpya  mandarādayo nikhilādrayo dharitrīṃ ratnāni mahauṣadhīśca duduhuradhukṣanta| 
dvikarmako duhiḥ| 
yacchabdena sarvatrādrirājaḥ parāmṛśyate| kadā te duduhire| 
dogdhari merau sthite| yato 'sau dohadakṣo dohapravīṇaḥ| 
kīdṛśīṃ dharitrīm|
pṛthunā ādirājena vainyenopadiṣṭāṃ dohe kṛtopadeśām|
prathamaṃ hi tenāsau sarvasasyāni dugdhā| 
tatastannideśena ṛṣisurāsurapitṛnāgarākṣasagandharvaparvatatarubhiḥ| 
tatra caiṣāṃ pratyeksaṃ vibhāgena vatsadogdhṛkṣīrāṇyāsan| 
yadā ca śailairasāvadohi tadā himavāṃstarṇako merudogdhā ratnauṣadhayo dugdhamāsīdityāgamaḥ| 
yaduktam---
śailaiśca śrūyate rājanpunardugdhā vasundharā| 
oṣadhīrvai mūrtimatīi ratnāni vividhāni ca| 
vatsastu himavānāsīddogdhā merurmahāgiriḥ||
vatsapradhānaḥ kṣīrasrāvikaḥ| uktaṃ ca---`vatsaṃ tu mama sampaśya
kṣareyaṃ yena vatsalā'
iti|| 2||

anantaratnaprabhavasya yasya himaṃ na saubhāgyavilopi jātam|
eko hi doṣo guṇasaṃnipāte nimajjatīndoḥ kiraṇeṣvivāṅkaḥ|| 3||

yasya himavato himaṃ tuhinaṃ saubhāgyavilopi rāmaṇīyakavicchedi na jātaṃ na sampannam| 
yato 'nantaratnaprabhavasya prabhūtotkṛṣṭavastukulagṛhasya prabhavatyasmāditi prabhavaḥ|
yadyasau prabhūtānāṃ ratnānāṃ prabhavaḥ kimetāvatāsya duṣṭahimavahanaṃ na doṣakṛdityāha---yasmādguṇānāṃ bahūnāṃ saṃnipāte samūhe eko doṣo nimajjati vruḍati naśyati na dūṣayati| 
yathā candrasyāmṛtasrāviṣu mayūkheṣvaṅkaḥ śaśākhyaṃ lakṣma|
jātamiti kartari ktaḥ|| 3||

yaścāpsarovibhramamaṇḍanānāṃ sampādayitrīṃ śikharairbibharti|
balāhakacchedavibhaktarāgāmakālasandhyāmiva dhātumattām|| 4||

yaścāgeśo dhātumattāṃ sadhātutvaṃ śikharairbibharti|
dhātavo 'tra sindūrādayo raktāste vidyante yasya sa dhātumāṃstadbhāvo dhātumattā tāṃ śṛṅgairvahati|
dhātūndhārayatītyarthaḥ| kīdṛśīm| 
apsarasāṃ yāni vibhramārthaṃ vilāsārthaṃ maṇḍanāni bhūṣaṇāni tilakādīni teṣāṃ sampādayitrīṃ ghaṭayitrīm| 
tathā ca balāhakacchedeṣu meghakhaṇḍeṣu vibhakto 'rpito rāgo raktatvaṃ yayā tām|
ataścotprekṣyate| akālasandhyāmiva| 
sandhivelā kila lohitameghā bhavati| 
madhyāhnādāvapi raktajaladāvalokanāditthamūhaḥ|
akālagrahaṇena sadaiva meghānāṃ rāgārpaṇaṃ pratīyate| 
utprekṣā caiṣā nopamā| tatkilopamānaṃ dīyate yatsambhavati|
nākālasandhyā kvacidbhavati| 
utprekṣāyāṃ tu pratyakṣameva tathāvabhāsanaṃ hetuḥ| 
yathā---

antarjalaughamavagāḍhavataḥ kapolau hitvā kṣaṇaṃ vitatapakṣatirantarikṣe| 
dravyāśrayeṣvapi guṇeṣu rarāja nīlo varṇaḥ pṛthaggata ivāligaṇo gajasya|| 4||

āmekhalaṃ saṃcaratāṃ ghanānāṃ chāyāmadhaḥsānugatāṃ niṣevya|
udvejitā vṛṣṭibhirāśrayante śṛṅgāṇi yasyātapavanti siddhāḥ|| 5||

yasyātapavanti sātapāni śṛṅgāṇi śikharāṇi siddhā āśrayanta āsevante| 
`avāptāṣṭaguṇaiśvaryāḥ siddhāḥ sadbhirudāhṛtāḥ'|
kiṃ kṛtvā|
āmekhalaṃ nitambaparyantaṃ paryaṭatāṃ ghanānāṃ jīmūtānāmadhaḥsānugatāmupatyakāpatitāṃ chāyāṃ niṣevya|
ataśca vṛṣṭibhirudvejitāḥ santaḥ śītāpanuttaye śṛṅgāṇi
ravikāntimantyārohantītyuccatvoktiḥ| mekhalā girermadhyabhūḥ| ā
mekhalāyā āmekhalamiti `āṅmaryādābhividhyayoḥ'||
5||

padaṃ tuṣārasrutidhautaraktaṃ yasminnadṛṣṭvāpi hatadvipānām|
vidanti mārgaṃ nakharandhramuktairmuktāphalaiḥ kesariṇāṃ kirātāḥ|| 6||

yatrotpāṭitakariṇāṃ siṃhānāṃ mārgaṃ gamanapathaṃ kirātāḥ pulindā vidanti jānate|
kadācinnihatahastitvādasṛgaṅkitakramadarśanaṃ syādityāha---padamadṛṣṭvāpi|
yatastuṣārasrutidhautaraktaṃ galitatuhinakṣālitarudhiram| kathaṃ tarhi
vidantītyāha---nakharandhramuktaiḥ karavivaranirgatairmauktikaiḥ|
siṃhānāṃ karikarataṭapāṭanamācaratāṃ nakhavivarapraviṣṭāni
mauktikāni tatasteṣāṃ parivrajatāṃ yāni patitāni sthitānīti
samṛddhikathanam| 
muktāphalāni tatra paramajinārthināṃ kirātānāṃ kesaripathasūcakāni|  
na tu teṣūpari kasyacidāstheti|| 6||

nyastākṣarā dhāturasena yatra bhūrjatvacaḥ kuñjarabinduśoṇāḥ|
vrajanti vidyādharasundarīṇāmanaṅgalekhakriyayopayogam|| 7||

yatra bhūrjatarutvaco vidyādharasundarīṇāṃ madanasaṃdeśasampādanenopayogaṃ vrajanti sāphalyaṃ yānti|
na tvāyavyayavyāpāreṇa| kīdṛśyastvacaḥ|
dhāturasena sindūrādidravyeṇa nyastākṣarā likhitavarṇāḥ|
ataścākṣarāṇāṃ lauhityātkuñjarabinduvacchoṇā lohitāḥ|
pañcamyāṃ hi daśāyāṃ karīndrāṇāṃ raktabindavo nirgacchantīti
tadvidaḥ| dhātulipeśca varṇasaṃsthānasārūpyādaprasiddhā api
kuñjarabindava upamānam| dhātuśabdo 'yaṃ sāmānyena
prayujyamāno raktaśveteṣu vartate|
yathā---`raktāḥ saktairivaughairudayagiritaṭīdhātudhārādravasya'
yathā ca `paśya dhātuśikhareṣu cātmanaḥ saṃvibhaktamiva
sāndhyamātapam'
`akālasandhyāmiva dhātumattām'
iti ca| yathā ca `dhāturaktāni vāsāṃsi'
iti| ete cānye yadatrābuddhyā bhūrjatvacāṃ rājiṣu
lauhityaṃ svābhāvikamāhustadvastugauravatattvavarjitatvādupekṣārhameva||
7||

yaḥ pūrayankīcakarandhrabhāgāndarīmukhotthena samīraṇena|
udgāsyatāmicchati kiṃnarāṇāṃ sthānapradāyitvamivopagantum|| 8||

yo 'drirudgāsyatāṃ gātukāmānāṃ kiṃnarāṇāṃ sthānapradāyitvamupagantumicchatīva sthānaṃ dhitsatīva| 
sthānaṃ svareṇa dhvanerdānaṃ tatpradānaśīlaḥ sthānapradāyī tadbhāvaṃ yiyāsatīva|
yato guhāvadanodbhavenānilena kīcakānāṃ veṇūnāṃ vivarapradeśānvyāpnuvan| 
jigāsato hi vāṃśiko veṇunā sthānaṃ dadāti| 
sasvarā vaṃśāḥ kīcakāḥ|| 8||

kapolakaṇḍūḥ karibhirvinetuṃ vighaṭṭitānāṃ saraladrumāṇām|
yatra srutakṣīratayā samīraḥ sānūni gandhaiḥ surabhīkaroti|| 9||

yatra vāyurdevadārūṇāṃ srutakṣīratayā galitarasatvena ye
gandhā āmodāstaiḥ sānūni surabhīkaroti sugandhayati|
kīdṛśānāmiti rasasrutikāraṇamāha| kaṣaṇena
kapolakaṇḍūrvinetumapāsituṃ gajaiḥ sphāṭitānām| kaṇḍūriti
śasantaḥ| `sānuśabdaḥ puṃsi vā'||
9||

vanecarāṇāṃ vanitāsakhānāṃ darīgṛhotsaṅganiṣiktabhāsaḥ|
bhavanti yatrauṣadhayo rajanyāmatailapūrāḥ suratapradīpāḥ|| 10||

yatra niśi yuvatiyutānāṃ pulindānāṃ vanavāsināmoṣadhayaḥ suratārthaṃ pradīpā bhavanti|
tejovyāpterdīpāntarādviśeṣamāha---tailena pūryata iti tailapūrāḥ, na tailapūrā atailapūrā akṛtrimatvāt|
daryaḥ kandarā eva gṛhāstadutsaṅge niṣaktā lagnā bhāso yāsāṃ tāḥ|
vanitānāṃ sakhāyo vanitāsakhāḥ| `rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ ṭac'||
10||

udvejayatyaṅgulipārṣṇibhāgānmārge śilībhūtahime 'pi yatra|
na durvahaśroṇipayodharārtā bhindanti mandāṃ gatimaśvamukhyaḥ|| 11||

yatrādrāvaśvamukhyaḥ kiṃnaryaḥ kharapavanavaśādupalībhūtahime 'pi mārge mandāṃ mantharāṃ gatiṃ na bhindanti na tyajanti| 
kīdṛśe|
sahimatvādaṅguliparyantānpārṣṇipradeśāṃścodvejayati sphāṭayamāne| 
kathaṃ tarhi tvarayā na yāntītyāha--durvaheṇa pīnena śroṇipayodhareṇa jaghanastanenārtāḥ pīḍitāḥ| 
yadi vā ṛtāḥ samṛddhāḥ| `upasargādṛṭi dhātau'
vṛddhirekādeśaḥ| 
tāsāṃ cāśvamukhīnāṃ kāyasya nārīsārūpyātstanajaghanāṅgulipārṣṇisambhavaḥ| 
kiṃnarāṇāṃ hi dve rūpe---kecidaśvamukhāḥ puruṣaśarīrāḥ kecinmanuṣyamukhā aśvaśarīrā iti|
pārṣṇiḥ khurikā|| 11||

divākarādrakṣati yo guhāsau līnaṃ divābhītamivāndhakāram|
kṣudre 'pi nūnaṃ śaraṇaṃ prapanne mamatvamuccaiḥśirasāṃ satīva|| 12||

yo nago darīṣu līnaṃ tamo 'rkādrakṣati| dine 'pi bhītamiva|
sabhayaḥ kilānyasmādrakṣyate| nanu dṛṣṭasya rakṣāyāṃ ka ivāsya
guṇa ityāha---uccaiḥśirasāmunnatānāṃ durjane 'pi śaraṇaṃ prāpte
niścitaṃ satīva sādhau yathā mamatvamātmīyatvaṃ bhavati|
guṇyāguṇyāvicāreṇa mahāntaḥ śaraṇāgataṃ pālayantītyarthaḥ|
mamatvaṃ mamateti ṣaṣṭhyantapratirūpakau nipātau||| 12||

lāṅgūlavikṣepavisarpiśobhairitastataścandramarīciśubhraiḥ|
yasyārthayuktaṃ girirājaśabdaṃ kurvanti vālavyajanaiścamaryaḥ|| 13||

yasya bhūbhṛnnāthasya sthāvararūpasyāpi
camaryo vālavyajanaiḥ prakīrṇakairgirirāja itīmaṃ śabdamarthayuktaṃ sārthakaṃ kurvanti|
rājñaḥ kila cāmarairvījanīyam| lāṅgūlamuparitano bhāgastasya
vikṣepeṇa cālanenetastato visarpantī prasarantī śobhā
yeṣāṃ taiḥ| tathā śaśimayūkhavacchubhrairdhavalaiḥ|
ākāro 'pyatropamito boddhavyaḥ| anyathā marīcigrahaṇena kimatra
kṛtaṃ syāt| `aja gatikṣepaṇayoḥ'
ityasya vipūrvasya karaṇe vyajanaśabdaḥ| `īja gatau'
ityasya tu vījanaśabdaḥ| `tvarayerdakṣiṇavātavījanaiḥ'
iti yathā|| 13||

yatrāṃśukākṣepavilajjitānāṃ yadṛcchayā kiṃpuruṣāṅganānām|
darīgṛhadvāravilambibimbāstiraskariṇyo jaladā bhavanti|| 14||

yatra
kiṃnarīṇāṃ priyeṇāmbarāpahāravrīḍitānāṃ jīmūtāḥ svecchayaiva
tiraskariṇyo bhavanti javanikāḥ sampadyante| tadaṅgādarśanāt|
yato darīgṛhadvāre vilambibimbā viśrāntamaṇḍalāḥ| tiraskaroti
sthagayatīti tiraskariṇī| bāhulakādiniḥ| `tiraso 'nyatarasyām'
iti satvam| yadṛcchāśabda icchārtho mayūravyaṃsakādiḥ||
14||

bhāgīrathīnirjharaśīkarāṇāṃ voḍhā muhuḥ kampitadevadāruḥ|
yadvāyuranviṣṭamṛgaiḥ kirātairāsevyate bhinnaśikhaṇḍibarhaḥ|| 15||

yadīyo vāyuranviṣṭamṛgatvātpariśrāntaiḥ śabarapatibhirāśrīyate|
kīdṛśaḥ|
bhāgīrathīnirjharaśīkarāṇāṃ gaṅgāprapātajalakaṇānāṃ voḍhā
kṣepteti śaityapuṇyatvoktiḥ| muhurasakṛccālitasuratauviṭapa iti
saurabhoktiḥ| bhinnaśikhaṇḍibarhastruṭitakalāpipakṣa iti cāpalakathanam| 
niyataṃ jharati sravatīti nirjharaḥ| vahatīti voḍhā||
15||

saptarṣihastāvacitāvaśeṣāṇyadho vivasvānparivartamānaḥ|
padmāni yasyāgrasaroruhāṇi prabodhayatyūrdhvamukhairmayūkhaiḥ|| 16||

yasyābjāni ravirūrdhvamukhaiḥ kiraṇairvikāsayati| na tvadhogataiḥ|
yatastasyāgrasaroruhāṇi| 
sa tu sarasāmadhobudhne parivartamānaḥ paryaṭan| 
ataścordhvaprasaratkiraṇapañcaśatyā eva tadvikāsasāmarthyam| 
kīdṛśāni| tridaśamunikarāvacayādavaśeṣāṇi|
pratyūṣasi hi te pūrvaṃ pratyahaṃ tānyarcanārthaṃ nayanti|
avaśiṣyanta ityavaśeṣāṇi|| 16||

yajñāṅgayonitvamavekṣya yasya sāraṃ dharitrīdharaṇakṣamaṃ ca|
prajāpatiḥ kalpitayajñabhāgaṃ śailādhipatyaṃ svayamanvatiṣṭhat|| 17||

kiṃ bahunā yasya svayaṃ brahmānagādhirājyamavatiṣṭhaddadau|
svayaṃ tenābhiṣikta ityarthaḥ|
yato yajñāṅgānāṃ somapalāśādīnāṃ yoniḥ prabhavo 'yamityasāvavagatavān|
urvīvahanayogyaṃ ca sāraṃ balaṃ dṛṣṭvā|
kiṃ kevalaṃ śailādhipatyaṃ dadau| netyāha--kalpitayajñabhāgam|
kratubhāgamapyaṅgīcakāretyarthaḥ| ata evāsya devatātmakatvam|
saratīti sāraḥ| `vyādhimatsyabaleṣu'
iti ghañ|| 17||

sa mānasīṃ merusakhaḥ pitṝṇāṃ kanyāṃ kulasya sthitaye sthitijñaḥ|
menāṃ munīnāmapi mānanīyāmātmānurūpāṃ vidhinopayeme|| 18||

sa evaṃvidho nageśaḥ pitṝṇāṃ manonirmitāṃ menākhyāṃ kanyāṃ yathāvadupayeme
vyavāhayat| kulasya vaṃśasya sthitaye 'vicchedāya| yato 'sau
sthitijña ācāravit| lokācāraḥ kila na hātavyaḥ|
merusakhatvaṃ kulaprabhavādisāmyaṃ tenāpi pitṛkanyakopayamādvā|
pitṛbhirhi manasā kanyātrayaṃ nirmame| ekā himavate kanyā dattāparā
merave tṛtīyānyasmai ityāgamaḥ| ata eva tāmṛṣīṇāmapi
pūjyām| ātmano 'nurūpāṃ kulaśīlādibhiḥ| vidhinā śāstroktena
vidhānena| upayema iti `upādyamaḥ svakaraṇe'
iti taṅi dvitvam
`ata ekahalmadhye 'nādeśārliṭi'
iti ekatvābhyāsalopau| evamanyatra|| 18||

asūta sā nāgavadhūpabhogyaṃ mainākamambhonidhibaddhasakhyam|
kruddhe 'pi pakṣacchidi vṛtraśatrāvavedanājñaṃ kuliśakṣatānām|| 19||

sā menā mainākhyaṃ sutamasūtājanayat| samudreṇa saha kṛtavāyasyam|
ataśca sahavāsānnāgakanyānāmupabhogyaṃ sevyaṃ patitvena| tathā
parvatapakṣacchedinīndre kupite 'pi
kuliśakṣatānāṃ vajravraṇānāmavedanājñam| pīḍāṃ na
jānātyabdhimadhye śakrasya praveśābhāvāt| pūrvaṃ hi
sapakṣāḥ parvatā āsan| tatasteṣāṃ lokasya rujatāṃ vṛtrahā vajreṇa
pakṣānacchaitsīdityāgamaḥ| pakṣāṃśchinnavāniti pakṣacchit|
asūteti ṣūño laṅ|| 19||

athāvamānena pituḥ prayuktā dakṣasya kanyā bhavapūrvapatnī|
satī satī yogavisṛṣṭadehā tāṃ janmane śailavadhūṃ prapede|| 20||

atha kadācittāṃ himālayajāyāṃ menāṃ dakṣaprajāpateḥ sutā śivasya pūrvabhāryā satīsaṃjñā janmārthaṃ prapede prāpa| 
punarutpattaye menākukṣāvātmānamakṣipadityarthaḥ| 
yataḥ pituravamānena prayuktā preritā| 
ataśca yogena dhāraṇayā visṛṣṭadehā tyaktaśarīrā|
yato 'sau satī sādhvī pativratā bhartuḥ paribhavaṃ na sahate| 
dakṣeṇa hi yogotsave sarveṣu jāmātṛṣu sapatnīkeṣu nimantriteṣu gaurī devasahitā yadānāhūtā tadā tayā mamedṛśena nirācāreṇāvatsalena pitrā kiṃ prayojanamityuktvā dehotsargo vyadhāyītyāgamaḥ|| 20||

sā bhūdharāṇāmadhipena tasyāṃ samādhimatyāmudapādi bhavyā|
samyakprayogādaparikṣatāyāṃ nītāvivotsāhaguṇena sampat|| 21||

sā devī nagarājena tasyāṃ menāyāmudapādi janitā|
tasyāmityādhāravivakṣayā saptamī|
samādhiryogyāpatyārthaṃ niyamastadyuktāyām| sā tu bhavyā praśastā|
kena kva kā yathotpādyata ityāha---utsāhākhyena guṇena nītau yathā sampajjanyate| nītiḥ ṣāḍguṇyam| kīdṛśyām|
samyagyathāśāstraṃ prayogādvyavahārādaparikṣatāyāmanaṣṭāyām|
yo hi vijigīṣuḥ ṣāḍguṇyaṃ vidhivatprayuñjāna utsāhamāśrayate so 'vaśyamarivijayena samṛddhimāpnoti| 
tatra nītāvityanena mantraśaktirākṣiptā| 
utsāhaguṇenetyutsāhaśaktiḥ|
sampadityanena prabhuśaktiḥ| asyāśca mantrotsāhau mūlam| 
udapādīti ṇyantaḥ karmaṇi bhave sādhurbhavyā|| 21||

prasannadikpāṃsuviviktavātaṃ śaṅkhasvanānantarapuṣpavṛṣṭi|
śarīriṇāṃ sthāvarajaṅgamānāṃ sukhāya tajjanmadinaṃ babhūva|| 22||

sthāvarā vṛkṣādayaḥ| 
jaṅgamā grāmyāgraṇyabhedena siṃhamanujādayaścaturdaśavidhāḥ paśavaḥ| 
teṣāṃ dvayānāmapi śarīriṇāṃ bhūtānāṃ tasyā devyā janmadinamutpattivāsaraṃ sukhāyāsīt|
prasannadiṅnirmalāśam| pāṃsuviviktavātaṃ rajorahitamārutam| 
divyācca śaṅkhadhvaneranantaraṃ puṣpavṛṣṭayo yatra tat|| 22||

tayā duhitrā sutarāṃ janitrī sphuratprabhāmaṇḍalayā cakāśe|
vaiḍūryabhūmirnavameghaśabdādudbhinnayā ratnaśalākayeva|| 23||

tayā putryā gauryā janitrī mātā suṣṭhu cakāśe reje|
sphuratprabhāmaṇḍalayā lasatkāntipaṭalayā| 
prabhā hi mahatāmabhyudayasūcikā| 
yathā viḍūrākhyasyādrervālavāyājāparanāmno bhūmiravanirghanāghanagarjitotpannayā ratnaśalākayā maṇisūcyā kāntimatyā kāśate| 
tatra hi megharavena prāvṛṣi ratnāni jāyanta iti vārtā|| 23||

dine dine sā parivardhamānā labdhodayā cāndramasīva lekhā|
pupoṣa lāvaṇyamayānviśeṣāñjyotsnāntarāṇīva kalāntarāṇi|| 24||

sā devī labdhodayā prāptotpattiranvahaṃ śaśikalāvatpūryamāṇā satī lāvaṇyamayānsaundaryarūpānviśeṣānpupoṣāvīvṛdhat|
jyotsnā antare teṣāṃ tāni jyotsnāntarāṇīti kalāntaraviśeṣaṇam|
labdhodayā pratyahaṃ vardhamānā candralekhā yathā jyotsnāgarbhāḥ kalāḥ poṣayati tathā devī lāvaṇyamiti vākyārthaḥ|
kriyābhedena kartṛkarmaṇordvayoraupamya ivaśabdāvapi dvau prayuktau|
vṛddhikriyayā hi gauryāścandralekhopamānam, puṣaṇena tu viśeṣaṇaṃ karma kalāntarāṇi| 
sāmānyavācakasyāpyanekasya prayogo nyāyyaḥ| yathā---

tataḥ pratasthe kauberīṃ bhāsvāniva raghurdiśam|
śarairusrairivodīcyānuddhariṣyanrasāniva||

niryāya vidyātha dinādiramyādbimbādivārkasya mukhānmaharṣeḥ|
pārthānanaṃ vahnikaṇāvadātaṃ dīptiḥ sphuratpadmamivābhipede||

varṇaiḥ katipayaireva grathitasya svarairiva|
anantā vāṅmayasyāho geyasyeva vicitratā||


priyasakhi vipaddaṇḍaprāntaprapātaparaṃparāparicalaccintāṃ cakre vidhāya vidhiḥ khalaḥ|
mṛdamiva balātpiṇḍīkṛtya pragalbhakulālavadbhramayati mano no jānīmaḥ kimatra vidhāsyati||

sadyo vismṛtisiṃhalendravibhavaḥ kakṣāpradeśeṣvaho|
dvāḥstheneva kutūhalena mahatā grāmyo yathāhaṃ śṛṭaḥ||

labdho lapsyamāna udayo haraprāptiryayā|
`āśaṃsāyāṃ bhūtavacca'
iti ktaḥ| 
anyāḥ kalāḥ kalāntarāṇi yathā anyā jyotsnā jyotsnāntarāṇi prāpnuvantīti kecit|| 24||

tāṃ pārvatītyābhijanena nāmnā bandhupriyāṃ bandhujano juhāva|
uṃ meti mātrā tapaso niṣiddhā paścādumākhyāṃ sumukhī jagāma|| 25||

tāṃ devīṃ svajanavallabhatvādbandhujanaḥ pūrvaṃ pārvatītyanena
nāmnā juhāvākārayat| ābhijanenānvayāgatena parvatāpatyatayā|
tataḥ paścātkālāntareṇa saiva sumukhyumākhyāṃ prāpa| 
mātrā menayā uṃ meti padadvayena tapaso niṣiddhā| umiti praṇayakope|
māśabdo nivāraṇe| ataśca niruktaprakriyayā umā| yaduktam---

uṃ meti capale putri na kṣamaṃ tāvakaṃ vapuḥ|
soḍhuṃ kleśātmarūpasya tapasaḥ somyadarśane||
juhāveti hveño rūpam|| 25||

mahībhṛtaḥ putravato 'pi dṛṣṭistasminnapatye na jagāma tṛptim|
anantapuṣpasya madhorhi cūte dvirephamālā saviśeṣasaṅgā|| 26||

adrīndrasya bahvapatyasyāpyumāyāmapatye dṛṣṭistṛptiṃ na jagāma na yayau|
dṛśyate caitat| 
bahukusumanirbhare vasante dvirephamālā bhramarāvalī cūtapuṣpe saviśeṣasaṅgādhikaṃ rajyate| 
madhoriti mālāpekṣayā sambandhe ṣaṣṭhī|| 26||

prabhāmahatyā śikhayeva dīpastrimārgayeva tridivasya mārgaḥ|
saṃskāravatyeva girā manīṣī tayā sa pūtaśca vibhūṣitaśca|| 27||

tayā devyā so 'drirājaḥ pavitro 'laṃkṛtaścāsīt| yasya hi
sākṣāddevī sutā so 'vaśyaṃ pavitraḥ| apatyena ca
pitarāvalaṃkṛtau bhavataḥ| kaḥ kayeva| prabhāmahatyā
dīptimahatyā śikhayā jvālayā yathā
dīpaḥ pūto vibhūṣitaśca bhavati| 
nirvāṇayā hyarciṣā bhājanamapraśastamaśrīkaṃ ca bhavati| 
dīpaśabdenātra jvālāvarttitailabhājanātmakaḥ samudāya ākṣiptaḥ| 
yathā ca trimārgayā gaṅgayā svargamārgaḥ pūto 'laṃkṛtaśca bhavati|
yathā ca cchandovyākaraṇādisaṃskṛtayā vācā paṇḍitaḥ pūyate bhūṣyate ca| 
prabhayā mahatī prabhāmahatīti tṛtīyāsamāsaḥ| manīṣā buddhiḥ|
mukhyastāvadayaṃ pakṣo yatsamuccīyamānasamāni samuccayapadāni

iti caśabdadvayaprayogo 'tra| yathā dhavakhadirapalāśā iti dvandve|| 27||

mandākinīsaikatavedikābhiḥ sā kandukaiḥ kṛtrimaputrakaiśca|
reme muhurmadhyagatā sakhīnāṃ krīḍārasaṃ nirviśatīva bālyam|| 28||

sā bālā sakhīmadhye cikrīḍa| kena| 
mandākinī gaṅgā tasyāḥ saikataṃ tīraṃ tatra vedikābhiḥ sthalībhiḥ kandukaiḥ kṛtrimairdārvādimayaiḥ putrakaiḥ krīḍanakaiśca|
ataśca bhūyo bhūyaḥ krīḍanādutprekṣyate|
krīḍāyāṃ raso rāgo yatra tatkrīḍārasam|
bālyaṃ śaiśavaṃ nirviśatīva pibantīva| nuṃ vibhāṣitaḥ|
kareṇa nirvṛttaṃ kṛtrimam| `ḍvitaḥ ktriḥ '
`trermaṃ nityam'
putraka iti saṃjñāyāṃ kan||
28||

tāṃ haṃsamālāḥ śaradīva gaṅgāṃ mahauṣadhīṃ naktamivātmabhāsaḥ|
sthiropadeśāmupadeśakāle prapedire prāktanajanmavidyāḥ|| 29||

tāṃ devīṃ śikṣāsamaye pūrvajanmabhavā vidyāḥ prapedire prāpuḥ|
yataḥ sthiropadeśāṃ divyatvādanaśvarajñānām| 
śaradi yathā haṃsamālā gaṅgāmāyāntīti bhūṣaṇoktiḥ| 
yathā ca naktaṃ mahauṣadhīṃ nijaprabhāḥ prapadyanta iti bhāsvaratvoktiḥ|
prāgbhavaṃ prāktanam|| 29||

asambhṛtaṃ maṇḍanamaṅgayaṣṭeranāsavākhyaṃ karaṇaṃ madasya|
kāmasya puṣpavyatiriktamastraṃ bālyātparaṃ sātha vayaḥ prapede|| 30||

atha sā devī śaiśavādanantaraṃ yauvanākhyaṃ vayaḥ prapede prāpa|
kīdṛśam|
aṅgayaṣṭestanulatāyā asambhṛtamanāhāryamaprayatnopārjitaṃ maṇḍanaṃ bhūṣaṇamiti kaṭakakuṇḍalādibhyo viśeṣaṇam|
tathānāsavākhyaṃ pānavyatiriktaṃ madasya cetovikārasya jananam|
madyādikaṃ hi madakāri prasiddham| 
tathā kusumāyudhasya puṣpavyatiriktaṃ kusumavilakṣaṇamastraṃ vaśīkaraṇamiti|
vibhāvanākhyo 'yamalaṅkāraḥ|| 30||

unmīlitaṃ tūlikayeva citraṃ sūryāṃśubhirbhinnamivāravindam|
babhūva tasyāścaturaśraśobhi vapurvibhaktaṃ navayauvanena|| 31||

tasyā devyāḥ pratyagreṇa tāruṇyena śarīraṃ vibhaktaṃ bhāgīkṛtaṃ sevitaṃ saccaturaśraśobhi samantato bhadramabhūt| 
keneva kimityāha---tūlikayā sūkṣmasūcyā citraṃ yathonmīlitaṃ prakaṭīkṛtāvayavaṃ caturaśraṃ śobhate|
pūrvaṃ hi tadavibhaktāṅgamullikhyate| 
yathā ca raviraśmibhirbhinnaṃ vikasitaṃ padmaṃ sarvaramyaṃ bhavati|
caturāśraṃ samantataḥ śobhata iti caturaśraśobhi|| 31||

tadeva rūpavarṇanadvāreṇāha---

abhyunnatāṅguṣṭhanakhaprabhābhirnikṣepaṇādrāgamivodgirantau|
ājahvatustaccaraṇau pṛthivyāṃ sthalāravindaśriyamavyavasthām|| 32||

devīnāṃ rūpaṃ pādāṅguṣṭhātprabhṛti varṇyate mānuṣīṇāṃ tu keśebhya ārabhyeti kavisamācāra iti tathaivāha| 
tasyāḥ pādau nikṣepaṇātkramanyāsaddhetoravyavasthāṃ saṃcāriṇīṃ bhuvi sthalakamalalakṣmīmājahraturapādayatām| 
tatsadṛśaśobhājananāt|
kīdṛśau tau| 
abhyunnatāvamagnau yāvaṅguṣṭhanakhau tayoḥ kāntibhī rāgamivodgirantau lauhityamiva vamantau| 
padmaṃ hi raktaṃ bhavati| caraṇā nakhāśca raktāḥ praśastāḥ| 
udgiraṇādayaḥ śabdā mukhādanyatraupacārikāḥ|| 32||

sā rājahaṃsairiva saṃnatāṅgī gateṣu līlāñcitavibhrameṣu|
vyanīyata pratyupadeśalubdhairāditsubhirnūpuraśiñjitāni|| 33||

stanābhogavaśātsaṃnatamaṅgaṃ dehaṃ yasyāḥ sā saṃnatāṅgī devī gateṣu gamaneṣu rājahaṃsairiva vyanīyatāśikṣyata| 
tadvadeva gamanāt| 
kimiti te tāṃ gatiṃ śikṣayantītyāha---pratyupadeśalubdhairvidyāntaraṃ tatsakāśājjighṛkṣubhiḥ|
tadāha---nūpuraśiñjitāni mañjīraraṇitānyāditsubhirgrahītukāmaiḥ| ataśca `vidyayā vidyā'
iti haṃsairiva gateṣu sā vyanīyata| 
tena tasyā gamanaṃ mañjīraśiñjitaṃ ca rājahaṃsanibhamityarthaḥ|
kīdṛśeṣu gateṣu| līlayā helayāñcito ramyo vibhramo yeṣu|
akṛtrimavilāseṣvityarthaḥ| `añceḥ pūjāyām'
itīṭ| `nāñceḥ pūjāyām'
iti nalopābhāvaḥ| gateṣviti vaiṣayike 'dhikaraṇe saptamī|
vyanīyateti karmaṇi|| 33||

vṛttānupūrve ca na cātidīrghe jaṅghe śubhe sṛṣṭavatastadīye|
śeṣāṅganirmāṇavidhau vidhāturlāvaṇya utpādya ivāsa yatnaḥ|| 34||

vedhaso devyā jaṅghe prasṛte lāvaṇyanirbhare
nirmitavato jaghanādyavayavasṛṣṭāvarjanīya iva saundaryayatno 'bhūt|
sarvasyaiva lāvaṇyasyākulatvena tayornikṣepāt| kīdṛśe| 
vṛtte parivartule pūrvamanugate anupūrve gopucchākāre| viśeṣaṇasamāsaḥ|
na cātidīrghe api tu madhyapramāṇe| śubhe praśaste| 
āseti kavīnāṃ pramādajaḥ prayogaḥ| `asterbhūḥ '
iti bhūbhāvaprasaṅgāt| 
yattvanye bruvate `tiṅantapratirūpako nipātaḥ '
iti tatsat| tādṛśasya tiṅantasyaiva bhavanāt|| 34||

nāgendrahastāstvaci karkaśatvādekāntaśaityātkadalīviśeṣāḥ|
labdhvāpi loke pariṇāhi rūpaṃ jātāstadūrvorupamānabāhyāḥ|| 35||

nāgendrahastā hastikarāstathā
kadalīviśeṣā vṛkṣabhedāstasyā ūrvorupamānabāhyā asadṛśā jātāḥ sampannāḥ|
kadācitte na vṛttāḥ syurityāha---pariṇāhi rūpaṃ parimaṇḍalaṃ saṃsthānaṃ prāpyāpi kathaṃ tarhyaupamyabahirbhūtā ityāha---tvaci karkaśatvādekāntaśaityācceti| 
karikarāstvaci paruṣā bhavanti|
tau tu komalau| kadalyo 'pyekāntena niyamena śītalāḥ| 
ūrū tu śiśire 'pyaśiśirau| evaṃ ca vailakṣaṇyātkathamaupamyam| 
ekāntena śaityamekāntaśaityam| bāhulakātsamāsaḥ| 
pariṇāho vidyate yasya tatpariṇāhi|| 35||

etāvatā nanvanumeyaśobhaṃ kāñcīguṇasthānamaninditāyāḥ|
āropitaṃ yadgiriśena paścādananyanārīkamanīyamaṅkam|| 36||

kāñcīguṇo raśanādāma tiṣṭhati yatra tatkāñcīguṇasthānaṃ śroṇībimbaṃ devyā apratyakṣadṛśyatvādetāvataivānumeyaśobham|
yatpaścāduttarakālaṃ śivenāṅkamāropitamutsaṅge gṛhītam|
kadācittadaṅko bahutaravadhūpabhogyaḥ syādityāha---anyāsāṃ nārīṇāmakamanīyamakāmyam|
devasyordhvaretastvāt| 
evaṃ yadi tadutkṛṣṭaṃ na syāttatkathaṃ bhagavānādriyeta| 
aninditā praśastā|
kumārīrūpavarṇanakāle 'pyaṅkamāropitamiti kaveretadanucitamapi na viruddham| 
kavikāvyakāle vivāhasya vṛttatvāt| 
ata eva paścādgrahaṇaṃ kṛtam| evamuttaratra|
caityabhuvanādivadgiriśabdo bhāṣāyāṃ prayogārhaḥ| 
yadi vā giriḥ kailāso vidyate yasya sa giriśaḥ| lomāditvācchaḥ|

giriṃ śayatīti giriśa ityanye|| 36||

tasyāḥ praviṣṭā natanābhirandhraṃ rarāja tanvī navaromarājiḥ|
nīvīmatikramya sitetarasya tanmekhalāmadhyamaṇerivārciḥ|| 37||

tasyā devyā navaromāvalistanīyasī reje|
nataṃ gambhīraṃ nābhivivaraṃ praviṣṭā tatraiva vicchedaṃ prāptā| 
yā ca kārṣṇyādutprekṣyate| 
mekhalāmadhyamaṇeḥ raśanānāyakabhūtasya sitetarasyendranīlasyārciḥ kāntiriva nīvīmatikramyoccayamullaṅghyopari praviṣṭeti| 
nīvī hi mekhalāyā ūrdhvaṃ kriyate| 
yadi vā nīviśabdena nīvyā yadgrathyate tadadhovāso lakṣyate| 
tenāmbaraṃ bhaṅktvābhyantaramarciriva praviṣṭā| 
vāsaso hyupari mekhalā kriyate|
arciḥśabdaḥ strīliṅgo 'pi| sitāditaraḥ sitetara iti `pañcamī'

iti yogavibhāgātsamāsaḥ| 
śuklakṛṣṇayorvipakṣatayā prasiddherasitetarādibhiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇa eva pratītaḥ| 
atikramyeti praveśakriyāpekṣaṃ paurvakālyam|| 37||

madhyena sā vedivilagnamadhyā valitrayaṃ cāru babhāra balā|
ārohaṇārthaṃ navayauvanena kāmasya sopānamiva prayuktam|| 38||

vediragnyāhitānāṃ tretāgnisthānaṃ tadvadvilagnaṃ kṣāmaṃ madhyamudaraṃ yasyāḥ sā bālā devī madhyena ramyaṃ valitrayaṃ trivalīmuvāha| 
utprekṣyate|
navayauvanena kāmasyārohaṇāya sopānamiva tatprayuktamiti| 
tāruṇye hi madanāvirbhāvaḥ|| 38||

anyonyamutpīḍayadutpalākṣyāḥ stanadvayaṃ pāṇḍu tathā vivṛddham|
madhye yathā śyāmamukhasya tasya mṛṇālasūtrāntaramapyalabhyam|| 39||

tasyāḥ kuvalanayanāyāḥ kucayugmaṃ gauraṃ tathā tena prakāreṇa vivṛddhaṃ yathā tadantare bisatantorapyavakāśo durlabhaḥ|
yataḥ parasparamutpīḍayat| 
śyāmamukhasya nīlacūcukasyeti svarūpakathanam|| 39||

śirīṣamālādhikasaukumāryau bāhū tadīyāviti me vitarkaḥ|
parājitenāpi kṛtau harasya yau kaṇṭhapāśau makaradhvajena|| 40||

devyā bhujau śirīṣakusumamālāto 'bhyadhikaṃ sukumārāviti me vitarka ūhaḥ| 
kuta ityāha---yaddagdhenāpi makaradhvajena śivasya kaṇṭhapāśau vaśīkaraṇau kṛtau| sukumārapraharaṇaḥ kila kāmaḥ|
mṛdunāstreṇa tena jagadvaśīkāryam| 
yadi ca puṣpebhyo 'pi tadbāhuyugmaṃ mṛdu na bhavettatsatsvapi śirīṣādikusumeṣvaparābhūtenāpi tena pūrvaṃ yo haro na vaśīkṛtastaṃ kathamadhunā jayet| 
yadi vā yaḥ sukumārasvabhāvastatrāpyaśarīraḥ kathaṃ sa kaṭhoraṃ vastu pāśīkuryāditi bhāvaḥ| 
atra yāvityasya sthāne yaditi hetupadaṃ nyāyyam| 
yathā `āropitaṃ yadgiriśena'
ityatra|| 40||

kaṇṭhasya tasyāḥ stanabandhurasya muktākalāpasya ca nistalasya|
anyonyaśobhājananādbabhūva sādhāraṇo bhūṣaṇabhūṣyabhāvaḥ|| 41||

devyāḥ kaṇṭhasya muktāharasya cānyonyaśobhotpādanātsādhāraṇaṃ bhūṣaṇabhūṣyatvamāsīditi svābhāvikaśobhākathanam|
yato galasya stanābhyāṃ bandhurasya manojñasya|
aparasyāpi nistalasya vṛttasya| avidyamānaṃ talamasyeti kṛtvā| 
vākyārthasya bhūṣaṇatve tātparyātpradhānatayā bhūṣaṇaśabdasya pūrvanipātaḥ| 
etacca hetupadenaivoktam|| 41||

candraṃ gatā padmaguṇānna bhuṅkte padmāśritā cāndramasīmabhikhyām|
umāmukhaṃ tu pratipadya lolā dvisaṃsrayāṃ prītimavāpa lakṣmīḥ|| 42||

gauryā mukhaṃ śaśikālanibhamityetadeva vastu bhaṅgyantareṇāha---śrīrindau sthitā kamalakāntiṃ nopabhuṅkte|
niśi tasya saṃkucitatvāt| padmamapi yātā cāndramasīmabhikhyāṃ nānubhavati| divā śaśino vicchāyatvāt|
devyāstu sā vaktramāsādyobhayādhiṣṭhānaṃ saukhyaṃ lebhe|
tanmukhasyobhayasādṛśyāt| yato 'sau lolā lampaṭobhayaguṇārthinī||
42||

puṣpaṃ pravālopahitaṃ yadi syānmuktāphalaṃ vā sphuṭavidrumastham|
tato 'nukuryādviśasyas tasyāstāmrauṣṭhaparyastarucaḥ smitasya|| 43||

puṣpamauktike īdṛśe yadi
syātāṃ tato devyā vimalaṃ bimbādharagataṃ hasitamanukūryātām|
kīdṛśaṃ puṣpam| pravālopahitaṃ kisalayamadhyastham| muktāphalamapi
nirmalavidrumagatam| evaṃ hi śauklasya lauhityasya ca
vyatikarādanukāraḥ pūrṇo bhavedityanumānotpādanāyotpādyopamānopameyam|
tāmre oṣṭhe paryastā patitā rukkāntiryasya tasya
tāmrauṣṭhaparyastarucaḥ| smitasyeti sambandhavivakṣayā ṣaṣṭhī|
`na māṣāṇāmaśnīyāt' itivat| puṣpaśabdo 'tra site vartate|| 43||

svareṇa tasyāmamṛtasruteva prajalpitāyāmabhijātavāci|
apyanyapuṣṭā pratikūlaśabdā śroturvitantrīriva vādyamānā|| 44||

tasyāṃ pārvatyāmabhijātavāci komalagiri svareṇa
prajalpitāyāṃ vaktuṃ pravṛttāyāṃ satyāṃ śroturanyapuṣṭāpi
kokilāpi pratikūlaśabdodvegakāriṇī bhavati| visvarā tantrīriva
vādyamānā| tadīyāṃ mṛdvīṃ vācaṃ ya ākarṇayati tasya kokilāpi
vitantrīvatkarṇāsukhakāriṇītyarthaḥ| sthānacalitā hi
tantrīratitarāmudvegajananī| kīdṛśena svareṇa|
amṛtaṃ sravatītyamṛtasrut| teneva mādhuryāmṛtaṃ sravateva|
svaro 'tra śabdamātram| viśeṣaṇayogārthaṃ ca tadupādānam|
śiśūnāṃ kokilānāṃ kākapoṣitatvādanyapuṣṭeti
yatārthaṃ nāmeti śuddhajātyabhāvātṅīṣabhāvaḥ|
tantrīriti `avitṝstṝtantribhya īḥ '
visvarā cāsau tantrī vitantrīḥ|| 44||

pravātanīlotpalanirviśeṣamadhīraviprekṣitamāyatākṣyā|
tayā gṛhītaṃ nu mṛgāṅganābhyastato gṛhītaṃ nu mṛgāṅganābhiḥ|| 45||

adhīraṃ kātaraṃ yadviprekṣitaṃ vīkṣaṇaṃ tanna jānīmastayā pārvatyā
kiṃ mṛgīṇāṃ sakāśādāttaṃ kiṃ vā tasyāḥ sakāśānmṛgībhiriti|
sādṛśyānna niścayaḥ| 
yataḥ pravāte prakṛṣṭe vāte yannīlotpalaṃ tena nirviśeṣamabhinnam| 
nurvitarke|| 45||

tasyāḥ śalākāñjananirmitaiva kāntirbhruvorānatalekhayoryā|
tāṃ vīkṣya līlācikurāmanaṅgaḥ svacāpasaundaryamadaṃ mumoca|| 46||

tasyā devyā ānatalekhayorbhruvoryā kāntiḥ śobhā tāmālokya kāmo nijakārmukarāmaṇīyakajaṃ darpamatyaikṣīdityupamānasya vaiguṇyakathanamupameyasya śobhātiśayoktiḥ| 
śalākā tūlikā tasyā yadañjanaṃ kajjalaṃ tena nirmiteva likhiteveti tanutvakārṣṇyoktiḥ| 
kīdṛśīm| līlayā vilāsena cikurāṃ sundarām|
cikurāmityaprasiddhatvādārṣaḥ pāṭhaḥ|| 46||

lajjā tiraścāṃ yadi cetasi syādasaṃśayaṃ parvatarājaputryāḥ|
taṃ keśapaśaṃ prasamīkṣya kuryurvālapriyatvaṃ śithilaṃ camaryaḥ|| 47||

paśūnāṃ manasi lajjā trapā
yadyabhaviṣyanniścitaṃ pārvatyāstaṃ keśapāśaṃ śiroruhakārṣṇyaśobhāmālokya
camaryaḥ priyapucchatvaṃ śithilamavākariṣyan| tā hi
camaryo vīrudgahanalagnalāṅgūlavicchedakātarā vyādhasāyakaṃ nāśakaramapyaṅgīkurute|
na tu vālabhaṅgam| yatastāsāṃ vālāni priyāṇi| 
atra kriyātipattyā `bhūte ca'
iti lṛṅbhāvaścintyaḥ| tamiti sarvanāma keśapāśasya ramyatvena
prasiddhimāha| keśapāśaśabdaḥ praśaṃsāyām|| 47||

vibhāgaśo 'vayavānnirvarṇyedānīṃ nikurumbīkṛtyāha---

sarvopamādravyasamuccayena yathāpradeśaṃ viniveśitena|
sā nirmitā viśvasṛjā prayatnādekasthasaundaryadidṛkṣayeva|| 48||

kiṃ bahunā---sarveṣāmupamādravyāṇāṃ śaśikamalakuvalayarambhādīnāṃ samuccayena
saṃghaṭanena sā devī pravīṇena dhātrā vinirmitā| tena ca
yathāpradeśaṃ yathānurūpaṃ viniveśitena| śaśikalamaśobhā hi mukha eva
racitā, kuvalayakāntirnetrayoḥ , kadalīcārutorvorevetyādi|
utprekṣyate| ekasthasaundaryadidṛkṣayevaupamānavastusamuccayena
nirmitā| dravyāṇāṃ samuccayaṃ tāvadvikīrṇamadhunaikasthaṃ paśyāmi
kīdṛśametaditi| ato buddhyaiva vidhinotpāditetyarthaḥ|
upamīyate yenetyupamā| tadākhyāni ca tāni dravyāṇi
teṣāṃ samuccayastena| yo yaḥ pradeśo yathāpradeśam|| 48||

tāṃ nāradaḥ kāmacaraḥ kadācitkanyāṃ kila prekṣya pituḥ samīpe|
samādideśaikavadhūṃ bhavitrīṃ premṇā śarīrārdhaharāṃ harasya|| 49||

tataḥ kadācidevaṃrūpāṃ tāṃ kumārīṃ janakābhyāse vilokya svecchācārī nāradamunirharasyaikavadhūṃ bhavitrīmasapatnīkāṃ bhāryāṃ bhāvinīṃ samādideśoktavān|
premṇā prītivaśāccharīrādhaharāmardhadehamākramya sthitām|
kiletyāgamasūcanārthaḥ| 
evaṃ hyuktam---eṣā bhāryā priyā bhartuḥ śaṅkarasya śarīrādhaharā bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ| 
kāmena svecchayā caratyaṭatītikāmacaraḥ| bhaviṣyatīti bhavitrī|
śarīrārdhaśabde samapravibhāgavivakṣāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhīsamāsaḥ|| 49||

guruḥ pragalbhe 'pi vayasyato 'syāstasthau nivṛttānyavarābhilāṣaḥ|
ṛte kṛśānorna hi mantrapūtamarhanti tejāṃsyaparāṇi havyam|| 50||

yato nārada evamādiṣṭavānataḥ kāraṇādguruḥ pitāsyāstāruṇye 'pi nivṛttānyavarābhilāṣastasthau| 
nivṛtto 'nyasminvare bhartaryabhilāṣo yasya sa evaṃvidha āsīt|
harādanyaṃ varaṃ manasāpi na cakāretyarthaḥ| 
yataḥ kṛśānorṛte vahniṃ vinā mantreṇa pūtaṃ havyamāhutimanyāni tejāṃsi nārhanti bhoktuṃ na śaknuvanti| 
hūyata iti havyam| kṛśānoriti ṛteśabdaprayoge pañcamī|| 50||

tarhi svayameva tātaḥ sa kasmāttāṃ harāya na dadāvityāha---

ayācitāraṃ na hi devadevamadriḥ sutāṃ grāhayituṃ śaśāka|
abhyarthanābhaṅgabhayena sādhurmādhyasthyamiṣṭe 'pyavalambate 'rthe|| 51||

devadevaṃ maheśvaramaprārthayamānaṃ santaṃ himavānduhitaraṃ grāhayituṃ na
śaśāka| yāvadbhagavatā sā nābhyarthitā tāvattasmai giristāṃ na
dadāvityarthaḥ| kiśabdo 'trottarāśrayahetvarthaḥ|
yasmānmanasvyabhimate 'pi vastuni mādhyasthyamaudāsīnyamavalambate
śrayati| kena| prārthanābhaṅgatrāsena| kadācittāmapi
nāṅgīkuryāditi| `gatyarthānāṃ tathaiva ca'
iti cakārādgrahiprabhṛtiyoge 'pi dvikarmakatā| yathā
`ajigrahattaṃ janako dhanustat'
`devāsurairamṛtamambunidhirmamanthe'
`muktājālaṃ ciraparicitaṃ tyājito daivagatyā'
`tvāmapyasraṃ navajalamayaṃ mocayiṣyatyavaśyam'
`gargāḥ śataṃ daṇḍyantām'
iti|| 51||

idānimīśvaravyāpāraṃ vivarṇayiṣurāha---

yadaiva pūrve janane śarīraṃ sā dakṣaroṣātsvayamutsasarja|
tadā prabhṛtyeva vimuktasaṅgaḥ patiḥ paśūnāmaparigraho 'bhūt|| 52||

yasminneva kāle pūrvasmiñjanane janmani devī
pitṛkopātsvayaṃ dehamatyākṣīttata evārabhya
parihṛtaviṣayatvādbhūtanātho 'parigraho 'bhūdakṛtadāra āsīt|
premavaśādbrahmacaryaṃ cacāretyarthaḥ| tadeti
pañcamyarthavṛttirnipātaḥ|
sañjanti teṣviti saṅgā viṣayāḥ| parigṛhyata iti
parigraho dārāḥ|| 52||

sa kṛttivāsāstapase yatātmā gaṅgāprapātokṣitadevadāru|
prasthaṃ himādrermṛganābhigandhi kiṃcitkvaṇatkiṃnaramadhyuvāsa|| 53||

kṛttirgajājinaṃ vāso 'mbaraṃ yasya sa bhagavānsaṃyatendriyastaporthaṃ himādreḥ prasthaṃ sānumadhyuvāsa bheje| kīdṛśam| 
gaṅgāyāḥ prapātena nirjharāmbhasokṣitāḥ siktā devadāravo yatra|
mṛgāṇāṃ kastūrikākuraṅgāṇāṃ nābhigandho vidyate yatra| kiṃcinna
tūccaiḥ kvaṇanto gāyantaḥ kiṃnarā yatreti sevyatvakathanam|
prasthaśabdaḥ puṃnapuṃsakayoḥ|| 53||

gaṇā nameruprasavāvataṃsā bhūrjatvacaḥ sparśavatīrvasānāḥ|
manaḥśilāvicchuritā niṣeduḥ śaileyanaddheṣu śilātaleṣu|| 54||

gaṇāḥ pramathāḥ śilātaleṣūpalapaṭṭeṣu niṣedurupaviviśuḥ| yatra
hi bhagavāṃstatra tairbhāvyam| kīdṛśāḥ|
namervākhyā vṛkṣā vīrudho vā teṣāṃ prasavena
puṣpaphalenāvataṃsaḥ śekharo yeṣām| tathā
sparśavatīḥ komalā bhūrjatvaco vasānāḥ paridadhataḥ| manaḥśilayā
dhātuviśeṣeṇa vicchuritā avaliptāḥ| teṣu tu
śaileyaiḥ śilākusumairnaddheṣu channeṣu| śileva śaileyam|
vasterḍhañi prakṛte
`śilāyā ḍhaḥ '
iti yogavibhāgāḍḍhañ||
54||

tuṣārasaṃghātaśilāḥ khurāgraiḥ samullikhandarpakalaḥ kakudmān|
dṛṣṭaḥ kathaṃcidgavayairvivignairasoḍhasiṃhadhvanirunnanāda|| 55||

kakudmānharavṛṣabha unnanāda jagarja| kīdṛśaḥ|
himānīḥ śaphāgrairullikhandārayan| darpakalo madamadhuraḥ|
ataścāsoḍhasiṃhadhvaniḥ kesariṇāṃ nādamapyakṣamamāṇaḥ| ata eva
gavayākhyaiḥ prāṇibhirvivignaiḥ khinnaiḥ kathaṃciddūrādīkṣitaḥ|
kakudvidyate yasyāsau kakudmān| yavāditvādvatvābhāvaḥ|
dānto 'yaṃ na tu tāntaḥ| vivigna iti ovijeḥ|| 55||

tatrāgnimādhāya samitsamiddhaṃ svameva mūrtyantaramaṣṭamūrtiḥ|
svayaṃ vidhātā tapasaḥ phalānāṃ kenāpi kāmena tapaścacāra|| 56||

tatra himavatsānāvagnyādhānaṃ kṛtvā bhagavānkenāpi kāmena
kayāpyajñātecchayā tapaścacāra| ajñānasya kāraṇamāha|
tapasaḥ phalānāṃ svargāpavargāṇāṃ svayaṃ karteśvaratvāt|
kīdṛśamagnim| samidbhiredhaiḥ samiddhaṃ dīptam| tathā svameva
mūrtyantaramātmīyameva tanuviśeṣam| yato 'sāvaṣṭamūrtiḥ|
kṣitikalapavanahutāśanayajamānākāśasomasūryā hi śambhormūrtayaḥ|
anyā mūrtirmūrtyantaramiti supsupeti
samāsaḥ|| 56||

anarghyamarghyeṇa tamadrināthaḥ svargaukasāmarcitamarcayitvā|
ārādhanāyāsya sakhīsametāṃ samādideśa prayatāṃ tanūjām|| 57||

tato nijasānuni tapasyantamīśaṃ jñātvā nāradavacanamanusmarannageśastamarghyeṇābhyarcyārcāpūrvametatsevārthaṃ vayasyāsahitāṃ saniyamāṃ sutāṃ samādideśājñāpitavān|
kīdṛśaṃ tam| anarghyamapricchedyamajñeyatvāt|
svargaukasāṃ devānāmarcitaṃ pūjyam| `ktasya ca vartamāne'
iti ṣaṣṭhī| arghārthamudakādikamarghyam| `pādārghābhyāṃ ca'
iti yat| oko gṛham| tanuśabda ūkārānto 'pi|| 57||

pratyarthibhūtāmapi tāṃ samādheḥ śuśrūṣamāṇāṃ giriśo 'numene|
vikārahetau sati vikriyante yeṣāṃ na cetāṃsi ta eva dhīrāḥ|| 58||

tāṃ devīṃ śuśrūṣamāṇāṃ sevamānāṃ satīṃ bhagavānanumene 'ṅgīcakāra|
ananumananaṃ ca prāptam| 
yataḥ samādherniyamasya pratyarthibhūtāṃ strītvātpratipakṣarūpām|
pratyarthitvaṃ bhūtāṃ prāptāṃ pratyarthibhūtām| 
yadi vā bhūtaśabda upamānavacanaḥ| vipakṣasadṛśīmityarthaḥ|
kathaṃ tarhyanumena ityāha| 
yasmādvikārahetau satyapi yeṣāṃ manāṃsi na vikriyante vikāraṃ na nīyante ta eva dhīrāḥ sattvavantaḥ| 
śuśrūṣā sevā| śrotumiccheti tu paraṃ vyutpattimātram| 
sevāyāṃ vā śravaṇaṃ vidyate| grahaṇaṃ vidyata ityarthaḥ| 
sevako hi śṛṇoti na tvavahelayati| `jñāśrusmṛdṛśāṃ sanas'
ityātmanepadam| vikriyanta iti karmaṇi| karmakartari tu
`veḥ śabdakarmaṇaḥ '
`akarmakācca'
ityātmanepadākarmakatvāt `ṇiśranthigranthi'
iti yaṅniṣedhaḥ syāt|| 58||

avacitabalipuṣpā vedisaṃmārgadakṣā niyamavidhijalānāṃ barhiṣāṃ copanetrī|
giriśamupacacāra pratyahaṃ sā sukeśī niyamitaparikhedā tacchiraścandrapādaiḥ|| 59||

sā sukeśī devyanujñātā satī pratyahamanudinaṃ giriśamupacacāra siṣeve| 
tāmeva sevāmāha---avacitānyuccitāni balyarthaṃ pūjārthaṃ puṣpāṇi yayā sā| 
vedisaṃmārge 'gnisaṃmārjane dakṣā caturā| 
niyamavidhijalānāṃ barhiṣāṃ darbhāṇāṃ copanetrī ḍhaukinī| 
etatkāraṇādyaḥ parikhedaḥ śramaḥ sa haramaulimṛgāṅkamayūkhairniyamito 'pāsto yasyā iti bhagavatprasādadarśanaphalam| 
saṃmārjanaṃ saṃmārgaḥ| ghañ|
`mṛjervṛddhiḥ '|
`cajoḥ ku'
iti kutvam| upanayatītyupanetrī| ahanyahani pratyaham|
yathārthe 'vyayībhāvaḥ| `anaśca'
`napuṃsakādanyatarasyām'
iti ṭac ṭilopaḥ| sukeśīti `svāṅgāccopasarjanāt'
iti ṅī.ḥ| mālinīvṛttam|| 59||

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ prathamaḥ sargaḥ||

 Dvitīyaḥ sargaḥ|

tasminviprakṛtāḥ kāle tārakeṇa divaukasaḥ|
turāsāhaṃ purodhāya dhāma svāyambhuvaṃ yayuḥ|| 1||

yadā girijā giriśamavarivasyattasminnevāvasare tārakeṇa vajrāṅgatanayenāsureṇa viprakṛtā upadrutāḥ santo divaukaso devāsturāsāhamindraṃ purodhāyāgrekṛtya svāyambhuvaṃ dhāma brahmalokaṃ yayurjagmuḥ| divaśabdo 'kārānto 'pi|
yathā `diśo bāhū divaṃ śiraḥ '|
vainyādivadbhāṣāyāmapi turāṣā.cchabdaḥ|
svayambhūrbrahmā tasyedaṃ svāyambhuvam|
`saṃjñāpūrvako vidhiranityas'
iti `orguṇas'
iti guṇābhāvaḥ| sarge 'sminnanuṣṭubho vṛttam|| 1||

teṣāmāvirabhūdbrahmā parimlānamukhaśriyām|
sarasāṃ suptapadmānāṃ prātardīdhitimāniva|| 2||

tārakaviprakārānnaṣṭamukhakāntīnāṃ devānāṃ viriñca āvirabhūtpratyakṣībhūtaḥ|
na tu darśanavighna udapādi| 
yathā saṃkucitāravindānāṃ toyāśayānāṃ prabhāte ravirāvirbhavatītyupamā| 
anena śokavināśānmukhaprasādaḥ sūcitaḥ|| 2||

atha sarvasya dhātāraṃ sarve te sarvatomukham|
vāgīśaṃ vāgbhirarthyābhiḥ praṇipatyopatasthire|| 3||

tato 'khilā eva surā vāgīśaṃ brahmāṇaṃ prahvībhūyārthyābhiḥ satyābhirgīrbhirupatasthire tuṣṭuvire| 
kīdṛśaṃ tam| sarvasya viśvasya dhātāraṃ sraṣṭāram|
sarvatomukhaṃ caturmukham| yadi vā bahudvāramakhilāgamastutyatvāt|
vācāṃ vedaśāstramayīnāmīśaṃ prabhavaṃ patiṃ ca| yaduktam---
        yogo jñānaṃ tathā sāṃkhyaṃ vidyāḥ śilpāni karma ca|
        vedāḥ śāstrāṇi vijñānametatsarvaṃ pitāmahāt||
arthādanapetā acalitā arthyā anadhyāropitārthāḥ|
`dharmapathyarthanyāyādanapete'|
upatasthire iti `upāddevapūjā'
iti taṅ|| 3||

tāmeva nutimāha---

namastrimūrtaye tubhyaṃ prāksṛṣṭeḥ kevalātmane|
guṇatrayavibhāgāya paścādbhedamupeyuṣe|| 4||

trimūrtaya hariharabrahmavapuṣe tubhyaṃ namaḥ| 
sṛṣṭestu pūrvaṃ kevalātmane 'bhinnarūpāya| 
guṇānāmakṣubhitatvāt|
tato guṇatrayasya sattvarajastamolakṣaṇasya vibhāgāya|
paścādbhedaṃ brahmaviṣṇusrudralakṣaṇamupeyuṣe prāptāya|
avibhaktā hi guṇā na kāryakaraṇakṣamā iti
devamanuṣyatiryagrūpāṃ prajāṃ nirmātuṃ na ghaṭate| guṇavibhāgācca
trimūrtitvamāgatameva| taduktam---
        namo rajojuṣe sṛṣṭau sthitau sattvamayāya ca|
        tamomayāya saṃhāre trirūpāya svayambhuve||
4||

yadamoghamapāmantaruptaṃ bījamaja tvayā|
ataścarācaraṃ viśvaṃ prabhavastasya gīyase|| 5||

he aja sanātana yattvayāpāmantastoyamadhye 'moghamavandhyaṃ kāryajananaṃ bījaṃ vīryamuptaṃ kṣiptamato bījāccarācaraṃ sthāvarajaṅgamātmakaṃ viśvaṃ jagat|
ataśca tasya viśvasya tvaṃ prabhavaḥ kāraṇaṃ gīyase munibhiruśyase|
yaduktam---
        so 'bhidhyāya śarīrātsvātsisṛkṣurvividhāḥ prajāḥ|
        ata eva sasarjādau tāsu vīryamathākṣipat||
caraṃ cācaraṃ ca carācaram| prabhavatyasmāditi prabhavaḥ|| 5||

tisṛbhistvamavasthābhirmahimānamudīrayan|
pralayasthitisargāṇāmekaḥ kāraṇatāṃ gataḥ|| 6||

tvaṃ haraharibrahmarūpābhistisṛbhiravasthābhirdaśābhiḥ 
mahimānaṃ māhātmyamudīrayankathayanpralayasthitisargāṇāṃ 
saṃhārarakṣāsṛṣṭīnāmeka eva kāraṇatāṃ gato nidānatvaṃ prāptaḥ|
yaduktam---
        brahmatve sṛjate lokāṃ kālatve saṃharatyapi|
        puruṣatva udāsīnastisro 'vasthāḥ svayambhuvaḥ||
sthitiḥ sattāpālanam|| 6||

strīpuṃsāvātmabhāgau te bhinnamūrteḥ sisṛkṣayā|
prasūtibhājaḥ sargasya tāveva pitarau smṛtau|| 7||

strīpuṃsau prakṛtipuruṣau tavātmano bhāgāvaṃśau|
yataḥ sraṣṭumicchayā bhinnamūrterdvidhākṛtavapuṣastāveva strīpuṃsau prasūtibhājo yonijasya sargasya pitarau mātāpitarau smṛtāvuktau| 
yaduktam---
        dvidhākṛtātmano dehamardhena puruṣo 'bhavat|
        ardhena nārī tasyāṃ sa virājamasṛjatprabhuḥ||
prākṛtamānasādīnāmapi sargāṇāṃ sambhavātprasūtibhāggrahaṇam|
strī ca pumāṃśca strīpuṃsau| acaturāditvādac| mātā ca pitā ca tau
pitarau| `pitā mātrā'|| 7||

svakālaparimāṇena vyastarātriṃdivasya te|
yau svapnabodhau tāveva bhūtānāṃ pralayodayau|| 8||

tava yau svapnabodhau tāveva prāṇināṃ pralayodayau vināśāvirbhāvau|
yaduktam---
        yadā sa devo jāgarti tadedaṃ ceṣṭate jagat|
        yadā svapiti śāntātmā tadā sarvaṃ pralīyate||
kīdṛśasya te| svakālaparimāṇena nijasamayamānena
vyastaṃ vibhāgīkṛtaṃ rātriṃdivamahorātrau yena tasya| [yaduktam---]
        sahasrayugaparyantamaharyadbrahmaṇo viduḥ|
        rātriṃ yugasahasrāntāṃ te 'horātravido janāḥ||
anyatrāpyuktam---
        yadetatparisaṃkhyātamādau martyacaturyugam|
        etaddvādaśasāhasraṃ devānāṃ yugamucyate||
        daivikānāṃ yugānāṃ tu sahasraparisaṃkhyayā|
        brāhmamekamaharjñeyaṃ tāvatī rātrireva ca||
dvandve
divāśabdaḥ prātipadikārthamātravṛttirnādhikaraṇārthavṛttiḥ|
nityaṃ hyadhikaraṇārthatve `doṣāmanyamahaḥ '
`divāmanyā rātris'
iti karmabhāvo durghaṭaḥ|| 8||

jagadyonirayonistvamananto jagato 'ntakaḥ|
jagadādiranādistvaṃ jagadīśo 'pyanīśvaraḥ|| 9||

brahmatvena tvaṃ jagatāṃ yoniḥ prabhavaḥ| tatrādhikaraṇārthavṛttiḥ|
tava tu na kaścidyonirajatvāt| 
tathā tvaṃ viśvasyāntako rudrarūpeṇa saṃhārāt| 
tava tu na kaścidanto 'ntakārī avināśitvāt| 
tathā jagata ādistvaṃ purāṇatvāt| tava tu na kaścidādirnityatvāt| tathā
jagatastvamīśvarastvadāyattatvātsargasthitilayānām| tava tu na
kaścidīśvaraḥ paripūrṇatvāt| apirvirodhe sarvatra sambandhanīyaḥ|
virodhastu padānāṃ tatpuruṣāśrayaṇena bahuvrīhiṇā tvavirodhaḥ||
9||

ātmānamātmanā vetsi sṛjasyātmānamātmanā|
ātmanā kṛtinā ca tvamātmanyeva pralīyase|| 10||

tava sraṣṭā saṃhartā veditā ca nānyaḥ kaścidastīti vākyārthaḥ|
atha yo nityastasya svayamapi kīdṛśau sargasaṃhārau|
avatārabhedenetyadoṣaḥ| tadīyā hyaṃśāḥ kāryārthamutpadyante
ca pralīyante ca| yadi vā puruṣabahutvāditthamuktam| kṛtinā
pravīṇena sarvavidā| pralīyasa iti laṭkartari|| 10||

dravaḥ saṃghātakaṭhinaḥ sthūlaḥ sūkṣmo laghurguruḥ|
vyakto vyaktetaraścāsi prākāmyaṃ te vibhūtiṣe|| 11||

tava vibhūtiṣu bhūmyādiṣu mahimāsu prākāmyaṃ bāhulyaṃ yathecchatā
vā| tathā hi tvameva dravo rasātmakaḥ|
saṃghātaḥ paramāṇusamūhaḥ sa cāsau tena vā kaṭhinaḥ kaṭhoraḥ|
saṃghātarūpatvātkaṭhina ityarthaḥ|
sthūlaḥ pṛthivyādimahābhūtamayatvāt|
sūkṣma indriyaśaktyātmakatvāt| lāghavagaurave api tvadīye vibhūtī|
sarvaśaktyātmakatvādbrahmaṇaḥ| sthūlo 'pi laghurnāvādivadbhavati|
sūkṣmo 'pi guruḥ kanakalavavatpṛthagupādānam|
tathā tvameva vyakto dṛśyo mahadādirūpatvāt|
vyaktetaraścāvyaktaḥ prakṛtipuruṣamayatvāt|
tadidaṃ yatkiṃciddṛśyādṛśyameva bhavadvibhavalava iti
vākyārthaḥ|| 11||

udgīthaḥ praṇavo yāsāṃ nyāyaistribhirudīraṇam|
karma yajñaḥ phalaṃ svargastāsāṃ tvaṃ prabhavo girām|| 12||

tāsāṃ girāṃ vācāṃ tvaṃ prabhava utpattisthānam|
kāsāmityāha---yāsāṃ praṇavaḥ .okāra udgīthākhyaḥ| vede
hyasyodgīthasaṃjñayā vyavahāraḥ|
kecittvārambhakaṃ samāpakaṃ codgīthamāhuḥ| pāṭhe
hyavaśyamādyantayoḥ .okāraḥ prayujyate| yāsāṃ ca
tribhirnyāyairvyavasthābhistāramandramadhyaiḥ saṃhitāpadakramairvā
udāttānudāttasvaritairvā adhyayanādhyāpanakarmabhirvā
ṛgyajuḥsāmabhirvā udīraṇamuccāraṇam| 
yāsāṃ ca karma yajño yajamānavyāpāraḥ phalaṃ ca svargaḥ|
tāsāṃ śrutīnāmityarthaḥ| 
tena vedānāṃ tvaṃ prathamaḥ smartā pravartaka ityuktaṃ bhavati|| 12||

tvāmāmananti prakṛtiṃ puruṣārthapravartinīm|
taddarśinamudāsīnaṃ tvāmeva puruṣaṃ viduḥ|| 13||

sāṃkhyāstvāṃ prakṛtiṃ buddhimāmananti kathayanti| mno manaḥ|
kīdṛśīm| puruṣārthena jñaprayojanena pravartata iti
puruṣārthapravartinī tām| sarvā hi prakṛtiḥ puruṣasya
bhogārthaṃ guṇapuruṣabhedajñānārthaṃ ca| uktaṃ ca---
        jñānaṃ pratyupabhogaṃ yasmātpuruṣasya sādhayati buddhiḥ|
        saiva ca viśinaṣṭi punaḥ pradhānapuruṣāntaraṃ sūkṣmam||
yo 'pi cāsau puruṣastaṃ tvāmeva vidurjānanti| kīdṛśam|
tāṃ prakṛtiṃ paśyatīti taddarśī tam| draṣṭā hi puruṣo dṛśyā tu
buddhiriti kāpilāḥ| tathā udāsīnaṃ niṣkriyam| yaduktam---
        tasmācca viparyāsātsiddhaṃ sākṣitvamasya puruṣasya|
        kaivalyaṃ mādhyasthyaṃ draṣṭṛtvamakartṛbhāvaśca||
13||

tvaṃ pitṝṇāmapi pitā devānāmapi devatā|
parato 'pi paraścāsi vidhātā vedhasāmapi|| 14||

pitaraḥ saptavidhā devaviśeṣāsteṣāmapi tvaṃ pitā śrāddhe
tarpaṇīyatvāt| devānāmapīndrādīnāṃ tvaṃ devatā yājyatvāt|
parato 'pi sūkṣmebhyo 'pīndriyādibhyastvaṃ paraḥ sūkṣmatamaḥ|
yaduktam---
        indriyebhyaḥ parā hyarthā arthebhyastu paraṃ manaḥ|
        manasastu parā buddhirbuddherātmā tato mahān||
        mahataḥ paramavyaktamavyaktātpuruṣaḥ paraḥ|
        puruṣānna paraṃ kiṃcitsā kāṣṭhā sā parā gatiḥ||
tathā vedhasāṃ prajāpatīnāmapi
dakṣamanvādīnāṃ tvaṃ vedhāḥ sraṣṭā| apirvismaye|| 14||

tvameva havyaṃ hotā ca bhojyaṃ bhiktā ca śāśvatam|
vedyaṃ ca veditā cāsi dhyātā dhyeyaṃ ca yatparam|| 15||

kartṛkarmaṇoradvaitamāśritya stutiriyam| 
yo juhoti yacca hūyate yo vidhivadbhuṅkte yacca bhujyate yo vetti yacca vedyaṃ jñeyaṃ yo dhyātā yacca paramutkṛṣṭaṃ dhyeyaṃ tatsarvātmakaṃ tvameva brahmeti|
śāśvatamanaśvaram| 
eṣa tāvaduttānaḥ stutyartho lāghavādvyākhyātaḥ| 
vistarastu śāstrāntaraparyālocanāt|| 15||

iti tebhyo nutīḥ śrutvā yathārthā hṛdayaṃgamāḥ|
prasādābhimukho vedhāḥ pratyuvāca divaukasaḥ|| 16||

itthaṃ surebhyo nutīrākarṇya prasādenābhimukho vedhā brahmā gīrvāṇānpratīdamavocat| 
kīdṛśīḥ| yathārthāḥ satyābhidheyāḥ|
ata eva hṛdayaṃgamā manaḥpriyāḥ| gamaśceti khac|| 16||

purāṇasya kavestasya caturmukhasamīritā|
pravṛttirāsīcchabdānāṃ caritārthā catuṣṭayī|| 17||

kavirāha| 
tasyādyasya kaveḥ sarvavidaścaturbhirvaktrairuccāritā śabdānāṃ dravyaguṇakriyājātibhedena catuṣṭayī pravṛttiścaritārthā kṛtārthābhavat| 
sākṣādbhagavaduktatvāt|
caturṇāṃ mukhānāṃ samāhāraścaturmukham| pātrādiḥ|
catvāro 'vayavā yasyāḥ sā catuṣṭayī| `saṃkhyāyā avayave tayap'|
`hrasvāttādau taddhite'
iti ṣatvam|| 17||

kimuvācetyāha---

svāgataṃ svānadhikārānprabhāvairavalambya vaḥ|
yugapadyugabāhubhyaḥ prāptebhyaḥ prājyavikramāḥ|| 18||

he prājyavikramāḥ prabhūtavīryā vo yuṣmabhyaṃ svāgatam| āgamanasya
pūjādvāreṇāśīḥ suśabdena pratipādyate| `kriyāgrahaṇamapi'
iti sampradānatvam| kīdṛśebhyo vaḥ|
svānadhikārānniyogānmahimābhiravalambya parigṛhya
yugapadāgatebhyaḥ| na hyādityā nabhogatiṃ hitvā tatrāgatāḥ|
yugapramāṇā bāhavo yeṣāṃ yebhyo yugabāhubhya ājānubhujebhyaḥ|
hastadvayadvayasaṃ yugam|| 18||

kimidaṃ dyutimātmīyāṃ na bibhrati yathā purā|
himakliṣṭaprasādāni jyotīṃṣīva mukhāni vaḥ|| 19||

vo yuṣmākaṃ vaktrāṇi pūrvaṃ yathā
kāntimabibharurdhṛtavantastathādya
na bibhrati na vahanti| kimidaṃ brūta me|
himena nīhāreṇa kliṣṭaḥ kadarthitaḥ prasādo nairmalyaṃ yeṣāṃ tāni jyotīṃṣi tārā yathā dyutiṃ na dadhati tathā bhavadvadanāni|| 19||

idānīmetadeva viśeṣeṇāha--

praśamādarciṣāmetadanudgīrṇasurāyudham|
vṛtrasya hantuḥ kuliśaṃ kuṇṭhitāśrīva lakṣyate|| 20||

vṛtrāsurariporindrasya vajramidaṃ kuṇṭhitāśrīva bhagnadhāramiva dṛśyate| 
kimidam|
ata evārciṣāṃ praśamāddīptīnāṃ nirvāṇādanudgīrṇasurāyudhamaniṣṭhitendracāpam|
śakradhanurhi vajradyutiprasarādudetītyāhuḥ| aśrirdhārā|| 20||

kiṃ cāyamaridurvāraḥ pāṇau pāśaḥ pracetasaḥ|
mantreṇa hatavīryasya phaṇino dainyamāśritaḥ|| 21||

kasmācca ayaṃ varuṇasya pāśo yaḥ pūrvamaridurvāra āsītso 'dya
mantreṇa hatavīryasya phaṇino nāgasya dainyaṃ viklavavatvamāśritaḥ|
nirviṣasarpavannaṣṭaśaktiḥ sampanna ityarthaḥ|| 21||

kuberasya manaḥśalyaṃ śaṃsatīva parābhavam|
apaviddhagado bāhurbhagnaśākha iva drumaḥ|| 22||

apaviddhā tyaktā gadā yena so 'paviddhagado vaiśravaṇasya bhujo manasaḥ śalyabhūtaṃ pīḍākāramariparibhavaṃ kathayatīva| 
na hyaparibhūtaḥ svāyudhaṃ kṣipati| 
ata eva kuberasya mlānaśarīrasya gadātyāgācca chinnaśākhatarutulyatā|| 22||

yamo 'pi vilikhanbhūmiṃ daṇḍenāstamitatviṣā|
kurute 'sminnamoghe 'pi nirvāṇālātalāghavam|| 23||

vaivasvato 'pyayaṃ vailakṣyātsvāyudhena daṇḍenorvīmullikhanpracaṇḍe 'pyasmindaṇḍe nirvāṇasya praśāntasyālātasyolmukaśeṣasya yallāghavamanādarastatkurute|
yato 'stamitatviṣā naṣṭakāntinā| `nirvāṇo 'vāte'|| 23||

amī ca kathamādityāḥ pratāpakṣatiśītalāḥ|
citranyastā iva gatāḥ prakāmālokanīyatām|| 24||

ete ca sūryāḥ pratāpakṣatiśītalatvātkasmādālekhyagatā iva
prakāmaṃ yathecchamālokanīyatāṃ gatā dṛśyatvaṃ prāptāḥ|
pūrvaṃ hyete manāgapi vīkṣitā dṛṣṭimadhākṣuḥ|| 24||

paryākulatvānmarutāṃ vegabhaṅgo 'numīyate|
ambhasāmoghasaṃrodhaḥ pratīpagamanādiva|| 25||

marutāṃ vāyūnāṃ vegabhaṅgo rayarodho 'numīyata ūhyate|
kutaḥ| paryākulatvātpuñjībhūtatvātsambhrāntatvāt| 
vegāddhi prasaranto nākulā bhavanti| 
yathā jalānāṃ pūrarodhaḥ pratīpagamanāttarkyate|| 25||

āvarjitajaṭāmaulivilambiśaśikoṭayaḥ|
rudrāṇāmapi mūrdhānaḥ kṣatahuṃkāraśaṃsinaḥ|| 26||

anantaprabhāvānāṃ rudrāṇāmapi devaviśeṣāṇāṃ mūrdhānaḥ kṣataṃ naṣṭaṃ huṃkāramasraviśeṣaṃ śaṃsanti|
te tathāvidhā jātāḥ|
yata āvarjitajaṭāmaulivilambiśaśikoṭayaḥ| 
jaṭā eva maulayo mukuṭāni tadākāratvāt| 
jaṭārūpā vā maulayaḥ keśāḥ| jaṭānāṃ vā maulayaḥ| 
āvarjitāḥ srastā ye jaṭāmaulayasteṣu vilambinī śaśikoṭiryeṣu| 
muktakeśatā hi paribhavaśaṃsinī| kṣatāhaṃkāraśaṃsina iti jaratpāṭho 'tra
ramyataraḥ|| 26|| 

labdhapratiṣṭhāḥ prathamaṃ yūyaṃ hi balavattaraiḥ|
apavādairivotsargāḥ kṛtavyāvṛttayaḥ paraiḥ|| 27||

ataśca pūrvaṃ ye bhavanto labdhapratiṣṭhāḥ prāptasthitayaste 'dya kimiti balibhiḥ parairaribhiḥ kṛtavyāvṛttayo vihitāspadabhaṅgāḥ|
apavādairivotsargāḥ| 
sāmānyalakṣaṇaṃ hi prathamaṃ svaviṣaye labdhapratiṣṭhamapi pareṇa viśeṣalakṣaṇena balavattvādātmaviṣaye 'pāsyate|| 27||

tadbrūta vatsāḥ kimitaḥ prārthayadhve samāgatāḥ|
mayi sṛṣṭirhi lokānāṃ rakṣā yuṣmāsvavasthitā|| 28||

he putrakā yadi parābhūtā yūyaṃ tatkathayata|
kimito matsakāśātprārthayadhva icchatha|
kiṃśabdaḥ saṃśayapūrvake praśne| sargarakṣayormadhyādyadi sṛṣṭimarthayadhve tadbhadram| 
yasmādvedhasi sṛṣṭirāyattā|
rakṣā  tu bhavatsu lokapāleṣu| prārthayadhvamityapapāṭhaḥ|
saṃśayapraśne loḍarthasyāvācakatvāt| 
niṣedhapare hi vākyārthe vidhyartho yujyate| yathā---

kiṃ dadātu kimaśnātu bhartavyabharaṇākulaḥ|
udāramatirāpte 'pi jagattritayamātrake||

atra ca kiṃ vastu bhavanto 'rthayanta iti saṃśaye laṭprayoga eva nyāyyaḥ||28||

tato mandāniloddhūtakamalākaraśobhinā|
guruṃ netrasahasreṇa codayāmāsa vāsavaḥ|| 29||

tadbrūteti śravaṇākāṅkṣāmavadhāryānantaramindraḥ suragurumakṣiṣaṇḍenācūcudat|
ataśca kampavaśānmṛdupavanakampitasarasijavanakāntinā|
animeṣāṇāmapi devānāmicchāvaśānnetracalanaṃ yujyata iti
nāstrākṣinikoco durghaṭaḥ|| 29||

sa dvinetraṃ hareścakṣuḥ sahasranayanādhikam|
vācaspatiruvācedaṃ prāñjalirjalajāsanam|| 30||

tataḥ sa bṛhaspatirbaddhāñjalirviriñcamidaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ jagāda|
kiṃbhūtaḥ| dvinetramapi harerindrasya nayanasahasrādhikaṃ cakṣurnetram|
cakṣuriva cakṣuḥ|
yāvatkilāsau tenekṣate na tāvannayanasahasreṇa| 
ata eva taccodanam| 
netraviśeṣaṇatve 'spi gurorevaite viśeṣaṇe boddhavye| tasyaiva cakṣuṣo rūpitatvāt| 
sahasraṃ nayanāni samāhṛtāni sahasranayanam| taddhitārthottarapadasamāhāre ca|
dvigurekavacanam|
vainyagiriśavadbhāṣāyāṃ vācaspatiśabdaḥ|| 30||

kimuvācetyāha---

evaṃ yathāttha bhagavannāmṛṣṭaṃ naḥ paraiḥ padam|
pratyekaṃ viniyuktātmā kathaṃ na jñāsyati prabhuḥ|| 2.31||

he bhagavanyathā tvamāttha nirūpayasi labdhapratiṣṭhā ityevametat| 
yato no 'smākamaribhirāspadamāmṛṣṭamutpuṃsitamapahṛtam|
na ca bhagavajjñānametadadbhutam|
yato yaḥ sarvasyātmarūpeṇāvasthita īśvaraḥ sa kathamiva na jñāsyati na vetti| 
āttheti bruvaḥ pañcānāmādita āho bruvaḥ|
bhagavanniti pūjāpadam| 

aiśvaryasya samagrasya dharmasya yaśasaḥ śriyaḥ|

vairāgyasyātha mokṣasya ṣaṇṇāṃ bhaga iti smṛtiḥ|| 

jñāsyatīti apahnave jñaḥ 
akarmakācca
ityātmanepadaṃ vibhāṣitam| 
vartamāne 'pi lṛṭaṃ prāyeṇa prayuñjate| 
yathā---svasti te 'stu gamiṣyāmi|
kārye guruṇyātmasamaṃ niyokṣye
tasyāḥ kariṣyāmi dṛḍhānutāpame
ityādau|| 31||

āmṛṣṭaṃ naḥ paraiḥ padamiti 
sāmānyenoktvā viśeṣeṇāha---

bhavallabdhavarodīrṇastārakākhyo mahāsuraḥ|
upaplavāya lokānāṃ dhūmaketurivotthitaḥ|| 32||

bhavatsakāśāllabdhena vareṇodīrṇaḥ pracaṇḍo vajrāṅgātmajastārako nāma mahādaityo jagato bādhārtho dhūmaketuvadutthitaḥ|
ketūdayo hi lokopadravāya| dhūmākāraḥ keturdhūmaketuḥ| 
sa cātiviṣamaḥ| udīrṇa iti ṛgatau ktaḥ| 
ṛta iddhātoḥ|
raparatvam|| 
32||

tatrodīrṇatvaṃ tāvadāha---

pure tāvantamevāsya tanoti ravirātapam|
dīrghikākamalonmeṣo yāvanmātreṇa sādhyate| 33||

tadīye nagare tāvanmātramarkastapati yāvatā padminīnalinavikāso janyate| 
na tvadhikaṃ tadbhayāt|
dīrghikāśabde saṃjñāyāṃ kan|
yatparimāṇamasya yāvān| 
tataḥ svārthe mātrac|| 33||

sarvābhiḥ sarvadā candrastaṃ kalābhirniṣevate|
nādatte kevalāṃ lekhāṃ haracūḍāmaṇīkṛtām|| 34||

akhilābhiḥ kalābhirajasramindustaṃ sevate|
kevalamīśvaramaulibhūtāmekāṃ kalāṃ na gṛhṇāti|
mahāprabhāvatvāddevasya| 
evaṃ yadā lokaṃ hitvā nityaparipūrṇaḥ śaśī bhayāttamevārādhayati tadā lokopaplavaḥ| 
evamuttaratra| 
atra ca śaśino bhedaṃ gṛhītvā haraśaśilekhā ca kvāsyopayujyata iti rabhasādavicārya nādatta ityādyuktam|| 34||

vyāvṛttagatirudyānakusumasteyasādhvasāt|
na vāti vāyustatpārśve tālavṛntānilādhikam|| 35||

tasya nikaṭe samīrastālavṛntānilādvyajanapavanādhikaṃ na vahati| 
yata udyānakusumāparaṇabhayānnivṛttaprasaraḥ| 
yadi hi vegena vahettatkadācidupavanaprasūnānyapavāhayet| 
tato 'sya daṇḍo bhavet|| 35||

paryāyasevāmutsṛjya puṣpasambhāratatparāḥ|
udyānapālasāmānyamṛtavastamupāsate|| 36||

vasantādayaḥ ṣaḍṛtavaḥ kramasevāṃ hitvodyānapālavatsadaiva tamupāsate sevante| 
atyuṣṇaśītādikaṃ doṣaṃ tyaktvā kevalaṃ kusumārjanaparāyaṇāḥ samānameva sāmānyam|
tatparaśabde 'tra tacchabdaprayogo na tathā nyāyyaḥ|
parāmṛśyasya sākṣānnirdeśāt| 
yathā tvaddarśanaparau karau ityādau| 
punaḥ śravaṇādvāvadhāraṇaṃ pratīyate|| 36||

tasyopāyanayogyāni ratnāni saritāṃ patiḥ|
kathamapyambhasāmantarā niṣpatteḥ pratīkṣate|| 37||

samudrastoyamadhye tārakasyopadhārhāṇi ratnāni kathamapi pratīkṣate gaveṣayati| 
ā niṣpatteḥ samāptiparyantaṃ yāvattadyogyamaṇilābha ityarthaḥ|
pratīkṣata ityatrāpekṣata iti ramyaḥ pāṭhaḥ|| 37||

jvalanmaṇiśikhāścainaṃ vāsukipramukhā niśi|
sthirapradīpatāmetya bhujaṅgāḥ paryupāsate|| 38||

yaṃ ca
jvalanmaṇiśikhātvādvāsukitakṣakādayo nāgeśvarāḥ sthirapradīpatvaṃ prāpya
rātrau sevante| sthiratvaṃ tu
tailādyanapekṣatvādvātādibādhābhāvācca| atra
śṛṅgāriṇastārakasya niśi bhujaṅgasannidhānamucitaṃ na
veti sahṛdayairvicāryam| enamiti dvitīyāṭaussvenaḥ|| 38||

tatkṛtānugrahāpekṣī pratyahaṃ sūtahāritaiḥ|
anukūlayatīndro 'pi kalpadrumavibhūṣaṇaiḥ|| 39||

āsatāmanye surāḥ| 
suranātho 'pi dūtaprāpitaiḥ kalpapādapālaṃkārairanudinamenamārādhayati|
yatastārakakṛtaṃ prasādamarthayate| 
haratiḥ prāptāvapi vartate na moṣa eva|| 39||

itthamārādhyamāno 'pi kliśnāti bhuvanatrayam|
śāmyetpratyapakāreṇa nopakāreṇa durjanaḥ|| 40||

itthamuktaprakāreṇa raviśaśipavana{}ṛtūdadhibhujaṅgasureśaiḥ sevyamāno 'pyasau jaganti bādhata eva| 
na caitadāścaryam|
yataḥ khalaḥ pratīpamapakāreṇopadraveṇaiva śāmyecchānto bhavenna tūpakāreṇa| 
liṅṅevamādausambhāvane|| 
40||

tameva kleśamāha---

tenāmaravadhūhastasadayālūnapallavāḥ|
abhijñāśchedapātānāṃ kriyante nandanadrumāḥ|| 41||

tena devodyānataravaśchedapātānāṃ dvaidhībhāvonmūlanānāmabhijñā anubhāvukāḥ kriyante|
chidyante pātyante cetyarthaḥ| 
kadācittadyogyā eva te syurityāha---amaravadhūhastaiḥ suralalanākaraiḥ karṇapūrādyarthaṃ sadayamālūnapallavāḥ kṛttakisalayāḥ|
evaṃ kalpavṛkṣanāśānmahānupadravaḥ kṛto bhavati|
abhijānātītyabhijñaḥ kaḥ|| 41||

vījyate sa ca saṃsuptaḥ śvāsasādhāraṇānilaiḥ|
cāmaraiḥ suravandībhirbāṣpaśīkaravarṣibhiḥ|| 42||

sa cāsuraḥ śayitaḥ sandevavadhūbhirvālavyajanairvījyate
nirvāpyate| kīdṛśaiḥ| śvāsena
sādhāraṇaḥ sāmānyo miśrito 'nilo yeṣām| tathā
bāṣpaśīkarānaśrikaṇānvarṣanti muñcanti yāni| tā hi
duḥkhāducchvasanti rudanti ca| balena hṛtā ripunārī vandī|
īja gatāvityasya
vipūrvasya ṇici karmaṇi vījyata iti rūpam| anekārthāśca
dhātavaḥ| caḥ pūrvāpekṣayā samuccaye| 
hīti pāṭhe cārthe hiḥ| 
cāmarairiti karaṇe tṛtīyā| vandībhiriti kartari|
vandīnāmiti pāṭhe 
cāmarāpekṣayā ṣaṣṭhī| vījane tu sannidhānādvandya eva
kartā cāmarāṇi vā|| 42||

utpāṭya meruśṛṅgāṇi kṣuṇṇāni haritāṃ khuraiḥ|
ākrīḍaparvatāstena kalpitāḥ sveṣu veśmasu|| 43||

tena suraśikhariśikharāṇyunmūlya nijasadaneṣvākrīḍaparvatāḥ keliśailā racitāḥ|
ākrīḍyanta eṣvityākrīḍāste ca te parvatāḥ| kīdṛśāni|
haritāṃ ravirathahayānāṃ khuraiḥ kṣuṇṇāni
piṣṭānītyuccatvoktiḥ|| 43||

mandākinyāḥ payaḥ śeṣaṃ digvāraṇamadāvilam|
hemāmbhoruhasasyānāṃ tadvāpyo dhāma sāṃpratam|| 44||

mandākinyāḥ khanadyā adya payaḥ śeṣaṃ toyamevāvaśiṣyate
diggajamadenāvilaṃ kaluṣam| te hi tatra jalakrīḍārthamāyānti|
kanakakamalāni tarhi kva gatānītyāha---hemāmbhoruhāṇyeva
sasyaṃ phalaṃ teṣāṃ tadvāpyastadīyā dīrghikāḥ sāṃprataṃ dhāma
sthānam| tata utkhāya tatra ropitatvāditi sārāpaharaṇoktiḥ|
śiṣyata iti śeṣam| bhāvavarjito ghañvācyaliṅgaḥ|
sampratyeva sāmpratam| prajñāditvādaṇ|| 44||

bhuvanālokanaprītirnākibhirnānubhūyate|
khile bhūte vimānānāṃ tadāpātabhayātpathi|| 45||

nākibhirdevairbhuvanānāmālokanena darśanena
paritoṣo nānubhūyate| kuta ityāha---vimānānāṃ pathi gagane
khile bhūte śūnye sampanne tasya
tārakasyāpāta āskandastato bhayam| tatasteṣāṃ hi
niḥśaṅkaṃ krāmatāṃ kadācidasāvāgatya sahasopari patet||
45||

yajvabhiḥ sambhṛtaṃ havyaṃ vitateṣvadhvareṣu saḥ|
jātavedomukhānmāyī miṣatāmāchinatti naḥ|| 46||

yajvabhiryāyajūkaiḥ prasṛteṣu kratuṣvarjitaṃ havyaṃ puroḍāśādikamasau māyitvānno 'smākaṃ miṣatāṃ spardhamānānāṃ paśyatāṃ vā vahnivaktrādācchinattyapaharati| 
yajata iti yajvā|
suyajoḥ ṅvanip|
māyeti vrīhyādiḥ| 
na iti havyāpekṣayā sambandhe ṣaṣṭhī| 
anādare vā|| 46||

uccairuccaiḥśravāstena hayaratnamahāri ca|
devabaddhamivendrasya cirakālārjitaṃ yaśaḥ|| 47||

uccairuccaiḥśravaḥsaṃjño 'śvaśreṣṭhastenendrasyoccaiḥ prakaṭamahāri
hṛtaḥ|
utprekṣyate---cirakālārjitaṃ dehabaddhaṃ mūrtaṃ yaśa iva hareḥ|
ahāri karmaṇi luṅ|| 47||

atha sāmādyupāyaprayogaḥ kathaṃ tatra na kṛta ityāha---

tasminnupāyāḥ sarve naḥ krūre pratihatakriyāḥ|
vīryavantyauṣadhānīva vikāre sāṃnipātike|| 48||

tasmiṃstārake no 'smākaṃ sāmadānabhedadaṇḍāścatvāro 'pyupāyāḥ pratihatakriyā naṣṭaśaktayaḥ|
yataḥ krūre viṣame yathā śaktimantyauṣadhāni sāṃnipātike
tridoṣaje vikāre vyādhau krūratvānniṣphalāni bhavanti|
dhātūnāmanyonyasya virodhāt| saṃnipātasya
kopanaḥ sāṃnipātikaḥ| saṃnipātācceti vaktavyamiti ṭhak|| 48||

tadeva pratihatakriyatvamāha---

jayāśā yatra cāsmākaṃ pratighātotthitārciṣā|
haricakreṇa tenāsya kaṇṭhe niṣka ivārpitaḥ|| 49||

yatra cakre sadaiva no 'smākaṃ jayāśā nūnametena vayamarīnvijeṣyāmaha iti tena haricakreṇa sudarśanenāsya kaṇṭhe niṣka ivārpitaḥ| 
śiraśchedāya kṣiptaṃ niṣkavacchobhitaṃ pravṛttaṃ naṣṭaśaktisampannamityarthaḥ|
kevalaṃ galapratīghātavaśādutthitānyarcīṃṣi yasya tena|
tatkaṇṭhasya vajranibhatvāt| urasyamābharaṇaṃ niṣkam|| 49||

tadīyāstoyadeṣvadya puṣkarāvartakādiṣu|
abhyasyanti taṭāghātānnirjitairāvaṇā gajāḥ|| 50||

tārakīyā dviradāḥ paribhūtasurakaritvātpuṣkarāvartakaprabhṛtikalpāntamegheṣvadya
taṭāghātānvaprapariṇatikrīḍāmabhyasyanti| te hi
tatprahārakṣamāḥ|| 50||

evaṃ paribhavamudghāṭyāgamanaprayojanamāha---

tadicchāma vibho sṛṣṭaṃ senānyaṃ tasya śāntaye|
karmabandhacchidaṃ dharmaṃ bhavasyeva mumukṣavaḥ|| 51||

tasmādvibho senānyaṃ sṛṣṭamicchāma vayamarthayāmahe| tvayā
coktametanmayi sṛṣṭirhīti| 
yathā bhavasya saṃsārasya śāntaye
karmapāścchedinaṃ puṇyaṃ yogaṃ mumukṣavo yogino vāñchanti|
jñānānalena hi karmendhanadāhaḥ| sṛṣṭamicchāmeti
dhātusambandhe pratyayaḥ| yadi vā
sotsāho darpavānsṛṣṭa ucyate|
yathā---astraṃ harādāptavatā durāpaṃ yenendralokāvajayāya
sṛṣṭa iti| 
sraṣṭumiti 
tvapapāṭha eva| senāṃ nayati yastaṃ senānyam| satsūdviṣeti
yaṇādeśaḥ| icchāmeti prārthane loṭ|| 51||

goptāraṃ surasenānāṃ yaṃ puraskṛtya gotrabhit|
pratyāneṣyati śatrubhyo vandīmiva jayaśriyam|| 52||

kīdṛśaṃ senānyam| 
yaṃ surasenānāṃ goptāramagrato vidhāya gotrabhidindraḥ śatrūṇāṃ sakāśājjayalakṣmīṃ pratīpamāneṣyati vandīmiva haṭhahṛtāṃ nārīmiva| 
dvayamapi pratyāneṣyatītyarthaḥ| puraskṛtyeti puro 'vyayamiti 
gatitve namaspurasorgatyoriti
satvam| gāṃ bhuvaṃ trāyanta iti
gotrāḥ parvatāstānbhinnavāniti gotrabhidindraḥ|| 52||

vacasyavasite tasminsasarja giramātmabhūḥ|
garjitānantarāṃ vṛṣṭiṃ saubhāgyena jigāya yā|| 53||

tasminbārhaspatye vacasyavasite samāpte satyātmabhūrbrahmā giraṃ sasarja vācamabravīt| 
yā gīḥ saubhāgyena sāphalyena garjitādanantarāṃ purato bhāvinīṃ vṛṣṭiṃ jigāyātiśiṣye|
guruprārthanāḍambarasya saphalīkaraṇāt| 
jigāyeti
sanliṭorjeriti
iti kutvam|| 53||

tāmeva girimāha---

sampatsyate vaḥ kāmo 'yaṃ kaścitkālaḥ pratīkṣyatām|
na tvasya siddhau yāsyāmi sargavyāpāramātmanā|| 54||

senānīsamutpattilakṣaṇaḥ kāmo manoratho bhavatāṃ ghaṭiṣyate|
samprati manāksamayaḥ pratipālyatām| yasmādahametasya kāryasya
siddhinimittaṃ sṛṣṭilakṣaṇaṃ vyāpāraṃ svayaṃ na vrajāmi|| 54||

kasmādityāha---

itaḥ sa daityaḥ prāptaśrīrneta evārhati kṣayam|
viṣavṛkṣo 'pi saṃvardhya svayaṃ chettumasāmpratam|| 55||

sa vajrāṅgasuta ito matto varavaśādāsāditasamṛddhirato matta eva nāśaṃ nārhati| 
yasmādāstāmanyaḥ phalavṛkṣo viṣatarurapi vṛddhiṃ nītvā svayaṃ lavitumasāmpratamayuktaṃ na chidyate|
sāmprataśabdo 'yaṃ yuktārthaḥ svabhāvādgarbhīkṛtakarmaśaktiriti
tenaiva karmaṇo 'bhihitatvādviṣavṛkṣādidvitīyābhāvaḥ|
vardhanakriyāpekṣāpyasya nārhati|
mukhyakarmaṇo 'bhihitatvāt|
evaṃ hyuktam---pradhānaśaktyabhidhāne guṇaśaktirabhihitavatprakāśate|
yathā ripunārīyaṃ vadhyatāmiti| vṛkṣaviśeṣaṇatve 'pi ca
sāmānyopakramādasāmpratamiti yathāsthiti nirdeśaḥ|| 55||

atha kasmāttvayaivāyamupadravaḥ kṛta ityāha---

vṛtaṃ tenedameva prāṅmayā cāsmai pratiśrutam|
vareṇāśamitaṃ lokānalaṃ dagdhuṃ hi tattapaḥ|| 56||

tena tārakeṇa prākpūrvamidameva vṛtaṃ yathā saptavāsaraśiśuvarjaṃ devānāmahamavadhyo bhūyāsamiti|
mayāpi tasmai tathaiva pratiśrutamaṅgīkṛtam| 
yasmāttasya tapo varadānenānirvāpitaṃ sadbhuvanāni sagdhumalaṃ śaktam|
tapasastāvatphalenāvaśyaṃ bhāvyam| 
yadi ca vareṇa tanna jaḍīkriyate tatastadadhikopadravakṣamaṃ syāt| 
asmā iti pratyāṅbhyāṃ śruva iti
sampradānatvam|| 56||

asmāsveva vadhaśaktirvidhīyatāmityāha---

saṃyuge sāṃyugīnaṃ tamudyataṃ prasaheta kaḥ|
aṃśādṛte niṣiktasya nīlalohitaretasaḥ|| 57||

samare taṃ kṛtotsāhaṃ bhavatāṃ madhye kaḥ soḍhuṃ śaknuyāt|
nīlalohitaḥ śarvastasya retaḥ śukraṃ tasya niṣiktasya kṣetre
kṣiptasya yo 'ṃśo bhāgo 'vatārastasmādṛte taṃ varjayitvā|
haratanayo yadi paraṃ taṃ jetuṃ śakta ityarthaḥ|
yatastaṃ sāṃyugīnaṃ raṇapaṇḍitam| sādhvarthe
pratijanādibhyaḥ khañ| 
aṃśāditi ṛteśabdayoge pañcamī|| 57||

atha yatrendropandrādayo na śaktāstatra
kathaṃ harāṃśo mallaḥ syādityāha---

sa hi devaḥ paraṃ jyotistamaḥpāre pratiṣṭhitam|
paricchinnaprabhāvarddhirna mayā na ca viṣṇunā|| 58||

yasmātsa mahādevastamaḥpāre pratiṣṭhitamanādyantaṃ paramutkṛṣṭaṃ sūkṣmaṃ jyotistejaḥ paramātmāravyam(?)|
ataśca na mayā nāpi viṣṇunā paricchinnā niścitā
prabhāvānāṃ mahimnāmṛddhiḥ sampadyasya sa tathoktaḥ| 
ataśca ya evaṃ mahādevastadīyo 'ṃśaḥ kathaṃ vipakṣavidāraṇo na syāt|| 58||

tadaṃśasambhave copāyamāha---

umārūpeṇa te yūyaṃ saṃyamastimitaṃ manaḥ|
śambhoryatadhvamākraṣṭumayaskāntena lohavat|| 59||

umārūpeṇa gaurīvapuṣā te yūyaṃ samādhinā stimitaṃ lohavadaya iva niścalaṃ śambhormana ākraṣṭumapahartuṃ yatadhvamudyacchadhvam|
ta iti sarvanāmnā prayatnaparatāṃ sūcayati|
ayasaḥ kānto 'yaskāntaḥ|
ataḥ kṛkamītyaprāpte 'pyupacāraḥ kaskādiṣu
pāṭhāt|| 59||

gauryā alābhādyuvatyantareṇa
kiṃ haracetaḥkarṣaṇaṃ śakyaṃ kiṃ na vetyāha---

ubhe eva kṣame soḍhumubhayorvīryamāhitam|
sā vā śambhostadīyā vā mūrtirjalamayī mama|| 60||

ubhayoḥ sambandhi vīryaṃ reta āhitaṃ kṣitaṃ sadubhe eva striyau
soḍhuṃ kṣame dhārayituṃ samarthe| kayoḥ ke ityāha---sā ca
śambhoḥ śāmbhavī cābrūpā tanurmama| brahmaṇā hi
vīryamapsu kṣiptamāsīt| ... visarga...
ścāṣṭamūrtereva mūrtiḥ| 
etacca prasaṅgādaupamyavidhitsayoktam|
yathāpo madvīryaṃ soḍhuṃ kṣamā evaṃ gauryeva harateja ityarthaḥ|
vāśabdāvatra samuccaye|
pradhānaścāyaṃ pakṣo yaddyotyasamāni dyotakāni| 

āhūto 'pi sahāyairemītyuktvā nirmuktanidro 'pi| 
gantumanā api pathikaḥ saṃkocaṃ naiva śithilayati|| 60||

tasyātmā śitikaṇṭhasya senāpatyamupetya vaḥ|
mokṣyati svargavandīnāṃ veṇīrvīryavibhūtibhiḥ|| 61||

tasyaivaṃvidhasya śitikaṇṭhasya harasyātmā putro vā yuṣmākaṃ camūnāthatvaṃ prāpya baddhānāṃ surasundarīṇāṃ veṇīḥ kavarīḥ śaktisamṛddhibhirmokṣyati|
baddhāyā hi nāryāḥ svāminaivonmocya karavīmokṣaḥ kārya ityācāraḥ| 
kālakūṭapānavaśācchivasya nīlagalatvam|| 61||

iti vyāhṛtya vibudhānviśvayonistirodadhe|
manasyāhitakartavyāste 'pi pratiyayurdivam|| 62||

devānitthamuktvā viśvayonirvedhāstirodadhe 'ntarhitaḥ|
devā api cetasi kṛtakāryāḥ svargaṃ pratijagmatuḥ|| 62||

tatra niścitya kandarpamagamatpākaśāsanaḥ|
manasā kāryasaṃsiddhitvarādviguṇaraṃhasā|| 63||

tatastatra nāke kathaṃ haragaurīsamāgamaḥ kārya iti mantribhiḥ saha niścitya pākaśāsana indraścetasā smaramagātkāmaṃ sasmāra| 
kīdṛśena manasā| 
kāryasya haragaurīsamāgamalakṣaṇasya yā saṃsiddhirniṣpattistatra yā tvarā śīghratā tayā dviguṇaraṃhasā mahāsyadena| 
agamaditi
luṅi lṛditvādaṅādeśaḥ| 
pāko nāmāsurastasya vadhātpākaśāsanaḥ|| 63||

atha salalitayoṣidbhrūlarācāruśṛṅgaṃ 
rativalayapadāṅke cāpamāsajya kaṇṭhe|
sahacaramadhuhastanyatacūtāṅkurāstraḥ 
śatamakhamupatasthe prāñjaliḥ puṣpaketuḥ|| 64||

athānusmṛtaḥ kāmo 'ñjaliṃ vidhāya śatamakhamindramupatasthe ḍuḍhauke| 
saṃgatakaraṇe taṅ| kiṃ kṛtvā|
prāñjalitvātkaṇṭhe dhanurnidhāya| kīdṛśam|
salalitā vilāsānvitā yā yoṣito 'ṅganāstāsāṃ bhrūlatāvaccāruśṛṅgam|
ramyāṭanilauṭilyādvaśīkaraṇācca| kaṇṭhe kīdṛśe|
ratirasya bhāryā| 
tasyā valayapadāni kaṭakamudrā evāṅkaścihnaṃ yasya| 
tadāśleṣavaśāt|
kīdṛśaḥ kusumadhvajaḥ|
sahacaro vayasyo yo madhurvasantastasya haste nyasto 'rpitaścūtāṅkura evāstraṃ śaro yena saḥ|
mālinīvṛttam|| 65

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ dvitīyaḥ sargaḥ||
 
 Tṛtīyaḥ sargaḥ|

tasminmaghonastridaśānvihāya sahasramakṣṇāṃ yugapatpapāta|
prayojanāpekṣitayā prabhūṇāṃ prāyaścalaṃ gauravamāśriteṣu|| 1||

tato maghona indrasyākṣṇāṃ sahasraṃ tasminkāme
samakālaṃ papāta| nayanadaśaśatyā samagrayā
tamapaśyadityarthaḥ| tridaśānvihāya devānhitvā|
yuktaṃ caitadyataḥ prabhūṇāmāśriteṣu sevakeṣu gauravaṃ prāyeṇa calamasthiram| 
kutaḥ prayojanāpekṣitayā kāryavaśena| taduktam---

aurasānapi putrāṃste tyajantyanupakāriṇaḥ|

sarge 'tropajātaya eva vṛttāni prāyaśaḥ|| 1||

sa vāsavenāsanasaṃnikṛṣṭamito niṣīdeti nisṛṣṭabhūmiḥ| 
bhartuḥ prasādaṃ pratinandya mūrdhnā vaktuṃ mithaḥ prākramataivamenam|| 2||

tataḥ sa smaraḥ prabhuprasādaṃ śirasābhinandya mitho rahasyenamākhaṇḍalamevaṃ vaktuṃ prākramatārebhe|
tameva svāmyanugrāhamāha---ito 'tra madīyaviṣṭaranikaṭe tvamupaviśeti svayaṃ śakreṇa nisṛṣṭabhūmirdattasthānaḥ|
āsanasannikṛṣṭaṃ yatra tadāsanasannikṛṣṭamāsanasamīpa ityarthaḥ| 
prākramateti propābhyāṃ samarthābhyāmityātmanepadam|| 2||

kimuvācetyāha---

ājñāpaya jñātaviśeṣa puṃsāṃ lokeṣu yatte karaṇīyamasti|
anugrahaṃ saṃsmaraṇapravṛttamicchāmi saṃvarddhitumājñayā te|| 3||

he puṃsāṃ jñātaviśeṣa puruṣamadhye jñānaśreṣṭha lokeṣu
bhuvaneṣu te tvayā yatkaraṇīyaṃ tadājñāpaya| tatkatham|
anugraheṇa prasādena yatsmaraṇaṃ tena pravṛttaṃ pravartitaṃ te
tavājñayā saṃvarddhituṃ vṛddhikartumicchāmi|| 3||

kenābhyasūyā phalakāṅkṣiṇā te nitāntadīrghairjanitā tapobhiḥ|
yāvadbhavatvāhitasāyakasya matkārmukasyāsya nideśavartī|| 4||

kenāpavargecchunā
nitāntadīrghaiścirasaṃcitaistapobhistavābhyasūyerṣyā janitotpāditā| 
yāvadāhitasāyakasyāropitaśarasya matkodaṇḍasyājñāvidheyo 'stu| 
etaduktaṃ bhavati---na tava kaścidantarāyo 'sti| ājñāpaya|
yāvadadhunaivājñāṃ karomītyarthaḥ|| 4||

asaṃmataḥ kastava muktimārgaṃ punarbhavakleśabhayātprapannaḥ|
baddhaściraṃ tiṣṭhatu sundarīṇāmārecitabhrūlalitaiḥ kaṭākṣaiḥ|| 5||

tavāsaṃmato bhavato 'nabhipretaḥ ko muktimārgaṃ mokṣapathaṃ jñānvairāgyalakṣaṇaṃ prapannaḥ|
punarbhavakleśabhayātpunaryo bhavaḥ saṃsārastatra
kleśā avidyāsmitarāgadveṣābhiniveśāstebhyo bhayaṃ tataḥ punarbhavakleśabhayādbhūyaḥ saṃsāraduḥkhāt|
yāvadasau
sundarīṇāmuttamāṅganānāṃ kaṭākṣairapāṅganirīkṣitaiściraṃ bahukālaṃ baddhastiṣṭhatu|
baddha iva baddhaḥ| yathā baddho na
kvacidgantuṃ samarthastatraiva
tiṣṭhatyevaṃ kaṭākṣairbaddhaḥ sanstrīviṣayābhilāṣī
bhavati na pūrvoktaṃ muktimārgaṃ prāpnotīti
bandhasāmānyādbaddhaśabdenopamīyate|
kīdṛśaiḥ kaṭākṣaiḥ| ārecitaṃ bhrūkarma bhrūbhaṅga ucyate|
yadekadeśenoccālya savilāsaṃ pātyate taducyate|
ārecitabhrūlalitairnartitaromarājiśobhitaiḥ|
baddhaściramihaiva tiṣṭhatvityājñāpaya|| 5||

adhyāpitasyośanasāpi nītiṃ prayuktarāgapraṇidherdviṣaste|
kasyārthadharmau  vada pīḍayāmi sindhostaṭāvogha iva pravṛddhaḥ|| 6||

vada kathaya| te tava dviṣaḥ śatroḥ kasyārthadharmau pīḍayāmi|
arthaśca dharmaśca tāvarthadharmau| kīdṛśasya dviṣaḥ|
uśanasāpi śukreṇāpi
nītiṃ nītiśāstraṃ ṣāḍguṇyaṃ sāmādyupāyalakṣaṇamadhyāpitasya
pāṭhitasya śikṣitasya| etaduktaṃ bhavati---yo hyuśanasā
vinītaḥ so 'vaśyaṃ trivargaṃ saṃsevate| ahaṃ punastasya
tathāvidhasyāpyarthadharmau pīḍayāmi| bhūyo 'pi sa eva
viśeṣyate| kīdṛśasya
tasyetyata āha---prayuktarāgapraṇidheḥ|
rāga praṇidhiścintā rāgapraṇidhiḥ prayuktā
rāgapraṇidhiryasya| prayukto rāga eva praṇidhiścaro yasyeti
vā| evaṃvidhasya kasya te dviṣo 'rthakāmau pīḍayāmi| ka iva
kasya kāvityāha---yathā
sindhornadyā ogho jalapūraḥ pravṛddho vṛddhiṃ gatastaṭau
rodhasī pīḍayati| evamahaṃ ca
pravṛddha ulbaṇaḥ kasyārthadharmau pīḍayāmītyarthaḥ|| 6||

kāmekapatnīvrataduḥkhaśīlāṃ lolaṃ manaścārutayā praviṣṭām|
vilambinīmicchasi muktalajjāṃ kaṇṭhe svayaṃ grāhaviṣaktabāhum|| 7||

kāmaṅganāṃ kaṇṭhe gale svayamātmanā vilambinīṃ lagnāṃ saṃśliṣṭāmicchasyabhilaṣasi kāmayase| 
kīdṛśīm| 
grāhaviṣaktabāhuṃ grāhāviva grāhau dārḍhyasāmānyāt| 
grāhasadṛśau viṣaktau bāhū bhujau yathā sā grāhaviṣaktabāhustām| evaṃvidhāṃ kāmaṅganāmicchasi|
nanu ca yāmindraḥ prārthayate sā kathaṃ tamavadhīrayatītyata āha---ekapatnīvrataduḥśīlām|
ekaḥ patiryasyāḥ saikapatnī patiṃvarā sādhvī ucyate|
ekapatnīnāṃ vrataṃ niyama ekapatnīvrataṃ tadeva duḥkhaṃ tena vā
duḥkhaṃ tacchīlaṃ svabhāvo yasyāḥ saikapatnīvrataduḥkhaśīlā
tām| nanu ca yaivaṃvidhā
tāṃ kimitīndraḥ prārthayata ityāha---tava
lolaṃ manaścārutayā praviṣṭām| lolaṃ calaṃ sābhilāṣaṃ vā|
kathaṃ praviṣṭām| cārutayā
darśanīyatayā ramyatayetyarthaḥ| bhūyaḥ saiva viśeṣyate|
kiṃviśiṣṭāṃ tām| muktalajjāṃ muktā parityaktā lajjā yayā
sā muktalajjā tāṃ parityaktahrīkām|| 7||

kayāsi kāminsarasāparādhaḥ pādānataḥ kopanayāvadhūtaḥ|
yasyāḥ kariṣyāmi dṛḍhānutāpaṃ pravālaśayyāśaraṇaṃ śarīram|| 8||

he kāminkāmuka kayā kāminyāsi
tvamavadhūto 'vajñātastiraskṛtaḥ| kīdṛśastvam|
pādānataḥ pādayorānataścaraṇapatitaḥ|
kimityavadhūta ityāha---yataḥ sarasa ārdro 'parādho yasyāsau
sarasāparādhaḥ pratyagradṛṣṭavyalīkaḥ| kīdṛśyā tayā|
kopanayā krodhanayā| roṣaṇayetyarthaḥ|
yasyā mahilāyā ahaṃ śarīraṃ pravālaśayyāśaraṇaṃ kariṣyāmi
pallavaśayanaparāyaṇaṃ vidadhe| sā hi
tvatprārthanāmagaṇayitvā mayānutāpyamānā
madīyaśaravyathitāṅgī santāpaśāntaye
kusumapallavaśayanamabhilaṣati|| 8||

prasīda viśrāmyatu vīra vajraṃ śarairmadīyaiḥ katamaḥ surāriḥ|
bibhetu moghīkṛtabāhuvīryaḥ strībhyo 'pi kopasphuritādharābhyaḥ|| 9||

he vīra prasādaṃ kuru| tvadāyudhametadvajraṃ viśrāmyatu
tadāstām|
katamaḥ kiṃjātīyaḥ surārirasuro 'smatpṛṣatkapraśamitabhujabalaḥ sankopasphuritādharābhyaḥ strībhyo 'pi bibhetu| 
yadā hi kupitā bhāminyo 'dharāvoṣṭhau kampayantyastaṃ samīkṣante tadaivāsāvakhilaṃ kāryamupekṣya tatprasādanaparo bhavati| 
prasīda viśrāmyatviti prārthane loṭ|
bibhetviti prāptakāle|
daityadānavarākṣasādīnāṃ surārīṇāṃ bahutvājjātipariprāptaḥ sambhavatīti|
katama iti ḍatamajutpattiḥ|| 9|| 

atha cedāttha kasmāttavaivaṃvidhā śaktirityāha---

bhavatprasādātkusumāyudho 'pi sahāyamekaṃ madhumeva labdhvā|
kuryāṃ harasyāpi pinākapāṇerdhairyacyutiṃ ke mama dhanvino 'nye|| 10||

puṣpāstro 'pyahaṃ tvatprasādādevaikaṃ sahāyaṃ vasantamevāsādya
pinākapāṇeḥ śivasyāpi dhairyacyutiṃ kuryām| ataścānye
varākā dhanvino dhanurgrahā mama ke| akiṃcitkarā ityarthaḥ|
yatrāhaṃ cāpahastaṃ haraṃ jetuṃ samarthastatrānye
kṛpaṇadhānuṣkāḥ kiṃ mama kuryurityarthaḥ|
bhavatprasādādityanauddhatyaparam| 
madhuścaitrastena ca vasanto lakṣyate| madhumādhavatvāttasya| 
kuryāmiti sambhāvane liṅ| 
pinākaḥ śārvaṃ dhanuḥ śūlaṃ ca| dhanurastraṃ vidyate
yeṣāṃ te dhanvinaḥ| vrīhyāditvādiniḥ|| 10||

athorudeśādavatārya pādamākrāntisambhāvitapādapīṭham|
saṃkalpite 'rthe vivṛtātmaśaktimākhaṇḍalaḥ kāmamidaṃ babhāṣe|| 11||

tataḥ śakraḥ smaramidaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ babhāṣe jagāda|
kīdṛśam| saṃkalpite 'rthe cikīrṣite vastuni
vivṛtātmaśaktiṃ vyākhyātanijamāhātmyaṃ kuryāṃ hasrasyāpi dhairyacyutimiti| 
ataścādarātiśayavaśādūrutaścaraṇamavatārya bhāṣaṇam|
kīdṛśaṃ pādam| ākrāntyākramaṇenādhiṣṭhāne
sambhāvitamanugṛhītaṃ gurutvaṃ nītaṃ pādapīṭhaṃ yena|
eṣa eva tasyānugraho yadupari caraṇanyāsaḥ|| 11||

kimabravīdityutsāhayannāha---

sarvaṃ sakhe tvayyupapannametadubhe mamāstre kuliśaṃ bhavāṃśca|
vajraṃ tapovīryamahatsu kuṇṭhaṃ tvaṃ sarvatogāmi ca sādhakaṃ ca|| 12||

sakha ityāhvānaṃ gauravārtham| he vayasya yattvamāttha
tatsarvametattvayyupapannaṃ sughaṭam| yasmānmama dve evāstre
vajraṃ tvaṃ ca| ubhayorviśeṣamāha| vajraṃ tapovīryeṇa mahatsu
durjayeṣu tāpaseṣu kuṇṭhaṃ bhugnam| tāpaseṣu
prahartumaśakyatvāt| tvaṃ pravarāstraṃ sarvatogāmi
sarvaviṣayaṃ tāpaseṣvapi rāgotpādanāt| sādhakaṃ ca
kāryaniṣpādakam| astrāpekṣayākṣatatvāt|| 12||

avaimi te sāramataḥ khalu tvāṃ kārye guruṇyātmasamaṃ niyokṣye|
vyādiśyate bhūdharatāmavekṣya kṛṣṇena dehodvahanāya śeṣaḥ|| 13||

yadā ca te sāraṃ balaṃ jāne tatastvāṃ mahati kārya ātmānamiva niyokṣye vyāpāraye| 
yathā nikhilorvīvahanaśaktatvamālocya viṣṇunātmavapurdhāraṇārthamananta ājñāpyate|
niyokṣya iti svarādyantopasṛṣṭādityātmanepadam|
bhuvaṃ dhārayatīti bhūdharaḥ| bahulamanyatrāpi saṃjñācchandasoriti ṇiluk|| 13||

āśaṃsatā bāṇagatiṃ vṛṣāṅke kāryaṃ tvayā naḥ pratipannakalpam|
nibodha yajñāṃśubhujāmidānīmuccairdviṣāmīpsitamarthamatra|| 14|| 

bhavatā hare śaraprasaraṃ kathayatādhunā prayojanamasmākamaṅgīkṛtaprāyam|
yato yajñāṃśubhujāṃ devānāmīpsitamitthamatra hare nibodha jānīhi|
uccairdviṣāṃ balavadarīṇāmiti bhaṅgyā tamarthaṃ sūcayati| 
budha bodhane
ityasya svaritāto nibodheti rūpam|| 14||

kasmāddharāyattaṃ prayojanameṣāmityāha---

amī hi vīryaprabhavaṃ harasya jayāya senānyamuśanti devāḥ|
sa ca tvadekeṣunipātasādhyo brahmāṅgabhūrbrahmaṇi yojitātmā|| 15||

amī devā harasya vīryaprabhavaṃ retaḥsamutthaṃ senāpatiṃ jayārthamuśantīcchanti|
sa ca harastvadekeṣunipātasādhyastvadīyenaikenaiveṣunipātena śarakṣepeṇa sādhyaścālayituṃ śakyaḥ| 
yato brahmaṇyātmani jñāne yojitātmā nikṣiptacetāḥ| 
ataśca tvadanyaḥ ka iva vaśīkartumīśo bhavet| 
brahmā aṅgabhūtastanūjo yasya sa brahmāṅgabhūḥ| 
brahmaṇo vāṅgabhūriti kecit| 
vayaṃ tu brūmaḥ ---brahmāṇyaṅgāni ca mantraviśeṣāḥ śaivaprasiddhāsteṣāṃ bhūḥ prabhavaḥ| 
tatprabhavatvānmantrāṇām|
uśantīti vaśa kāntau|| 15||


tasmai himādreḥ prayatāṃ tanūjāṃ yatātmane rocayituṃ yatasva|
yoṣitsu tadvīryaniṣekabhūmiḥ saiva kṣametyātmabhuvopadiṣṭam|| 16||

atastasmai harāya pārvatīṃ rocayitumabhilāṣayituṃ yatasva prayatnaṃ kuru|
yasmātstrīṣu madhye tadvīryaniṣekabhūmistryambakaśukrakṣeporvī hauryeva kṣamā yogyeti brahmaṇā diṣṭaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ vā|
prayatāṃ yatātmana iti tadvyāpārasyaiva sāmarthyamāha| 
na hi saniyamayoḥ svayaṃ pravṛttiḥ| 
tasmai iti rucyarthānāṃ prīyamāṇaḥ 
iti sampradānatvam|| 16||

na cāsau dūrasthā yena rocanā duṣkarā syādityāha---

gurorniyogācca nagendrakanyā sthāṇuṃ tapasyantamadhityakāyām|
anvāsta ityapsarasāṃ mukhebhyaḥ śrutaṃ mayā matpraṇidhiḥ sa vargaḥ|| 17||

piturnideśātpārvatī sānuni tapaścarantaṃ pinākinamanvāste sevata ityapsaraso mukhānmayākarṇitam| 
yasmādasau suravadhūsārtho matpraṇidhirmadīyaścaraḥ| 
adhityakādreruparitanā bhūḥ| upādhibhyāṃ tyakannāsannārūḍhayoḥ|
caśabdaḥ pūrvavākyāpekṣayā samuccaye| evamanyatra|| 17||

tadgaccha siddhyai kuru devakāryamartho 'yamarthottara bhavya eva|
apekṣate pratyayamaṅgalabdhyai bījāṅkuraḥ prāgudayādivāmbhaḥ|| 18||

he arthottara kāma tasmātprayāhi siddhaye surakṛtyaṃ vidhehi|
yasmādayamarthaḥ kumārajanmalakṣaṇo bhavya eva bhavitaiva|
kevalamaṅgalabdhyai ātmotpattaye pratyayaṃ kāraṇamapekṣate
prārthayate| bījāṅkura utpatteḥ pūrvamambha iva|
upādānakārakāddhi bījāṅkureṇa bhāvyam| toyaṃ tu
sahakāriṇaṃ vinā na bhavituṃ śaknotīti tatra tasyāpekṣā|
bhavyaśabdaḥ kartari nipātitaḥ|| 18||

utsāhayanvākyadvayamāha---

asminsurāṇāṃ vijayābhyupāye tavaiva nāmāstragatiḥ kṛtī tvam|
apyaprasiddhaṃ yaśase hi puṃsāmananyasādhāraṇameva karma|| 19||

asmindevānāṃ vijayopāye tavaiva nāmāstrasya gatiḥ prasaro na
tvanyasya| ataśca kṛtī kṛtārthaḥ pravīṇastvam|
yasmādaprasiddhamapi svalpamapi karma
yāvadananyasādhāraṇamanyena kartumaśakyaṃ tadapi
karturyaśaskāri| kiṃ punarmahat| nāmaśabdaḥ sambhāvane|
tavaitatkarma sambhāvyamityarthaḥ| harasya vijayopāyatvamatra
kāraṇakāraṇatvāt| kṛtamasyāstīti kṛtī kṛtārthaḥ|| 19||

surāḥ samabhyarthayitāra ete kāryaṃ trayāṇāmapi viṣṭapānām|
cāpena te karma na cātihiṃsramaho batāsi spṛhaṇīyavīryaḥ|| 20||

aho bata vismaye| asi tvamabhilāṣaṇīyaparākramaḥ| tathā hi
sarvamevaite mahāprabhāvā devā arthinaḥ| tribhuvanasya
prayojanam| tatrāpi ca tava dhanurmātreṇa karma vyāpāraḥ|
tadapi na hiṃsātmakaṃ pratyuta prītikāri|
ahobataśabdāvekārthāvatra vismayasyādhikyaṃ brūtaḥ|| 20||

bhavatprasadādityuddiśyāha---

madhuśca te manmatha sāhacaryādasāvanukto 'pi sahāya eva|
samīraṇaścodayitā bhaveti vyādiśyate kena hutāśanasya|| 21||

he madana madājñāṃ vināpi vasantaḥ sahacaratvāttava
sahāya eva| yathāgneruddīpayitā tvaṃ bhaveti kena
vāyurājñāpyate| tau kila sahacarau| na hi
vātaṃ vināgnirjvalyate| saha sākamayata iti sahāyaḥ|| 21||

tatheti śeṣāmiva bharturājñāmādāya mūrdhnā madanaḥ pratasthe|
digvāraṇāsphālanakarkaśena hastena pasparśa tadaṅgamindraḥ|| 22||

tathetyevamastu sampādayāmi tvadādeśamiti śirasā
svāminideśaṃ mālāmiva smaro gṛhītvā prayayau| prasādadattā
maṅgalārthaṃ śeṣā| tāmiveti sahoktiḥ|
tāmapyādāyetyarthaḥ|
prayāṇakāle mālā dīyata iti sthitiḥ|
tasya ca vrajato 'ṅgaṃ pṛṣṭhaṃ śiro vā prītisūcanārthaṃ pāṇinā śakraḥ pasparśa parāmṛśat|
kīdṛśena| digvāraṇo .airāvaṇastasya tejovivṛddhaye
yadāsphālanamāghātastadvaśātkarkaśena kaṭhoreṇa|| 22||

sa mādhavenābhimatena sakhyā ratyā ca sāśaṅkamanuprayātaḥ|
aṅgavyayaprārthitakarmasiddhiḥ sthāṇvāśramaṃ haimavataṃ jagāma|| 23||

tataḥ sa kāmo himavadbhavaṃ haratapovanaṃ yayau| kīdṛśaḥ|
priyavayasyena vasantena jāyayā ca ratyā viṣamamidaṃ karma
saṃdigdhamuttaraṇamiti sāśaṅkamanugataḥ| tathāṅgavyayena
dehanāśenāpi prārthitā cikīrṣitā karmasiddhiryena|
maraṇamapyaṅgīkṛtyāvaśyaṃ surakāryaṃ karavāṇīti|
ata evāśaṅkāmādhavaśabdau| maghoḥ ña ca
iti madhumādhaveṣorjādayaḥ sukaviparamparayā bhāṣāyāmapi
prayujyante|| 23||

tasminvane saṃyamināṃ munīnāṃ tapaḥsamādheḥ pratikūlavartī|
saṃkalpayonerabhimānabhūtamātmānamādhāya madhurjajṛmbhe|| 24||

tatastatrāśrame madhuḥ puṣpādirūpeṇātmānamādhāya
utpādya jajṛmbhe ullalāsa| akālavasantaḥ prādurbabhūva|
kīdṛśaḥ| śāntānāmapi
ṛṣīṇāṃ tapaḥsamādheḥ pratikūlavartī vipakṣaḥ|
utkaṇṭhājanananāt| 
taṃ tu saṃkalpayonermanobhuvo 'bhimānabhūtaṃ darpakalpaṃ tadvaśāttasya durjayatvāt| 
samādhirekāgratā|| 24||

tameva madhumadhunā varṇayitumupakramate---

kuverajuṣṭāṃ diśamuṣṇaraśmau gantuṃ pravṛtte samayaṃ vilaṅghya|
digdakṣiṇā gandhavahaṃ mukhena vyalīkaniḥśvāsamivotsasarja|| 25||

dakṣiṇā digavācī mukhena vaktreṇa gandhavahaṃ vātamutsasarja cikṣepa| 
madhau hi malayamāruto vahati| kadā| 
samayaṃ vilaṅghya kālamatikramya kuverajuṣṭāṃ dhanadādhyuṣitāmāśāṃ sūrye yātuṃ prastute sati| 
vasante hyuttarāśāṃ raviryāti| 
sa ca tadā tasya tāṃ sevitumakālo dakṣiṇāyanasya prakṛtatvāt|
ataścotprekṣyate|
vyalīkaniḥśvāsamivātyucchvāsamivaivamamucat| 
yadā hi nāyakaḥ samayaṃ śapathamatikramya kuvereṇa nindyavapuṣā sevitāṃ rāgeṇa gacchati tadā dakṣiṇānukūlā nāyikā manyunā niḥśvasati| 
veraṃ śarīram| vyalīkaṃ priyakṛto 'parādhaḥ|
gandhavahādayaḥ pacādau draṣṭavyāḥ|| 25|| 

asūta sadyaḥ kusumānyaśokaḥ skandhātprabhṛtyeva sapallavāni|
pādena nāpaikṣata sundarīṇāṃ samparkamāśiñjitanūpureṇa|| 26||

aśokataruḥ sapadi viṭapādārabhya puṣpāṇi patrasahitānyasūtodapādayat| 
kālasya balavattayā cāsau raṇitamañjīreṇa yuvaticaraṇena prahāraṃ nāpaikṣata nārthayata| 
sanūpurapādatāḍito hyasau puṣpyati|| 26||

sakhyuḥ pravālodgamacārupatre nīte samāptiṃ navacūtabāṇe|
niveśayāmāsa madhurdvirephānnāmākṣarāṇīva manobhavasya|| 27||

navaṃ cūtameva bāṇaḥ śarastasminsamāpite madhuralīnnyaveśayat| 
utprekṣyate|
sakhyuścetobhuvo nāmākṣarāṇīva saṃjñāvarṇānīva| 
śare hi svāmino nāma likhyate| bāṇe pakṣairbhāvyam| 
tatra tu pravālodgamaḥ kisalayodgama eva cārūṇi patrāṇi yasmin|| 27||

varṇaprakarṣe sati karṇikāraṃ dunoti nirgandhamiti sma cetaḥ|
prāyeṇa sāmagryavidhau guṇānāṃ parāṅmukhī viśvasṛjaḥ pravṛttiḥ|| 28||

karṇikākhyaṃ puṣpaṃ rūpasaundarye 'pi satyasurabhitvānmano dunoti smāpīḍayat| 
sugandhi tarhi kathaṃ nākārītyāha---guṇānāṃ sāmagryavidhau sākalyakaraṇe prāyeṇa vedhaso vimukhaḥ prasaraḥ| 
nāsau sarvānguṇānekatra kurute| 
arthāntarābhāsaścāyaṃ boddhavyo na tvarthāntaranyāsastadartharahitatvāt| 
pradhānārthasamarthako hi sādharmyavaidharmyābhyāmarthāntaranyāsaḥ| 
atra cānyadupakrāntamanyatra cārthāntaraṃ nyastam|
ataścaivaṃ vaktavyam---mukhyena hīnaṃ guṇinaṃ guṇena dṛṣṭvā na tapyeta hi kaḥ sacetāḥ| 
yadi vā---tenaiva sarvo ramate guṇena yenāśu rājanti guṇāntarāṇi|| 28||

bālenduvakrāṇyavikāsabhāvādbabhuḥ palāśānyatilohitāni|
sadyo vasantena samāgatānāṃ nakhakṣatānīva vanasthalīnām|| 29||

palāśapuṣpāṇi babhū rejire| kīdṛśāni|
avikāśabhāvādavikāsādbālenduvakrāṇi śaśikalākuṭilāni|
svabhāvāccātiraktāni| ataścotprekṣyate| patinibhena
surabhiṇā saṃgatānāṃ kānanakaṭīnāṃ sadyastatkṣaṇaṃ datāni
nakhakṣatānīva| karajapadānyapi vakrāṇi lohitāni ca
bhavanti|| 29||

lagnadvirephāñjanabhakticitraṃ mukhe madhuśrīstilakaṃ niveśya|
rāgeṇa bālātapakomalena cūtapravāloṣṭhamalaṃcakāra|| 30||

madhuśrīrvasantalakṣmīrmukhe prārambhe tilakākhyaṃ puṣpaṃ vṛkṣaṃ vā niveśya racayitvā tato 'bhinavātapasadṛśena rāgeṇa lauhityena cūtakisalayādharamabhūṣayat| kīdṛśaṃ tilakam| 
lagnā ye dvirephā bhramarāsta eva kārṣṇyādañjanabhaktiḥ kajjalavicchittistayā citraṃ tilakam|
parāganirbharatvādalivṛndasevyaṃ cūtaśca kisalayitamiti vākyārthaḥ| 
yāpi nārī vilāsānvitā sā śobhārthamañjanatilakaṃ viśeṣakaṃ mukhe niveśya tāmbūlādirāgeṇauṣṭhamalaṃkurute| 
komalaḥ sadṛśaḥ|| 30||

mṛgāḥ priyāludrumamañjarīṇāṃ rajaḥkaṇairvighnitadṛṣṭipātāḥ|
madoddhatāḥ pratyanilaṃ vicerurvanasthalīrmarmarapatramokṣāḥ|| 31||

madapracaṇḍā hariṇā vātābhimukhaṃ kānanāvalīrvicerurbabhramuḥ|
vātābhimukhatvāt| kīdṛśāḥ|
priyālvākhyatarumañjarīṇāṃ reṇulavairvighnitaḥ pratihato dṛṣṭipāto netrakṣepo yeṣām|
vātasya parāganirbharatvāt| sthalīḥ kīdṛśīḥ|
marmaraḥ saśabdaḥ patramokṣaḥ parṇapāto yāsu yāḥ| 
tadā hi śuṣkāṇi patrāṇi patanti navāni jāyante|| 31||

cūtāṅkurāsvādakaṣāyakaṇṭhaḥ puṃskokilo yanmadhuraṃ cukūja|
manasvinīnāmavighātadakṣaṃ tadeva jātaṃ vacanaṃ smarasya|| 32||

kokilayuvā cūtāṅkurāsvādaviśadakaṇṭhatvādyanmadhuraṃ cukūja vavāśe tadeva māninīmānavināśacaturaṃ kāmasya vacanamanunayavacojātaṃ sampannam| 
tadākarṇanena priyeṣu saṃmukhībhāvāt| varṇavadraso 'pi kaṣāyaḥ|
kaṇṭhādīnāṃ ca kaṣāyamadhurakaṭukādivyavahāro .aupacārikaḥ| puṃskokilaśabde puṃśabdo vispaṣṭārthaḥ|| 32||

himavyapāyādviśadādharāṇāmāpāṇḍurībhūtamukhacchavīnām|
svedo navaḥ kiṃpuruṣāṅganānāṃ cakre padaṃ patraviśeṣakeṣu|| 33||

kiṃnarīṇāṃ patrarūpeṣu tilakeṣu nūtanaḥ svedaḥ padaṃ cakre sthānaṃ vyadhāt| 
prathamaṃ tatra sudarśanatvāt| kīdṛśīnām|
himavyapāyācchītātapāgamādviśadādharāṇāṃ nirmaloṣṭhīnām|
himena hyadharayorabhijātyābhāvādvivarṇatā jāyate| 
tathā kiṃcitpāṇḍuritā vadanacchaviryāsām|
nanvākālikatvānmadhupravṛttestataḥ pūrvaṃ tathākālasyābhāvātkathamatra
taddharmavarṇanam| satyametat|
ki.ṃ tūpakṣepamātre 'sāmayikatvamabhidhāyānantaraṃ sāmānyarūpeṇa
varṇanamityadoṣaḥ|| 33||

tapasvinaḥ sthāṇuvanaukasastāmākālikīṃ vīkṣya madhupravṛttim|
prayatnasaṃstambhitavikriyāṇāṃ kathaṃcidīśā manasāṃ babhūvuḥ|| 34||

sthāṇuvanaukso harāśramanivāsino munayastāmākālikīmasamayajāṃ vasantāvirbhūtimavalokya kṛcchreṇa cetasāṃ vaśitāro 'bhavan| 
yataḥ kālasya balavattvātprayatnena saṃstambhitā praśamitā vikriyā vikāro yeṣām| 
īśata iti īśāḥ prabhavaḥ| 
akāle bhavā ākālikī| adhyātmāditvāṭṭhañ|
ākālikaḍādyantavacane
ityetattvatra na saṃgatārtham|| 34||

taṃ deśamāropitapuṣpacāpe ratidvitīye madane prapanne|
kāṣṭhāgatasneharasānuviddhaṃ dvandvāni bhāvaṃ kriyayā vivavruḥ|| 35||

āropitaṃ sajyaṃ kṛtaṃ puṣpamayaṃ cāpaṃ yena
tasminnāropitapuṣpacāpe sabhārye smare tamāśramaṃ prāpte sati
bhṛṅgahariṇahastyādīni dvandvāni mithunāni
īdṛśaṃ bhāvamabhiprāyaṃ kriyayā karmaṇāṃ nirvṛtyā
vivavrurācakhyuḥ prakaṭīcakruḥ| kīdṛśam|
kāṣṭhāṃ parāṃ koṭiṃ gataḥ prāpto yaḥ snehaḥ prītī rasaśca
rāgastābhyāmanuviddhaṃ bhāvitam| ratirāgagarbhamityarthaḥ||
35||

kriyayā vivavrurityuktam| tadeva viśeṣeṇāha---

madhu dvirephaḥ kusumaikapātre papau priyāṃ svāmanuvartamānaḥ| 3.36ab
śṛṅgeṇa ca sparśanimīlitākṣīṃ mṛgīmakaṇḍūyata kṛṣṇaśāraḥ|| 3.36cd

kusumamevaikaṃ sādhāraṇaṃ pātraṃ caṣakam| tatra bhramaryā saha
madhupo madhumakarandamadadhat| 
tathā kṛṣṇaśārākhyo mṛgaḥ sparśamukulitanayanāṃ priyāṃ viṣāṇenākaṇḍūyatākaṣat|
sahapānaṃ kaṇḍūyanaṃ ca riraṃsāsūcakaṃ teṣām| evamuttaratra|
anuvṛttiścittagrahaṇamāvarjanam| akaṇḍūyateti kartari
ñitvāt| 
kaṇḍvādibhyo yak|
kṛṣṇaścāsau śāraśceti vigṛhya varṇo varṇena
iti samāsaḥ|| 36||

dadau saraḥpaṅkajareṇugandhi gajāya gaṇḍūṣajalaṃ kareṇuḥ|
ardhopabhuktena bisena jāyāṃ sambhāvayāmāsa rathāṅganāmā|| 37||

kareṇuḥ kariṇīḥ patye gaṇḍūṣajalaṃ dadau vyatarat| kīdṛśam|
sarasi paṅkajāni padmāni teṣāṃ reṇuḥ parāgastasya
gandho vidyate yatra| rathāṅganāmā cakravākaḥ sāmibhuktena
mṛṇālena priyāṃ sambhāvayāmāsāvarjayat|| 37||

gītāntare ca śramavārileśaiḥ kiṃcitsamucchvāsitapatralekham|
puṣpāsavāghūrṇitanetraśobhi priyāmukhaṃ kiṃpuruṣaścucumba|| 38||

gāyantyāḥ preyasyā vadanaṃ kiṃnaro rāgāccucumba papau|
kīdṛśam| 
svedasya kaṇairīṣatsamucchvasitā vikasitā patralatā yatra| 
tathā puṣpabhāvitenāsavena pānenāghūrṇitābhyāṃ bhramitābhyāṃ nayanābhyāṃ śobhate yattathoktam| 
gītāntare gītamadhye|| 38||

paryāptapuṣpastabakastanībhyaḥ sphuratpravāloṣṭhamanoharābhyaḥ|
latāvadhūbhyastaravo 'pyavāpurvinamraśākhābhujabandhanāni|| 39||

āsatāṃ tāvatsacetasaḥ| sthāvararūpāstaravo 'pi tadā
latāvadhūbhyo vallījāyābhyaḥ sakāśādvinamraśākhābhujabandhanāni
kuñcitapratānabāhvāliṅgitānyavāpurlebhire| tā hi
śākhābhistānāśliṣyantyārohanti| kīdṛśībhya iti
vadhūsādharmyamāha---paryāptāḥ paripūrṇāḥ puṣpastabakāḥ kusumagulmā eva
stanā yāsām| tathā kampamānāni pravālāni
kisalayānyevādharāstairmanoharābhyo rucirābhyaḥ|| 39||

śrutāpsarogītirapi kṣaṇe 'sminharaḥ prasaṃkhyānaparo babhūva|
ātmeśvarāṇāṃ na hi jātu vighnāḥ samādhibhedaprabhavo bhavanti|| 40||

asminkṣaṇe vasantāvirbhāvakāle bhagavānnirūpitasuralalanāgeyadhvanirapi prasaṃkhyānaparaḥ samādhiniṣṭha āsīnna tu vikṛtamanāḥ|
yasmādya ātmanaścittasyeśvarā vaśinasteṣāṃ vasantotsavādayo vighnāḥ śreyaḥpratyūhāḥ samādhibheda ekāgratābhaṅge prabhavaḥ śaktā na kadācitsampadyante| 
calacittasya hi vighnāvirbhāvaḥ| 
prasaṃkhyānādayo viśeṣarūpā api kāvyeṣvekāgratālakṣaṇaparāḥ| 
ātmaśabdenātra ṣaḍindriyāṇi lakṣyante|| 40||

latāgṛhadvāragato 'tha nandī vāmaprakoṣṭhārpitahemavetraḥ|
mukhārpitaikāṅgulisaṃjñayaiva mā cāpalāyeti gaṇānvyanaiṣīt|| 41||

tato nandī pratīhāro gaṇānvadananihitatarjanīsaṃketenaiva mā cāpalāyeti vyanaiṣīnnyayamayat|
evamākārapraśleṣeṇārta na kiṃcidadhyāhāryaṃ vartate|
kīdṛśo 'sau| latāgṛhadvārapradeśa vasthitaḥ pratīhāratvāt|
vāmaprakoṣṭhe golake 'rpitaṃ nihitaṃ hemavetraṃ svarṇadaṇḍo yena|
vetraṃ dāruviśeṣaḥ| tacca bāhulyena dvāsthā gṛhṇate|
sauvarṇādau tvaupacāriko vetraśabdasya vyavahāraḥ|
prakoṣṭhamantaraṃ vidyādaratnimaṇibandhayoḥ|
atra cāsabhyārthapratibhāsādekāṅguliśabdaṃ na sādhu manyante| 
mūtrotsarge hyekāṅguliśabdasaṃketaḥ|
ato mukhāgrasaṃsthāpitatarjanīka iti pāṭho yuktaḥ|| 41||

niṣkampavṛkṣaṃ nibhṛtadvirephaṃ mūkāṇḍajaṃ śāntamṛgapracāram|
tacchāsanātkānanameva sarvaṃ citrārpitārambhamivāvatasthe|| 42||

tato nandinideśādakhilameva
vanamālekhyanihitasaṃsthānamivābhavat| tathā hi
niṣkampavṛkṣaṃ niścalānokahaṃ nibhṛtadvirephaṃ vinītacañcarīkaṃ mūkāṇḍajaṃ mūkaśakuntaṃ śāntamṛgapracāraṃ nivṛttahariṇādibhramaṇam|
avatastha iti samavapravibhyaḥ sthaḥ|| 42||

dṛṣṭipradīpaṃ parihṛtya tasya kāmaḥ puraḥśukramiva prayāṇe|
prānteṣu saṃsaktanameruśākhaṃ dhyānāspadaṃ bhūtapaterviveśa|| 43||

tato madanaḥ śivasya dhyānāspadaṃ viveśa samādhisthānamaviśat|
bhagavato dṛṣṭipradīpaṃ netrajyotiḥ puraḥśukraprayāṇavatparihṛtya|
yathā bhagavānna paśyatītyarthaḥ| jigīṣorapi
yātrāyāṃ saṃmukho bhārgavo neṣyate| yaduktam---

pratiśukraṃ pratibudhaṃ pratyaṅgārakameva ca|
api śakrasamo rājā hatasainyo nivartate||

kīdṛśaṃ tat| prānteṣu nikaṭeṣu
saṃsaktā lagnā namerutaruśākhā yatra|| 43||

sa devadārudrumavedikāyāṃ śārdūlacarmavyavadhānavatyām|
āsīnamāsannaśarīrapātastriyambakaṃ saṃyaminaṃ dadarśa|| 44||

sa kāmastriyambakaṃ trinetraṃ tatra saṃyaminaṃ dhyānāsaktamadrākṣīt| 
kīdṛśaṃ devadārudrumasya vedikāyāmadhaḥsthalāyāṃ vyāghrājināntaritāyāmāsīnamupaviṣṭam|
āsanno nikaṭaḥ śarīrapāto dehadhvaṃso yasyeti
kāmaviśeṣaṇaṃ pādapūraṇārtham| 
iyādīnāṃ chandasi 
vidhānādbhāṣāyāṃ triyambakamiti prayogo durlabha iti
maheśvaramiti paṭhanīyam|| 44||

ślokaṣaṭkena samādhisthaṃ bhagavantaṃ varṇayitumāha---

paryaṅkabandhasthirapūrvakāyamṛjvāyatāsaṃnamitobhayāṃsam|
uttānapāṇidvayasaṃniveśātpraphullarājīvamivāṅkamadhye|| 45||

kīdṛśaṃ devaṃ dadarśa| 
paryaṅkabandhena vāsukiparyastikāracanena sthito niścalaḥ pūrvakāyaḥ pṛṣṭhabhāgo yasya| 
tathā ṛjū spaṣṭāvāyatau vistṛtāvubhau yāvaṃsau skandhau tau tadā saṃyaṅnamitau yena| 
utsaṅgāntare cāñjaliracanādvikasitakuśeśayayutamiva||  45||

bhujaṅgamonnaddhajaṭākalāpaṃ karāvasaktadviguṇākṣasūtram|
kaṇṭhaprabhābhyaktaviśeṣanīlāṃ mṛgatvacaṃ granthimatīṃ vasānam|| 46||

bhujaṅgamena vāsukinonnaddha ūrdhvabaddho jaṭājūṭo yena|
kare 'vasaktaṃ dviguṇamakṣasūtraṃ yasya|
akṣapūrṇaṃ sūtramakṣasūtram| dviguṇatvaṃ ca tasya sūtre
granthivaśāt| na tu dviguṇīkṛtya kare praveśāt| 
tathā mṛgatvacameṇājinaṃ vasānaṃ paridadhatam| kīdṛśīm| 
kaṇṭhasya kṛṣṇayā prabhayābhyaktāṃ snapitāṃ churitāmata eva viśeṣanīlāmadhikakṛṣṇām| devo hi nīlagalaḥ|
abhyaktārtho 'tra gauṇaḥ| abhyaṅgeti pāṭhe
tṛtīyāsamāsaḥ| granthimatīṃ dṛbdhiyutām|| 46||

kiṃcitprakāśastimitogratārairbhrūvikriyāyāṃ virataprasaṅgaiḥ|
netrairavispanditapakṣmamālairlakṣyīkṛtaghrāṇamadhomayūkhaiḥ|| 47||

netrairlakṣyīkṛtaghrāṇamīkṣitanāsāpuṭam| 
yaduktam---

sampaśyannāsikāgraṃ svaṃ diśaścānavalokayan||

trinetratvādbahuvacanam| kīdṛśaiḥ| prāyeṇa
nimīlitātkiṃcitprakāśā dṛśyāḥ stimitā niścalā ugrāścaṇḍāstārāḥ kanīnikā yeṣām|
bhrūkampādau ca nivṛttāvasaraiḥ|
avispanditā niścalāḥ pakṣmamālāḥ pattrālyo yeṣām|
adhaḥ prasṛtā mayūkhā aṃśavo yeṣāṃ taiḥ|| 47||

avṛṣṭisaṃrambhamivāmbuvāhamapāmivādhāramanuttaraṅgam|
antaścarāṇāṃ marutāṃ nirodhānnivātaniṣkampamiva pradīpam|| 48||

dehābhyantaravartināṃ prāṇādīnāṃ vāyūnāṃ nirodhāddhāraṇādevaṃvidhajaladodadhipradīpanibham|
kīdṛśaṃ megham|
avidyamāno vṛṣṭisaṃrambho varṣaṇārthaṃ garjitāḍambaro yasya
tam| abdhimapyanudgatakallolam| dīpaṃ tu
nivātatvānniṣkampamavicalam| bhagavānhi
niḥśabdaḥ śvāsapraśvāsarahito niṣpandasarvendriyaḥ|| 48||

kapālanetrāntaralabdhamārgairjyotiṣprarohairuditaiḥ śirastaḥ|
mṛṇālasūtrādhikasaukumāryāṃ bālasya lakṣmīṃ glapayantamindoḥ|| 49||

uttamāṅgādutthitairjyotiṣprarohaistejoṅkurairbālasya kalāmātrasya mauliśaśino lakṣmīṃ kāntiṃ glapayantaṃ khaṇḍayyantam|
yogināṃ hyuttamāṅgātteja udeti| kīdṛśaistaiḥ|
kapālaṃ mūrdhāsthi tasya netrāṇi randhrāṇi tanmadhyena labdhamārgairnirgataiḥ| 
tāṃ tu bisatantuto 'pyadhikakomalām|
jyotiṣprarohairiti nityaṃ samāse
iti ṣatvam| glapayantamiti glāsnāvanuvayāṃ ca
iti mitvasaṃjñā|| 49|| 

mano navadvāraniṣiddhavṛtti hṛdi vyavasthāpya samādhivaśyam|
yamakṣaraṃ kṣetravido vidustamātmānamātmanyavalokayantam|| 50||

tamātmānaṃ deheśvaramātmani svavapuṣi paśyantam| kaṃ tamityāha|
kṣetravido yogino yamakṣaramavināśinaṃ paraṃ brahmarūpaṃ vidurjānanti|
kiṃ kṛtvāvalokayantam| mano hṛdaye niveśya tata eva

karanetraśrotrāsyanāsikāstananābhibhiḥ|
pāyūpasthayutairdvārairnavabhirvapurā... ṃ 

ityeteṣu navadvāreṣu niṣiddhavṛtti nivartitaprasaram|
yataḥ samādhinaikāgratayā vaśyaṃ vaśanīyam| kulakam|| 50||

smarastathābhūtamayugmanetraṃ paśyannadūrānmanasāpyadhṛṣyam|
nālakṣayatsādhvasasannahastaḥ srastaṃ śarāvāpamapi svahastāt|| 51||

tato madana īdṛśaṃ tryakṣaṃ cetasāpyanabhibhāvyaṃ nikaṭādālokya
bhayātkampamānakaratvāccharāvāpaṃ sāyakamuṣṭiṃ cāpaṃ vātmapāṇerbhraṣṭamapi
sambhramavaśānnācetayat| śarā upyante 'neneti śarāvāpaḥ|
kṣepyo muṣṭiḥ śarāṇāṃ dhanureva vā| halaśca
iti ghañ|| 51||

nirvāṇabhūyiṣṭhamathāsya vīryaṃ saṃdhukṣayantīva vapurguṇena|
anuprayātā vanadevatābhyāmadṛśyata sthāvararājakanyā|| 52||

athāsminnavasare sakhīdvayānugatā pārvatyadṛśyata|
bhagavatsevārthamāgatetyarthaḥ| 
asya smarasya vīryaṃ balaṃ nirvāṇabhūyiṣṭhaṃ praśāntaprāyamapi vapurguṇena śarīrasaundaryeṇa saṃdhukṣayantīvoddīpayantī yathā| 
ālambanāvirbhāvasampatteḥ| 
nirvāṇaśabdo 'vāte niṣṭhāyām| nirvāṇo 'vāte
iti natvam| atiśayena bahu bhūyiṣṭham| bahorlopo bhū ca bahoḥ 
iṣṭasya yi.cca
nirvāṇena bhūyiṣṭhaṃ nirvāṇabhūyiṣṭhamiti tṛtīyasamāsaḥ|| 52||

aśokanirbhartsitapadmarāgamākṛṣṭahemadyutikarṇikāram|
muktākalāpīkṛtasindhuvāraṃ vasantapuṣpābharaṇaṃ vahantī|| 53||

vāsantikapuṣpāṇyevāgrāmyamalaṃkaraṇaṃ bibhratyadṛśyatet
sambandhaḥ| kīdṛśaṃ tat|
aśokapuṣpairnirbhartsitastiraskṛtaḥ padmarāgamaṇiryatra|
tathā piśaṅgatvādākṛṣṭā ānītā hemnaḥ suvarṇasya
dyutiḥ kāntiryena tattathāvidhaṃ karṇikāraṃ yatra| sitatvācca
muktākalāpīkṛtaṃ sindhuvāraṃ yatra|
mauktikasuvarṇapadmarāgāḥ kilābharaṇatayā prasiddhāḥ|| 53||

āvarjitā kiṃcidiva stanābhyāṃ vāso vasānā taruṇārkarāgam|
saṃjātapuṣpastabakāvanamrā saṃcāriṇī pallavinī lateva|| 54||

stanābhyāṃ manāṅmātramāvarjitā namitā taruṇārkarāgaṃ navoditaraviraktaṃ kausumbhamambaraṃ vasānā paridadhatī| 
ataścotprekṣyate| 
paryāptakusumagucchāvanatā sakisalayā ca saṃcāriṇī lateva| vane hi latā sambhāvyā|
pratyakṣameva tathā darśanātsaṃcāritvotprekṣā| 
yathā hiraṇmayīsālalateva jaṅgamā
iti bhaṭṭeḥ|| 54||

srastāṃ nitambādavalambamānā punaḥ punaḥ kesarapuṣpakāñcīm|
nyāsīkṛtāṃ sthānavidā smareṇa dvitīyamaurvīmiva kārmukasya|| 55||

śroṇībhāgāccalitāṃ bakulakusumaraśanāmaskṛdavalambamānotkṣipantī|
utprekṣyate---sthānavidā nikṣepāspadajñena madanena nijadhanuṣo dvitīyāṃ maurvīṃ jyāmiva|
nyāsīkṛtāṃ nikṣepaṃ sthāpitām| 
sā hi vaidagdhyasvarūpatāruṇyāvirbhāvaiḥ sthānaṃ smaranikṣepasya|| 55||

sugandhiniṣśvāsavivṛddhatṛṣṇaṃ bimbādharāsannacalaṃ dvirepham|
pratikṣaṇaṃ sambhramaloladṛṣṭirlīlāravindena nivārayantī|| 56||

vilāsanalinena madhupamasakṛdapāsyantī|
yato bimbaphalalohite 'dhara āsannaṃ nikaṭaṃ calaṃ ca bhramantam| 
kuta ityāha---sugandhau niḥśvāse vivṛddhatṛṣṇaṃ saṃjātagarvam| 
ata eva sā sambhramavaśālloladṛṣṭiścakitekṣaṇā sahajatvātsaugandhyasyaikāntikatve sati sugandhīti
gandhasyedu
itītvam| bimbatulyo 'dharo bimbādhara iti
śākapārthivāditvātsamāsaḥ| tadetena rūpavarṇanena
saṃvananayogyatvaṃ devyā darśitam|| kulakam|| 56||

tāṃ vīkṣya sarvāvayavānavadyāṃ raterapi hrīpadamādadhānām|
yatendriye śūlini puṣpaketuḥ svakarmasiddhiṃ punarāśaśaṃsa|| 57||

tāmevaṃvidhāṃ gaurīmavalokya kusumadhvajaścetoharaṇalakṣaṇāṃ svakarmasiddhiṃ jitendriye 'pi hare punarāśaśaṃsa samabhāvayat|
yataḥ sarveṣvavayaveṣuhastapādādiṣvanavadyāmanindyāṃ manojñām|
ata eva smaravadhvā api hrīpadaṃ lajjāspadamādadhānāṃ kurvatīm| 
hriyaḥ padaṃ hrīpadam|
āśaśaṃseti śaṃsu stutau 
ityasyāṅpūrvasya rūpam| na tu āṅaḥ śasi icchāyām 
ityasyātmanepadinaḥ| kuryāṃ harasyāpītyetadapekṣayā
punastvam|| 57||

upāsituṃ sā ca pinākapāṇiṃ samāsasāda pratihārabhūmim|
yogātsa cāntargatamātmasaṃjñaṃ dṛṣṭvā paraṃ jyotirupārarāma|| 58||

yadaiva devī bhagavantaṃ sevituṃ dvārapradeśamāpa tadaiva devo 'pi hṛtpadmasaṃsthaṃ paraṃ jyotirātmākhyamālokya yogātsamādherupārarāma nyavartata|
paramātmatejodarśanaparyantaṃ yogavidhiḥ|
caśabdāvekakālasūcanārthau| 
ekena hi samuccayamātraṃ pratīyate na tu kriyayorekakālatā| upārarāmeti vyāṅparibhyo ramaḥ 
upācca|
pratīhāro dvāram|| 58||

tato bhujaṅgādhipateḥ phaṇābhiradhaḥ kathaṃciddhṛtabhūmibhāgam|
śanaiḥ kṛtaprāṇavimuktirīśaḥ paryaṅkabandhaṃ nibiḍaṃ bibheda|| 59||

tato jyotirdarśanādanantaramīśvaro nibiḍaṃ dṛḍhaṃ paryaṅkabandhamavasaktikāracanāṃ bibheda samāpayat| kīdṛśam| 
nāganāthasya śeṣāheḥ phaṇābhiḥ śirobhiradhaḥ pātāle kathaṃciddhṛto bhūmibhāgo yatra| 
gauravaṃ hi mahātmanāṃ sahajam| viśeṣataḥ samādhisamaye|
bhagavānkīdṛśaḥ| 
śanairna sahasā kṛtā prāṇānāṃ vāyūnāṃ vimuktistyāgo yena| 
samādhau hi marutāṃ nirodhaḥ| 
bhujaṅgādhipatiśabde rājapuruṣavatṣaṣṭhīsamāsaḥ|| 59||

tasmai śaśaṃsa praṇipatya nandī śuśrūṣayā śailasutāmupetām|
praveśayāmāsa ca bharturenāṃ bhrūkṣepamātrānumitapraveśām|| 60||

tataḥ sevārthamāgatāṃ gaurīṃ śailādiḥ praṇipatya harāya vyajijñapat|
śaṃsitvā ca tāṃ prāveśayat|
yataḥ prabhorbhrūkampamātreṇānumitapraveśām| 
tasmā iti kriyāgrahaṇamiti sampradānatvam|| 
60||

tasyāḥ sakhībhyāṃ praṇipātapūrvaṃ svahastabhūtaḥ śiśirātyayasya|
vyakīryata tryambakapādamūle puṣpoccayaḥ pallavabhaṅgabhinnaḥ|| 61||

tato devaṃ praṇamya vanadevatābhyāṃ pārvatīvayasyābhyāṃ haracaraṇamūle kisalayakhaṇḍamiśraḥ kusumaprakaro vyakīryata vyakṣepi|
kīdṛśaḥ| 
śiśirātyayasya vasantasya svahastabhūtaḥ pāṇinibhaḥ| 
tanmayatvāttasya| atyayo 'ntaḥ|
uccayaśabdaḥ kavīnāṃ pramādajaḥ| hastādāne cerasteye
iti ghañā aco bādhitatvāt| 
bhāvānayane dravyānayanamityuccitāni puṣpāṇi vyakīryantetyayamarthaḥ|
bhajyata iti bhaṅgaḥ khaṇḍaḥ| bhinno viśeṣitaḥ|| 61||

umāpi nīlālakamadhyaśobhi visraṃsayantī navakarṇikāram|
cakāra karṇacyutapallavena mūrdhnā praṇāmaṃ vṛṣabhadhvajāya|| 62||

na kevalaṃ sakhyau yāvatpārvatyapi vṛṣaketuṃ śirasāvandata|
kīdṛśī|
kṛṣṇasīmantaracitaṃ pratyagrakarṇikārakusumaṃ praṇāmavaśādvisraṃsayantī
cālayantī| praṇāmādeva mūrdhnaḥ śrotrabhraṣṭakisalayatvam||
62||

ananyabhājaṃ patnimāpnuhīti sā tathyamevābhihitā bhavena|
na hīśvaravyāhṛtayaḥ kadācitpuṣyanti pāke viparītamartham|| 63||

kṛtapraṇāmā cāsau
hareṇānanyabhājamasādhāraṇaṃ bhartāraṃ labhasvetyagadyata|
etacca satyameva| devena paścādudvāhitatvāt| na
caitadāścaryam|
yasmādīśvarāṇāmāḍhyānāṃ vyāhṛtaya uktayaḥ pāke
phalakāle viparītamanyamevārthaṃ na puṣyanti na phalanti|
devaśceśvaraḥ|
kleśakarmavipākāśayairaparāmṛṣṭaḥ puruṣaviśeṣa īśvaraḥ|
anyaṃ bhajatītyanyabhāk| tato nañsamāsaḥ|| 63||

kāmastu bāṇāvasarapratīkṣaḥ pataṅgavadvahnimukhaṃ vivikṣuḥ|
umāsamakṣaṃ harabaddhalakṣyaḥ śarāsanajyāṃ muhurāmamarśa|| 64||

gaurīśvarau vandanāśiṣau cakratuḥ|
madanaḥ punaḥ śarakṣepasamayapratīkṣaḥ sandhanurmaurvīmasakṛdāmamarśa
pasparśa| umāpratyakṣaṃ hara eva baddhaṃ lakṣyaṃ yen| 
ata eva śalabhavadagnimadhyaṃ yiyāsuḥ| 
na hi tatrāpakṛtya svāsthyam(?)|| 64||

athopaninye giriśāya gaurī tapasvine tāmrarucā kareṇa|
viśoṣitāṃ bhānumato mayūkhairmandākinīpuṣkarabījamālām|| 65||

tato gaurī sthāṇave nijapāṇinā gaṅgāpadmākṣavalayaṃ ḍhaukanikārthamupaninye 'ḍhaukayat|
yato 'sau tapasvī tādṛśaireva vastubhiḥ prīyate| 
tāmrarucā lauhityenetyabhilāṣapratipādanaparam|
bhānumato mayūkhairviśoṣitāmiti svarūpamātroktiḥ|| 65||

pratigrahītuṃ praṇayipriyatvāttrilocanastāmupacakrame ca|
saṃmohanaṃ nāma ca puṣpadhanvā dhanuṣyamoghaṃ samadhatta bāṇam|| 66||

tataḥ priyabhaktatvādyadaiva devastāmakṣamālāmādhātumupacakrame prārebhe tadaiva kāmadevaḥ kārmuke saṃmohanākhamavandhyaṃ śaraṃ samadhatta prāyojayat| 
puṣpairdhanuryasya puṣpadhanvā| dhanuṣaśca
ityanaṅṅādeśaḥ (?)|
saṃmohanonmādanatāpanaśoṣaṇamāraṇākhyāḥ pañca śarāḥ||
66||

harastu kiṃcitparivṛttadhairyaścandrodayārambha ivāmburāśiḥ|
umāmukhe bimbaphalādharauṣṭhe vyāpārayāmāsa vilocanāni|| 67||

atha bhagavānpārvatīvaktre dṛṣṭimakṣipat|
yataḥ smaraśaraprahāravaśātkiṃcinmanākparivṛttadhairyaścalitagāmbhīryaḥ śaśikarasaṃsparśādudadhiriva|
bimbaphalalohito 'dharauṣṭho yasyetyabhilāṣadarśanapratipādanaparaṃ mukhaviśeṣaṇam|
tuśabdo 'thaśabdārthaḥ|| 67||

vivṛṇvatī śailasutāpi bhāvamaṅgaiḥ sphuradbālakadambakalpaiḥ|
sācīkṛtā cārutareṇa tasthau mukhena paryastavilocanena|| 68||

gauryapi lajjāvaśānmukhena sācīkṛtā tiryagbhūtā tasthāvāsta| 
ata eva paryaste 'dhaḥ pātite locane yasya tena| kīdṛśī|
romāñcitatvātsphuṭadbālakadambakalpairvidaladajaraṭhakadambakusumanibhairavayavairbhāvamabhiprāyamabhilāṣaṃ vivṛṇvantī prakaṭayantī| 
rāgavaśāddhi romāñcotpattiḥ|
kadambānāṃ romavaśādupamānatvam| 
apiḥ pūrvāpekṣayā samuccaye|| 68||

athendriyakṣobhamayugmanetraḥ punarvaśitvādbalavannigṛhya|
hetuṃ svacetovikṛterdidṛkṣurdiśāmupānteṣu sasarja dṛṣṭim|| 69||

atha gauryāmabhilāṣakāryamindriyavikāraṃ tryakṣo jitendriyatvādbalena nigṛhya vaśīkṛtya nijamanovikārakāraṇaṃ vicicīṣuḥ kakubhāṃ paryanteṣu dṛṣṭiṃ sasarja cikṣepa|
balaṃ vidyate yatra tadbalavadvaśo 'syāstīti vaśī śāntaḥ|| 69||

sa dakṣiṇāpāṅganiviṣṭamuṣṭiṃ natāṃsamākuñcitasavyapādam|
dadarśa cakrīkṛtacārucāpaṃ prahartumabhyudyatamātmayonim|| 70||

tato 'sāvātmayoniṃ manobhavamaikṣata| kīdṛśam|
prahartumabhyudyatam| 
ataśca cāpakarṣaṇavaśāddakṣiṇe 'pāṅge netraparyante niviṣṭo muṣṭiryasya| 
nato vāmo 'ṃso yasya| 
ā īṣatkuñcito vakraḥ savyapādo yasya|
cakrīkṛtaṃ maṇḍalitaṃ cārucāpaṃ yena|| 70||

tapaḥparāmarśavivṛddhamanyorbhrūbhaṅgaduṣprekṣyamukhasya tasya|
sphurannudarciḥ sahasā tṛtīyādakṣṇaḥ kṛśānuḥ kila niṣpapāta|| 71||

tataḥ śivasya lalāṭanetrādudarcirjvalajjvālo 'nalo jhaṭiti
nirjagāma| yatastapasaḥ parāmarśena khaṇḍanayā
vivṛddhamanyostīvrakopasya| ataśca
bhrūbhaṅgavaśāddurdarśavaktrasya| kiletyāgame|| 71||

krodhaṃ prabho saṃhara saṃhareti yāvadgiraḥ khe marutāṃ caranti|
tāvatsa vahnirbhavanetrajanmā bhasmāvaśeṣaṃ madanaṃ cakāra|| 72||

bhagavanmanyuṃ śamaya
kṣamasvetyādiko vāco yāvaddevānāmākāśe prasaranti sma
tāvadevāsau haranayanajo 'nalo bhūtiśeṣaṃ kāmamakārṣīt|
dadāhetyarthaḥ| saṃhara saṃhareti sambhrame dvitvam|
carantīti laṭprayogo na tathā nyāyyaḥ| 
bhūte liṅādibhirbādhitatvāt| yathā 
na yāvadetāvadudapaśyadutthitau
iti māghasya| yāvattāvacchabdau nipātitau
kriyayostulyakālatāmāhatuḥ|| 72||

tīvrābhiṣaṅgaprabhavena vṛttiṃ mohena saṃstambhayatendriyāṇām|
ajñātabhartṛvyasanā muhūrtaṃ kṛtopakāreva ratirbabhūva|| 73||

tadā ca kṣaṇamātraṃ mūrcchayācetitapativināśā ratirupakṛtevāsīt|
yataścakṣurādīnāmindriyāṇāṃ vṛttiṃ darśanādivyāpāraṃ saṃstambhayatā praśamayatā|
tīvro duḥsaho yo 'bhiṣaṅgo 'bhighāto duḥkhaṃ tataḥ prabhavo janma yasyeti mohaviśeṣaṇam|| 73||

tamāśu vighnaṃ tapasastapasvī vanaspatiṃ vajra ivāvabhajya|
strīsaṃnikarṣaṃ parihartumicchannantardadhe bhūtapatiḥ sabhūtaḥ|| 74||

tato bhagavānaṅganāsamīpaṃ tityakṣuḥ sabhūto gaṇasahito 'ntardadhe tirobhūt|
taṃ tapovighnaṃ madanamāśu tvaritamavabhajya vināśya|
vajro 'śaniryathā vanaspatiṃ taruṃ bhanakti|
vajraśabdo 'rdharcādiḥ|| 74|| 

atha sa mukulitākṣīṃ rudrasaṃrambhabhītyā duhitaramanukampyāmadrirādāya dorbhyām|
suragaja iva bibhratpadminīṃ dantalagnāṃ pratipathagatirāsīdvegadīrghīkṛtāṅgaḥ|| 75||

tata evaṃvidhaṃ vṛttāntamavagatya himavānanukampyāṃ lālanīyāṃ sutāṃ bāhubhyāmādāya pratipathagatirāsītpratīpagāmī babhūva| 
gṛhaṃ yayāvityarthaḥ| kīdṛśīṃ tām|
harakṣobhatrāsānmukulitākṣīṃ saṃkucitanetrāmata evānukampyāṃ yogyām|
suragajo .airāvaṇo viṣāṇadhṛtāṃ nalinīmudvahanyathā pratipathagatirbhavatyevamadrirājo 'bhūt|
padminīśabdenaivamādau padmānyeva tātsthyāducyante|
patha ābhimukhyena pratipatham| ṛkpūrabdhūḥpathāmānakṣe|
pratipathaṃ gatiryasya sa pratipathagatiḥ| 
vegena kṣobhena dīrghīkṛtaṃ prasāritamivāṅgaṃ yena| mālinīvṛttam|| 75||

śailātmajāpi piturucchiraso 'bhilāṣaṃ 
vyarthaṃ samarthya lalitaṃ vapurātmanaśca|
sakhyoḥ samakṣamiti cādhikajātalajjā
śūnyā jagāma bhavanābhimukhī kathaṃcit|| 76||

atha pārvatī śūnyacittā gṛhābhimukhaṃ kṛcchreṇa yayau|
kiṃ kṛtvā| 
ucchirasa uddhurakandharasyonnatacittasya piturīśvarāyaināṃ dadāmīti manorathaṃ vyarthaṃ samarthya|
viphalamavagamyātmīyaṃ ca lalitaṃ savilāsaṃ dehaṃ vyarthaṃ samarthya kimetena nirarthakamanohareṇa śarīrakeṇa mama prayojanamiti| 
tathā sakhyorvanadevatayoranvakṣamevamayaṃ paribhava ityato hetoradhikā jātā lajjā yasyāḥ| 
anyādarśane hi na tathā paribhavo hṛdayamāskandati| 
sampūrvasyārthayateḥ samartheti rūpam| vasantatilakaṃ vṛttam|| 76|| 

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ tṛtīyaḥ sargaḥ||
 
 Caturthaḥ sargaḥ|

atha mohaparāyaṇā satī vivaśā kāmavadhūrvibodhitā|
vidhinā pratipādayiṣyatā navavaidhavyamasahyavedanam|| 1||

tato mohāviṣṭatvādvivaśāsvādhīnā satī ratiḥ kṣaṇamātreṇa vedhasā duḥsahaṃ pratyagraṃ vaidhavyamabhartṛkatvaṃ pratipādayituṃ vibodhitā prāptacetanā kṛtā| 
muhūrtamātraṃ hi tayā vaidhavyaṃ nājñāyi| 
vigato naṣṭo dhavaḥ patiryasyāḥ sā vidhavā| 
pratipādayiṣyateti lṛṅṅatra kriyāyāṃ kriyārthāyām| 
sarge 'tra vaitālīyamardhasamaṃ vṛttam|| 1||

avadhānapare cakāra sā pralayāntonmiṣite vilocane|
na viveda tayoratṛptayoḥ priyamatyantanimagnadarśanam|| 2||

pralayo mohastadanta unmiṣite vilocane netre sā didṛkṣayāvadhānapare ekāgre vyadhāt| 
na ca nityanaṣṭāvalokanaṃ kāntaṃ tābhyāmatṛptābhyāmasāvajñāsīt|
asambhāvyatvānnāśasya| 
priyāpekṣayā tayoriti sambandhe ṣaṣṭhī| 
anādare vā| 
atṛpte netre anādṛtyātyantaṃ nimagnaṃ yasya|| 2||

ayi jīvitanātha jīvasītyabhidhāyotthitayā tayā puraḥ|
dadṛśe puruṣākṛti kṣitau harakopānalabhasma kevalam|| 3||

kaccitprāṇeśvara jīvasītyuktvotthitayā tayā kevalaṃ puruṣasaṃsthānaṃ rudraroṣāgnibhasma dadṛśe dṛṣṭam|
na tu priyaḥ| matsyasyeva dagdhasya tasyākāro na naṣṭaḥ||
3||

atha sā punareva vihvalā vasudhāliṅganadhūsarastanī|
vilalāpa vikīrṇamūrdhajā samaduḥkhāmiva kurvatī sthalīm|| 4||

tato vilulitakeśā vihvalā cākulā sā vilalāpa śuśoca|
punareva vasudhāliṅganena dhūsarastanī malinakucā| 
ādāvapi hyasau bhuvi patitāsīt|
karuṇavilāpātsthalīṃ samaduḥkhāmiva vidadhatī| 
tasyā api śokāvirbhāvāt| 
sthalīśabdenātra tadgatāḥ prāṇino lakṣyante| jānapadāditvātṅī.ḥ|| 
4||

tameva vilāpamāha---

upamānamabhūccharīriṇāṃ karaṇaṃ yattava kāntimattayā|
tadidaṃ gatamīdṛśīṃ daśāṃ na vidīrye kaṭhināḥ khalu striyaḥ|| 5||

priya tvadīyaṃ śarīraṃ rūpavattayā yatkāmināmupamānamabhūtkāmadevasadṛśo 'yamiti tadidamīdṛśīṃ bhasmarūpāṃ daśāmavasthāṃ yātam|
tathāpi nāhaṃ vidīrye sphuṭe| 
ataḥ striyaḥ khalu kaṭhināḥ kaṭhoracittāḥ| 
karaṇānīndriyāṇi vidyante yasya tatkaraṇaṃ vapuḥ| 
vidīrya iti karmakartari| khalurviṣāde|| 5||

kva nu māṃ tvadadhīnajīvitāṃ vinikīrya kṣaṇabhinnasauhṛdaḥ|
nalinīṃ kṣatasetubandhano jalasaṃghāta ivāsi vidrutaḥ|| 6||

bhavadāyattaprāṇāṃ māṃ vinikīrya hitvā kṣaṇamātreṇa bhinnaṃ kṣataṃ sauhṛdaṃ prītiryena sa bhavānkva nu vidrutaḥ palāyitaḥ| 
yathā setubandhanaṃ kṣapayitvā padminīṃ parityajya toyapūro vidravati| 
sauhṛdasya seturupamānam| suhṛdaḥ karma sauhṛdaṃ prītiḥ|
saṃjñāpūrvako vidhiranityaḥ 
ityubhayapadavṛddhyabhāvaḥ| vinikīryeti kṝ vikṣepe|
nurviṣāde|| 6||

kṛtavānasi vipriyaṃ na me pratikūlaṃ na ca te mayā kṛtam|
kimakāraṇameva darśanaṃ vilapantyai rataye na dīyate|| 7||

anyonyāprītividhānaṃ kila tyāgakāraṇam| 
taccāvayorna samasti| 
ataśca duḥkhitāṃ māṃ kasmādāgatya darśanena nāhlādayasīti vākyārthaḥ| viprīṇātīti vipriyam|| 7||

smarasi smara mekhalāguṇairuta gotraskhaliteṣu bandhanam|
cyutakesaradūṣitekṣaṇānyavataṃsotpalatāḍitāni vā|| 8||

athavā gotraskhaliteṣu nāmaviparyeṣu raśanādāmabandhanaṃ karṇakuvalayaprahārāṃśca smarasi tena manyukāraṇaṃ tavāsti| 
sa hi sapatnīnāmnāhvayaṃstayā mekhalayā baddhaḥ karṇotpalena ca tāḍitaḥ| 
cyutena kesareṇa dūṣite īkṣaṇe yairiti tāḍanaviśeṣaṇam|
śekharaḥ karṇapuṣpaṃ cāvataṃsaḥ|| 8||

hṛdaye vasasīti matpriyaṃ yadavocastadavaimi kaitavam|
upacārapadaṃ na cedidaṃ tvamanaṅgaḥ kathamakṣatā ratiḥ|| 9||

vallabhatvādahaṃ sadaiva tvāṃ cetasi vahāmi iti mama priyaṃ yattvamavoco 'bhyadhāstadahaṃ kaitavaṃ dhūrtatvaṃ vyājamavaimi jane| kasmāt|
yadyetannopacārapadamāvarjanavacanaṃ tattvamanaṅgo naṣṭaśarīro 'haṃ tu kathamakṣatādagdhā| 
ādhāranāśe hyādheyasyāpi bādhayā bhāvyam| 
avoca iti vacanam| kitavasya karma kaitavam|| 9||

paralokanavapravāsinaḥ pratipatsye padavīmahaṃ tava|
vidhinā jana eṣa vañcitastvadadhīnaṃ khalu dehināṃ sukham|| 10||

bhavannāśe na vā mama kvacitkṣatiḥ| 
yato yamalokagāmino 'pi tava panthānamahamanumaraṇādapi prāpsyāmi| 
lokaḥ punareṣa vedhasā vañcitaḥ| 
yato bhavadāyattaṃ prāṇināṃ sukham| sati hi kāme viṣayāḥ sukhakāriṇaḥ| 
tvadadhīnaśabde tvayyadhīti vigṛhya saptamī śauṇḍairiti
samāsaḥ| tato 'dhyuttarapadātkhaḥ|
adhiraiśvarye| tvaṃ sukhasyeśvara ityarthaḥ| evamanyatra||
10||

rajanītimirāvaguṇṭhite puramārge ghanaśabdaviklavāḥ|
vasatiṃ priya kāmināṃ priyāstvadṛte prāpayituṃ ka īśvaraḥ|| 11||

he priya niśāndhakārāvacchādite nagarapathe yā kāmināṃ vallabhānāṃ vasatiḥ sadma tāmabhisārikāḥ prāpayituṃ tvadṛte bhavadvarjaṃ ka īśvaraḥ śaktaḥ|
yatastā ghanaśabdaviklavā meghagarjitakātarāḥ| 
sati tu tvayi na timiraṃ gaṇyate na jaladaraṇitabhayam| 
priyā iti striyāṃ śasantaḥ| 
gatyarthatvācca dvikarmakatā| tvaditi ṛteśabdayoge pañcamī|| 11||

nayanānyaruṇāni ghūrṇayanvacanāni skhalayanpade pade|
asati tvayi vāruṇīmadaḥ pramadānāmadhunā viḍambanā|| 12||

dūrībhūte bhavatīdānīmaṅganānāṃ vidhavānāmiva vāruṇīmadaḥ surākṛtā kṣībatā viḍambanopahāsaḥ|
yato netrāṇi lohitīkṛtya ghūrṇayaṃstaralayanpratipadaṃ ca vacāṃsi skhalayan| 
evaṃ śṛṅgāraṃ vinā trapākarametat|| 12||

avagamya kathīkṛtaṃ vapuḥ priyabandhostava niṣphalodayaḥ|
bahule 'pi gate niśākarastanutāṃ duḥkhamanaṅga mokṣyati|| 13||

he anaṅga naṣṭatano tava priyabandhordehaṃ kathīkṛtaṃ kathāmātraśeṣaṃ vijñāya gate bahule 'pi kṛṣṇapakṣātikrame 'pi śaśāṅkastanutāṃ kārśyaṃ duḥkhaṃ kṛcchrakṛcchreṇa tyakṣyati| 
yato niṣphalodayaḥ| 
tena hyuditenotkaṇṭhādikaṃ kāryam| tacca nāsati tvayi|
vapuṣaḥ kathanātkathāmātraśeṣātkathāśabdavācyatvāt|
akathā kathā kṛtaṃ kathīkṛtam| cviḥ| 
asya cvau
itītvam| duḥkhamiti kriyāviśeṣaṇatvātkarmatvam|| 13||

haritāruṇacārubandhanaḥ kalapuṃskokilaśabdasūcitaḥ|
vada samprati kasya bāṇatāṃ navacūtaprasavo gamiṣyati|| 14||

priya kathayedānīmeṣa cūtatarornavaḥ prasavaḥ kusumaṃ kasyānyasya śaratvaṃ yāsyati|
tvameva kila cūtāṅkurāstraḥ| kīdṛśo 'sau|
kiṃciddharitaṃ nīlamīṣaccāruṇamata eva cāru bandhanaṃ vṛntaṃ yasya| 
tathā madhuraparapuṣṭaravasūcitaḥ|
tasyāpi svarabhāvāvirbhāvāt|| 14||

alipaṅktiranekaśastvayā guṇakṛtye dhanuṣo niyojitā|
vitataiḥ karuṇasvarairiyaṃ guruśokāmanuroditīva mām|| 15||

eṣā bhramarāvalī vitatairdīrghaiḥ karuṇaiśca svarairguñjitairatiduḥkhitāṃ māmanuroditīva paścācchocatīva| 
anurodanaṃ hi strīṇāṃ suprasiddham|
virutairiti pāṭhe karuṇasvanairiti paṭhanīyam|
svarāḥ ṣaḍjādayaḥ|
kastayoḥ paricayo yadanuroditītyāha---tvayā dhanuṣo guṇakṛtye maurvīkārye bahuśo niyojitā|
kvaṇadalikulaguṇaṃ hi kāmakārmukam| 
anuroditīti rutādibhyaḥ sārvadhātuke
itīḍāgamaḥ| 
akarmakā api dhātavaḥ sopasargāḥ sakarmakā bhavantīti 
sakarmakatvam|| 15||

pratipadya manoharaṃ vapuḥ punarapyādiśa tāvadutthitaḥ|
ratidūtipadeṣu kokilāṃ madhurālāpavisargapaṇḍitām|| 16||

ramyaṃ dehamāsādya ratidūtisthāneṣu bhūyo 'pi parapuṣṭāṃ prahiṇu| 
yataḥ sā madhurālāpavisarge kalavirutamokṣe paṇḍitā pravīṇā| 
kalavacanā kila dūtīkriyate| nisargeti pāṭhe svabhāvo nisargaḥ|
ratirityātmānaṃ nirdiśati| ramaṇaṃ vā ratiḥ| 
kāmasya hi kokilaiva ratidūtī| tadrutaniśamanena ririṃsotpādāt|
dūtiśabde bāhulakāddhrasvaḥ|| 16||

śirasā praṇipatya yācitānyupagūḍhāni savepathūni ca|
suratāni ca tāni tāni te smara saṃsmṛtya na śāntirasti me|| 17||

praṇatipūrvamabhyarthitāni kampayuktāni tavāliṅganānyanyāni ca paricumbanādīni tāni tāni ca suratāni nānārūpāṇi mohanānyanusmṛtya priya nāhaṃ nirvṛtiṃ labhe| 
prathame 'tra caśabdaḥ paricumbanādyanuktasamuccayārthaḥ|
upagūḍhaśabdo bhāve| 
saṃsmṛtya na śāntirastīti bhinnakartṛkatvātktvāpratyayo durlabhaḥ| 
yadi vā śamikriyāpekṣameva paurvakālyam| 
etatsaṃsmṛtya nāhaṃ śāmyāmītyarthaḥ| evamanyatra yathāśakti yojyam|| 17||

racitaṃ ratipaṇḍita tvayā svayamaṅgeṣu mamedamārtavam|
dhriyate kusumaprasādhanaṃ tava taccāru vapurna dṛśyate|| 18||

he ratikarmakuśala kusumālaṃkaraṇamidamārtavaṃ vāsantikaṃ bhavatā svayameva mamāvayaveṣu viniveśitaṃ lagitaṃ dhriyate tiṣṭhati| 
tava punastanmanoharamaṅgaṃ vapurna lakṣyate ityaho dehabhṛtāmasāratā| ṛtuḥ prāpto 'syārtavam| 
ṛtoraṇ|| 18||

vibudhairasi yasya dāruṇairasamāpte pratikarmaṇi smṛtaḥ|
tamimaṃ kuru dakṣiṇetaraṃ caraṇaṃ nirmitarāgamehi me|| 19||

yasyāsamāpte pratikarmaṇi prasādhane tvaṃ nirdayairnākibhirādhyātastamimaṃ savyaṃ me pādamāgatya
samāptālaktakaṃ vidhehi| 
sa hi tāmalaṅkurvannindreṇānusmṛtaḥ| 
dāruṇatvamatra prāṇāntakare karmaṇi viniyogāt|| 19||

iyametya pataṅgavartmanā punaraṅkāśrayiṇī bhavāmi te|
caturaiḥ surakāminījanaiḥ priya yāvanna vilobhyase divi|| 20||

pataṅgo 'gniḥ sa eva vartma mārgastatsamīpaprāptyupāyabhūtatvāttenāgatyeyamahaṃ bhavadutsaṅgavartinī bhūyo bhavāmi| 
yāvannipuṇairapsarolokairnāke kānta na vilobhyase|| 20||

madanena vinākṛtā ratiḥ kṣaṇamātraṃ kila jīviteti me|
vacanīyamidaṃ vyavasthitaṃ ramaṇa tvāmanuyāmi yadyapi|| 21||

he vallabha yadyapi tvāmanumaraṇenānugacchāmi tathāpi mama vācyate 'yaṃ loke rūḍhaiva yatkāme svargībhūte 'pi ratirmuhūtamāstraṃ jīviteti| 
tādṛśe hi premṇi tadaiva hṛdayasphoṭanena maraṇamucitam| 
vinākṛteti supsupeti samāsaḥ|| 21||

kriyatāṃ kathamantyamaṇḍanaṃ paralokāntaritasya te mayā|
samameva gato 'syatarkitāṃ gatimaṅgena ca jīvitena ca|| 22||

paralokāntaritasya vyavahitasya tava kusumavasanāṅgarāgādikamavasānabhūṣaṇaṃ kathaṃ mayā vidhīyatām|
yato jīvitadehābhyāṃ yugapannaṣṭo 'si|
anyastu mṛto 'pi śarīramātreṇa tiṣṭhati|| 22||

ṛjutāṃ nayataḥ smarāmi te śaramutsaṅganiṣaṇṇadhanvanaḥ|
madhunā saha sasmitāṃ kathāṃ nayanopāntavilokitaṃ ca tat|| 23||

tavāṅke cāpamavasthāpya sāyakaṃ spaṣṭīkurvataḥ surabhiṇā saha sahāsāṃ kathāmapāṅgekṣaṇaṃ ceti sarvamahamanusmarāmi| 
netrāntekṣaṇaṃ smarasya ratervā|| 23||

kva nu te hṛdayaṃgamaḥ sakhā kusumāyojitakārmuko madhuḥ|
na khalūgraruṣā pinākinā gamitaḥ so 'pi suhṛdgatāṃ gatim|| 24||

kvāsau tavātipriyo vayasyo vasantaḥ| 
tava kusumairāyojitaṃ viracitaṃ kārmukaṃ cāpo yena| 
kaccidatoroṣeṇa rudreṇa so 'pi tvayaiva saha nītaḥ| 
māso 'pi tena dagdha ityarthaḥ|| 24||

atha taiḥ paridevitākṣarairhṛdaye digdhaphalairivārditaḥ|
ratimabhyavapattumāturāmṛturātmānamadarśayatpuraḥ|| 25||

tato vasanto duḥkhitāṃ mitrajāyāmabhyavapattuṃ paritrātuṃ tadagrata ātmānamadarśayadāvirabhūt|
yatastadīyaiḥ pralāpavacobhirhṛdaye 'rditaḥ pīḍito digdhaphalairviṣaliptaiḥ śarairiva||
25||

tamavekṣya ruroda sā bhṛśaṃ stanasambādhamuro jaghāna ca|
svajanasya hi duḥkhamagrato vivṛtadvāramivopajāyate|| 26||

tato madhumālokya ratirnitarāṃ śuśoca| 
stanasaṃkaṭaṃ ca vakṣo 'tāḍayat|
yasmādbandhoḥ purato duḥkhaṃ vivṛtadvāramivocchṛṅkhalamivotpadyate 'navaratapravṛtteḥ||
26||

iti cainamuvāca duḥkhitā suhṛdaḥ paśya vasanta kiṃ sthitam|
yadidaṃ kaṇaśaḥ prakīryate pavanairbhasma kapotakarburaṃ || 27||

evaṃ ca vasantaṃ sā vidhurā idaṃ bravīt| 
he surabhe vilokaya kiṃ tava mitrasya sthitaṃ sampannam|
yadidaṃ kapotadhūsaraṃ tadīyaṃ bhasma vātaiḥ kaṇaśaḥ kaṇaṃ kaṇaṃ prakīryate vikṣipyate|
bhasmamayastvatsuhṛtsampanna ityarthaḥ|| 27||

ayi samprati dehi darśanaṃ smara paryutsuka eṣa mādhavaḥ|
dayitāsvanavasthitaṃ nṛṇāṃ na khalu prema calaṃ suhṛjjane|| 28||

he priyādhunātmānaṃ darśaya| 
yato 'sau surabhistavotkaṇṭhito darśanenāhlādanīyaḥ|
yato narāṇāṃ preyasīṣu prītirasthirā na tu mitraloke| 
tena mama vā darśanaṃ mā dāḥ| madhuṃ tvāgatyāhlādaya|| 28||

syādetatkiṃ mamaitena suhṛttvaṃ kṛtamityāha---

amunā nanu pārśvavartinā jagadājñāṃ sasurāsuraṃ tava|
bisatantuguṇasya kāritaṃ dhanuṣaḥ pelavapuṣpapattriṇaḥ|| 29||

amunā vasantena nikaṭasthena tava dhanuṣa evaṃvidhasyāpi sasurāsuraṃ jagadājñāṃ kāritaṃ nideśe sthāpitam|
vaśīkṛtamityarthaḥ| vasante kāmasya duḥsahatvāt|
kīdṛśasya| bisatantureva guṇo yasya| 
pelavāni mṛdūni puṣpāṇyeva pattriṇaḥ śarā yasya| nanuramarṣe hetau vā||
29||

gata eva na te nivartate sa sakhā dīpa ivānilāhataḥ|
ahamasya daśeva paśya māmaviṣahyavyasanapradūṣitām|| 30||

vasantamāha---sa tava vayasyo gata eva naṣṭa eva| 
evakāreṇa yadvyavacchinnaṃ tatsvarūpeṇāha| 
na nivartate no pratyāgacchati| yathā vātanunno dīpo naśyatyeva na tu nivartate tathāsau| 
ahamasya kāmapradīpasya pariśeṣatvāddaśeva vartitulyā| 
ataśca duḥsahena vyasanena duḥkhena pradūṣitāṃ tāpyamānāṃ māmīkṣasva| 
daśā hi dīpe gate pradūṣitā tiṣṭhati|| 30||

vidhinā kṛtamadya vaiśasaṃ nanu māṃ kāmavadhe vimuñcatā|
anaghāpi hi saṃśrayadrume gajabhagne patanāya vallarī|| 31||

adya vidhinā kāmavadhe māṃ tyajatā vaiśasaṃ nṛśaṃsatvaṃ kṛtam|
yadi hyasau māmapi hanyāttadā
duḥkhānanubhavādyuktaṃ tenācaritaṃ syāt| 
mama tu maraṇaṃ sāmarthyaprāptameva| tathā cāśrayabhūte
pādape karimathite vallarī latānaghāpyakhaṇḍāpi
pātāyaiva bhavati| ādhārabādhayādheyasyāpi
sāmarthyabādhitatvāt| ardhetyatrāpapāṭha eva| akataravadhe
hi vaiśasaṃ na tūbhayabādhāyām|| 31||

śocitvedānīmavaśyakartavyopadeśamāha---

tadidaṃ kriyatāmanantaraṃ bhavatā bandhujanaprayojanam|
vidhurāṃ jvalanātisarjanānnanu māṃ prāpaya bharturantikam|| 32||

kiṃ bahunā| adhunā tvayedaṃ mitrajāyākāryaṃ vidhīyatām|
duḥkhitāṃ māmagnidānādbharturnikaṭaṃ prāpaya| 
anumaraṇena patilokaprāptiśruteḥ| nanurābhimukhye| tadityupasaṃhāre|
vidhurāvenāgnidāne (?) svayamasāmarthyamāha|
atisargo dānam|| 32||

na cānumaraṇaṃ nāma na kenacidanuṣṭhitamityāha---

śaśinā saha yāti kaumudī saha meghena taḍitpralīyate|
pramadāḥ pativartmagā iti pratipannaṃ hi vicetanairapi|| 33||

striyo bhartṛmārgamanuyantītyetadyadācetanairapyanuṣṭhitaṃ tadā mamānugamanaṃ nāyuktam| 
tathā hi mṛgāṅkena sākaṃ jyotsnāstametyeva| 
jīmūtena sārdhaṃ vidyutpralīyate naśyatyeva| kaumudī kārtikī niśā| 
kavestu candrikā vivakṣitā| pralīyata iti līṅaḥ kartari|| 33||

na cāhaṃ maraṇakātareti vaktumāha---

amunaiva kaṣāyitastanī subhagena priyagātrabhasmanā|
navapallavasaṃstare yathā racayiṣyāmi tanuṃ vibhāvasau|| 34||

etenaivātivallabhena vallabhadehabhūticandanena kaṣāyitastanyanuliptakucā sarasakisalayaśayanīya ivānale nirbhayaṃ dehaṃ nidhāsyāmi| 
samālabdhasya kila pallavasaṃstara ucitaḥ| 
kaṣāyitaṃ rūṣitaṃ churitam|| 34||

na ca tavāgnidānena sāhāyyakaraṇamanucitamiti vaktumāha--

kusumāstaraṇe sahāyatāṃ bahuśaḥ somya gatastvamāvayoḥ|
kuru samprati tāvadāśu me praṇipātāñjaliyācitaścitām|| 35||

asakṛdeva hyāvayoḥ puṣpaśayyābhiḥ sahāyakatvaṃ prāptaḥ|
tadadhunāpi praṇipātamiśreṇāñjalinābhyarthitaḥ saṃścitāṃ mama vidhehi|
soma iva somyaḥ| śākhādibhyo yat|
cīyata iti citā kāṣṭharacanā|| 35||

tadanu jvalanaṃ madarpitaṃ tvarayerdakṣiṇavātavījanaiḥ|
viditaṃ khalu te yathā smaraḥ kṣaṇamapyutsahate na madvinā|| 36||

tato mayyarpitaṃ dattamagniṃ malayapavanāvakṣepakaistvarayeḥ saṃdhukṣayeḥ|
yasmādavagatametattvayā yathā mayā vinā kāmo nimeṣamapi notsahate soḍhuṃ na śaknoti| 
atra hi sarvapaścātpadaṃ vartata iti bhāṣyakāravacanaprāmāṇyāttadanvādayo 'pi ṣaṣṭhīsamāsāḥ sādhavaḥ| 
mayyarpitaṃ madarpitamiti saptamīsamāsaḥ| 
mamārpitamiti pāṭhāntaram| vījyate 'neneti
vījanam| maditi vināśabdayoge pṛthagvinānānābhiriti pañcamī|| 36||

iti cāpi vidhāya dīyatāṃ salilasyāñjalireka eva nau|
avibhajya paratra yanmayā sahitaḥ pāsyati te sa bāndhavaḥ|| 37||

agniṃ dattvā tato nāvāvābhyāṃ sādhāraṇa eka eva
jalāñjalistvayā deyaḥ| yadyasmādavibhajyāvibhāgena mayā
saha paratra sa tvadvayasyaḥ pāsyati|
āvayorhi sahapānabhojanaṃ sadaiveṣṭam| pṛthagdāne tu taddurghaṭam|
yaditi hetupadam| yamiti pāṭhe 'ñjaliparāmarśaḥ|
nāviti yuṣmadasmadorityādinā caturthīdvivacanāntasyāsmado nāvādeśaḥ|| 37||

paralokavidhau ca mādhava smaramuddiśya vilolapallavāḥ|
nivapeḥ sahakāramañjarīḥ priyacūtaprasavo hi te sakhā|| 38||

he mādhava paralokavidhāvaurdhvadaihike 'pi mitroddeśena calatkisalayāḥ sahakāramañjarīrnivaperdadyāḥ| 
yasmātsa tava vayasyaḥ sadaiva cūtakusumapriyaḥ| 
sahakāraśca cūtaviśeṣa eva| atyantabhede tu viruddhametadvacanaṃ yadanyasya
priyatve 'nyasya dānam| pretoddeśena dānaṃ nivāpaḥ|| 38||

iti dehavimuktaye sthitāṃ ratimākāśabhavā sarasvatī|
śapharīṃ hradaśoṣavihvalāṃ prathamā vṛṣṭirivānvakampata|| 39||

itthaṃ śarīratyāganiścitāṃ kāmavadhūmākāśabhavādṛśyā sarasvatī vāganvakampata paryatrāyata|
ratirakṣārthamākāśādbhāratyuccacāretyarthaḥ| 
yathā śapharīṃ matsyīṃ jalāśayaśoṣaṇākulāṃ prathamapravṛttā jaladharavṛṣṭiranukampate tathāsau tām| 
bhavatīti bhavā| 
ṇasya vibhāṣitatvādac| 
ākāśādbhavākāśabhavā|| 39||

tāmeva vācamāha---

kusumāyudhapatni durlabhastava bhartā na cirādbhaviṣyati|
śṛṇu yena sa karmaṇā gataḥ śalabhatvaṃ haralocanārciṣām|| 40||

he kāmajāye dehaṃ mā tyākṣīḥ| 
yasmāttava patiracirātsulabho bhaviṣyati| 
yena ca karmaṇāsau trinayananayanajvālānāṃ śalabhatvaṃ pataṅgatvaṃ dāhyatvaṃ prāptastadākarṇaya|
kusumāyudhaḥ patiryasyāḥ sā kusumāyudhapatnī| 
vibhāṣā sapūrvasya
iti ṇībnakārau|| 40||

abhikāṣamudīritendriyaḥ svasutāyāmakarotprajāpatiḥ|
atha tena nigṛhya vikriyāmabhiśaptaḥ phalametadanvabhūt|| 41||

evamāgamaḥ| 
brahmā udīritendriyaścalitamanāḥ sannijaduhitaraṃ tilottamāmacakamata|
tatastena vaśitvāccetovikāraṃ nigṛhyābhiśaptastvatpriya etatphalaṃ dehadāhalakṣaṇamanubabhūva||
41||

pariṇeṣyati pārvatīṃ yadā tapasā tatpravaṇīkṛto haraḥ|
upalabdhasukhastadā smaraṃ vapuṣā svena sa yojayiṣyati|| 42||

iti cāha sa dharmayācitaḥ smaraśāpāntaśivāṃ sarasvatīm|
aśaneramṛtasya cobhayorvaśinaścāmbudharāśca yonayaḥ|| 43||

tato dharmeṇa sṛṣṭirakṣārthamabhyarthitaḥ sansa vedhāḥ smaraśāpāntena śivāṃ bhadrāṃ sarasvatīṃ vācamityevamuvāca|
kāṃ vācamityāha---tapasā tatpravaṇīkṛta ātmaikaniṣṭha ātmaikaparāyaṇatāṃ nītaḥ śivo yadā gaurīṃ pariṇeṣyatyupayaṃsyate tadā nu bhūtajoṣaḥ sannasau kāṃ nijena dehena yojayiṣyati|
haragaurīvivāhaḥ śāpānto 'syetyarthaḥ| 
nanu yadi śaśāpāsau kimiti śāpāntamakarodityāha---vaśinaḥ prabhavo 'mbudāścāśaneramṛtasya ca dvayorapi yonayaḥ prabhavāḥ| 
yathā meghāḥ kadācidaśaniṃ kṣipanti kadācicca toyamevamīśvarā nigrahānugrahāvityarthaḥ|
upamāsamuccayarūpo 'yamarthāntaranyāsaḥ|
yojayiṣyatītyanadyatane 'pi laṭprayogaḥ padasaṃskārapakṣāśrayaṇena| āheti bhūte kavīnāṃ pramādajaḥ prayogaḥ|| 42--43||

tadidaṃ parirakṣa śobhane bhavitavyapriyasaṃgamaṃ vapuḥ|
ravipītajalā tapātyaye punaroghena hi yujyate nadī|| 44||

he śobhane bhadre tattasmānnijametaccharīraṃ rakṣa mā dhākṣīḥ| 
yato bhavitavyo bhāvī priyasaṃgamo bhartṛsaṃyogo yasya| 
etadeva dṛṣṭāntena draḍhayati---grīṣmeṇa nipītajalāpi nadī tapātyaye varṣāmukhe kimoghena pūreṇa na yujyate| 
bhavitavyaśabde kṛtyalyuṭo bahulamiti kartari tavyaḥ| tapātyayo grīṣmāntaḥ| 
yujyata iti kartari karmaṇi vā|| 44||

itthaṃ rateḥ kimapi bhūtamadṛśyarūpaṃ mandīcakāra maraṇavyavasāyabuddhim|
tatpratyayācca kusumāyudhabandhurenāmāśvāsayatsucaritārthapadairvacobhiḥ|| 45||

adṛśyarūpaṃ kimapi bhūtaṃ ko 'pi sattvo ratermaraṇavyavasāyabuddhimitthaṃ mandīcakārāśithilayat|
madhurapi bhūtapratyayena sahārthairvacobhistāmāśvāsayanniḥśokīcakāra| 
suṣṭhu caritārthānyanuṣṭheyatvātkṛtārthāni padāni yeṣu taiḥ|
tadyathā---

sukhasyānantaraṃ duḥkhaṃ duḥkhasyānantaraṃ sukham|
sukhāttvaṃ duḥkhamāpannaḥ punarāpatsyase sukham||

ityādi| vasantatilakaṃ vṛttam|| 45||

atha madanavadhūrupaplavāntaṃ vyasanakṛśā pratipālayāṃbabhūva|
śaśina iva divātanasya lekhā kiraṇaparikṣayadhūsarā pradoṣam| 46||

tatastadupaśrutya kāmajāyā vyasanakṛśā duḥkhakṣāmā
upaplavāntamanarthāvasānaṃ pratipālayāṃbabhūva pratyaikṣata|
yathā divātanasya divasabhavasyendormayūkhanāśamalinā lekhā
pradoṣaṃ niśāmukhaṃ pratīkṣate| tadā kāntyāvirbhāvāt| divā
bhavo divātanaḥ| avyayatvāṭṭyultu.cca| 
puṣpitāgrā vṛttam|| 46||

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ caturthaḥ sargaḥ||


 Pañcamaḥ sargaḥ|

ratikāmodantamākhyāyedānīṃ devīvṛttāntamāha---

tathā samakṣaṃ dahatā manobhavaṃ pinākinā bhagnamanorathā satī|
nininda rūpaṃ hṛdayena pārvatī priyeṣu saubhāgyaphalā hi cārutā|| 1||

atha gaurī hṛdayena cetasā rūpaṃ rāmaṇīyakaṃ nininda jagarha|
yataḥ śambhunā pūrvoktaprakāreṇānvakṣameva kāmaṃ pluṣyatā bhagno nāśitaḥ śivo me bhartā bhūyāditi manoratho yasyāḥ|
kimityetāvatā rūpagarhetyāha---yasmāccārutā priyeṣu saubhāgyaphalā priyeṣu viṣayeṣu saubhāgyaṃ vāllabhyameva phalaṃ yasyāḥ sā tathoktā| 
sā ca vallabhā yadi bhavasya bhavettatkathamasau madanaṃ dahet| 
yā ca na subhagā kiṃ tasyā rūpeṇa sarge 'tra vaṃśasthaṃ vṛttam|| 1||

iyeṣa sā kartumavandhyarūpatāṃ samādhimāsthāya tapobhirātmanaḥ|
avāpyate vā kathamanyathā dvayaṃ tathāvidhaṃ prema patiśca tādṛśaḥ|| 2||

tato 'sau samādhiṃ niyamamāśritya tapobhirātmano 'vandhyarūpatāṃ saphalaṃ rāmaṇīyakaṃ vidhātumiyeṣa cakame| 
na caitadadbhutam| 
yato 'nyathā tapasā vinā tādṛśaṃ dehārdhadānanidānaṃ prema tādṛśaśca saptabhuvanādhipatirmaheśvara iti kathametaddvayamāsādyate|
vāśabdaḥ pūrvoktāpekṣayā samuccaye| 
tādṛśatathāvidhaśabdau sāmānyārthāvapi viśeṣyayorutkṛṣṭatvena prasiddhatvādviśeṣātiśayaniṣṭhāveva|| 2||

manīṣitāḥ santi gṛheṣu devatāstapaḥ kva vatse kva ca tāvakaṃ vapuḥ|
padaṃ saheta bhramarasya pelavaṃ śirīṣapuṣpaṃ na punaḥ patattriṇaḥ|| 3||

iti śrutecchāmanuśāsatī sutāṃ śaśāka menā na niyantumudyamāt|
ka īpsitārthasthiraniścayaṃ manaḥ payaśca nimnābhimukhaṃ pratīpayet|| 4||

tapoviṣayā śrutecchābhilāṣo yasyāstāṃ śrutecchāṃ jñātāśayāṃ duhitaramitthamanuśāsatyupadiśantyapi menodyamādutsāhānniyantuṃ na śaśāka na prābhavat|
yata īpsite 'rthe sthiro dṛḍho niścayo vyavasāyo yasya tādṛśaṃ manaḥ kaḥ prīpayedvyāvartayet|
nimnābhimukhamadhaḥprasṛtaṃ toyamiva|
kathamanuśāsatītyāha---manīṣitā ityādi| 
he putri devatārādhanārthaṃ cettapasyasi tadalam| 
yato nijaveśmanyeva manīṣitā abhimatā devatāḥ santi| tā ārādhaya|
yataḥ kleśātmakaṃ kva tapaḥ kva ca sukumāraṃ tvadīyaṃ śarīram|
etadeva dṛṣṭāntena draḍhayati|
pelavaṃ sukumāraṃ śirīṣapuṣpaṃ kartṛ ṣaṭpadasya padamavasthānaṃ soḍhuṃ śaknuyāt| 
na tu śukādeḥ pakṣiṇaḥ|
manīṣitamabhipretam| yathā---manīṣitaṃ dyaurapi yena dugdhā
iti| pratīpaṃ kuryātpratīpayet|| 3--4||

kadācidāsannasakhīmukhena sā manorathajñaṃ pitaraṃ manasvinī|
ayācatāraṇyaninivāsamātmanaḥ phalodayāntāya tapaḥsamādhaye|| 5||

tataḥ katipayakālāpagame 'sau nikaṭavayasyādvāreṇa janakamātmano vanāvasthānamayācata prārthayata| 
kimartham|
phalamīśvarārādhanaṃ tasyodaya utpattiḥ sa evānto yasya tasmai| 
tādṛśāya taporthaṃ samādhaye niyamārtham|
manorathajñamityanujñāsampattiṃ sūcayati|
yo hyabhilāṣatvarāṃ na vetti nāsāvanujānāti|
sābhimānaṃ mano vidyate yasyāḥ sā manasvinī māninī|
asantatvādviniḥ| 
tasau matvarthe
iti bhatvādrutvābhāvaḥ|| 5||

athānurūpābhiniveśatoṣiṇā kṛtābhyanujñā guruṇā garīyasā|
prajāsu paścātprathitaṃ tadākhyayā jagāma gaurī śikharaṃ śikhaṇḍimat|| 5||

tato gaurī taporthaṃ śikharamadriśṛṅgamayāsīt|
yato garīyasā pūjyena guruṇā pitrā datājñānumatā|
tenaiva duṣkare karmaṇi kathamanujñāteti cedāha---anurūpeṇa yogyenābhiniveśenāgraheṇa toṣiṇā
parituṣṭena sthāne 'syā abhiniveśo yātu harārādhanāya iti|
kiṃ śikharamityāha---tadākhyayā gaurīvyapadeśenaiva jagati paścādanantaraṃ prasiddhaṃ gaurīśikharamiti|
śikhaṇḍimatsadā barhiyutamiti ramyatvoktiḥ|| 6||

vimucya sā hāramahāryaniścayā vilolayaṣṭipraviluptacandanam|
babandha bālāruṇababhru valkalaṃ payodharotsedhaviśīrṇasaṃhati|| 7||

tapasyahāryo hartumaśakyo niścayo yasyāḥ sā devī muktāhāramapāsya tadāspade valkalaṃ cīraṃ babandha dadhre|
kīdṛśaṃ hāram| 
krīḍākampānubandhādvilolayā capalayā yaṣṭyā latayotpuṃsitāṅgarāgam| 
valkalaṃ tu bālāruṇababhru navoditānūrukapilam| 
tathā payodharotsedhena stanocchrāyeṇa truṭitasandhibandham|| 7||

yathā prasiddhairmadhuraṃ śiroruhairjaṭābhirapyevamabhūttadānanam|
na ṣaṭpadaśreṇibhireva paṅkajaṃ saśevalāsaṃgamapi prakāśate|| 8||

gauryā mukhaṃ prasiddhairalaṃkṛtaiḥ keśairyadvanmadhuraṃ manojñaṃ tathaiva jaṭābhirapi babhūva| 
tathā hi kamalaṃ na kevalaṃ bhramarāvalībhireva prakāśate śobhate yāvacchevalasamparkeṇāpi| 
śevalasyāsaṅgaḥ śevalāsaṅgaḥ|
saha śevalāsaṅgena vartate yattatsaśevalāsaṅgam|| 8||

pratikṣaṇaṃ sā kṛtarūpavikriyā vratāya mauñjīṃ triguṇāṃ babhāra yām|
akāri tatpūrvanibaddhayā tayā sarāgamasyā raśanāguṇāspadam|| 9||

muhurmuhurvihitatapasviveśā sā vratārthaṃ triguṇāṃ mauñjīṃ mekhalāṃ yāmuvāha tayā tasyāḥ kāñcīguṇasthānaṃ sarāgaṃ lohitamakāri vyadhāyi|
yatastatpūrvaṃ tadādi nibaddhayā| 
ataśca nitamabasya saukumāryānmauñjyāśca pāruṣyādraktatāpādanam|| 9||

visṛṣṭarāgādadharānnivartitaḥ stanāṅgarāgāruṇitācca kandukāt|
kuśāṅkurādānaparikṣatāṅguliḥ kṛto 'kṣasūtrapraṇayī tayā karaḥ|| 10

tayādharātkandukācca niṣidhya pāṇirakṣasūtrapraṇayī vidadhe| 
tadānīṃ tasyocitatvāt| 
ādau tvasau rāgotpādanāyauṣṭhe sakta āsīt| 
krīḍārthaṃ ca kanduke|
kīdṛśādadharāt| 
visṛṣṭastyakta upekṣito rāgo 'laktakādikṛto yena|
kandukāttu stanāṅgarāgeṇa kucakuṅkumenāruṇitādityatipriyatvoktiḥ|
kīdṛśaḥ karaḥ|
kuśāṅkurādānena darbhasūcīgrahaṇena parikṣatāṅguliḥ pāṭitakaraśākhaḥ| 
praṇayaḥ prītirvidyate yasyāsau praṇayī|| 10||

mahārhaśayyāparivartanacyutaiḥ svakeśapuṣpairapi yā sma dūyate|
aśeta sā bāhulatopadhāyinī niṣeduṣī sthaṇḍila eva kevale|| 11||

yā devī pūrvaṃ parārghyaśayanapatitairnijakavarīkusumairapi dūyate smākhidyata sā tadā bhujalatāmupadhānīkṛtya niṣeduṣī niṣaṇṇopaviṣṭaiva kevale śādvalarahite sthaṇḍila evāśeta suṣvāpa| 
sthaṇḍilaśayanasya vratatvāt|
mahāntamutkṛṣṭamarhatīti mahārhā bahudhanā|
bāhulatāmupadadhāti śirasi karotīti bāhulatopadhāyinī|
dūyate smeti laṭsme|| 11||

punargrahītuṃ niyamasthayā tayā dvayeṣu nikṣepamivārpitaṃ dvayam|
latāsu tanvīṣu vilāsaceṣṭitaṃ viloladṛṣṭaṃ hariṇāṅganāsu ca|| 12||

tapovaśādvibhramatyāge kavirūhate| 
tayā gauryā vratasthayā nikaṭavartiṣūbhayeṣu dvayamidaṃ nikṣepamiva nyāsabhūtamiva punarādātumarpitaṃ sthāpitam| 
keṣu kimityāha---tanvīṣu latāsu vibhramaparibhramaṇam| 
caṭulaṃ ca vīkṣitaṃ mṛgīṣu|
viśeṣasya strītve 'pi dvayeṣviti sāmānyopakramādastrīliṅganirdeśaḥ| 
nikṣipyata iti nikṣepam|
dvayaviśeṣaṇatvānnapuṃsakatvam| 
dvayeṣviti rāśyapekṣaṃ dvyavayatvam| 
rāśyostu pratyekamavayavāpekṣaṃ bahutvamiti bahuvacanaṃ nānupapannam|
etadeva ca darśayituṃ latāsviti hariṇāṅganāsviti bahutvanirdeśaḥ| 
dvayamiti tvekātmaka evāvayava ityekavacananirdeśaḥ|| 12||

araṇyabījāñjalidānalālitāstathā ca tasyā hariṇā viśaśvasuḥ|
yathā tadīyairnayanaiḥ kutūhalātpuraḥ sakhīnāmamimīta locane|| 13||

araṇyabījāni nīvārādivrīhayasteṣāṃ muṣṭibhistoṣitā hariṇāḥ| 
tathā tena prakāreṇa gauryā viśaśvasurvisrambhamāpuḥ| 
yathā tadīyairnayanairasau kautukādagrataḥ sakhīnāṃ locanānyamimīta paryacchidatkasya viśālānīti| 
netre mānamatra sakhīnāṃ na tvātmanaḥ|
tapaḥsthāyā anaucityāt| amimīteti māṅo laṅ| bhṛñāmit|
ī halyaghoḥ|

atandritā sā svayameva vṛkṣakānghaṭastanaprasravaṇairvyavardhayat|
guho 'pi yeṣāṃ prathamāptajanmanāṃ na putravāllabhyamapākariṣyati|| 14||

sā devyatandritānalasā satī vṛkṣakānalpatarūnkalaśakucapayobhirātmanaiva pupoṣa|
yeṣāṃ pūrvalabdhajanmatvātkumāro 'pi putrasnehaṃ nāpākariṣyati na hariṣyati| 
pūrvajāto hi mātāpitṛpriyaḥ| putraśca stanaprasravaṇena poṣyate|
alpā hrasvā vā vṛkṣā vṛkṣakāḥ| tandrā ālasyam|
tārakāditvāditac|| 14||

kṛtābhiṣekāṃ hutajātavedasaṃ tvaguttarāsaṅgavatīmadhītinīm|
didṛkṣavastāṃ munayo 'pyupāgamanna dharmavṛddheṣu vayaḥ samīkṣyate|| 15||

tāmevaṃvidhāṃ draṣṭuṃ munayo 'pyupāyayuḥ| kīdṛśīm|
kṛtābhiṣekāṃ vihitasnānām| hutajātavedasaṃ kṛtāgnikāryām|
tvagvalkalamuttarāsaṅga uttarīyaṃ vidyate yasyāstām|
lāghavamanādriyamāṇāḥ karmadhārayānmatvarthīyaṃ prayuñjata eva|
yathā bisakisalacchedapātheyavanta iti|
yadi vā tvacā uttarāsaṅgavatīmiti tṛtīyāsamāsaḥ|
adhītaṃ vidyate yasyāstāmadhītinīṃ kṛtasvādhyāyām|
cirantanāste kathaṃ bālāṃ tāṃ draṣṭumāyayurityāha---na dharmavṛddheṣu vayaḥ samīkṣyate|
taduktam---

na tena vṛddho bhavati yenāsya palitaṃ śiraḥ|
yo vai yuvāpyadhīyānastaṃ devāḥ sthaviraṃ viduḥ|| 15||

virodhisattvojjhitapūrvamatsaraṃ drumairapīṣṭaprasavārcitātithi|
navoṭajābhyantarasambhṛtānalaṃ tapovanaṃ tacca babhūva pāvanam|| 16||

taddevyāstapovanaṃ pavitramāsīt| kīdṛśam|
ahimayūrādibhirvirodhibhiḥ sattvairujjhitapūrvamatsaraṃ tyaktaśāśvatikavairamiti taponubhāvāt| 
yaduktam---satsannidhau vairatyāga iti|
tathāsatāṃ sacetanāḥ| 
sthāvaraistarubhirapi priyaiḥ prasavaiḥ puṣpaphalaiḥ pūjitāgantukam| 
navoṭajābhyantare nūtanaparṇagṛhamadhye sambhṛtānalaṃ saṃcitāgnikam|| 16||

yadā phalaṃ sarvasamādhisādhanaṃ na tāvatā labhyamamaṃsta kāṅkṣitam|
tadānapekṣya svaśarīramārdavaṃ tapo mahatsā carituṃ pracakrame|| 17||

yadāsāvabhimataphalaṃ bhavabhartṛlābharūpamakhilaniyamādhīnatvāttāvatā
parimitena tapasā sulabhaṃ nāmaṃsta nājñāsīttadā
nijavapuḥsaukumāryamavagaṇayyaiva kaṣṭāni vratāni
cāndrāyaṇādīni kartuṃ prārebhe| labdhumaśakyamalabhyam|| 17||

klamaṃ yayau kandukalīlayāpi yā tayā munīnāṃ caritaṃ vyagāhyata|
dhruvaṃ vapuḥ kāñcanapadmanirmitaṃ mṛdu prakṛtyā ca susārameva ca|| 18||

yā devī pūrvaṃ vīṭākrīḍayāpi saukumāryādaklāmyattayā
tadā tīvratapaścaryayā
kaṭhinakāyānāmṛṣīṇāṃ caritaṃ vyagāhyata paspṛśe|
ataścotprekṣyate---tadīyaṃ śarīraṃ niścitaṃ kāñcanapadmena nirmitaṃ kṛtaṃ yatsvabhāvena mṛdu atha ca susāraṃ dṛḍhaṃ kleśasaham| 
kanakakamalaṃ hi sauvarṇatvāddṛḍhaṃ padmatvānmṛdu| sasmitamiti vanditamiti capāṭhāvanāryau| 
dhruvaśabda... sā vācakatvāt|
vyagāhyateti karmaṇi|| 18||

tadeva mahattapa āha---

śucau caturṇāṃ jvalatāṃ havirbhujāṃ śucismitā madhyagatā sumadhyamā|
vijitya netrapratighātinīṃ prabhāmananyadṛṣṭiḥ savitāramaikṣata|| 19||

śucāvāṣāḍhe māsi dīpyamānānāṃ caturṇāmagnīnāṃ madhyasthā satī devī nayananāśinīmarkadīptimabhibhūya tadgatadṛṣṭiḥ sūryamadrākṣīditi pañcāgnitapaḥkathanam|
śucismitā nirmalahasitetyaklāntikathanam|| 19||

tathāpi taptaṃ saviturgabhastibhirmukhaṃ tadīyaṃ kamalaśriyaṃ dadhau|
apāṅgayoḥ kevalamasya dīrghayoḥ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ śyāmikayā kṛtaṃ padam|| 20||

tathā pūrvoktena prakāreṇa raviraśmibhistaptamapi devīvaktraṃ nalinalakṣmīṃ babhāra| 
kamalaṃ hi tapanatāpādvikasati|
kevalamasyāpāṅgayornetraprāntayoḥ kramācchyāmikayā kālimnā padaṃ kṛtamatisaukumāryāt|| 20||

ayācitopasthitamambu kevalaṃ rasātmakasyoḍupateśca raśmayaḥ|
babhūva tasyāḥ kila pāraṇāvidhirna vṛkṣavṛttivyatiriktasādhanaḥ|| 21||

tasyāḥ pāraṇāvidhiḥ śarīrayātrāsampattirvṛkṣavṛttervyatiriktasādhano 'dhikopakaraṇo nāsīt|
taruvṛttitulyo 'bhūt| 
tathā hyaprārthitopanataṃ toyaṃ kevalamasyāḥ pāraṇamamṛtamayasya śaśino mayūkhāśca| drumāṇāmapyambu śītāṃśuraśmayaśca jīvanam| 
kiletyāgame|| 21||

nikāmataptā dvividhena vahninā nabhaścareṇendhanasambhṛtena ca|
tapātyaye vāribhirukṣitā navairbhuvā sahoṣmāṇamamuñcadūrdhvagam|| 22||

sā devī ravikāṣṭhajabhedāddvirūpeṇāgninā pūrvaṃ glapitā satī tatastapātyaye grīṣmānte prathamairjalaiḥ siktā bhūrivordhvapravṛttamūṣmāṇaṃ bāṣpamamuñcaditi prāvṛṭtapasa upakrāntiḥ| 
pṛthvī hi dāvāgninārkeṇa grīṣme tāpitā tato varṣāsu meghajalasiktoṣmāṇaṃ muñcati|
tapo grīṣmaḥ|| 22||

sthitāḥ kṣaṇaṃ pakṣmasu tāḍitādharāḥ payodharotsedhanipātacūrṇitāḥ|
valīṣu tasyāḥ skhalitāḥ prapedire cireṇa nābhiṃ prathamodabindavaḥ|| 23||

tasyā gauryāḥ prathamapravṛttā udabindavo jalakaṇāścireṇa nābhisthānaṃ prāpuḥ| 
tathā hi pūrvaṃ kṣaṇamātraṃ pakṣmasvakṣilomasu sthitāsteṣāṃ ghanatvānnādhaḥ patitāstatastāḍitādharāstato 'pi stanocchrāyapātena cūrṇitāstadanu nimnatvādvalitraye skhalitā anantaraṃ nābhimagnāḥ| 
tadanena prathamaprāvṛṭsvarūpaṃ kathayatā devyā rūpātiśayaḥ sūcitaḥ| 
udakasya bindava udabindavaḥ|
manthaudanasaktubindu ityudādeśaḥ| utsedha ucchrāyaḥ|| 23||

śilāśayāṃ tāmaniketavāsinīṃ nirantarāsvantaravarṣavṛṣṭiṣu|
vyalokayannunmiṣitaistaḍinmayairmahātapaḥsākṣya iva sthitāḥ kṣapāḥ|| 24||

tāṃ pārvatīṃ kṣapā niśā vidyudrūpairunmiṣitairavalokitairvyalokayandadṛśuḥ|
utprekṣyate| mahātapasāṃ sākṣitve sthitā iva| 
sākṣī hyasakṛtpaśyati| kīdṛśīṃ tām| 
śilāsu śeta iti śilāśayā dṛṣatpaṭṭasaṃveśinī tām| 
sthaṇḍile hi tadā paṅkasadbhāvaḥ| aniketavāsinīṃ bahiravasthāyinīm| 
kadā| nirantarāsvantaravarṣavṛṣṭiṣu| 
antare madhye varṣaṃ jalamayaṃ yāsāṃ tāsu vṛṣṭiṣu karakārūpāsu satīṣvaśanivarṣeṣu patatsvityarthaḥ| 
evaṃ hi tapaso mahattvaṃ bhavati|
varṣavṛṣṭiśabdayorekārthayoḥ prayogādatra viśeṣāvasāyaḥ|
sākṣiṇo bhāvaḥ karma vā sākṣyam|| 24||

nināya sātyarthahimottarānilāḥ sahasyarātrīrudavāsatatparā|
parasparākrandini cakravākayoḥ puro viyukte mithune kṛpāvatī|| 25||

sā devī sahasyarātrīḥ pauṣaniśā atiśītalā jalavāsatatparā satī nināyātyavāhayat|
kīdṛśīḥ| atyarthaṃ himottarastuṣārādhiko 'nilo vāyuryāsu|
uttaraśabda ādhikyaṃ bruvāṇaḥ saṃmiśratvamāha|
yathā---kampottaraṃ bhīru tavopagūḍham
kleśottaraṃ rāgavaśātplavante
dūrvāyavāṅkuraplakṣatvagabhinnapuṭottaram
ityādau| utkara ityutkira iti cāpapāṭhāveva| kīdṛśī devī|
agrato viyukte viśiṣṭe cakravākayoryugme kṛpāvatī sadayā svayaṃ viyogavyathānubhāvāt|
viśleṣavaśātparasparaṃ cākrandini kūjati|
ekasthānasthayorapi hi tayoranyonyamadarśanameva viyogaḥ| 
udake vāsa udavāsaḥ| peṣaṃvāsavāhanadhiṣu ca
ityudādeśaḥ| 
śaradvasantayoranuṣṇāśītatvānna tayorvarṇanam| 
śiśiro 'pi hemantenaikayogakṣemaḥ|| 25||

mukhena sā padmasugandhinā niśi pravepamānādharapatraśobhinā|
tuṣāravṛṣṭikṣatapadmasampadāṃ sarojasaṃdhānamivākarodapām|| 26||

himasekena dagdhāmbhojaśrīṇāṃ nīrāṇām| 
sā devī toyāntasthā| 
tatra sattvātsā kamalasurabhiṇā vaktreṇa sarojasaṃdhānamivākarotpadmaracanāmiva vyaddhatta| 
padme palāśairbhāvyam| 
tatra japāsaktatvātpravepamānenādhareṇaiva patreṇa śobhata iti|
niśīti tadāpyatyāgo jalamadhye pratipāditaḥ|
paddannomāshṛnniśa
iti niśādeśaḥ|| 26||

svayaṃviśīrṇadrumaparṇavṛttitā parā hi kāṣṭhā tapasastayā punaḥ|
tadapyapākīrṇamataḥ priyaṃvadāṃ vadantyaparṇāmiti tāṃ purāvidaḥ|| 27

tapasa eṣā parā kāṣṭhā koṭiryadātmanā patitena tarupatreṇa vṛttiḥ śarīrayātrā kriyate| 
tayā tu yadā tadapi parṇamapakīrṇaṃ tyaktaṃ tadā tāṃ priyabhāṣiṇīmaparṇāṃ purāvidaścirantanā vadanti| 
na bhuktaṃ parṇaṃ yayeti kṛtvā| gauryā hyaparṇeti nāma| 
yaduktam---aparṇā caikaparṇā ca tathā syādekapāṭalā|
iti| aparṇāmiti kathaṃ dvitīyā| 
itiśabdena hi prātipadikārthamātre 'vasthāpanātprathamayā bhavituṃ nyāyyaṃ yathā kramādamuṃ nārada ityabodhi saḥ 
iti| cintyametat| 
yadi vetinā purāvidāṃ sambandho na tvaparṇāyāḥ| 
tāmaparṇāmato vadantīti purāvida āhurityarthaḥ|| 27||

mṛṇālikāpelavamevamādibhirvrataistadaṅgaṃ kṣapayantyaharniśam|
tapaḥ śarīraiḥ kaṭhinairupārjitaṃ tapasvināṃ dūramadhaścakāra sā|| 28||

evamādibhiḥ pañcāgniprabhṛtibhistapobhirmṛṇālikāpelavaṃ bisinīsukumāraṃ divārātraṃ nijaṃ vapuḥ kleśayantī
devī vṛddhamunīnāṃ kaṭhorairapi dehaiḥ saṃcitaṃ tapo dūramatyarthamadhaścakāra jigāya|
pelavaśabdaḥ keṣāṃcinmatena grāmyo na sarveṣām|| 28||

athājināṣāḍhadharaḥ pragalbhavāgjvalanniva brahmamayena tejasā|
viveśa kaścijjaṭilastapovanaṃ śarīrabaddhaḥ prathamāśramo yathā|| 29||

tataḥ kadācijjaṭilo vipro gauryāśramamāyayau| kīdṛśaḥ|
ajinaṃ mṛgacarma āṣāḍhaḥ pālāśo daṇḍastau bibharti yaḥ pragalbhavāgvācāṭo brāhmyā ca kāntyā dedīpyamāna iva|
ataścotprekṣyate| 
śarīrabaddho dehavānprathamāśramo yathā brahmacaryamiva| 
brahmaṇa āgataṃ brahmamayaṃ tena vedasamutthena tejasā|| 29||

tamātitheyī bahumānapūrvayā saparyayā pratyudiyāya pārvatī|
bhavanti sāmye 'pi niviṣṭacetasāṃ vapurviśeṣeṣvadhigauravāḥ kriyāḥ|| 30||

taṃ vipraṃ devī gauravapuraḥsarayā saparyayārcayā hetubhūtayā pratyudiyāyābhyujjagāma| 
pūjārthamagrato niryayāvityarthaḥ|
yato 'sāvatithau sādhurātitheyyatithiparicaraṇakuśalā|
pathyatithisatisvapaterḍhañ|
nanu sāpi svayaṃ tapasvinyeva na tasmādūnā ataḥ ko 'syāstadarcāṃ prati bhara ityāha---niviṣṭacetasāṃ śāntamanasāṃ sāmye 'pi vapurviśeṣeṣu rūpātiśayeṣu sabahumānāśceṣṭāḥ prasaranti|
āḍambarāṇi kila pūjyāni| sa cājinādiyuktatvādviśeṣavān|
kecittu sāmye 'pi samadṛṣṭitve 'pīti kilāhuḥ|
kaṇḍvādiṣu saparaśabdapāṭhātsaparyayeti yakpratyayāt||
30|| 

vidhiprayuktāṃ pratigṛhya satkriyāṃ pariśramaṃ nāma vinīya ca kṣaṇam|
umāṃ sa paśyannṛjunaiva cakṣuṣā pracakrame vaktumanujjhitakramaḥ|| 31||

tato 'sau jaṭī samyakkṛtāmarcāmādāya kiṃcicca kila viśramya gadituṃ prārebhe|
anujjhitakrama āśritaparipāṭīko vaktavyasya sakramābhidhānāt| 
devīmṛjunaiva rāgadveṣarahitatvātspaṣṭenaiva cakṣuṣā paśyan|
anantaraṃ kilāsau rāgaṃ dveṣaṃ ca darśayiṣyati|| 31||

tameva kramamāha---

api kriyārthaṃ sulabhaṃ samitkuśaṃ jalānyapi snānavidhikṣamāṇi te|
api svaśaktyā tapasi pravartase śarīramādyaṃ khalu dharmasādhanam|| 32||

apiriṣṭapraśne| homādyarthaṃ kaccittavendhanadarbhādi suprāpam| 
api tava toyāni viṣādyadūṣitatvādabhiṣekayogyāni|
kaccicca dehasāmarthyaṃ samīkṣya vratāni kuruṣe na mūḍhagraheṇa| 
yasmānmukhyataḥ śarīraṃ dharmasādhanam|
samidhaśca kuśāśca samitkuśam| jātiraprāṇinām|| 32||

api tvadāvarjitavārisambhṛtaṃ pravālamāsāmanubandhi vīrudhām|
cirojjhitālaktakapāṭalena te tulāṃ yadārohati dantavāsasā|| 33||

kaccidāsāṃ vīrudhāṃ latānāṃ bhavaddattasekodakasaṃjātaṃ kisalayamanubandhi baddhaṃ jātam| kīdṛśam| 
bahukālatyaktayāvakenāpi pāṭalena tvadīyadantavāsasā daśanacchadena yattulāṃ sāmyamārohati spṛśati| 
dvayorapi svabhāvalohitatvāt|
anubadhnātyutpadyata ityanubandhi|| 33||

api prasannaṃ hariṇeṣu te manaḥ karasthadarbhapraṇayāparādhiṣu|
ya utpalakṣepacalairvilokitaistavākṣisāpatnyamiva prayuñjate|| 34||

kaccittava hariṇeṣu manaḥ prasannaṃ prītimat|
kuto 'prasādāśaṅketyāha---tvatpāṇitalavartikuśāpahāreṇāparādhiṣu kṛtāgassu| 
kāraṇāntaramāha---ye hariṇā vilokitairvīkṣaṇaistvadakṣṇoḥ sāpatnyamiva spardhāmiva kurvate caṭulatvāt| 
kīdṛśaiḥ|
utpalānāṃ kṣepaḥ preraṇaṃ kampotpādanaṃ tadvaccalaiḥ kampaiḥ|
kṣipyamāṇasya hi kuvalayasya kampānubandhādatitarāṃ śobhā bhavati| 
ākṣepastvapapāṭha eva| praṇayaḥ prārthanā|
sapatnaḥ śatrustasya dharmaḥ sāpatnyaṃ vairaṃ spardhā ca|| 34||

yaducyate pārvati pāpavṛttaye na rūpamityavyabhicāri tadvacaḥ|
tathā hi te śīlamudāradarśane tapasvināmapyupadeśatāṃ gatam|| 35||

he pārvati yadidaṃ lakṣaṇajñairucyate yathā pāpavṛttaye na rūpamiti pāpā cāsau vṛttirācāraḥ pāpavṛttistadarthaṃ rūpaṃ na bhavati yatrākṛtistatra guṇā vasantīti tadidānīṃ vacanamavyabhicāri satyam| 
kuta ityāha---tathā hi tava śīlaṃ vipulanayane munīnāmapyupadeśatāṃ gataṃ śikṣakaṃ sampannam|
dharmiṣṭhā api tvadīyaṃ caritaṃ śikṣanta ityarthaḥ| 
yadi rūpavanto duḥśīlāḥ syustatrabhavatī dharmaparā na syāt|
tasyāśca rūpavattvamudāranayanatvenaivākṣiptam|| 35||

vikīrṇasaptarṣibaliprahāsibhistathā na gāṅgaiḥ salilairdivaścyutaiḥ|
yathā tvadīyaiścaritairanāvilairmahīdharaḥ pāvita eṣa sānvayaḥ|| 36||

eṣa himavānsaputrapautro yathā tvadīyaiścaritairanāvilairakaluṣaiśceṣṭitaiḥ pavitrīkṛtastathā na svargapatitairgāṅgaiḥ saurasaindhavairapi nirmalairudakaiḥ|
gaṅgā hi nākāttacchirasi patitā|
vikīrṇo vikṣipto yaḥ saptarṣibhiḥ puṣpādiko balirupahārastena prahāsibhiḥ sitatvātsmayamānairiva|| 36||

anena dharmaḥ saviśeṣamadya me trivargasāraḥ pratibhāti bhāmini|
tvayā manonirviṣayārthakāmayā yadeka eva pratigṛhya sevyate|| 37||

he bhāmini mānini ādau sāratvena jñāto 'pyadyānena vakṣyamāṇena vastunā saviśeṣaṃ dharmastrivargasya dharmārthakāmalakṣaṇasya sāra utkṛṣṭo me pratibhāsate|
yattvayārthakāmāvanādṛtya sa evaiko 'ṅgīkṛtya sevyate|
yadi cāsau sarvotkṛṣṭo na syāttatkathaṃ bhavatī dharmārthinī tapasyediti|| 37||

gajanimīlitenaiva dharmahetutvaṃ tapaso 'syā uktvedānīṃ viśeṣajijñāsayāha---


prayuktasatkāraviśeṣamātmanā na māṃ paraṃ sampratipattumarhasi|
yadā satāṃ saṃnatagātri saṃgataṃ manīṣibhiḥ sāptapadīnamucyate|| 38||

he saṃnatagātri kṛśāṅgi tvaṃ māṃ paramanyaṃ sampratipattuṃ boddhuṃ nārhasi|
yataḥ kīdṛśaṃ mām| 
ātmanā svayameva na tvanyamukhena prayuktasatkāraviśeṣaṃ vihitapūjātiśayam|
yadyapyātmanārcitastataḥ kimityāha---yadā yato manīṣibhiḥ paṇḍitaiḥ satāṃ sādhūnāṃ saṃgataṃ sakhyaṃ sāptapadīnamucyate|
sāptapadīnaṃ sakhyam|
yena sapta padānyuccāritāni sa sakhetyarthaḥ|
yaduktam---sambandhamābhāṣaṇapūrvamāhuḥ 
iti| āvayośca vāṅmilanaṃ jātameva|| 38||

ato 'dya kiṃcidbhavatīṃ bahukṣamāṃ dvijātibhāvādupapannacāpalaḥ|
ayaṃ janaḥ praṣṭumanāstapodhane na cedrahasyaṃ prativaktumarhasi|| 39||

ataḥ sakhibhāvāttvāṃ bahukṣamāṃ kadarthanāsahāmahaṃ praṣṭukāmaḥ|
dvijātibhāvādbrāhmaṇyādupapannaṃ sulabhaṃ cāpalaṃ kautukaṃ yasya me| 
vaṭukautukādahaṃ pṛcchāmītyarthaḥ| 
yadi caitanna rahasyaṃ gopyaṃ na tatpratīpaṃ kathayitumarhasi| 
yato bahukṣamā tvam| īkṣikṣamibhyāṃ ca
iti ṇiḥ| praṣṭuṃ mano yasya sa praṣṭumanāḥ|
lumpedavaśyamaḥ kṛtye tuṃkāmamanasorapi
iti malopaḥ|| 39||

kule prasūtiḥ prathamasya vedhasastrilokasaundaryamivoditaṃ vapuḥ|
amṛgyamaiśvaryasukhaṃ navaṃ vayastapaḥphalaṃ syātkimataḥ paraṃ vada|| 40||

kathayāto 'dhikaṃ tapaḥphalaṃ kiṃ tava bhavet|
yattapasā prāthanīyaṃ tatsarvaṃ tavāstītyarthaḥ| 
tathā hi prathamasya vedhasa ādyasya prajāpateḥ śambhoḥ kule prasūtirjanma|
haranirmāṇaṃ himavānityāgamaḥ| 
tathā ca bhāraviḥ prathayituṃ vibhutāmabhinirmitaṃ pratinidhiṃ jagatāmiva śambhuneti|
anye tvāhus---prathamo vidhātā brahmā| 
prajāpatervā etattokaṃ prathamaṃ yatparvatā iti
śrutiḥ| vapuśca te mūrtaṃ trilokasaundaryamivotthitam|
aiśvaryasukhaṃ cāprārthanīyaṃ parvatarājaputrītvāt| 
vayo 'pi navaṃ pratyagraṃ prāptayauvanatvāt| 
ataśca tapaḥphalaṃ syātkimataḥ paraṃ tava| 
trisaṃkhyo lokastrilokaḥ|| 40||

bhavatyaniṣṭādapi nāma duḥsahānmanasvinīnāṃ pratipattirīdṛśī|
vicāramārgaprahitena cetasā na dṛśyate tacca tanūdari tvayi|| 41||

api ca māninīnāṃ duḥsahādaniṣṭādvaidhavyalakṣaṇādīdṛśī pratipattiranuṣṭhānaṃ tapaścaryālakṣaṇaṃ bhavati|
taccāniṣṭaṃ tava kṛśamadhye vivekapadavīnikṣiptena manasā na lakṣyate|| 41||

kuta ityāha--

alabhyaśokābhibhaveyamākṛtirvimānanā subhru kutaḥ piturgṛhe|
parāvamarśo na tavāsti kaḥ karaṃ prasārayetpannagaratnasūcaye|| 42||

alabhyo labdhumanarhaḥ śokenābhibhava ākrāntiryasyāḥ sā tādṛśīyamākṛtiḥ saṃsthānam| 
asyāṃ hyākṛtau vaidhavyaṃ na yogyam| 
paraparibhavādapi vairāgyaṃ syāt| 
tadapi tava nāstītyāha---pitṛgṛhe subhru kuto vimānanā|
parakṛto 'pyavamarśo vidhvaṃsanāya saṃsparśastava nāsti|
yasmāduragaśiromaṇiśalākāgrahaṇāya kaḥ pāṇiṃ prasārayet|
na hi tvatparibhavakṛtsvastho bhavati| 
subhrūśabde hrasvaḥ pramādajo nadīsaṃjñāniṣedhāt|| 42|| 

kimityapāsyābharaṇāni yauvane dhṛtaṃ tvayā vārdhakaśobhi valkalam|
vada pradoṣe sphuṭacandratārake vibhāvarī yadyaruṇāya kalpate|| 43||

ataśca kasmāttāruṇya evālaṃkārānapahāya sthāvirojjvalaṃ cīraṃ bhavatyā gṛhītam| 
yatkilacaturthe vayasi yogyaṃ tadyauvane 'nucitam| 
tathā ca kathaya prakaṭaśaśinakṣatre rātrimukhe niśā yadyaruṇāya kalpate lauhityena pariṇamati| 
valkalasya ca raktatvādupamānam| kḷpi sampadyamāne
iti caturthī| ābharaṇānāṃ candratārakā upamānam| 
vṛddhasya bhāvo vārdhakam| vayovacanatvādañ| 
vārdhameva vārdhakam|
kecinmanojñādiṣu 
vṛddhaśabdaṃ paṭhanti|| 43||

tapasi kāraṇāntarāṇyudghāṭya dūṣayitumāha---

divaṃ yadi prārthayase vṛthā śramaḥ pituḥ pradeśāstava devabhūmayaḥ|
athopayantāramalaṃ samādhinā na ratnamanviṣyati mṛgyate hi tat|| 44||

svargaṃ cettapasābhilaṣyasi tannirarthako 'yaṃ kleśo yatastvatpitṛpradeśā eva surapurāṇi| 
athopayantāraṃ bhartāramarthayase tadalaṃ samādhinā| mā niyamaṃ kṛthāḥ| 
yato ratnaṃ na grahītāramanviṣyati gaveṣayati ko māṃ grahīṣyatīti|
api tu haṭhāttadanyena mṛgyate 'rthyate| evaṃ tvamarthanīyā na tu tvamarthayase| 
upayacchate svīkarotītyupayantā patiḥ|
alaṃ samādhineti prakṛtyāditvāttṛtīyā| 
caturthīvidhau tu paryāptyarthasyālamo grahaṇam|| 
44||

athopayantāramiti varakathāvasare gauryā ucchvāsamālakṣyāha---

niveditaṃ niḥśvasitena soṣmaṇā manastu me saṃśayameva gāhate|
na dṛśyate prārthayitavya eva te bhaviṣyati prārthitadurlabhaḥ katham|| 45||

uṣṇena niḥśvasitena me sūcitaṃ yathā patimabhilaṣyasīti|
tatrāpi mama manaḥ saṃśete| 
yataḥ kāmya eva te na samāste kutaḥ punararthito 'pi duṣprāpaḥ syāt| 
tava strīratnatvāditi bhāvaḥ| prārthitavya iti hetau kṛtyaḥ|| 45||

tadānīṃ patiprārthanāmeva tūṣṇīṃbhāvānniścityāha---

aho sthiraḥ ko 'pi tavepsito yuvā cirāya karṇotpalaśūnyatāṃ gate|
upekṣate yaḥ ślathabandhalambinīrjaṭāḥ kapole kalamāgrapiṅgalāḥ|| 46||

aho citraṃ ko 'pi sthiraḥ krūrastaruṇastavepsita āptumiṣṭo yaste śravaṇakuvalayarahitatvaṃ prāpte kapole śithilabandhavaśātsraṃsamānā jaṭā upekṣate na samāracayati|
kalamākhyaḥ śālistasyāgraṃ kiṃśārustadvatpiṅgalāḥ kapilāstailasaṃskārābhāvāt||
46||

munivrataistvāmatimātrakarśitāṃ divākarāpluṣṭavibhūṣaṇāspadām|
śaśāṅkalekhāmiva paśyato divā sacetasaḥ kasya mano na dīryate|| 47||

munivratāni cāndrāyaṇādīni| tairatyarthatanūkṛtāṃ tvāṃ dine
śaśikalāmivāvalokya kasya sahṛdayasya mano na sphuṭati| tena
tvaddarśanānmama cittapīḍeti bhāvaḥ| 
raviṇā pluṣṭāni dagdhānyatisaukumāryādalaṃkaraṇasthānāni yasyāḥ|
pluṣeruditaḥ pluṣṭamiti rūpam|
dīryata iti karmakartari|| 47||

avaimi saubhāgyamadena vañcitaṃ tava priyaṃ yaścaturāvalokinaḥ|
karoti lakṣyaṃ sthiramasya cakṣuṣo na vaktramātmīyamarālapakṣmaṇaḥ|| 48||

tava priyaṃ vāllabhyagarveṇa vañcitaṃ vipralabdhamahamavagacchāmi| 
yastvadīyasyāsya netrasyātmīyaṃ mukhaṃ saṃnidhānena lakṣyabhūtaṃ na kurute|
yaṃ tvaṃ nekṣasa ityarthaḥ| tvadīyadarśanena hi tasya
janmasāphalyam| kīdṛśasya cakṣuṣaḥ|
caturāvalokino madhuradarśinaḥ|
caturaṃ kiṃciducchvāsānmadhurāyatatā bhruvoḥ||
ata evārālapakṣmaṇo nataromṇo 'dhodṛṣṭitvāt|| 48||

kiyacciraṃ śrāmyasi gauri vidyate mamāpi pūrvāśramasaṃcitaṃ tapaḥ|
tato 'rdhabhāgena labhasva kāṅkṣitaṃ varaṃ tamicchāmi ca sādhu veditum|| 49||

he gauri kiyacciraṃ śrāmyasi kutaḥ kālādārabhya tapaścarasi|
yadi vā kiyadanvadhikaṃ cirakālaṃ tapasyasītyarthaḥ| mamāpi
tāvatpūrvāśramasaṃcitaṃ brahmacaryārjitaṃ tapo 'sti|
tadardhāṃśena
tvamabhimataṃ varaṃ patimāpnuhītyāśīranujñā vā| 
taṃ ca tvadvaraṃ sādhu samyagjñātumicchāmi|
yogyaścettadanumanyata iti bhāvaḥ| 
ardhaścāsau bhāgo 'rdhabhāgaḥ|| 49||

iti praviśyābhihitā dvijanmanā manogataṃ sā na śaśāka śaṃsitum|
atho vayasyāṃ paripārśvavartinīṃ vivartitānañjananetramaikṣata|| 50||

itthaṃ tenāntarbhūyoktā sā śālīnatvādabhiprāyaṃ vaktuṃ nāśakat|
atho 'nantaraṃ kathanārthaṃ nikaṭasthāṃ sakhīmaikṣata| katham|
vivartitaṃ calitamanañjanaṃ netraṃ yatra| 
kathaya tvamasyetyakṣinikocenālīmacodayadityarthaḥ| 
pārśvameva paripārśvam|| 50||

sakhī tadīyā nijagāda varṇinaṃ nibodha sādho tava cetkutūhalam|
yadarthamambhojamivoṣṇavāraṇaṃ kṛtaṃ tapaḥsādhanametayā vapuḥ|| 51||

tato devyāḥ sakhī varṇinamavocat| he sādho śṛṇu yadi te kutūhalaṃ kautukaṃ yadarthamanayā saroruhamivātapatraṃ vapustapaḥsādhanaṃ vratanirvartakaṃ vihitam|
yathaivābjasyātapanivāraṇātkadarthanā tathaitatkāyasya
tapaścaraṇādityarthaḥ|| 51||

iyaṃ kilendraprabhṛtīnadhiśriyaścaturdigīśānavamanya māninī|
arūpahāryaṃ madanasya nigrahātpinākapāṇiṃ patimāptumicchati|| 52||

indrayamavaruṇadhanadānadhigatavibhavāndikpatīnavamanyāvajñayāvekṣyeyaṃ manasvinī haraṃ kila bhartāraṃ lipsate| 
kilaśabdenālabhyatvaṃ tasya sūcayati| 
smarasya dāhādarūpahāryaṃ saundaryeṇa hartumaśakyam| 
yadi hyasau rūpavaśyaḥ syādetannimittaṃ madanaṃ na dahet| 
māninīti harajigīṣonmukhatvamapyāha| 
praṣṭavyamakhilametāvatā kathitam|| 52||

idānīṃ prasaṅgāttasyā madanāvasthāṃ kathayati---

asahyahuṃkāranivartitaḥ purā smarārimaprāptamukhaḥ śilīmukhaḥ|
imāṃ hṛdi vyāyatapātamakṣiṇodviśīrṇamūrterapi puṣpadhanvanaḥ|| 53||

pūrvaṃ haramuddiśya madanena yaḥ sāyakaḥ prahitaḥ sa
smarārimaprāptamukhatvādimāmeva pratyuta
hṛdaye 'kṣiṇojjaghāna| yataḥ śambhunā durjayena
huṃkārāstreṇa nivartitaḥ parāṅmukhīkṛtaḥ|
viśīrṇamūrterapi dagdhavapuṣo 'pi| sāyakakṣepānupadameva
hyasau hareṇādāhi| vyāyato dīrghaḥ pātaḥ praveśo yatra|
akṣiṇoditi ṛkṣicirītyasya rūpam| 
na prāptaṃ mukhaṃ yasya so 'prāptamukhaḥ| prāptamiti kartari|
smarārimiti guṇakriyāpekṣā dvitīyā yathā kṛtapūrvī
kaṭaṃ bhuktapūrvyodanamiti|
puṣpaiḥ puṣpāṇi vā dhanuryasya sa puṣpadhanvā|
dhanuṣaścetyanaṅṅādeśaḥ|| 53||

tadāprabhṛtyunmadanā piturgṛhe lalāṭikācandanadhūsarālakā|
na jātu bālā labhate sma nirvṛtiṃ tuṣārasaṃghātaśilātaleṣvapi|| 54||

tata ārabhyāsyāḥ smarārtatvāttuhinanikaradṛṣatpaṭṭeṣvapi nirvṛtiṃ saukhyaṃ na kadācillebhe|
saṃtāpāpanuttaye 'laṃkāravicchittyā lalāṭe vihitaṃ candanaṃ lalāṭikācandanaṃ tena dhūsarālakā malinakacā|
karṇalalāṭātkannalaṃkāre|
tadeti pañcamyarthavṛttiḥ|| 54||

upāttavarṇe carite pinākinaḥ sabāṣpakaṇṭhaskhalitaiḥ padairiyam|
anekaśaḥ kiṃnararājakanyakā vanāntasaṃgītasakhīrarodayat|| 55||

vanānta upavane saṃgītisakhīrguṇanikālīḥ kiṃnarīreṣā virahārtā asakṛdarodayat| 
kena keva| 
sabāṣpakaṇṭhe
skhalitaiḥ pratihataiḥ padairvacobhiḥ| kadā| pinākinaścaritre
tripuravadhādāvapadāna upāttavarṇe varṇīkṛte gīyamāne|
ataśca priyasyaiva carite kīrtyamāne dviguṇatararāgāvirbhāvādasrotpattyā vacasāmaspaṣṭatā|
sakhīnāṃ ca kāruṇyādanurodanam|
varṇā geyaśāstraprasiddhāḥ sthāyyārohādayaḥ|| 55||

tribhāgaśeṣāsu niśāsu ca kṣaṇaṃ nimīlya netre sahasā vyabudhyata|
kva nīlakaṇṭha vrajasītyalakṣyavāgasatyakaṇṭhārpitabāhubandhanā|| 56||

eṣā caturthayāme kathamapi kṣaṇamātraṃ nidrāvaśādakṣiṇī
saṃkocya jhaṭiti vyabudhyata prabuddhonnidadrau| kva priyatama
vrajasītyasphuṭaṃ vadantī| asatye 'pāramārthike
kaṇṭhe 'rpitaṃ bāhubandhanaṃ bhujapāśo yayā| svapne hyetayā
sa evāgato dṛṣṭaḥ|| 56||

yadā budhaiḥ sarvagatastvamucyase na vetsi bhāvasthamimaṃ janaṃ katham|
iti svahastālikhitaśca mugdhayā rahasyupālabhyata candraśekharaḥ|| 57||

etayā ca mugdhayā citre svayamālikhya candramauliritthamupālabhyata sāsūyamagadyata| 
kathamityāha---yadā tvaṃ manīṣibhiḥ sarvagataḥ sarvavyāpī kathyase tademaṃ janaṃ bhāvasthaṃ bhaktaṃ rāgiṇaṃ kathaṃ na jānāsi|
vyasaninīmimāṃ vijñāya paritrāṇaṃ kartuṃ yuktaṃ tavetyarthaḥ| 
bhāvo vāsanā tatra tiṣṭhatīti bhāvasthaḥ| imamityātmanirdeśaḥ|
caḥ pūrvāpekṣayā samuccaye| evamanyatra| upālambho vācyatā||
57||

yadā ca tasyādhigame jagatpaterapaśyadanyaṃ na vidhiṃ vicinvatī|
tadā sahāsmābhiranujñayā guroriyaṃ prapannā tapase tapovanam|| 58||

tasya sarveśvarasya harasya prāptau yadā cāsau vidhiṃ vicinvatī
vīkṣamāṇāpyupāyāntaraṃ naikṣiṣṭa tadā
piturnideśenāsmābhiḥ saha sākaṃ taporthamāśramaṃ prāptā|
puṇyairvinā na hi bhavanti samīhitārthāḥ|| 58||

kiyacciraṃ śrāmyasītyuttaramāha---

drumeṣu sakhyā kṛtajanmasu svayaṃ phalaṃ tapaḥsākṣiṣu baddhametayā|
na ca prarohābhimukho 'pi dṛśyate manoratho 'syāḥ śaśimaulisaṃśrayaḥ|| 59||

anayā svayaṃ ropiteṣvamīṣu vṛkṣakeṣu phalamapi
baddhamutpannam| asyāstu yaḥ śivālambano manorathaḥ sa
prarohābhimukho 'pyaṅkurito 'pi na lakṣyate| tapasaḥ sākṣiṣu
draṣṭṛṣu| teṣāṃ pūrvaṃ ropitatvāt|| 59||

na vedmi sa prārthitadurlabhaḥ kadā sakhībhirasrottaramīkṣitāmimām|
tapaḥkṛśāmabhyavapatsyate sakhīṃ vṛṣeva sītāṃ tadavagrahakṣatām|| 6||

ataśca na jāne sa prārthito 'pi durlabhaḥ kademāṃ sakhīṃ niyamadurbalāmata evālībhirasrottaraṃ bāṣpamārgaṃ dṛṣṭāmabhyavapatsyate paritrāsyate| 
vṛṣā śakro yathā sītāṃ tadavagrahakṣatāmindrānāvṛṣṭibādhitāṃ vṛṣṭyābhyavapadyate|
tasyendrasyāvagrahastadavagrahaḥ| ave graho varṣapratibandhe|
tapasā kṛśā tapaḥkṛśeti ojaḥsahombhastapasastṛtīyāyā iti
alugabhāvaścintyaḥ|| 60||

agūḍhasadbhāvamitīṅgitajñayā nivedite naiṣṭhikasundarastayā|
apīdamevaṃ parihāsa ityumāmapṛcchadavyañjitaharṣalakṣaṇaḥ|| 61||

tatastayeṅgitajñayābhiprāyavidā sakhyāgūḍhasadbhāvaṃ prakaṭaparamārthamitītthamākhyāte sati sa naiṣṭhikasundaro varṇī gaurīmaprākṣīt|
kimityāha---yadetadetayoktamapīdamevaṃ satyamuta
parihāso narma| dvitīyapraśnapadābhāve 'pi
pāṭhaviśeṣavaśāttadarthapratītiḥ| yathā
devaḥ kiṃ bāndhavaḥ syādityatra|
naiṣṭhiko vratī| 
sa cāsau sundaraḥ subhago naiṣṭhikasundaraḥ|
naiṣṭhikatvaṃ tadveṣaparigrahāt| 
sundaratvaṃ tu tasyaiva prārthyamānatvāt| 
avyañjitānyaprakaṭitāni harṣalakṣaṇāni romāñcādīni yena sa tathoktaḥ| 
ātmasaubhāgyākarṇanena hi teṣāmutpattiryuktā|| 61||

athāgrahaste mukulīkṛtāṅgulau samarpayantī sphaṭikākṣamaṇḍalam|
kathaṃcidadrestanayā mitākṣaraṃ ciravyavasthāpitavāgabhāṣata|| 62||

tataḥ pārvatī kṛcchreṇa parimitamabravīt| kīdṛśī|
kuḍmalitakaraśākhe karāgre sitamaṇigulikāvalayaṃ samarpayantīyojayantī|
lajjānubhāvo 'yam| 
cireṇa kleśena vyavasthāpitānudyamitā vāgyayā|| 62||

kimuvācetyāha---

yathā śrutaṃ vedavidāṃ vara tvayā jano 'yamuccaiḥpadalaṅghanotsukaḥ|
tapaḥ kiledaṃ tadavāptisādhanaṃ manorathānāmagatirna vidyate|| 63||

he dvijottama yathā tvayā śrutaṃ tathaivaitat|
yato 'yaṃ jana unnatasthānākramaṇapravaṇaḥ|
kuta ityāha---idaṃ kila tapo haralābhanirvartakam| 
na cānena tapasā sa sulabha iti kilaśabdaḥ sūcayati| 
yadi na prāpyate kiṃ kleśenetyāha---manorājyānāmaviṣayo nāma na kaścidasti|
āśā hi sarvatraiva prerayati| 
tadavāptīti lajjāvaśātsarvanāmanirdeśaḥ| 
yathāśrutagrahaṇāttu viśeṣāvagatiḥ| yathā śrutamiti dve pade|| 63||

athāha varṇī vidito maheśvarastadarthinī tvaṃ punareva vartase|
amaṅgalābhyāsarataṃ vicintya taṃ tavānuvṛttiṃ na tu kartumutsahe|| 64||

tataḥ punarbrahmacārī jagāda| kimityāha---vidito maheśvaraḥ|
yathāsvarūpaṃ jānāmi tamityarthaḥ|
maheśvara ityulluṇṭhanāpadam| 
kopagarbhamāha---punarapi bhavatī tadarthinī vartate| 
kāmadāhātprākkila tvaṃ tadarthinyabhūḥ| 
tādṛśaṃ ca paribhavamanubhūyādyāpi bhūyastameva prārthayase| pura eveti pāṭhe tu vākyadvayametatsotprāśam| 
tadarthinī tvamityayuktametat| 
pūrvasmātkālādārabhya tadarthinī vartase| 
tathāpi pura evāgrata eva tiṣṭhasi na tu lajjayā palāyasa ityarthaḥ| 
ahaṃ tu tavānuvṛttimanumatadānena cittārādhanaṃ kartuṃ na śaknomi| 
amaṅgalābhyāse śmaśānavāsādike rataṃ saktaṃ taṃ tvatpatiṃ vicintya vīkṣya| 
na hyasau tava patirucitaḥ|| 64||

idānīṃ taddoṣakīrtanamāha---

avastunirbandhapare kathaṃ nu te karo 'yamābaddhavivāhakautukaḥ|
kareṇa śambhorvalayīkṛtāhinā sahiṣyate tatprathamāvalambanam|| 65||

haraprāthanayā he asthānahevākini kathaṃ tavāyaṃ baddhodvāhakaṅkaṇapāṇirbhavasya kaṭakīkṛtorageṇa bāhunā tatprathamaṃ tadādyavalambanaṃ grahaṇaṃ sahiṣyate| 
sa hi sarpābharaṇaḥ|| 65||

tvameva tāvatparicintaya svayaṃ kadācidete yadi yogamarhataḥ|
vadhūdugūlaṃ ca sahaṃsalakṣaṇaṃ gajājinaṃ śoṇitabinduvarṣi ca|| 66||

āstāmanyastvameva tāvadidaṃ vicāraya yadi rocanālikhitahaṃsāṅkasya patiṃvarāpaṭṭāṃśukasya rudhirakaṇamucaśca karicarmaṇo yogaḥ sambandho yogyaḥ|
bhagavānhi karikṛttivasanaḥ|| 66||

catuṣkapuṣpaprakarāvakīrṇayoḥ paro 'pi ko nāma tavānumaṃsyate|
alaktakāṅkāni padāni pādayorvikīrṇakeśāsu paretabhūmiṣu|| 67||

tava pādayoryāvakacihnāni padāni kramānvikṣiptakeśāsthiṣu paretabhūmiṣu pretāvaniṣu śmaśāneṣu śatrurapi ko 'numaṃsyate 'nujñāsyati| 
kadācittadyogyāveva caraṇau syātāmityāha---catuṣkaṃ veśmaviśeṣastatra yaḥ puṣpaprakarastatrāvakīrṇayornikṣiptayoḥ| 
evaṃ yau yāvakarañjitau vāsaveśmakusumopakārasaṃcaraṇocitau tayoḥ śavakeśāsthikalilāsu śmaśānāvaniṣu caṅkramaṇamativaiśasam| 
bhavo hi śmaśānavāsī| 
catuṣkaśabde catuḥśālāsaṃjñāyāṃ kan|| 
67||

ayuktarūpaṃ kimataḥ paraṃ vada trinetravakṣaḥsulabhaṃ tavāpi yat|
stanadvaye 'sminharicandanāspade padaṃ citābhasmarajaḥ kariṣyati|| 68||

kathayātaścānyatkimasāmpratamanupapannaṃ yadīśānorasi nihitaḥ śavabhūtireṇustavāpyasmindivyānulepanocite kucayuge sthāsyati| 
āśleṣavaśāddhi tatra saṃcarati|| 68||

iyaṃ ca te 'nyā purato viḍambanā yadūḍhayā vāraṇarājahāryayā|
vilokya vṛddhokṣamadhiṣṭhitaṃ tvayā mahājanaḥ smeramukho bhaviṣyati|| 69||

iyaṃ ca tavāgrato viḍambanopahāsarūpā sthitaiva|
yattvayoḍhayodvāhitayā haravāhanaṃ jaradgavamārūḍhamālokya sādhuloko 'pi prahasitavadanaḥ sampatsyate| 
kadācittadyogyaiva sā syādityāha---vāraṇarājenairāvaṇena hāryayā prāpyayā|
tvayā hīndreṇoḍhayā dvipendreṇa gantuṃ nyāyyam|
vṛddhaścāsāvukṣā vṛddhokṣaḥ| acaturetyādināc|| 69||

dvayaṃ gataṃ samprati śocanīyatāṃ samāgamaprārthanayā kapālinaḥ|
kalā ca sā kāntimatī kalāvatastvamasya lokasya ca netrakaumudī|| 70||

paśupatisaṃyogābhilāṣeṇādhunobhayaṃ śocyatvaṃ prāptam|
kiṃ tat| 
kalāvataḥ śaśino dyutiyutā sā kalā janasya nayanānandinī tvaṃ ca| 
kalāvata ityulluṇṭhanāpadam| 
sa kila kalāvānvidagdhaḥ|| 70||

vapurvirūpākṣamalakṣyajanmatā digambaratvena niveditaṃ vasu|
vareṣu yadbālamṛgākṣi mṛgyate tadasti kiṃ vyastamapi trilocane|| 71||

he hariṇaśiśunayane vareṣu kanyāmārgakeṣu rūpakuladhanādikaṃ yanmṛgyate gaveṣyate tatsamastamāstāṃ vyastamekamapi hare kiṃ vidyate| 
naivāsti|
tathā hi vapustāvadasya virūpākṣamanalapiṅgatvādvibhīṣaṇanetram|
janmāpi naiva lakṣyate kuto 'yaṃ jāta iti| 
dhanamapi digambaratvena nagnatayā kathitam|| 71||

nivartayāsmādasamīkṣitānmanaḥ kva tadvidhastvaṃ kva ca puṇyalakṣaṇā|
apekṣate sādhujano na vaidikīṃ śmaśānaśūlasya hi yūpasatkriyām|| 72||

yata evamato 'smādaparyālocitācceto nivartaya parāṅmukhīkuru| 
yasmātsa pūrvoktavidhaḥ prakāro yasya sa tadvidho durbhagaḥ kvāsau kva ca tvaṃ puṇyalakṣaṇā praśastacihnā| 
anucito yuvayoḥ saṃgama ityarthaḥ| 
etadeva dṛṣṭāntena draḍhayati| 
sādhujano dvijalokaḥ śmaśānaśūlasya nigrahastambhasya vedoktāṃ yūpasatkriyāṃ nāpekṣate nārthayate|
na hi yajñayūpasya yaḥ satkāraḥ sa cauraśūlasya kenacitkovidena kriyate| 
tvaṃ ca yadi tasyātmānamarpayase tadāsau saṃskṛto bhavati| 
atrāparārdhe tricaturāṇi pāṭhāntarāṇi pracaranti|
tatra sarvatraikameva vastu| satkriyātulyatvamatra devyāḥ|| 72||

iti dvijātau pratikūlavādini pravepamānādharalakṣyakopayā|
vikuñcitabhrūlatamāhite tayā vilocane tiryagupāntalohite|| 73||

tasminvarṇinītthamapriyabhāṣiṇi gauryā bhrukuṭiṃ vidhāya roṣaraktāpāṅge netre tiryaksācyāhite kṣipte| 
gauravavati hi kopānna saṃmukhadarśanam|
pravepamānābhyāmadharābhyāṃ lakṣyaḥ kopo yasyāḥ| 
ruṣā hyoṣṭhakampaḥ| vikuñcite kuṭilīkṛte bhrūlate yatrādhāne||
73|| 

uvāca cainaṃ paramārthato haraṃ na vetsi nūnaṃ yata evamāttha mām|
alokasāmānyamacintyahetukaṃ dviṣanti mandāścaritaṃ mahātmanām|| 74||

evaṃ ca vipramasau jagāda|
kimityāha---tattvatastvaṃ śivaṃ nūnaṃ na buddhyase|
yata evaṃ rūkṣaṃ māmāttha bravīṣi| 
yasmādye mandā ajñāste mahatāṃ ceṣṭitaṃ sarvavilakṣaṇamajñeyanidānaṃ ca dviṣanti nindanti| 
yadi ca tvaṃ prājño vijñātaparamārthaḥ syāstannaivaṃ brūyāḥ|| 74||

idānīṃ yattena amaṅgalābhyāsaratamityādyuktaṃ tatra yathākramamuttaramāha---

vipatpratīkārapareṇa maṅgalaṃ niṣevyate bhūtisamutsukena vā|
jagaccharaṇyasya nirāśiṣaḥ sataḥ kimebhirāśopahatātmavṛttibhiḥ|| 75||

iha dvābhyāṃ maṅgalaṃ sevyate| vyādhyādyanarthanāśecchunā
vibhavotkaṇṭhitena ca| yaśca jagatāṃ śaraṇya ārtiharastasya
vipanna sambhāvyate| 
yaśca paripūrṇatvānnirāśīrniṣkāmaḥ sa kāmiva vibhūtimaprāptāṃ kāmayatām| ataśca jagaccharaṇyasya nirāśiṣaḥ sato harasya kimebhirmaṅgalaiḥ|
āśayopahatā ninditātmavṛttiḥ svarūpaṃ yeṣāṃ taiḥ|
āśā cālpacetasām| 
maṅgalamityekavacananirdeśo yukto na veti budhāḥ pramāṇam| 
sāmānyanirdeśo vaibhiriti||
śṛṇāti bhayamiti śaraṇyastrātā| śṛramyoścetyanyaḥ|
yadi vā śaraṇe rakṣāyāṃ sādhuḥ śaraṇyaḥ|| 75||

vapurvirūpākṣamityuddiśyāha--- 

akiṃcanaḥ sanprabhavaḥ sa sampadāṃ sa lokanāthaḥ pitṛsadmagocaraḥ|
sa bhīmarūpaḥ śiva ityudīryate na santi yāthātmyavidaḥ pinākinaḥ|| 76||

śarvasya yāthātmyavido yathāsvarūpajñā na vidyante| 
tathā hyakiṃcano 'pi nirvibhavo 'pi sannasau sampadāmaiśvaryāṇāṃ prabhavaḥ kāraṇam|
akiṃcano nirāśīrdaridraśca tathā śmaśānavāsyapyasau lokanāthaḥ saptabhuvanaprabhuḥ| 
bhairavādibhīṣaṇarūpo 'pi cāsau śiva ityudīryate| 
yaśca bhayānakaḥ sa kathaṃ śreyaskaraḥ syāt| 
ataśca viruddhānekarūpadarśanānna santi yāthātmyavidaḥ pinākinaḥ|| 76||

vibhūṣaṇodbhāsi pinaddhabhogi vā gajājinālambi dugūladhāri vā|
kapāli vā syādathavenduśekharaṃ na viśvamūrteravadhāryate vapuḥ|| 77||

kiṃ bahunā| viśvamūrteḥ sarvātmano devasya vapurevaṃvidhameveti nāvadhāryate na niścīyate| 
tathā hi vibhūṣaṇodbhāsi vā tadbhavatu pinaddhabhogi vā protoragam|
viruddhobhayarūpamapi bhavatītyarthaḥ| evamuttaratra|
gajājinālambi vā kṛttidhāri vā supaṭṭāṃsukabhṛdvā|
kapālayutaṃ vā bhavatu śaśimukuṭamathavā|
kadācidbhīṣaṇo 'sāvīkṣyate kadācitsaumyaḥ|
yato viśvamūrtirityarthaḥ| etena tvameva tāvaditi 
pratyuktam|| 77||

padaṃ citābhasmarajaḥ kariṣyatītyuttarayitumāha---

tadaṅgasaṃsparśamavāpya kalpate dhruvaṃ citābhasmarajo viśuddhaye|
tathā hi nṛttābhinayakriyācyutaṃ vilipyate maulibhirambaraukasām|| 78||

tasya devasyāṅgasamparkaṃ labdhvā niścitaṃ citābhasmarajo 'pi pavitraṃ sampadyate| 
kuta ityāha---tathā hi vṛtte ye 'bhinayāḥ karacaraṇādiprayogāsteṣāṃ kriyā karaṇaṃ tadvaśātpatitaṃ tannākināṃ śirobhirvilipyata utpuṃsyate|
yadi cāmaṅgalaṃ syāttatkathamahaṃpūrvikayā śakrādyā uttamāṅgena tadbibhṛyuḥ| 
etacca pratyakṣalakṣaṇam|| 78||

asampadastasya vṛṣeṇa gacchataḥ prabhinnadigvāraṇavāhano vṛṣā|
karoti pādāvupagamya maulinā vinidramandārarajoruṇāṅgulī|| 79||

tasya devasya vṛṣagāmitvādasampado jaradgavadhanasyāpi vṛṣā śakraścaraṇāvāgatya śirasā vinidramandārarajoruṇāṅgulī vikasitasurakusumaparāgalohitāṅgulīkau vidhatte|
evamīdṛśo 'pi yadi daridrastadevamastu| 
asampada iti paramatāpekṣayā| etena vilokya vṛddhokṣamiti 
digambaratvena niveditaṃ vasu
iti ca pratyuktam| kīdṛśo vṛṣā|
prabhinnaḥ sphuṭitagaṇḍo digvāraṇo .airāvaṇo vāhanaṃ yasya saḥ| 
upagamya dvipendrādavaruhya|| 79||

vivakṣatā doṣamapi cyutātmanā tvayaikamīśaṃ prati sādhu bhāṣitam|
yamāmanantyātmabhuvo 'pi kāraṇaṃ kathaṃ sa lakṣyaprabhavo bhaviṣyati|| 80||

bhavatā cyutātmanā haranindāvaśādbhraṣṭacetasā alakṣyajanmatā iti doṣamapi kathayatā śivoddeśena sādhu bhadramekamuktam|
yasmādyaṃ brahmaṇo 'pi prabhavamāmananti kathayanti|

kāmo brahmā brahma ca brāhmaṇāśca tvatsambhūtaṃ sthāṇu cariṣṇu cedam|

iti| sa devaḥ kathaṃ lakṣyaprabhavo jñātajanmā bhaviṣyati|
tasmādajatvaṃ stutireva|| 80||

alaṃ vivādena yathā śrutastvayā tathāvidhastāvadaśeṣamastu saḥ|
mamātra bhāvaikarasaṃ manaḥ sthitaṃ na kāmavṛttirvacanīyamīkṣate|| 81||

athavā kimatrodgrāhaṇikayā| 
bhavatā yādṛśo 'vagatastādṛśaḥ sarvamasau bhavatu| 
mama tvatra deve bhāvena bhaktyanurāgeṇaikarasamekarūpaṃ manaḥ sthitamanurāgamayameva sampannam| 
na tvayā vyāvartayituṃ śakyamityarthaḥ|
yataḥ kāmavṛttiḥ svecchāvyavahṛtirvacanīyaṃ vācyatāṃ nāpekṣate|
yaduktam---

asadgrahasya kā nītirvyasanasya kā yantraṇā|
viparītārthaboddhāraḥ satpathe kena yojitāḥ||

aśeṣamityastikriyāviśeṣaṇam|| 81||

nivāryatāmāli kimapyayaṃ vaṭuḥ punarvivakṣuḥ sphuritottarādharaḥ|
na kevalaṃ yo mahato 'pabhāṣate śṛṇoti tasmādapi yaḥ sa pāpabhāk|| 82||

ito gamiṣyāmyathaveti vādinī cacāla sā ca stanabhinnavalkalā|
svarūpamāsthāya ca tāṃ kṛtasmitaḥ samālalambe vṛṣarājaketanaḥ|| 83||

itthaṃ vādinī bruvāṇā sā ca devī cacāla| 
devo 'pi pratyakṣībhūya smeramukhastāṃ samālalambe 'vāṣṭabhnāt|
kiṃ vadantītyāha---he āli sakhi ayaṃ vaṭurvipraśiśurapāsyatām|
yasmādato 'nyadapyadhikaṃ kimapyavācyaṃ vivakṣurvaktukāmaḥ|
yataḥ sphuritottarādharaścalitordhvauṣṭhaḥ| 
vivakṣayā cauṣṭhakampaḥ| 
yadi kimapi vivakṣuḥ kimiti nivāryata ityāha---yasmānna kevalaṃ yo mahata uttamānapabhāṣate parivadati sa pāpabhāgyo 'vadyo 'pi tasmānnindakādākarṇayate so 'pyapuṇyamāpnoti| 
athaiṣa na nivartate tadahameveto 'smātsthānādvrajāmi| yaduktam---

na vācyaḥ paravādo vai na śrotavyaḥ kadācana|
karṇāveva pidhātavyau gantavyaṃ vā tato 'nyataḥ|| 

iti vādinī jigamaiṣayā yadaivottasthau tadaiva devaḥ svarūpaṃ prakaṭīkṛtya tāmālalambe|
stanabhinnavalkaleti cittakṣobhapratipādanaparam|
saṃsparśavaśādvā dehocchvāsādvā valkalabandhatroṭaḥ||
82--83||

taṃ vīkṣya vepathumatī sarasāṅgasandhirnikṣepa eva padamuddhṛtamudvahantī|
mārgācalavyatikarākuliteva sindhuḥ śailādhirājatanayā na yayau na tasthau|| 84||

tato devaṃ sākṣātpārvatī dṛṣṭvā kampasvedānvitā satī na yayau nāpyasthāt| 
yato nikṣepārthaṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ tameva bibhratī| 
yadi hyasau gacchettatsthānāntare kramaṃ nyaset|
athāpi tiṣṭhettaduddharaṇamanarthakamiti tatraiva tannyaset|
tatrāgamanaṃ prastutasya tatkāraṇasyābhāvādasthānamapyapūrvavṛttāntāvalokanena vyākulībhūtatvāt| 
mārgaśailasamparkavihvalā sindhurnadī yathā prasararodhānna yāti na ca tiṣṭhati tadvadasau| 
tayā hi nimnaṃ gantavyam|| 84||

adyaprabhṛtyanavamāṅgi tavāsmi dāsaḥ krītastapobhiriti vādini candramaulau|
ahnāya sā niyamajaṃ klamamutsasarja kleśaḥ phale na hi punarnavatāṃ vidhatte|| 85||

iti bruvāṇaḥ śaśiśekhare 'hnāya tatkṣaṇameva devī niyamajaṃ tapaḥsamutthaṃ klamamutsasarja glāniṃ jahau|
kimityāha---he anavamāṅgi kalyāṇagātri adyārabhya tavāhaṃ tapomūlyakrīto dāsa ityevaṃ bhāṣaṇāt| 
kimiti klamatyāga ityāha---yasmātkleśaḥ phale sati na punarnavatvaṃ bibharti| 
phaladarśanānnaśyatītyarthaḥ|
kleśasya hyetadeva navatvaṃ yadaṅgaglānyādyāvirbhāvaḥ|
ahnāyeti caturthyantapratirūpako nipātastatkṣaṇārthavṛttiḥ|
vasantatilakaṃ vṛttam| arthāntaranyāso 'yamalaṃkāraḥ|| 85||

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ pañcamaḥ sargaḥ||

 ṣaṣṭhaḥ sargaḥ|

atha viśvātmane gaurī saṃdideśa mithaḥ sakhīm|
dātā me bhūbhṛtāṃ nāthaḥ pramāṇīkriyatāmiti|| 1||

athānantaraṃ harāvaṣṭabdhā pārvatī viśvātmane śivāya mitho guptaṃ sakhīṃ saṃdideśājñāpayat| 
kim| pitā me dātā prabhurataḥ pramāṇīkriyatāmatra vastunyadhikriyatām| 
kanyā hi janakādhīnā|| 1||

tayā vyāhṛtasaṃdeśā sā babhau nibhṛtā priye|
cūtayaṣṭirivābhyāśe madhau parabhṛtāmukhī|| 2||

tayā sakhyā priye 'bhyāśe samīpasthe 'pi vyāhṛtaḥ kathitaḥ saṃdeśo yasyāḥ sā ata eva nibhṛtā salajjatvādvinītā devī babhau reje| 
svayamabhāṣaṇena nibhṛtatve sati śobhāmavāpetyarthaḥ| 
śālīnatvaṃ hi kanyānāmalaṃkāraḥ| keva babhau| 
madhau vasante 'bhyāśe nikaṭasthe parabhṛtāmukhī kokilādūtīkā cūtatarulatā yathā bhāti| 
tatsaṃdeśasya kathanārthe kokilāyā mukhatvam|
aupacārikaśca saṃdeśavyavahāro harasya madhurupamānaṃ gauryāścūtalatā sakhyāḥ parabhṛtā|
parabhṛtādīnāṃ kokilārthatve 'pi kriyāpravṛttinimittaṃ na tu jātiriti jāterastrīviṣayāditi ṅīṣ na bhavati|| 2||

sa tatheti pratijñāya visṛjya kathamapyumām|
ṛṣīñjyotirgṛhānsapta sasmāra smaraśāsanaḥ|| 3||

sa smararipustatheti pratijñāyaivaṃ karomīti yāce
nageśamityaṅgīkṛtya gaurīṃ ca kṛcchrādvimucya
ṛṣīnasmārṣīt| śeṣatvāvivakṣayā ṣaṣṭhyabhāvaḥ|
kānmunīn| jyotīṃṣi tārā eva gṛhaṃ dhiṣṇyaṃ yeṣāṃ tān|
saptarṣīnityarthaḥ| śasurhiṃsārthaḥ|
smaraṃ śāsitavāniti smaraśāsanaḥ| kulapāṃsanavaddīrghaḥ|
śāsorvā rūpam|| 
3||

te prabhāmaṇḍalairvyoma dyotayantastapodhanāḥ|
sārundhatīkāḥ sapadi prādurāsanpuraḥ prabhoḥ|| 4||

tataste munayo 'rundhatīsahitāḥ sapadi smaraṇānantarameva devasyāgrataḥ prādurāsannāvirbabhūvuḥ| 
nijaistejomaṇḍalairvyoma bhāsayantaḥ|| 4||

āplutāstīramandārakusumottaravīciṣu|
ākāśagaṅgāsrotaḥsu diṅnāgamadagandhiṣu|| 5||

kīdṛśāste saptarṣayaḥ| 
ākāśagaṅgāsrotaḥsu surasaritpravāheṣvāplutāḥ snātāḥ| 
kīdṛśeṣu| tīropānte mandārakusumairuttarā adhikā vīcayastaraṅgā yeṣu|
utkireti pāṭhe kusumānyutkiranti kṣipanti yāstā vīcayo yeṣām| 
tathā jalakrīḍāgatānāṃ diggajānāṃ madagandho vidyate yeṣu|| 5||

muktāyañjopavītāni bibhrato hemavalkalāḥ|
ratnākṣasūtrāḥ pravrajyāṃ kalpavṛkṣā ivāśritāḥ|| 6||

muktāmayāni yajñopavītāni dadhato hemnaḥ suvarṇasya valkalāni cīvarāṇi yeṣāṃ te hemavalkalāḥ| 
ratnamayāni cākṣasūtrāṇi yeṣāṃ te ratnākṣasūtrāḥ|
ataścotprekṣyate---kalpavṛkṣā iva
pravrajyāmāśritāḥ pravrajitāḥ| teṣāṃ hi ratnasulabhatvam|
pravrajanaṃ pravrajyā| vrajajayorbhāve kyap|
bibhrata iti nābhyastācchaturiti
numabhāvaḥ|| 6||

adhaḥprasthāpitāśvena samāvarjitaketunā|
sahasraraśminā śaśvatsapraṇāmamudīkṣitāḥ|| 7||

raviṇā nityaṃ praṇatipūrvamudīkṣitā ūrdhvaṃ dṛṣṭāḥ|
teṣāṃ hi dhruvanikaṭe sthānam|
ata evādhaḥprasthāpitā aśvā yena|
samāvarjito namitaḥ keturdhvajo yena|| 7||

āsaktabāhulatayā sārdhamuddhṛtayā bhuvā|
mahāvarāhadaṃṣṭrāyāṃ viśrāntāḥ pralayāpadi|| 8||

tathā pralayāpadi
kalpāntavipattāvādivarāhadaṃṣṭrāyāṃ viśrāntāḥ sthitā ityanaśvaratvoktiḥ|
kiṃ kevalāstatra viśrāntā ityāha---uddhṛtayā bhuvā saha|
sā hi bhagavatā toyādutkṣipya daṃṣṭrāyāmūḍhā|
āpātabhayāllagitā bāhulatā yayā|| 8||

sargaśeṣapraṇayanādviśvayoneranantaram|
purātanāḥ purāvidbhirdhātāra iti kīrtitāḥ|| 9||

purāvidbhiścirantanairmārkaṇḍeyādibhiḥ purātanā ādyā dhātāro vedhasa iti
kīrtitāḥ| kutaḥ| viśvayonerbrahmaṇaḥ sarvaśeṣapraṇayanāt|
brahmaṇā hi kiṃcinnirmāya tataste sṛṣṭau niyuktāḥ|| 9||

prāktanānāṃ viśuddhānāṃ paripākamupeyuṣām|
tapasāmupabhuñjānāḥ phalānyapi tapasvinaḥ|| 10||

tapasvino 'pi prāktanānāṃ pūrvabhūtānāṃ nirmalānāṃ pakvānāṃ ca
tapasāṃ phalānyaśnantaḥ| anyasya hi janmāntare tapaḥ phaladāyi|
eṣāṃ tu cirajīvitvāttadaiva| apirvismaye| citraṃ samprati
tapasyanto 'pi tapaḥphalopabhoginaḥ|| 10||

teṣāṃ madhyagatā sādhvī patyuḥ pādārpitekṣaṇā|
sākṣādiva tapaḥsiddhirbabhāse bahvarundhatī|| 11||

teṣāmṛṣīṇāṃ madhyasthārundhatī bahvatitarāṃ babhāse 'śobhata| 
kīdṛśī| patyurvasiṣṭhasya caraṇanihitanayanā| yataḥ sādhvī patidevatā| 
anyatra hi dṛṣṭistasyā na vrajati|
ataścotprekṣyate---sākṣānmūrtimatī tapaḥsiddhiriva|
munīnāṃ hi siddhyā bhāvyam|| 11||

tāmagauravabhedena munīṃścāpaśyadīśvaraḥ|
strī pumānityanāsthaiṣā vṛttaṃ hi mahitaṃ satām|| 12||

tāmarundhatīmṛṣīṃścāgauravabhedena samayāpratipattyā devo 'paśyadāvarjayat|
yasmādiyaṃ strī ayaṃ ca pumānityeṣā anāsthā apradhānaṃ gauravakaraṇe| 
etadanupayujyamānamapi tu satāṃ vṛttaṃ mahitaṃ śīlamādṛtam|
sādhavo vṛttaṃ pūjayantītyarthaḥ|
arundhatyāścānyaḥ kaścāritreṇādhikaḥ|| 12||

ataśca---

taddarśanādabhūcchambhorbhūyāndārārthamādaraḥ|
kriyāṇāṃ khalu dharmyāṇāṃ satpatnyo mūlasādhanam|| 13||

tasyā arundhatyāḥ sādhvyā avalokanācchivasya nitarāṃ bhāryāmānetuṃ prayatno 'bhūt|
yasmādijyādīnāṃ dharmyāṇāṃ kriyāṇāṃ sādhvyaḥ patnya eva mūlasādhanaṃ kāraṇam|| 13||

dharmeṇāpi padaṃ śarve kārite pārvatīṃ prati|
pūrvāparādhabhītasya kāmasyocchvasitaṃ manaḥ|| 14||

kāmasya mana ucchvasitaṃ vikasitam| 
śaktirūpeṇa manobhūrullasita ityarthaḥ| kadā| 
śarve pārvatyāṃ padamāsthābandhamudyamaṃ kārite sati| 
yadā haro gaurīmudvoḍhumaicchadityarthaḥ|
evaṃ hyuktam---pariṇeṣyati pārvatīṃ yadetyādi|
dharmapreritatvaṃ taddarśanādityādinaiva kathitam|
kīdṛśasya kāmasya|
pūrvasmādaparādhādīśvaracetaścālanalakṣaṇādbhītasya|
apirvismaye| 
citramidaṃ yadumāyāṃ padaṃ harau dharmeṇa kārito na tu rāgeṇa tathāpi smaraḥ pūrvāparādhabhīta iti|
bhayaṃ tu caṇḍakopatvādīśasya punarbādhāśaṅkayā|| 14||

atha te munayaḥ sarve mānayitvā jagadgurum|
idamūcuranūcānāḥ prītikaṇṭakitatvacaḥ|| 15||

tataste saptarṣayo bhagavantaṃ praṇāmādinārcayitvedaṃ vakṣyamāṇamūcurabruvan|
kīdṛśāḥ|
anūcānāḥ prahvā ājñāvidheyāḥ sāṅgavedādhyāyino vā|
tatā prītyā bhaktyā kaṇṭakitatvaco romāñcitāṅgāḥ|| 15||

kimūcurityāha---

yadbrahma samyagāmnātaṃ yadagnau vidhinā hutam|
yacca taptaṃ tapastasya vipakvaṃ phalamadya naḥ|| 16||

yadadhyakṣeṇa jagatāṃ vayamāropitāstvayā|
manorathasyāpyapathaṃ manoviṣayamātmanaḥ|| 17||

yadasmābhirvidhivadbrahma
vedo jñānaṃ vāmnātamabhyastaṃ yacca
yathāvadagnihotramāsevitaṃ yacca samyaṅniyamaśca cīrṇastasya
sarvasyādhunā phalaṃ pakvaṃ yadvayaṃ bhuvanaguruṇā
bhavatātmano manoviṣayaṃ cittagocaramāropitāḥ prāpitāḥ|
yattvayā smṛtā ityarthaḥ| kīdṛśaṃ tam|
manorājyānāmapyapathamaviṣayam| na hi manorathā api
kasyacidetāvantaḥ prasṛtā yadbhagavānapi smariṣyatīti||
16--17||

yasya cetasi vartethāḥ sa tāvatkṛtināṃ varaḥ|
kiṃ punarbrahmayoneryastava cetasi vartate|| 18||

yasya tāvattvaṃ cetasi vartethāstiṣṭheḥ sa
kṛtināṃ varaḥ kṛtārthānāṃ śreṣṭhaḥ|
puṇyasambhārānvitā hi bhavantaṃ smaranti| 
kiṃ punaryastava cetasi vartate tvaṃ yasya smarasi sa
kṛtārthānāṃ varo na bhavet| brahmaṇo virañcasya parasya vā
jñānasya yoneḥ prabhavasya tava|| 17||

satyamarkācca somācca paramadhyāsmahe padam|
adya tūccaistaraṃ tannaḥ smaraṇānugrahāttava|| 19||

dhruvanikaṭavāsātkāmaṃ sūryendubhyāṃ paramuccaiḥsthānaṃ vayamadhitiṣṭhāmaḥ|
adya tu tadasmākaṃ bhavato dhyānaprasādādunnatataraṃ tvadanudhyānāddhi vayamatyunnatāḥ saṃvṛttāḥ| 
uccaistarāmityāmvantapāṭho na nyāyyaḥ padasya dravyatvāt|| 19||

tvatsambhāvitamātmānaṃ bahu manyāmahe vayam|
prāyaḥ pratyayamādhatte svaguṇeṣūttamādaraḥ|| 20||

tvayā sambhāvitamādṛtaṃ yathātattvena jñātaṃ santamātmanaṃ vayaṃ bahu manyāmaha utkṛṣṭaṃ jānīmaḥ|
yasmāduttamādara īśvarapūjāprāyeṇa svaguṇeṣu pratyayamavabodhaṃ viśvāsamādhatte karoti| 
mahājanagauravāddhi jñāyate nūnaṃ guṇānvitā vayamiti| 
bahviti kriyāviśeṣaṇatve 'pyātmana evotkarṣaḥ pratīyate|| 20||

yā naḥ prītirvirūpākṣa tvadanudhyānasambhavā|
sā kimākhyāyate tubhyamantarātmāsi dehinām|| 21||

he virūpākṣa piṅgalanetra bhavatsmaraṇotpannā yāsmākaṃ tuṣṭiḥ sā kimiti tavāvedyate|
yasmātsarveṣāṃ prāṇināṃ tvamantastiṣṭhasi| ataśca
svayameva sarvamavaiṣi|| 21||

idānīṃ prasaṅgādbhagavatsvarūpajijñāsayāhuḥ ---

sākṣāddṛṣṭo 'si na punarvidmastvāṃ vayamañjasā|
prasīda kathayātmānaṃ na dhiyāṃ pathi vartase|| 22

citramidaṃ yatsākṣādavalokito 'syatha cāñjasā kārtsnyena tattvato vā tvāṃ vayaṃ na jānīmaḥ| 
ataśca prasādaṃ kuru|
ātmasvarūpaṃ kathaya kiṃrūpo 'sīti| 
svayameva kathaṃ na vicārayathetyāha---na dhiyāṃ pathi vartase| 
yaśca buddheraviṣayaḥ sa svayaṃ kathamavagamyatām|| 22||

kathayātmānamiti sāmānyenoktvā viśeṣeṇāhus---

kiṃ yena sṛjasi vyaktamuta yena bibharṣi tat|
āho yastasya saṃhartā bhāgaḥ katama eṣa te|| 23||

ayaṃ tava pratyakṣadṛśyo bhāgaḥ katamaḥ| 
kiṃ yena brahmādistambāntaṃ jagatsṛjasi sa brahmā uta yena tadbibharṣi pālayasi sa viṣṇurāho yastasya vyaktasya saṃhartā grasitā sa rudra iti| 
bhāgaḥ katama eṣa te| rudratve 'vagate 'pi kaḥ saṃśayasyāvasara iti cedbahurūpatvameva|| 23||

athavā sumahatyeṣā prārthanā deva tiṣṭhatu|
cintitopagatāṃstāvacchādhi naḥ karavāma kim|| 24||

athavaiṣābhyarthanā guhyārthaprakāśanādatimahatī bhagavannāstām|
dhyātānsataḥ prāptānasmānājñāpaya kiṃ karavāma sādhayāmeti| prārthane loṭ|| 24||

atha mauligatasyendorviśadairdaśanāṃśubhiḥ|
upacinvanprabhāṃ tanvīṃ pratyāha parameśvaraḥ|| 25||

tato devaḥ pratyāha pratīpamalapat| kiṃ kurvan| 
śiraḥsthasya śaśino 'lpīyasīṃ jyotsnāṃ nirmalairdantamayūkhairupacinvan|
āheti bhūte ṇalantabhramātprayogaḥ pramādajaḥ|| 25||

kanyāmārgaṇacodanādaśāntatāśaṅkānivāraṇāyāha---

viditaṃ vo yathā svārthā na me kāścitpravṛttayaḥ|
nanu mūrtibhiraṣṭābhiritthaṃbhūto 'smi sūcitaḥ|| 26||

bhavatāmavagatamevaitadyathā mama yāḥ kāścana pravṛttayo ye kecidvyāpārāste na svārthā api tu parārthāḥ|
yataḥ kṣitisalilapavanahutāśanayajamānākāśasomasūryākhyābhiraṣṭābhistanubhirevaṃvidhaḥ parārthonmukhaḥ kathita evāham|
pṛthivyādīnāṃ hi vyāpārāḥ parārthā eva| 
vo viditamiti ktasya ca vartamāne
iti ṣaṣṭhī|| 26||

so 'haṃ tṛṣṇāturairvṛṣṭiṃ vidyutvāniva cātakaiḥ|
ariviprakṛtairdevaiḥ prasūtiṃ prati yācitaḥ|| 27||

sa parārthavṛttirahaṃ sapatnaparibhūtairgīrvāṇaiḥ prasūtiṃ putraṃ prati yācito 'rthito bhagavannapatyamumāyāmutpādaya yo 'smākaṃ jayāya senānīrbhaviṣyatīti| 
yathā tṛṣṇāturaiḥ pipāsubhiścātakairmayūraviśeṣairvidyutvānmegho vṛṣṭiṃ yācyate yācita ityapradhānakarmaṇorniṣṭhayoktatvātpradhānayoḥ prasūtivṛṣṭyordvitīyā bhavatyeva| 
vidyuto vidyante yasyāsau vidyutvān| tasai matvarthe
iti bhatvātpadatvābhāve jaśtvābhāvaḥ|| 27|| 

ata āhartumicchāmi pārvatīmātmajanmane|
utpattaye havirbhokturyajamāna ivāraṇim|| 28||

yato 'haṃ putraṃ yācitastatkāraṇādātmajanmane putrotpattaye gaurīmāhartumānetumicchāmi| 
yathāgnerāvirbhāvāya dīkṣito 'raṇiṃ dāravīmājihīrṣati|| 28|| 

tāmasmadarthaṃ yuṣmābhiryācitavyo himālayaḥ|
vikriyāyai na kalpante sambandhāḥ sadanuṣṭhitāḥ|| 29||

atastāṃ pārvatīṃ madarthaṃ bhavadbhirnageśo 'rthayitavyaḥ|
yasyāyaṃ vyāpārastanmukhena kathaṃ na mṛgyata ityāha|
sadanuṣṭhitāḥ sādhubhirniścitāḥ sambandhā vikṛtiṃ na yānti sthirā bhavanti|| 29||

sarveśvaraḥ sankathamasamena sambandhaṃ kuruta ityāha---

unnatena sthitimatā dhuramudvahatā bhuvaḥ|
tena yojitasambandhaṃ vitta māmapyavañcitam|| 30||

tenādrirājena kṛtasambandhaṃ māmapyavañcitaṃ kṛtārthaṃ vitta jānīta| 
yathā mayā jāmātrā sa ślāghyate tathāhamapi tena śvaśureṇetyapiśabdārthaḥ| 
tathā hi rūpadvayenāsāvutkṛṣṭaḥ| 
tatra sthāvarapakṣe tāvattenonnatena vyomaspṛśā sthitimatā sthireṇa bhuvo dhuraṃ bhāraṃ bibhratā| 
mahīdharatvādadrīṇām|
jaṅgamapakṣe 'pyunnatena mahāprabhāvena sthitimatā samaryādena bhuvo dhuraṃ yogakṣemamudvahatā| 
parvatarājatvāt| vitteti viderloṭ|| 30||

evaṃ vācyaḥ sa kanyārthamiti vo nopadiśyate|
bhavatpraṇītamācāramāmananti hi sādhavaḥ|| 31||

varaguṇānuddiśya kanyārthamitthaṃ tatpiturvaktavyamiti bhavatāṃ nocyate|
yasmādvipaścito yuṣmannirmitamācāraṃ vyavahāramāhuḥ|
amṛtikartāro hi yūyam|| 31||

āryāpyarundhatī tatra vyāpāraṃ kartumarhati|
prāyeṇaivaṃvidhe karye purandhrīṇāṃ pragalbhatā|| 32||

tatra himavadgṛhe tatrabhavatyarundhatyapi vyāpāraṃ sāhāyakaṃ vidhātumarhati| 
yasmādevaṃvidhe kārye vadhūmārgaṇakṛtye prāyeṇa purandhrīṇāṃ cāturyam|
etā hyanicchantamapi kanyāpitaraṃ prerayituṃ jānanti|| 32||

tatprayātauṣadhiprasthaṃ siddhaye himavatpuram|
mahākośe prapāte 'sminsaṃgamaḥ punareva naḥ|| 33||

tattasmātkāraṇātsādhanāyauṣadhiprasthākhyaṃ himavatpuraṃ prayāta vrajata|
punaścāsmākaṃ kāryasiddhinivedanāyāsminmahākośākhye prapāte bhṛgau samāgamaḥ|
atrāhaṃ bhavatāṃ pratipālayāmītyarthaḥ|| 33||

tasminsaṃyamināmādye jāte pariṇayotsuke|
jahuḥ parigrahavrīḍāṃ prājāpatyāstapasvinaḥ|| 34||

tatastasminbhagavati saṃyamināmādye vivāhābhimukhe sampanne sati prājāpatyā brahmatanayā munayaḥ parigrahavrīḍāṃ vivāhalajjāṃ jahuratyajan|
te hi nityabrahmacāriṇaḥ śambhoragre sadaiva lajjitā āsan|
anubhūtastrīsaṃgamānāmasmākaṃ kīdṛśī tapasviteti| 
tadā tu tasminnapi rāgiṇi jāte sarveṣāṃ sāmyādapatrapātyāgaḥ||
34||

tataḥ paramamityuktvā pratasthe munimaṇḍalam|
bhagavānapi samprāptaḥ prathamoddiṣṭamāspadam|| 35||

anantaraṃ paramamevamastvityabhidhāya saptarṣivalayaṃ jagāma|
devo 'pi mahākośīprapātaṃ saṃcacāra| paramamityabhyupagame|
puṇyāhavacasītyanye|| 35||

ta ākāśamasiśyāmamutpatya paramarṣayaḥ|
āseduroṣadhiprasthaṃ manasā saha mānasāḥ|| 36||

manasā nirmitā mānasāste saptarṣayaḥ khaḍganīlaṃ khamudgamyauṣadhiprasthaṃ puramāseduḥ prāpuḥ|
manasā saha mana iveti cāturyoktiḥ| 
yadaiva gamanāya manaḥ kṛtaṃ tadaiva prāpurityarthaḥ|| 36||

idānīmoṣadhiprasthavarṇanamāha---


alakāmativāhyeva vasatiṃ vasusampadām|
svargābhiṣyandavamanaṃ kṛtveva viniveśitam|| 37||

kīdṛśaṃ puram|
vasusampadāṃ ratnavṛddhīnāṃ vasatimāśrayabhūtāmalakāṃ dhanadapurīmativāhyeva niṣpīḍyeva luṇṭhayitveva nirmitam| 
tathā svargasyābhiṣyandavamanaṃ sāroccayaṃ vidhāyeva racitam|
sarvotkṛṣṭayoralakāmarāvatyoḥ sāramādāyeva kṛtamityarthaḥ| 
evaṃ hyuktam---bhūtapūrvamabhūtapūrvaṃ vā paradeśāpavāhanena| svadeśābhiṣyandavamanena ca nagaraṃ viniveśayediti|| 37||

gaṅgāsrotaḥparikṣiptaṃ vaprāntajvalitauṣadhi|
bṛhanmaṇiśilāsālaṃ guptāvapi manoharam|| 38||

anyatra kasmāttanna ramyaṃ guptau guptisthāne 'pi paryantapradeśe 'pi manoharaṃ sevyam| 
tathā hi gaṅgāsrotasā parikṣiptaṃ veṣṭitamiti jalaguptiḥ| 
vaprānte taṭanikaṭe jvalitauṣadhītyagnidurgatvam| 
bṛhanmaṇiśilā eva sālā prākāro yatreti prākāraguptiḥ| 
anyatra tu nagare jalāgniprākāraguptayo bhīṣaṇā asevyā bhavanti|| 38||

jitasiṃhabhayā nāgā yatrāśvā bilayonayaḥ|
yakṣāḥ kiṃpuruṣāḥ paurā yoṣito vanadevatāḥ|| 39||

yatra kariṇo jitasiṃhabhayāḥ kesaribhyo na trasanti aśvāśca bilayonayo vanavivarebhya uttiṣṭhantīti sainyasampattikathanam|
yatra puṇyajanāḥ kiṃnarādaya eva paurā jānapadā vanadevatā eva ca yoṣito 'ṅganāḥ| 
atha kimanyajātīyāḥ paurayoṣito vane tatra na santi| 
kiyatī vaiṣā praśaṃsā| 
evaṃ tarhi kiṃpuruṣāśca pauratulyā vanadevatāśca yoṣinnibhā na tu teṣu tāsu vā kasyacidgauravabuddhiriti paurayoṣitpraśaṃsā|| 39||

śikharāsaktameghānāṃ vyajyante yatra veśmanām|
anugarjitasaṃdigdhāḥ karaṇairmurajasvanāḥ|| 40||

yatra veśmanāṃ murajasvanāḥ karaṇaistālairvyajyante niścīyante na tu svataḥ|
yataḥ śikharāsaktameghānāmuccaśṛṅgāvasthitajaladānām|
ata eva te 'nugarjitenāmbudaravapratiśrutyā saṃdigdhāḥ|
kimetanmeghagarjitaṃ syāduta murajadhvaniriti| 
saṃśaye ca karaṇānāṃ vyañjakatvam| na hi jaladaraveṣu tālasadbhāvaḥ||
40||

yatra kalpadrumaireva vilolaviṭapāṃśukaiḥ|
gṛhayantraptākāśrīrapaurādaranirmitā|| 41||

yatra veśmasu yantrapatākaśrīḥ kṛtakavaijayantīśobhā kalpavṛkṣaireva| 
yantrapatākayā yā śobhā kāryā tāṃ yatra suratarava eva gṛheṣu kurvantītyarthaḥ|
yato vilolaviṭapāṃśukairvilolāni caṭulāni viṭapeṣu prakāṇḍeṣvaṃśukāni yeṣāṃ taiḥ|
patākāyāṃ hyambarairbhāvyam| 
ata evāsau vinaiva paurādareṇa puruṣaprayatnena nirmitā kṛtā|| 41||

yatra sphaṭikaharmyeṣu naktamāpānabhūmiṣu|
jyotiṣāṃ pratibimbāni prāpnuvantyupakāratām|| 42||

yatra sphāṭikeṣu saudheṣvāpānabhūmayaḥ sarakorvyastāsu naktaṃ niśi tārāpratimā evopakāratāṃ puṣpaprakāratāṃ puṣpaprakaratvaṃ yānti|
sitatvena tatsādṛśyāt|| 42||

yatrauṣadhiprakāśena naktaṃ darśitasaṃcarāḥ|
anabhijñāstamisrāṇāṃ durdine 'pyabhisārikāḥ|| 43||

yatra naktaṃ rātrau durdine 'pyasāravarṣe 'pyabhisārikā vilāsinyastamisrāṇāṃ tamasāmanabhijñā ananubhavitryaḥ|
dhvāntabhayaṃ na jānantītyarthaḥ| 
yata oṣadhidhīptyā darśitaḥ saṃcaro mārgo yāsāṃ tāḥ| saṃcarantyasminniti saṃcaro mārgaḥ| 
tama eva tamisram| durdinaṃ varṣam| uktaṃ ca---

yā dūtikāgamanakālamapārayantī soḍhuṃ smarajvarabharārtipipāsiteva|
niryāti vallabhajanādharapānalobhātsā kathyate kavivarairabhisāriketi||
43||

yauvanāntaṃ vayo yasminnātaṅkaḥ kusumāyudhaḥ|
ratikhedasamutthānā nidrā saṃjñāviparyayaḥ|| 44||

anyatra sthavirāntaṃ vayastatra tu yauvanāntamiti jarādyātaṅkābhāvakathanam| 
yatra ca sāyakakṣepānmadana evātaṅka upadravo na tu vyādhyādikṛtaḥ| 
tathā ratikhedātsamutthānamutpattiryasyāḥ sā nidraiva saṃjñāviparyayo niścetanatvaṃ na tu prāṇaviyogaja ityajarāmaratvoktiḥ|| 44||

bhrūbhedibhiḥ sakampauṣṭhairlalitāṅgulitarjanaiḥ|
yatra kopaiḥ kṛtāḥ strīṇāmaprasādārthinaḥ priyāḥ|| 45||

yatra māninīnāṃ krodhairyuvāno 'prasādārthinaḥ kṛtāḥ|
prasādaṃ tāsāṃ nārthayante| kopasyaiva ramyataratvāt| 
tathā hi bhrūbhedhibhirbhrūbhaṅgayutaiḥ sakampauṣṭhaiḥ sphuradadharadalairlalitāni ca ramyāṇyaṅgulitarjanāni yeṣu taiḥ|| 45||

saṃtānakatarucchāyāsuptavidyādharādhvagam|
yasya copavanaṃ bāhyaṃ gandhavadgandhamādanam|| 46||

yasya ca bāhyaṃ laukikamupavanamudyānaṃ gandhamādanākhyo giriḥ|
kīdṛśam|
saṃtānākhyāstaravaḥ suravṛkṣāsteṣāṃ chāyāsu suptā vidyādharā evādhvagā yatra|
bāhyodyānaṃ hi sarvasevyam| gandhavatsurabhi|
gandhamādanaśabdo napuṃsakaliṅgaḥ|| 46||

atha te munayo divyāḥ prekṣya haimavataṃ puram|
svargābhisaṃdhisukṛtaṃ vañcanāmiva menire|| 47||

tataste saptarṣayastādṛśamoṣadhiprasthamālokya
svargamabhisaṃdhāyoddiśya sukṛtaṃ tapo vañcanāmivāvidan|
etatpuramuddiśya kasmādasmābhistapo na cīrṇam| na hi
surapuramato ramyataram|| 47||

te sadmani girervegādudmukhadvāsthavīkṣitāḥ|
avapeturjaṭābhārairlikhitānalaniścalaiḥ|| 48||

tataste munayo himavadgṛhe vedādavapeturavātaran|
tanmukhairdvāsthaiḥ pratīhārairvīkṣitāḥ ka ete syuriti|
likhitānalaniścalaiścitravahniniṣkampairjaṭājūṭairupalakṣitāḥ|
dvā dvāraṃ tatra tiṣṭhatīti dvāsthāstaiḥ|| 48||

gaganādavatīrṇā sā yathāvṛddhapuraḥsarā|
toyāntarbhāskarālīva reje muniparamparā|| 49||

gaganādākāśabhāgādavatīrṇā saptarṣimālā vyadyutat|
jalamadhyapratibimbitā sūryapaṅktiriveti tejasvitvakathanam| ye
ye vṛddhā yathāvṛddhaṃ puraḥsaramagragāmi yasyāḥ sā
yathāvṛddhapuraḥsarā| paramparā paṅktiḥ|| 49||

tānarghyānarghyamādāya dūraṃ pratyudyayau nagaḥ|
namayansāragurubhiḥ pādanyāsairvasundharām|| 50||

argho 'rcā tadarthamudakādyarghyam|
tadgṛhītvādrirājastānmunīndūraṃ pratyudyayāvabhyujjagāma|
yato 'rghyānarcyān| kiṃ kurvan| sāreṇa balena
gurubhirdurvahaiḥ pādanyāsairavanimadhaḥ praveśayan|| 50||

dhātutāmrādharaḥ prāṃśurdevadārubṛhadbhujaḥ|
prakṛtyaiva śiloraskaḥ suvyañjo himavāniti|| 51||

kīdṛśo 'sau| prakṛtyaiva himavāniti suvyañjaḥ sukhena
vyajyate jñāyate| rūpadvayasyāpi sādṛśyāt| īṣadduḥsuṣu
iti khal| tathā hi sthāvare tāvaddhātava eva tāmrādharo yasya
prāṃśurunnato devadārava eva bṛhanto bhujā yasya
śilā eva uro vakṣo yasya| jaṅgame tu
dhātuvattāmrādharaḥ prāṃśurmānonnato devadāruvadbṛhadbhujo dīrghabāhuḥ śilevāślakṣṇaṃ viśālaṃ kaṭhinamuro yasya|
asminnavasare na tathā saprayojano 'yaṃ ślokaḥ|| 51||

vidhiprayuktasatkāraiḥ svayaṃ mārgasya daiśikaḥ|
sa tairākramayāmāsa śuddhāntaṃ śuddhakarmabhiḥ|| 52||

sa tānmunīñchuddhāntamantaḥpuramākramayāmāsa nināya|
vidhinā prayuktaḥ satkāraḥ pūjā yeṣāṃ taiḥ| sa tu mārgasya
svayaṃ daiśika upadeṣṭānena pathāgacchateti|
kramergatyupasarjanaprāptyarthatvādatra na
mukhyaṃ gatyarthatvamiti 
tairiti dvitīyābhāvaḥ|| 52||

tatra vetrāsanāsīnānkṛtāsanaparigrahaḥ|
ityuvāceśvarānvācaḥ prāñjalirjagatīdharaḥ|| 53||

tatra niśānte tānīśvarānvaśino 'drinātha itthaṃ vāco jagādeti
dvikarmako vaciḥ| vāca īśvarānvācaspatīṃstāniti tu kecit|
vetraṃ dāruviśeṣastatkṛteṣvāsaneṣvāsīnānupaviṣṭān|
so 'pi tadājñayā gṛhītaviṣṭaraḥ|
prāñjaliḥ kṛtāñjalibandhaḥ|| 53||

kimuvācetyāha---

apameghodayaṃ varṣamadṛṣṭakusumaṃ phalam|
atarkitopapannaṃ vo darśanaṃ pratibhāti me|| 54||

atarkitamaśaṅkitamupapannaṃ ghaṭitaṃ vo bhavatāmavalokanamanabhravṛṣṭitulyamadṛṣṭakusumaphalanibhaṃ ca
mama pratibhāsata ityasambhavopamāgarbharūpakamalaṃkāraḥ| me
pratibhātīti dṛṣṭisaṃgrahaṇaṃ vikalpārthamiti
dvitīyābhāvaḥ|| 54||

mūrkhaṃ buddhamivātmānaṃ haimībhūtamivāyasam|
bhūmerdivamivārūḍhaṃ manye bhavadanugrahāt|| 55||

bhavadīyāddarśanānugrahādahamīdṛśamātmānamavagacchāmi|
kīdṛśam| mūrkhaṃ santaṃ buddhaṃ paṇḍitamivāyomayaṃ ca
suvarṇīkṛtamiva bhuvaśca svargamudgatamiva|
tattulyaparitoṣāt|| 55||

adyaprabhṛti bhūtānāmabhigamyo 'smi śuddhaye|
yadadhyāsitamarhadbhistaddhi tīrthaṃ pracakṣate|| 56||

ita ārabhya janānāṃ pāpāpanuttaye 'smyahamabhigamyaḥ|
yasmādyadarhadbhirvidvadbhirāsevitaṃ tattīrthamāhuḥ|
bhavadāgamanāddhi tīrthībhūto 'ham|| 56|| 

avaimi pūtamātmānaṃ dvayenaiva dvijottamāḥ|
mūrdhni gaṅgāprapātena dhautapādāmbhasā ca vaḥ|| 57||

he vipravarā ubhayenaivāhaṃ pavitramātmānamavaimi jāne|
kena dvayenetyāha śirasi bhāgīrathīnirjhareṇa bhavatāṃ ca dhautapādāmbhasā kṣālitacaraṇodakena|
yādṛśaṃ hi gāṅgamambhaḥ pavitraṃ tādṛśaṃ bhavatpādodakam|
viprāṇāṃ hi pādau prakṣālya tajjalaṃ śirasi vahedityāptāḥ|| 57||

jaṅgamaṃ praiṣyapakṣe vaḥ sthāvaraṃ caraṇāṅkitam|
vibhaktānugrahaṃ taddhi dvairūpyamapi me kṛtam|| 58||

mama rūpadvayamapi bhavadbhirvibhaktānugrahaṃ bhāgīkṛtaprasādaṃ kṛtam|
tathā hi jaṅgamaṃ bhramanme rūpaṃ vapuḥ praiṣyapakṣe dāsakarmaṇi
sthāvaramapi yuṣmatpādamudrācihnitam| atyarthaṃ gacchatīti
jaṅgamam| nugato 'nunāsikāntarasya|
preṣaṇīyaḥ praiṣyaḥ prādūhoḍhoḍhyeṣaivyeṣu
iti vṛddhiḥ| dve eva rūpe dvairūpyam|| 58||

bhavatsambhāvanotthāya paritoṣāya mūrchate|
api vyāptadigantāni nāṅgāni prabhavanti me|| 59||

bhavatsambhāvanotthāya yuṣmatādarotpannāya mūrchate
vardhamānāya paritoṣāya praharṣāya me 'ṅgāni
vyāptadigantānyapi na prabhavanti na samarthāni| taṃ voḍhuṃ na
śaknuvantītyarthaḥ| iti paritoṣasya bāhulyakathanam|
paritoṣāya na prabhavantītyalamarthatvāccaturthī|| 
59||

na kevalaṃ darīsaṃsthaṃ bhāsvatā darśanena vaḥ|
antargatamapāstaṃ me rajaso 'pi paraṃ tamaḥ|| 60||

bhavatāṃ bhāsvatā dīptimatā darśanena na
kevalaṃ guhāgataṃ tamo mama
nuttaṃ yāvadantargataṃ hṛtsthaṃ rajoguṇādapi
paraṃ mohākhyamapāstam| bhavadālokanena
hyahaṃ nirmohaḥ saṃvṛttaḥ|| 60||

idānīmāgamanaprayojanaṃ bhaṅgyantareṇa pipṛcchiṣurāha---

kartavyaṃ vo na paśyāmi syāccetkiṃ nopapadyate|
śaṅke matpāvanāyaiva prasthānaṃ bhavatāmidam|| 61||

asmatsakāśe tapasvitvādbhavatāṃ prayojanaṃ nekṣe| atha
cetsambhavetkiṃ mahāprabhāvatvātsvata eva na ghaṭate|
tajjāne matpavitrīkaraṇāyaiva yuṣmākamidamāgamanam|| 61||

tathāpi tāvatkasmiṃcidājñāṃ me dātumarhatha|
viniyogaprasādā hi kiṃkarāḥ prabhaviṣṇuṣu|| 62||

yadyapi vaḥ svayameva sarvaṃ sampadyate tathāpi kutrāpi kārye
mahyamādeśaṃ dadadhvam| yasmādye kiṃkarā bhṛtyāste
prabhaviṣṇuṣu viniyogaprasādāḥ| svāmyājñaiva
teṣāmanugrahaḥ| prabhaviṣṇuṣu sthito viniyoga iti
saptamyatra vācakīkāryā|| 62||

ete vayamamī dārāḥ kanyeyaṃ kulajīvitam|
brūta yenātra vaḥ kṛtyamanāsthā bāhyavastuṣu|| 63||

kiṃ bahunā raṭitena| ime vayam| dārā apyete|
kulajīvitanibheyamapi kanyā| kathayatāto madhyādyena
bhavatāṃ prayojanam| bhūhiraṇyādikaṃ kimiti
gopitamityāha---yasmādbahiraṅgeṣu bhūhiraṇyādiṣu
vastuṣvanāsthānādaraḥ| ātmaputrakalatrāṇyapi yo dadāti tasya dhane ka iva bahumānaḥ|| 63||

ityūcivāṃstamevārthaṃ darīmukhavisarpiṇā|
dvireva pratiśabdena vyājahāra himālayaḥ|| 64||

itthamuktavānnaganāthaḥ kandarāvivaraprasāriṇā pratidhvaninā
tamevārthaṃ niścayārthaṃ punarabhāṣateva|| 64||

athāṅgirasamagraṇyamudāharaṇavastuṣu|
ṛṣayaścodayāmāsuḥ pratyuvāca sa bhūdharam|| 65||

tato munayo 'ṅgirasamṛṣimacūcudan| yata udāharaṇavastuṣu
kathanīyaprakāreṣvagraṇyaṃ pravīṇam| sa
cāṅgirā nagādhipamagadat| udāhriyate
kathyata ityudāharaṇaṃ tacca tadvastūdāharaṇavastu|| 65||

kimabravīdityāha---

upapannamidaṃ sarvamataḥ paramapi tvayi|
manasaḥ śikharāṇāṃ ca sadṛśī te samunnatiḥ|| 66||

ete vayamityādi yattvayoktametadakhilamato vā paramapyadhikamapi
tvayyupapannaṃ sughaṭam| yataḥ śikharāṇīva tava
mano 'pyunnatamudāram| mahāśayasya hi kimiva duṣkaram|| 66||

sthāne tvāṃ sthāvarātmānaṃ viṣṇumāhustathā hi te|
carācarāṇāṃ bhūtānāṃ kukṣirādharatāṃ gataḥ|| 67||

vyāsādayo bhavantaṃ sthāvarātmānaṃ viṣṇuṃ sthāne viṣaye
yuktaṃ vā vadanti| yadāhuḥ sthāvarāṇāṃ himālaya iti|
yatastava
kukṣirudaraṃ carācarāṇāṃ bhūtānāmādhārataṃ gataḥ| sarve
hi sattvāḥ sthāvarāśca jaṅgamāśca tvanmadhye nivasanti|
viṣṇurapi hi jagannivāsa iti supratītam|| 67||

gāmadhāsyatkathaṃ nāgo mṛṇālasadṛśaiḥ phaṇaiḥ|
ā rasātalamūlāttvamavālambiṣyathā na cet|| 68||

nāgaḥ śeṣāhirbisasukumāraiḥ śirobhirgāṃ bhuvaṃ kathamadhāsyatkathaṃ bibhṛyādyadi
pātālaparyantaṃ tvamenāṃ nāvalambiṣyathā nāgrahīṣyaḥ|
bhavatsāhāyakena hi śeṣo 'vanimudvoḍhumudyacchata ityarthaḥ|
adhāsyaditi kriyātipattyabhavāllṛṅprayogaścintyaḥ|| 68||

acchinnāmalasaṃtānāḥ samudrormyanivāritāḥ|
punanti lokaṃ puṇyatvātkīrtayaḥ saritaśca te|| 69||

tvadīyāḥ kīrtayaḥ saritaśca puṇyatvāllokaṃ punanti pāvayanti|
kīdṛśyaḥ|
acchinno 'truṭito 'malaḥ śubhraḥ santānaḥ prabandhaḥ pravāhaśca yāsām| abdhikallolaiśca niṣiddhaprasarā ubhaye 'pi|| 69||

yathaiva ślāghyate gaṅgā pādena parameṣṭhinaḥ|
prabhaveṇa dvitīyena tathaivocchirasā tvayā|| 70||

parameṣṭhino viṣṇoḥ pādena prabhaveṇa janakena
surasaridyathaiva ślāghyate tathaivonnatakandhareṇa
bhavatāpi| himavato hi viṣṇupadī prabhavati| haricaraṇāttu
bhuvanatrayākramaṇakāle nryātetyāgamaḥ|| 70||

tiryagūrdhvamadhastācca vyāpako mahimā hareḥ|
trivikramodyatasyāsītsa tu svābhāvikastava|| 71||

harerviṣṇoḥ sarvavyāpī yo mahimābhūtsa trivikrame
bhuvanatrayākramaṇa udyatasya sato na tu nityam| tava tvasau
vyāpī mahimā svābhāvikaḥ sahajaḥ śāśvatika iti
viśeṣakathanam|
trayo vikramāḥ pādanyāsāḥ samāhṛtāstrivikramam|| 71||

yajñabhāgabhujāṃ madhye padamātasthuṣā tvayā|
uccairhiraṇmayaṃ śṛṅgaṃ sumerorvitathīkṛtam|| 72||

yajñabhāgabhujāṃ devānāṃ madhye yajñāṃśabhājitvena tvayā padamavasthānamātasthuṣā kṛtavatāmaraśikhariṇaḥ|
sauvarṇamapyuccamapi ca śikharaṃ vitathīkṛtaṃ niṣphalaṃ vihitamasatyaṃ sampāditam| 
na hyasau yajñāṃśabhāk| ataḥ sauvarṇṇenāpi kiṃ tena kriyate||
72||

kāṭhinyaṃ sthāvare kāye bhavatā sarvamarpitam|
idaṃ tu te bhaktinamramarhadārādhanaṃ vapuḥ|| 73||

mṛdukarkaśabhedena tava dvairūpyam| tatra sthāvare dehe śilāmaye
tvayākhilaṃ kāṭhinyaṃ vihitam| idaṃ tu jaṅgamaṃ tava
mṛdutvādbhaktyā namraṃ peśalam|
ata evārhatāṃ pūjyānāmārādhanaṃ sevanam| na tvatra
stabdhatā| 73||

tadāgamanakāryaṃ naḥ śṛṇu kāryaṃ tavaiva tat|
śreyasāmupadeśāttu vayamapyaṃśabhāginaḥ|| 74||

tadityupasaṃhāre| alaṃ te mahimasaṃkīrtanena|
asmākaṃ tāvadāgamanakāryamākarṇaya| 
kāryaṃ tu tvatprārthanīyatvāttavaiva| na tu naḥ| 
kiṃ tu śreyaso mārganirūpaṇādvayamapyaṃśabhāginaḥ śubhaphalāsādinaḥ|
tenāsmākamapi kāryamityarthaḥ|| 74||

aṇimādiguṇotthānamaspṛṣṭapuruṣāntaram|
śabdamīśvara ityuccaiḥ sārdhacandraṃ bibharti yaḥ|| 75||

kalpitānyonyasāmarthyaiḥ pṛthivyādibhirātmabhiḥ|
yasyedaṃ tanyate vyaktaṃ dhuryairyānamivādhvani|| 76||

yogino ye vicinvanti kṣetrābhyantaravartinam|
anāvṛttibhayaṃ yasya padamāhurmanīṣiṇaḥ|| 77||

sa te duhitaraṃ sākṣātsākṣī viśvasya karmaṇaḥ|
vṛṇute varadaḥ śambhurasmatsaṃkramitaiḥ padaiḥ|| 78||

sa tava varadaḥ śambhurasmatsaṃkramitairasmāsu
nihitaiḥ padairvacobhiḥ sākṣātsutāṃ vṛṇute prārthayate|
ko 'sāvityāha| ya evaṃvidhamīśvara iti
śabdamuccairvyāpakaṃ sārdhacandraṃ bibharti| śaśikhaṇḍamapi
vahatītyarthaḥ| kīdṛśaṃ śabdam|
aṇimāmahimāladhimāprāptiprākāmyeśitvavaśitvānāṃ guṇānāmutthānaṃ prabhavam|
aṇimādiguṇayukto hīśvara ityucyate|
uttiṣṭhantyasmādityutthānam|
tathāsaṃspṛṣṭamaviṣayīkṛtaṃ puruṣāntaramanyaḥ puruṣa ātmā yena| 
puruṣaviśeṣo hīśvaraḥ| 
uccairunnato vā mahāprabhāvaḥ| 
yasya sambandhibhiḥ pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśairātmabhirmūrtibhiridaṃ vyaktaṃ brahmaṇḍaṃ tanyate
prasāryate sampādyate| dhuryairaśvairmārge yānaṃ ratha iha|
kīdṛśaistaiḥ|
kalpitaṃ samarpitamanyonyaṃ sāmarthyaṃ śaktyādhāro yaiḥ|
dhṛtisaṃgrahapaktivyūhāvakāśavṛttibhiḥ parasparāhitaśaktibhiḥ kila te bhuvanāni nirmātuṃ prabhavanti|
dhuryā apyanyonyaṃ śaktimupajīvanto yānaṃ tantrayanti|
yaṃ devamadhyātmavidaḥ kṣetrābhyantaravartinaṃ śarīrāntarasthaṃ paramātmākhyaṃ vicinvanti
gaveṣayanti| yadīyaṃ ca padamanāvṛttibhayamāhuḥ|
avidyamānamāvṛttibhayaṃ saṃsaraṇatrāso yatra| na hi
tatsthānamāsādya punarjāyate| tathā viśvasya
jagataḥ karmaṇāṃ śubhāśubhānāṃ sākṣī draṣṭā
hṛtsthatvāt| varado 'bhīṣṭārthadātā|
sa evaṃvidho maheśvaraḥ sākṣādātmārthaṃ tava
duhitaramumāmarthayate| kalāpakametat|| 75--78||

tamarthamiva bhāratyā sutayā yoktumarhasi|
aśocyā hi pituḥ kanyā sadbhartre pratipāditā|| 79||

atastaṃ śambhuṃ tvaṃ duhitrā yoktuṃ ghaṭayitumarhasi| 
arthamiva bhāratyā| 
vāgarthau hi nityasambandhāvanyonyāvyabhicārāt|
taddānena ca tavaiva guṇaḥ| 
yasmātsadbhartre sādhave patye nisṛṣṭā kumārī pituraśocyā bhavati|| 79||

guṇāntaramapyāha---

yāvaddvayāni bhūtāni sthāvarāṇi carāṇi ca|
mātaraṃ kalpayantvenāmīśo hi jagataḥ pitā|| 80||

tvamasmai sutāṃ dehi yāvadenāṃ gaurīṃ dvayāni bhūtāni
carācarāṇi mātaraṃ kalpayantu| taddānena kathamasau
jagajjanitrī sampadyata ityāha---yasmādīśo mahādevo jagatāṃ pitā
sraṣṭṛtvādyogakṣemodvahanācca| pituśca yā bhāryā sā
mātocyate|| 80||

praṇmaya śitikaṇṭhāya vibudhāstadanantaram|
caraṇau rañjayantvasyāścūḍāmaṇimarīcibhiḥ|| 81||

api ca devyā āhnikaprakriyayā nīlagalaṃ praṇamya
tadanvasyā api gauryāḥ śiroratnaraśmibhiḥ pādau rañjayantu
citrayantu| praṇamya śitikaṇṭhāyeti
upapadavibhakteḥ kārakavibhaktirbalīyasī
iti dvitīyā nyāyyā svayambhuve namaskṛtyetyādiprayogadarśanāccaturthīprayogaḥ|| 81||

umā vadhūrbhavān dātā yācitāra ime vayam|
varaḥ śambhuralaṃ hyeṣa tvatkulodbhūtaye vidhiḥ|| 82||

tava vaṃśasyodbhūtaye 'bhyudayāya vidhirayamalaṃ paryāptaḥ|
ko 'sāvityāha---umā vadhūrgaurī dīyate tvaṃ dātā varo maheśvaro yācitāro vayamiti| 
anudghāṭitā api guṇā dhvanipadatvātpratīyante| 
yathā rāmo 'smi sarvaṃ saha iti|| 82||

astotuḥ stūyamānasya vandyasyānanyavandinaḥ|
sutāsambandhavidhinā bhava viśvagurorguruḥ|| 83||

gaurīṃ dattvā jagavibhorapi śambhorgururbhavātisampūjyaḥ sampadyasva|
śvaśuro hi pitṛnibhaḥ| kīdṛśasya| sarvotkṛṣṭatvātstūyamānasya
vandyasya ca|
kāṃścitso 'pyanyānstuyātpraṇameccetyāha---astoturavandituḥ|
tata utkṛṣṭatarasyābhāvāt|| 83||

evaṃvādini devarṣau pārśve pituradhomukhī|
līlākamalapatrāṇi gaṇayāmāsa pārvatī|| 84||

itthaṃ bruvāṇe 'ṅgirasi himavannikaṭe gaurī trapāvanatā līlākamalapatrāṇi vilāsanalinapalāśānyajīgaṇaditi lajjāvinihnavenābhilāṣātiśayasūcanam|| 84||

śailaḥ sampūrṇakāmo 'pi menāmukhamavaikṣata|
prāyeṇa gṛhiṇīnetrāḥ kanyārthe hi kuṭumbinaḥ|| 85||

himavānapi sampūrṇamanorathaḥ kimatra vaktavyamiti
patnīvaktramāluloke| yasmādye kuṭumbino gṛhasthāste
kanyāprayojane prāyeṇa gṛhiṇīnetrā bhāryācakṣuṣaḥ| tasyai
yadrocate tatte kurvantītyarthaḥ|| 85||

idamatrottaraṃ nyāyyamiti buddhyā vicārya saḥ|
ādade vacasāmante maṅgalālaṃkṛtāṃ sutām|| 86||

tataḥ kanyādānamevātrottaraṃ nyāyyaṃ na tvanyadityasau dhiyā niścitya prakṛtārthopayogi kiṃciduktvā vacanānte maṅgalābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ tanayāmagrahīt|| 86||

ehi śarvārpaṇā vatse bhikṣā tvaṃ parikalpitā|
arthino munayaḥ prāptaṃ gṛhamedhiphalaṃ mayā|| 87||

etāvaduktvā tanayāṃ munīnāha mahīdharaḥ|
iyaṃ namati vaḥ sarvāṃstrilocanavadhūriti|| 88||

he putri āgaccha śarvārpaṇā harārthaṃ bhikṣā tvaṃ mayā parikalpitā| 
mārgakāśca saptarṣayaḥ| 
ataśca gṛhasthaphalaṃ mayādya prāptam| 
gṛhamedhinā hi guṇavate kanyā deyā| 
itthamumāmabhidhāya saptarṣīnavādīt| 
iyaṃ śarvapatnī yuṣmānakhilānpraṇamatīti dānaṃ dhvanitam|
arpyate 'smā ityarpaṇaḥ| kṛtyalyuṭo bahulam|
śarvo 'rpaṇo yasyāḥ sā śarvārpaṇā| 
gṛhaṃ veśma dārāśca tairmedhante saṃgacchanta iti gṛhamedhino gṛhasthāḥ|
arthayanta ityarthinaḥ|| 87--88||

īpsitārthakriyodāraṃ te 'bhinandya girervacaḥ|
āśīrbhiredhayāmasuḥ puraḥpākābhirambikām|| 89||

tataste munayo 'bhilaṣitasampattimahārthaṃ himavadvacanamabhinandyāmodya tāmambikāṃ gaurīmāśīrbhiredhayāmāsuravīvṛdhan|
kīdṛśībhiḥ| 
puro 'gre pākaḥ phalaṃ bhartṛvāllabhyalakṣaṇaṃ yāsāṃ tābhiḥ puraḥpākābhirnikaṭābhyudayābhiḥ||
89||

tāṃ praṇāmādarasrastajāmbūnadavataṃsakām|
aṅkamāropayāmāsa lajjamānāmarundhatī|| 90||

bhartṛvārtayā lajjitāmambikāṃ vasiṣṭhapatnī utsaṅge jagrāha| 
praṇāmādareṇa pādavandanaprayatnena srastaḥ patito jāmbūnadavataṃsakaḥ kanakakarṇapūro yasyāstām||
90||

tanmātaraṃ cāsrumukhīṃ duhitṛsnehaviklavām|
varasyānanyapūrvasya viśokāmakarodguṇaiḥ|| 91||

tathā sutāsnehakātarāṃ rudantīṃ menāmasāvananyapūrvasyākṛtadārāntarasya jāmāturguṇairvigataduḥkhāmakṛta|
sarveśvaraḥ sarvaśaktirbhaktavatsalaste jāmātā sampannastatra praharṣasthāne kaḥ śokasyāvasara iti| 
avidyamānānyā yasyāsāvananyaḥ pūrvamananyo 'nanyapūrva iti sapatnīśaṅkāpanodanaparaṃ vacanam| 
supsupā
iti samāsaḥ|| 91||

vaivāhikīṃ tithiṃ pṛṣṭāstatkṣaṇaṃ harabandhunā|
te tryahādūrdhvamākhyāya celuścīraparigrahāḥ|| 92||

tataste munayaścelurgamanāyottasthuḥ| kīdṛśāḥ|
tatkṣaṇameva harabandhunā śaṃkaraśvaśureṇa
vaivāhikīṃ tithiṃ pṛṣṭāḥ kadā vivāho 'stviti| te 'pi
tryahādūrdhvaṃ paramahanyuktvā celuḥ| cīraṃ valkalameva
parigraho dhanaṃ yeṣāmityaspṛhatvakathanam| prāyeṇa hi
kanyāmelakāḥ saspṛhāḥ| vivāhaḥ prayojanaṃ yasyāḥ sā
vaivāhikī|| 92||

te himālayamāmantrya puraḥ prekṣya ca śūlinam|
siddhaṃ cāsmai nivedyārthaṃ tadvisṛṣṭāḥ khamudyayuḥ|| 93||

te munayo 'drināthamāmantrya jyokkṛtya bhavaṃ ca dadṛśire| 
gaurīlābhaṃ ca tasmai kathayitvā tena visarjitāḥ khamudyayurdivamagamanniti lāghavena kathopasaṃhāraḥ|| 93||

paśupatirapi tānyahāni kṛcchrādagamayadadrisutāsamāgamotkaḥ|
kamaparamavaśaṃ na viprakuryurvibhumapi taṃ yadamī spṛśanti bhāvāḥ|| 94||

munayaḥ svakaṃ sthānaṃ gatāḥ| bhagavānapi
pārvatīsaṃgamasamutkaṇṭhitastāni trīṇi dināni
kleśenāgamayadatyavāhayat| arthāntaranyāsaḥ| yatra
taṃ bhagavantaṃ vibhumapi vaśitāramapyamī
bhāvā utkaṣṭhāsnehādayaḥ spṛśantyākrāmanti
tatrānyamavaśamajitendriyaṃ kaṃ te na viprakuryurna bādheran|
puṣpitāgrā vṛttam|| 94||

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumāsambhavaṭīkāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhaḥ sargaḥ|

 saptamaḥ sargaḥ|

athauṣadhīnāmadhipasya vṛddhau tithau ca jāmitraguṇānvitāyām|
sametabandhurhimavānsutāyā vivāhadīkṣāvidhimanvatiṣṭhat|| 1||

athānantaraṃ naganātho duhiturvivāhadīkṣāvidhiṃ godānādikaṃ vratakaraṇamanvatiṣṭhatsamapādayat|
kadā| oṣadhīnāmadhipasya śaśino vṛddhau śuklapakṣe tithau jāmitraguṇenānvitāyāṃ praśastāyām|
jāmitraśabdo 'traupacārikaḥ praśasyatāṃ lakṣayati|
mukhyato hi lagnātsaptamaṃ sthānaṃ jāmitram| tacca
jāmitramanukūlam|
sametabandhuḥ saṃghaṭitasvajana ityutsavadharmaḥ|| 1||

vaivāhikaiḥ kautukasaṃvidhānairgṛhe gṛhe vyagrapurandhrivargam|
āsītpuraṃ sānumato 'nurāgādantaḥpuraṃ caikakulopameyam|| 2||

sānumato himavataḥ puramantaḥpuraṃ caikakulopameyamabhinnavaṃśasadṛśamabhūt|
samastaṃ nagaraṃ tanniśāntasthajananibhamajñāyatetyarthaḥ|
yato 'nurāgātprītyā
vivāhabhavaiḥ kautukasaṃvidhānairmaṅgalaprakāraiḥ prativeśma
vyagrā asakṣaṇāḥ purandhrivargā aṅganāpūgā yatra pure|
yanmaṅgalārthaṃ sudhālepanādi kriyate tatkautukam|| 2||

saṃtānakākīrṇamahāpathaṃ taccīnāṃśukaiḥ kalpitaketumālam|
bhāsā jvalatkāñcanatoraṇānāṃ sthānāntaraṃ svarga ivābabhāse|| 3||

sthānāntarapradeśasvargavadreje|
yataḥ santānakākhyairdivyakusumairākīrṇo nirbharo mahāpatho rājamārgo yatra|
cīnāṃśukaiścīnadeśabhavairambaraiḥ kalpitā racitā ketumālā dhvajarājiryatra| 
kāñcanatoraṇānāṃ ca bhāsā dīptyā jvaladbhāsamānam| 
anyatsthānaṃ sthānāntaram|| 3||

ekaiva satyāmapi putrapaṅktau cireṇa dṛṣṭeva mṛtotthiteva|
upoḍhapāṇigrahaṇetipitrorumā viśeṣocchvasitaṃ babhūva|| 4||

upoḍhapāṇigrahaṇā nikaṭavivāhetyato hetorgaurī pitroḥ satsvapi bahuṣvapatyeṣu snehavaśādekevābhūt|
anyatra tādṛśasya snehasyābhāvāt| tathā satatasaṃnihitāpi
cireṇa dṛṣṭevotkaṇṭhotpatteḥ| jīvantyapi
mṛtotthiteva| tathā
viśeṣocchvasitaṃ sātiśayajīvitaṃ tadāyattatvājjīvitasya|
virahasamaye ghanatarasnehāvirbhāvāditthamūhaḥ| yaduktam---

autsukyagarbhā bhramatīva dṛṣṭiḥ paryākulā kvāpi matiḥ prayāti|
niratyayapremanibandhanaṃ ca viyogakāle trasatīva cetaḥ|| 

|| 4||

aṅkādyayāvaṅkamudīritāśīḥ sā maṇḍanānmaṇḍanamanvabhuṅkta|
sambandhabhinno 'pi gireḥ kulasya snehastadekayānatāṃ jagāma|| 5||

sā devī bāndhavairuktāśīḥ satyutsaṅgādutsaṅgāntaramadhitasthau|
ekena cālaṃkāreṇa kṛte tadeva
cānyānītaṃ prasādhanāntaraṃ nirviveśa| tathā gireḥ kulasya
snehaḥ sambandhavaśādbhinno 'pyanekarūpo 'pi
tadekāyanatāṃ tadekāśrayatvamayāsīt| sambandhabhedāddhi
sneho bahuprabhedaḥ| tadyathā putre 'nyādṛśo naptari duhitari
dauhitre snuṣāyāṃ sakhyāṃ cānyādṛśa eva| na sāsti
prītiryā tasyāṃ bandhujanasya na pravṛtteti vākyārthaḥ|
atra copoḍhapāṇigrahaṇatvameva kāraṇam|
saivaikāyanaṃ sthānaṃ yasya sa tadekāyanastadbhāvastadekāyanatā|| 5||

maitre muhūrte śaśalakṣmaṇena yogaṃ gatāsūttaraphalgunīṣu|
tasyāḥ śarīre pratikarma cakrurbandhustriyo yāḥ patiputravatyaḥ|| 6||

tasyāḥ pārvatyā vapuṣyavidhavā avandhyāśca jñātimahiṣyaḥ pratikarma prasādhanaṃ kṛtavatyaḥ| kadā|
candramasottaraphalgunīṣu yogaṃ sambandhaṃ gatāsu|
uttaraphalgunīnakṣatra ityarthaḥ| śaśinā hi  yoge
tārakāṇāṃ nakṣatratvam| muhūrte maitradaivatye|| 6||

tadevābhyaṅgādārabhya śarīrapratikarmāha---

sā gaurasiddhārthaniveśavadbhirdūrvāpravālaiḥ pratibhinnarāgam|
nirnābhikauśeyamupoḍhabāṇamabhyaṅganepathyamalaṃcakāra|| 7||

abhyaṅgastailapātanam| 
tatra nepathyaṃ veśaṃ sā devyalaṃcakāra| 
na tu tena sā bhūṣitetyakṛtrimarūpatvoktiḥ| kīdṛśam|
gaurdasiddhārthānāṃ sitasarṣapāṇāṃ niveśo racanā vidyate
yatra
tairdūrvāpravālaiḥ śādvalāṅkuraiḥ pratibhinnarāgaṃ viśeṣitakānti|
avidyamānaṃ nābhikauśeyaṃ jaghanāmbaraṃ yatra| tadā hi
tadapāsyate| yadi vā nābherniṣkrāntaṃ nirnābhi
viyuktaṃ calitaṃ kauśeyaṃ kaghanāmbaraṃ yatra|
upoḍhabāṇaṃ dhṛtasāyakam| evaṃvidho hyeṣa lokācāraḥ|| 7||

babhau ca samparkamupetya bālā navena dīkṣāvidhisāyakena|
kareṇa bhānorbahulāvasāne saṃdhukṣyamāṇeva śaśāṅkalekhā|| 8||

tena ca nūtanena vivāhadīkṣāvidhisāyakena saṃśleṣamāsādya
vadhūḥ śuśubhe| keva| kṛṣṇapakṣāntare raviraśminā
suṣumṇākhyena saṃdhukṣyamāṇā vardhyamānā candrakaleva||
8||

tāṃ rodhrakalkena hṛtāṅgatailāmāśyānakālīyarasāṅgarāgām|
vāso vasānāmabhiṣekayogyaṃ nāryāścatuṣkābhimukhīmanaiṣuḥ|| 9||

tataḥ snānārthamavidhavāstāṃ catuṣkamukhīmanayan|
kīdṛśīm| 
rodhrarajaḥkalkena rūkṣeṇa hṛtāṅgatailāmapāstadehasnehām|
tathāśyānaḥ paridhānaḥ kālīyarasa evānulepanaṃ yasyāḥ|
kuṅkumanibhaṃ gandhadravyaṃ kālīyam| tacca snehagandhāpāsanāya
pātyate|
tathābhiṣekayogyaṃ snānānurūpamapaṭṭakṛtamāmbaraṃ vasānāṃ paridadhatīm|
catuṣkaṃ vāsaveśma|| 9||

vinyastavaiḍūryaśile ca tasminnaviddhamuktāphalabhakticitre|
āvarjitāṣṭāpadakumbhatoyāḥ satūryamenāṃ snapayāṃbabhūvuḥ|| 10||

tasmiṃścatuṣke yuvatayaḥ satūryaṃ vāditrānvitamenāṃ vadhūmasnāpayanta|
kīdṛśe|
snānabhūvibhāgārthaṃ vinyastā dṛbdhā vaiḍūryamaṇiśilā yatra|
tathāviddhānāmagrastānāṃ muktāphalānāṃ bhaktyā vicchityā
citre ramye| nāryaḥ kīdṛśyaḥ|
āvarjitaṃ kṣiptamaṣṭāpadakumbhatoyaṃ kanakaghaṭavāri yābhiḥ|| 10||

sā maṅgalasnānaviśuddhagātrī gṛhītaśubhrodgamanīyavastrā|
nirvṛttaparjanyajalābhiṣekā praphullakāśā vasudheva reje|| 11||

sā gaurī vivāhābhiṣekeṇa viśuddhagātrī kāntimatkāyā
ācchāditadhavaladhautāmbarā ca reje cakāśe| keva|
nirvṛttaḥ sampannaḥ parjanyajalābhiṣeko jīmūtatoyavṛṣṭiryasyāḥ sā
śaradi vikasitakāśakusumā bhūryathā rājate tathāsau|
udgamanīyavastraṃ dhautapūtam|| 11||

tasmātpradeśācca vitānavantaṃ yuktaṃ maṇistambhacatuṣṭayena|
pativratābhiḥ parigṛhya ninye kḷptāsanaṃ kautukavedimadhyam|| 12||

tasmātpradeśātsthānādasau sādhvībhirādāya kautukavedimadhyaṃ maṅgalasthalotsaṅgaṃ ninye nītā| 
kīdṛśam| vitānavantaṃ saraktakaṃ ratnasthūṇācatuṣkeṇa sambaddhaṃ kḷptāsanaṃ racitabhadrapīṭham| kṛpo ro laḥ|| 12||

tāṃ prāṅmukhīṃ tatra niveśya tanvīṃ kṣaṇaṃ vyalambanta puro niṣaṇṇāḥ|
bhūtārthaśobhāhriyamāṇanetrāḥ prasādhane saṃnihite 'pi nāryaḥ||

tatra pūrvābhimukhīṃ tāṃ kṛśāṅgīmupaveśya
saṃnihite 'pyalaṃkaraṇe
yuvatayo 'grasthitāḥ kṣaṇamātraṃ vyalambantodāsata|
yato bhūtārthayā svābhāvikyā śobhayā
hriyamāṇanetrā vilobhyamānanayanāḥ| 
akṛtrimasya hi rūpasya kiṃ maṇḍanena| bhūtārthaḥ pāramārthikam|| 13||

dhūpena saṃtyājitamārdrabhāvaṃ kleśāntamantaḥkusumaṃ tadīyam|
paryākṣipatkācidudārabandhaṃ dūrvāvatāpāṇḍumadhūkadhāmnā|| 14||

tataḥ kṣaṇamātreṇa kācidaṅganā tadīyaṃ keśapāśaṃ śādvalavalitena sitamadhūkakusumaśekhareṇa paryākṣipadabadhnāt| 
kīdṛśam|
agurvādidhūpadhūmenārdratvaṃ saṃtyājitaṃ parivāpitam|
antaḥkusumaṃ kusumagarbham|
dīrghatvādudāraḥ śreṣṭho bandho granthiryasya|| 14||

āsaktaśuklāguru cakrurasyāḥ sarocanāpatravibhaṅgamaṅgam|
sā cakravākāṅkitasaikatāyāstrisrotasaḥ kāntimatītya tasthau|| 15||

tasyā dehaṃ nārya evaṃvidhamakurvan| kiṃvidham|
āsaktaṃ nihitaṃ śuklāguru sitāṅgarāgaviśeṣo yatra|
śuklakṛṣṇabhedenāgurordve rūpe|
tathā stanādau gorocanāyāḥ patravibhaṅgāḥ patralatāḥ saha
tairvartata iti sarocanāpatravibhaṅgam| ataśca sā gaurī
rathāṅganāmacihnitatīrāyāstripathagāyāḥ śobhāmabhibhūyāsīt|
sā hi sitā| rocanāvattvāccakravākopamānam|| 15||

līnadvirephaṃ paribhūya padmaṃ sameghalekhaṃ śaśinaśca bimbam|
tadānanaśrīralakaiḥ prasiddhaiściccheda sādṛśyakathāprasaṅgam|| 16||

tasyā vaktralakṣmīḥ prasiddhairalakaiḥ sādṛśyakathāprasaṅgaṃ kimasya
sādṛśyaṃ syādityupamānavāgavasaramapi ciccheda vyanīnaśat|
saṃśliṣṭabhramaramaravindamabhralavayutaṃ cendumaṇḍalamabhibhūya
jitvā| kamalaśaśinau kila mukhasyopamānabhūtau| abhibhave tu
prasādhanameva hetuḥ|| 16||

karṇārpito rodhrakaṣāyarūkṣe gorocanābhedanitānagaure|
tasyāḥ kapole parabhāgalābhādbabandha cakṣūṃṣi yavaprarohaḥ|| 17||

tasyāḥ śravaṇanihito yavāṅkuro lokasya netrāṇi babandha
viṣayāntarānnyavartayat| kutaḥ| 
kapole parabhāgalābhācchobhātiśayāvāpteḥ| kīdṛśe| 
rodhrasya kaṣāyeṇa rasena rūkṣe viṣame| 
tathā gorocanāyā bhedo bhaṅgastadvadatigaure| 
evaṃ ca gaure haritasya śobhotkarṣāvāptiḥ| 
śāliyavāṅkurādīnāṃ ca praśasyatvānnidhānam|| 17||

rekhāvibhaktaśca vibhaktagātryāḥ kiṃcinmadhūcchiṣṭhavisṛṣṭarāgaḥ|
kāmapyabhikhyāṃ sphuritairapuṣyadāsannalāvaṇyaphalo 'dharoṣṭhaḥ|| 18||

yauvanavaśādvibhaktāṅgyāstasyā adharoṣṭho 'dhodharaḥ sphuritaiḥ kampaiḥ kāmapyavarṇanīyāmabhikhyāṃ śobhāmapuṣyadavardhayat|
kīdṛśaḥ| madhyarekhayā vibhakto dvidhā kṛtaḥ| 
tathā kiṃcinmanāṅmadhūcchiṣṭena sikthakena visṛṣṭarāgo 'pāstalauhityaḥ|
tāmbūlādyutkaṭo rāgo madhūcchiṣṭenotpuṃsya madhuraḥ kriyate|
priyaparicumbanādāsannaṃ nikaṭaṃ lāvaṇyaphalaṃ yasya|
adho bhavo 'dharo budhnasthaḥ|| 18||

patyuḥ śiraścandrakalāmanena spṛśeti sakhyā parihāsapūrvam|
sā rañjayantyā caraṇau kṛtāśīrmālyena tāṃ nirvacanaṃ jaghāna|| 19||

sā devī mālyena śekhareṇa nirvacanaṃ tūṣṇīṃ tāṃ jaghānātāḍayat| 
yatastayā sakhyā pādau rañjayantyā narmapūrvamitthaṃ kṛtāśīḥ|
kathamityāha---anena caraṇena patyuḥ śivasya surataviśeṣavaśāduttamāṅgasthāṃ śaśilekhāṃ spṛśeti|
ataśca roṣānmālyaprahāraḥ|| 19||

tasyāḥ sujātotpalapatrakānte prasādhikābhirnayane nirīkṣya|
na cakṣuṣoḥ kāntiviśeṣabuddhyā kālāñjanaṃ maṅgalamityupāttam|| 20||

sujātaṃ yadupalapatraṃ tadvatkānte ramye netre vilokyāpi
prasādhikābhiryatkajjalaṃ tayoradāyi tanmaṅgaladhiyā na tu
śobhātiśayabuddhyā| ye hi prakṛtyā vikasitakuvalayanibhe
tayoḥ kathaṃ varākamañjanaṃ śobhākāri|| 20||

sā sambhavadbhiḥ kusumairlateva jyotirbhirudyadbhiriva triyāmā|
saridvihaṅgairiva līyamānairāmucyamānābharaṇā cakāśe|| 21||

sā devyābaddhyamānālaṃkārā cakāśe reje| 
kairiva ketyābharaṇānāmanekavarṇatvādupamānānyāha|
sambhavadbhirjāyamānaiḥ kusumairyathā latā śobhata iti padmarāgendranīlādilābhaḥ|
nakṣatraiścodayamānairniśeveti muktāmaṇilābhaḥ|
vihaṅgaiścakravākaiḥ śliṣyadbhirnadīveti kanakābharaṇādilābhaḥ|| 21||

ātmānamālokya ca śobhamānamādarśabimbe stimitāyatākṣī|
haropayānatvaritā babhūva strīṇāṃ priyālokaphalo hi veśaḥ|| 22||

tato gaurī niścalaviśālalocanātmānaṃ makuramaṇḍale
śobhamānamavekṣya tryakṣāgamanasatvarāsīt|
yasmānnārīṇāṃ vallabhadarśanaphalo veśa ākalpo maṇḍanam|
asati hi priyālokane maṇḍanena kiṃ kriyate|| 22||

athāṅgulibhyāṃ haritālamārdraṃ maṅgalyamādāya manaḥśilāṃ ca|
karṇāvasaktāmaladantapatraṃ mātā tadīyaṃ mukhamunnamayya|| 23||

umāstanodbhedamanu pravṛddho manoratho yaḥ prathamo babhūva|
tameva menā duhituḥ kathaṃcidvivāhadīkṣātilakaṃ cakāra|| 24||

atha menā sutāyā vaktramutkṣipya tarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ haritālaṃ manaḥśilāṃ ca gṛhītvā
maṅgalārthaṃ vivāhadīkṣāyāṃ tilakamānandāsrākuladṛṣṭitvātkathaṃcitkleśena
cakāra vyadhāt| utprekṣyate---umāyāḥ stanodbhedamanu
payodharanirgamanena saha
yo 'syā yogyavaralābhaviṣayo manorathaḥ pravṛddhastameva
tamivākarot| tadā tasyā hṛdayānnirgatatvāditthamūhaḥ| 
evaśabda ivārthe| kīdṛśaṃ mukham|
karṇayoravasaktaṃ yojitamamalaṃ dantapatraṃ dviradaradanaparighaṭitā
patralatā yatra| stanodbhedamanvityanuśabdastṛtīyārthe karmapravacanīyaḥ|| 23--24||

babandha cāstākuladṛṣṭirasyāḥ sthānantare kalpitasaṃniveśam|
dhātryāṅgulībhiḥ pratisāryamāṇamūrṇāmayaṃ kautukahastasūtram|| 25||

na kevalamasau gauryāstilakamakarodyāvadaurṇaṃ kautukahastasūtraṃ babandhāmumoca|
kīdṛśam| bāṣpalolalocanatvādasthāne kṛtaracanam| ataśca
dhātryā kareṇa pratisāryamāṇaṃ sthānaṃ nīyamānam|| 25||

kṣīrodaveleva saphenapuñjā paryāptacandreva śarattriyāmā|
navaṃ navakṣaumanivāsinī sā bhūyo babhau darpaṇamādadhānā|| 26||

sā devī pratyagrapaṭṭāṃśukaparidhānā maṇimakuramābibhrāṇā bhūyo nitāntaṃ babhau vyadyotiṣṭa|
keva| ḍaṇḍīravalayayutā dugdhodadhikṛtiriva|
paripūrṇaśaśāṅkeva kaumudīniśā|| 26||

tāmarcitābhyaḥ kuladevatābhyaḥ kulapratiṣṭhāṃ praṇamayya mātā|
akārayatkārayitavyadakṣā krameṇa pādagrahaṇaṃ satīnām|| 27||

tāṃ devīṃ menā puṣpādipūjitābhyo gṛhadevatābhyaḥ praṇamayya
namaskāryānantaraṃ sādhvīnāṃ krameṇānujyeṣṭhaṃ pādavandanamakārayat|
yataḥ kārayitavye 'vaśyakārye dakṣā pravīṇā|
tāṃ devīṃ kulasya pratiṣṭhāṃ kīrtikarīm|
praṇamayyetyayāmanta iti
ṇerayādeśaḥ|| 27||

akhaṇḍitaṃ prema labhasva patyurityucyate tābhirumā sma namrā|
tayā tu tasyārdhaśarīralābhātpaścātkṛtāḥ snigdhajanāśiṣo 'pi|| 28||

tābhirvanditābhiravidhavābhiḥ sā devī namrā satī bhartuḥ sakāśādakhaṇḍitaṃ paripūrṇaṃ prema prītyatiśayaṃ lapsīṣṭhā ityucyate smāgadyata| 
tayā punaretāvatyo bāndhavalokāśiṣo 'pyanantaraṃ paścātkṛtāstiraskṛtāḥ|
kutaḥ| tasya patyurardhaśarīralābhāt| 
yena hi śarīrārdho 'pyadāyi tataḥ premamātralābho na durlabhaḥ|
śarīrasyārdhamardhaśarīram| ardhaṃ napuṃsakam|| 28||

icchāvibhūtyoranurūpamadristasyāḥ kṛtī kṛtyamaśaṣayitvā|
sabhyaḥ sabhāyāṃ suhṛdāsthitāyāṃ tasthau vṛṣāṅkāgamanapratīkṣaḥ|| 29||

tato naganātho mitrabandhusahitaḥ sabhāyāṃ vivāhasadasi
harāgamanapratīkṣa āsta| kiṃ kṛtvā|
abhilāṣavibhavayoranurūpaṃ duhitṛkāryamaśeṣayitvā samāpya|
kṛtamasyāstīti kṛtī| 
kṛtārtho bhagavati sarveśvare sutāyāḥ pratipādanāt|
sabhāyāṃ sādhuḥ sabhyaḥ pradhānaḥ kulaśīlādyutkarṣāt|
sabhāyā yaḥ|
śiṣeścaurādikasyāśeṣayitveti 
rūpam|| 29||

tāvadvarasyāpi kuberaśaile tatpūrvapāṇigrahaṇānurūpam|
prasādhanaṃ mātṛbhirādṛtābhirnyastaṃ purastātsmaraśāsanasya|| 30||

yāvadeva gaurī prasādhyate sma tāvatsmarārervarasya pariṇetuḥ kuberaśaile kailāse sayatnābhirmātṛbhirdevatābhiḥ prathamavivāhānurūpamalaṃkaraṇamagrato nihitam|| 30||

tadgauravānmaṅgalamaṇḍanaśrīḥ sā paspṛśe kevalamīśvareṇa|
sva eva veśaḥ pariṇeturiṣṭaṃ bhāvāntaraṃ tasya vibhoḥ prapede|| 31||

tato devena mātṛgauravātsā kautukakālaṃkāralakṣmīḥ kevalaṃ paspṛśe| abhininditā na tvaṅge nihitā|
yato 'syeśvarasyātmīya evākalpaḥ pariṇeturvarasyeṣṭamabhimataṃ bhāvāntaramanyadrūpaṃ prapede
prāpa|| 31||

tathā hi---

babhūva bhasmaiva sitāṅgarāgaḥ kapālamevāmalaśekharaśrīḥ|
upāntabhāgeṣu ca rocanāṅko gajājinasyaiva dugūlabhāvaḥ|| 32||

tasya bhasmaiva sitāṅgarāgaścandanānulepanamāsīt|
kapālamevāmalaśekharaśrīravataṃsalakṣmīrabhūt| tathā
gajājinasyaiva karikṛttereva
dugūlabhāvaḥ paṭṭāṃśukatvaṃ babhūva| upāntabhāgeṣu
pallavapradeśeṣu rocanaivāṅkaścihnaṃ yasya
goracanālikhitahaṃsayugalaramya ityarthaḥ|
siṃhājinasyetyapapāṭha eva karikṛttivāsastvādbhavasya|
tathā ca pūrvamevoktam---

vadhūdugūlaṃ ca sahaṃsalakṣaṇaṃ gajājinaṃ śoṇitabinduvarṣi ca

iti|| 32||

śaṅkhāntaradyoti vilocanaṃ yadantarniviṣṭāmalapiṅgatāram|
sāṃnidhyapakṣe haritālamayyāstadeva jātaṃ tilakakriyāyāḥ|| 33||

śaṅkhau lalāṭāntau tayorantare madhye dyotate bhāsate yadakṣi tṛtīyaṃ tadeva haritālamayyāstilakakriyāyāḥ sāṃnidhyapakṣe sadbhāvamārge jātaṃ sampannam| 
lālāṭamakṣi haritālatilakamabhūdityarthaḥ| kīdṛśaṃ netram|
antarniviṣṭā sthitāmalā piṅgatārā yasya|| 33||

yathāpradeśaṃ bhujageśvarāṇāṃ kariṣyatāmābharaṇāntaratvam|
śarīramātraṃ vikṛtiṃ prapede tathaiva tasthuḥ phaṇaratnaśobhāḥ|| 34||

vāsukiprabhṛtīnāṃ nāgendrāṇāṃ bāhvādipradeśānurūpeṇa keyūrakaṭakādirūpamalaṃkāraviśeṣaṃ vidhāsyatāṃ dehamātramābharaṇamayaṃ vikāramāpa|
śiromaṇiśobhāḥ punastathaiva tasthurna rūpāntaraṃ prāpuḥ|
ratnānāṃ svata evālaṃkaraṇatvāt|| 34||

divāpi niṣṭhyūtamarīcibhāsā bālyādanāviṣkṛtalakṣaṇena|
candreṇa nityaṃ pratibhinnamauleścūḍāmaṇau kiṃ grahaṇaṃ harasya|| 35||

bhavasya cūḍāmaṇau śiroratnaviṣaye kiṃ grahaṇaṃ ka ādaraḥ|
cūḍāmaṇirūpeṇa narāsthi na kiṃcidvyacīkaradityarthaḥ|
yato nityameva śaśinā pratibhinnamaulerviśeṣitajūṭasya|
kīdṛśena| ahanyapi prasṛtakiraṇakāntinā| 
tathā kalāmātrarūpatvādanāviṣkṛtalakṣaṇenāvyaktamalena|
paripūrṇasya hyasya śaśāvirbhāvaḥ| ataśca
yasyaivaṃvidhaḥ sitāṃśurābharaṇaṃ śirasi sa kimiti
cūḍāmaṇimapekṣate| grahaṇamādaraḥ|| 35||

ityadbhutaikaprabhavaḥ prabhāvātprasiddhanepathyavidhirvidhātā|
ātmānamāsannagaṇopanīte khaḍge niṣaktapratimaṃ dadarśa|| 36||

atha haraḥ pārśvasthagaṇaḍhaukite maṇḍalāgre lagnapratibimbamalaṃkṛtamātmānamaikṣata|
kīdṛśaḥ prabhāvānmahimna itītthaṃ prasiddhanepathyavidhiḥ sampannaveśaracanaḥ|
yato 'dbhutaikaprabhava āścaryaikanidhiḥ| vidhātā sraṣṭā||
36|| 

sa gopatiṃ nandibhujāvalambī śārdūlacarmāntaritorupṛṣṭham|
tadbhaktisaṃkṣiptabṛhatpramāṇamāruhya kailāsamiva pratasthe|| 37||

tato devo nandibhujāvalambanena vṛṣamāruhya prayayau|
kīdṛśam| śārdūlacarmaṇā
vyāghracarmaṇāntaritaṃ sthagitamurupuṛṣṭhaṃ yasya|
śauklyādutprekṣyate---bhagavadbhaktyā
saṃhṛtaṃ mahatpramāṇaṃ yena
tattādṛśaṃ kailāsamadrimivārhuya yayāvityarthaḥ|| 37||

taṃ mātaro devamanuvrajantyaḥ svavāhanakṣobhacalāvataṃsāḥ|
mukhaiḥ prabhāmaṇḍalareṇugauraiḥ padmākaraṃ cakrurivāntarikṣam|| 38||

taṃ devaṃ mātaro 'nuvrajantyo vaktrairvyoma kamalaṣaṇḍamiva
vyadhuḥ| mukhānāṃ kamalanibhatvāt| prabhāmaṇḍalameva
reṇustena gauraiḥ piṅgaiḥ| padme hi reṇunā bhāvyam|
tāḥ kīdṛśyaḥ| mahiṣolūkādikaṃ svaṃ svaṃ vāhanaṃ tatkṣobhe
calā avataṃsāḥ śekharā yāsāṃ tāḥ|| 38||

tāsāṃ ca paścātkanakaprabhāṇāṃ kālī kapālābharaṇā cakāśe|
balākinī nīlapayodarājirdūraṃ puraḥkṣiptaśatahradeva|| 39||

tāsāṃ mātṝṇāṃ suvarṇavarṇānāṃ paścātkālīsaṃjñā mātā sitakapālālaṃkārā cakāśe vyadyutat| 
keva|
balākāyuktāgre ca dūraṃ niṣṭhyūtataḍitkṛṣṇameghamālā yathā śobhate tathāsāvityarthaḥ|
kālyāḥ kālatvātkālīti nāma| varṇe ṅīṣūtpattiḥ||
39||

tato gaṇaiḥ śūlabhṛtaḥ purogairudīrito maṅgalatūryaghoṣaḥ|
vimānaśṛṅgāṇyavagāhamānaḥ śaśaṃsa sevāvasaraṃ surebhyaḥ|| 40||

atha harasyāgragāmibhiḥ pramathairutpādito ḍhakkādimaṅgalavāditradhvanirdevebhyaḥ sevāvasaraṃ śaśaṃsācakathat|
yataḥ surayānaśikharāṇi vyāpnuvannataśca tadākarṇanānnūnaṃ devo vivāhārthamuccalito yenāyaṃ tūryaravastadvrajāmo 'sya
purata iti sevākālakathanam|| 40||

tāmeva sevāmāha---

upādade tasya sahasraraśmistvaṣṭrā navaṃ nirmitamātapatram|
sa taddugūlādavidūramaulirbabhau vahangāṅgamiva pravāham|| 41||

tvaṣṭrā viśvakarmaṇā tatkālaghaṭitamātapatramasya devasya
daśaśatābhīśurupādade jagrāha| sa ca
harastaddugūlācchatrapaṭṭāṃśukādavidūramaulirnikaṭaśirā babhau|
sitatvādutprekṣyate---gāṅgamiva pravāhaṃ sroto vahan| sa hi
gaṅgādharaḥ|| 41||

mūrte ca gaṅgāyamune tadānīṃ sacāmare devamaseviṣātām|
samudragārūpaviparyaye 'pi sahaṃsapāte iva lakṣyamāṇe|| 42||

taṃ ceśvaraṃ gaṅgāyamune nadyau cāmarāṇi
gṛhītvāseviṣātāṃ vījayamāsatuḥ|
sacā,aratvādutprekṣyate---samudragārūpaviparyaye 'pi
jalamayasaṃsthānatyāge 'pi haṃsapātānvite iva dṛśyamāne|
srotorūpe hi nadīnāṃ haṃsairbhāvyam| tadā ca
mūtāvajalatve 'pi
sitaprakīrṇakasadbhāvāddhaṃsasamparkotprekṣā|
samudragāḥ saritastāsāṃ rūpaṃ srotomayam| aseviṣātāmiti
kartari luṅ|| 42||

tamabhyagacchatprathamo vidhātā śrīvatsalakṣmā puruṣaśca sākṣāt|
jayeti vācā mahimānamasya samedhayantau haviṣeva vahnim|| 43||

tamīśvaraṃ prathamo vidhātā brahmā śrīvatsāṅkaśca
puruṣo viṣṇurabhyagacchatsaṃmukhamāyayau| asya devasya jaya
jayeti vacasā svayaṃ māhātmyaṃ vardhayantau haviṣā vahnimiva|
citrabhānirhi havyena vardhate| śrīvatso harerurasi
lakṣaṇaviśeṣaḥ|| 43||

nanu brahmaviṣṇū sarvotkṛṣṭau kathamiva harasya
jayādiśabdamudacārayatāmityāha---

ekaiva mūrtirbibhide tridhā sā sāmānyameṣāṃ prathamāvaratvam|
viṣṇorharastasya hariḥ kadācidvedhāstayostāvapi dhāturīḍyau|| 44||

sā haraharihiraṇyagarbhalakṣaṇaikaiva mūrtistanustribhiḥ prakārairbibheda bhedaṃ gatāyaṃ haro harirayamayaṃ ca brahmeti|
yaduktaṃ namastrimūrtaye tubhyamiti|
ataścaiṣāṃ trayāṇāṃ yatprathamāvaratvaṃ prādhānyāprādhānyaṃ stotṛstutyatvāttatsāmānyaṃ sādhāraṇam|
tathā hi viṣṇoḥ kadācidīśvara īḍyaḥ stutyaḥ| tasya
kadāciddhariḥ| kadācidbrahmāṇaṃ hariharāvīḍāte| kadācittu
tau sa īṭṭe|| 44||

taṃ lokapālāḥ puruhūtamukhyāḥ śrīlakṣaṇotsargavinītaveśāḥ|
dṛṣṭipradāne kṛtanandisaṃjñāstaddarśitāḥ prāñjalayaḥ praṇemuḥ|| 45||

śakraprabhṛtayo digīśvarāstaṃ devaṃ praṇemuḥ| kīdṛśāḥ|
śrīlakṣaṇāni chatracāmarādīni teṣāmutsargeṇa tyāgena
vinītaveśā apariniṣṭhitākalpāḥ| 
tathā dṛṣṭipradānanimittaṃ kṛtā nandipratīhārasya saṃjñā saṃketo yaiḥ| 
avasaraṃ kuru darśayāsmāniti| 
tatastena vīrakeṇa darśitāḥ santo 'ñjaliṃ kṛtvā devamīśvaraṃ vavandire|| 45||

kampena mūrdhnaḥ śatapatrayoniṃ vācā hariṃ vṛtrahaṇaṃ smitena|
ālokamātreṇa surānaśeṣānsambhāvayāmāsa yathāpradhānam|| 46||

tato dhūrjaṭistānviriñcādīndevānyathāpradhānaṃ prabhāvānurūpyeṇāvarjayat|
tathā hi śiraścālanena brahmāṇaṃ samabhāvayat|
tato hariṃ vacasā| tadanvindramīṣaddhasitena| 
anyāṃśca gīrvāṇāndṛṣṭimātreṇa|| 46||

tasmai jayāśīḥ sasṛje purastātsaptarṣibhistānsmitapūrvamāha|
vivāhayajñe vitate 'tra yūyamadhvaryavaḥ pūrvakṛtā mayeti|| 47||

jaya jayetyāśīrnutirdevātāgrato vasiṣṭhādibhirmunibhiḥ sasṛja uccāritā|
tatastānasau sahāsamuvāca| asminnudvāhādhvare vitate prasṛte
pūrvameva mayādhvaryutve yūyaṃ preritāḥ|
tataḥ śīghraṃ vrajateti bhāvaḥ|| 47||

viśvāvasuprāgraharaiḥ pravīṇaiḥ saṃgīyamānatripurāpadānaḥ|
adhvānamadhvāntavikāralaṅghyastatāra tārādhipakhaṇḍadhārī|| 48||

tato devo 'dhvānaṃ tatāra mārgaṃ yayau| kīdṛśaḥ|
viśvāvasurgandharvarājaḥ prāgraharaḥ pradhānaṃ yeṣāṃ taiḥ pravīṇairgeyakuśalairuccairgīyamānaṃ tripuradāhalakṣaṇamapadānamāścaryakarma
yasya| dhvāntamāntaraṃ tamastasya vikārā harṣādayastairna
laṅghyo nākramaṇīyaḥ|
itthaṃ mahimadarśane 'pyanahaṃkṛta ityarthaḥ|
tārādhipakhaṇḍadhārī śaśikalābhṛt| tripuraśabdenātra
taddāho lakṣyate|| 48||

khe khelagāmī tamuvāha vāhaḥ saśabdacāmīkarakiṅkiṇīkaḥ|
taṭābhighātādiva lagnapaṅke dhunvanmuhuḥ protaghane viṣāṇe|| 49||

bāho vṛṣabhastamīśamākāśe 'vahat| kīdṛśaḥ| 
khelagāmī savilāsayāyī| 
tathā saśabdāścāmīkarakiṅkiṇyaḥ kanakaghaṇṭikā yasya saḥ| 
tathā protaghane syūtameghe viṣāṇe śṛṅge dhunvankampayan|
utprekṣyate---taṭābhighātādvaprakrīḍāta iva lagnapaṅke|
kardamaśleṣāddhi viṣāṇakampaḥ|| 49||

sa prāpadaprāptaparābhiyogaṃ nagendraguptaṃ nagaraṃ muhūrtam|
purovilagnairharadṛṣṭipātaiḥ suvarṇasūtrairiva kṛṣyamāṇam|| 50||

aprāptaparābhiyogamanāsāditaripupariveṣṭanamoṣadhiprasthaṃ sa īśvaraḥ kṣaṇamātreṇāsadat|
utprekṣyate---agrato vilagnairharatṛtīyanayanapātairhetubhūtaiḥ suvarṇasūtrairākṛṣyamāṇamiva|
anyathā kathaṃ dūrasyāśuprāptiḥ syāditi bhāvaḥ|
kartṛtṛtīyayā tu dvitīyamivaśabdaṃ vinotprekṣā durghaṭā syāt|
suvarṇasūtrairivetyeṣa ivaśabdo dṛṣṭipātānāmupamārtho notprekṣāmapi pratipādayituṃ samarthaḥ| 
ataścevaśabdadvayaprayogo nyāyyaḥ|
yathā---

aṅgulībhiriva keśasaṃcayaṃ saṃnigṛhya timiraṃ marīcibhiḥ| 
kuḍmalīkṛtasarojalocanaṃ cumbatīva rajanīmukhaṃ śaśī||
hetutṛtīyāyāṃ tu na kiṃcidahṛdayaṃgamam|| 50||

tasyopakaṇṭhe ghananīlakaṇṭhaḥ kutūhalādunmukhapauradṛṣṭaḥ|
svabāṇacihnādavatīrya mārgādāsannabhūpṛṣṭhamiyāya devaḥ|| 51||

tasyādrerupakaṇṭhe samīpe bhagavānāsannabhūpṛṣṭhamagāt|
svabāṇacihnānmārgādākāśādavaruhya| tripuravadhakāle
śarakṣepānnabhasaḥ svabāṇacihnatvam| kīdṛśo 'sau|
ghananīlakaṇṭho meghakālagalaḥ| tathā
kutūhalenonmukhairnāgarairvīkṣitaḥ|| 51||

tamṛddhimadbandhujanādhirūḍhairvṛndairgajānāṃ giricakravartī|
pratyujjagāmāgamanapratītaḥ praphullavṛkṣaiḥ kaṭakairiva svaiḥ|| 52||

tamīśamadrināthaḥ pratyujjagāmāgrato niryayau| kaiḥ|
sphītasvajanārūḍhairhāstikairvikasitapādapairnijairiva nitambaiḥ| 
kīdṛśaḥ| bhagavata āgamanena pratītaḥ pramuditaḥ|| 52||

vargāvubhau devamahīdharāṇāṃ dvāre purasyodghaṭitāpidhāne|
samīyaturdūravisarpighoṣau bhinnaikasetū payasāmivaughau|| 53||

tau suranagasaṅghāvudghaṭitāpidhāne prasṛtadvāḥkavāṭe
purasya dvāre samīyatuḥ saṃjagmāte| kāviva|
bhinno luṭhita ekaḥ sādhāraṇaḥ seturyayostau toyapūrau yathā
saṃgacchete| seturdvārasyopamānam|
dūravisarpighoṣāvityubhayatrāpi viśeṣaṇam| apidhīyate
sthagyate yena tadapidhānaṃ kavāṭaḥ|| 53||

hrīmānabhūdbhūmidharo hareṇa trailokyavandyena kṛtapraṇāmaḥ|
pūrvaṃ mahimnā sa hi tasya dūramāvarjitaṃ nātmaśiro viveda|| 54||

bhuvanatrayavanditena hareṇa pūrvaṃ vanditatvādadrinātho lajjito 'bhūt|
sarveśvaro nāmādau namatīti| 
sa ca dūramatyarthamāvarjitaṃ nāmitamapi nijamuttamāṅgaṃ na viveda nājñāsīt| 
kutaḥ| tasya mahimnā prabhāvātiśayena|
atyutkṛṣṭasya hi paścādvihitamapi vandanaṃ kiyadatreti mahimnā kartrā manyate| 
yadi vā bhagavataḥ sarvopari vartitvādbhuvanānāmadhaḥsthatve satyātmaśiraso 'tra pūrvavadboddhavyam| 
na tu praṇāmamātreṇa| 
mahimnā hi bhagavatā sarvaṃ nāmitameva| 
asminpakṣe mahimneti nāmanāpekṣā|
kartari tṛtīyā| ataścāsau na viveda| 
yadi hyavediṣyallajjito nābhaviṣyannityameva praṇatatvāt|| 54||

sa prītiyogādvikasanmukhaśrīrjāmāturagresaratāmupetya|
prāveśayanmandiramṛddhamenamāgulphakīrṇāpaṇamārgapuṣpam|| 55||

sa himavānprītyā jāmātuḥ puroyāyitvamavāpyainaṃ śrīkaṇṭhaṃ nijaṃ mandiraṃ prāveśayat|
ṛddhaṃ sphītaṃ tathāgulphaṃ pādapūraṃ kīrṇānyāpaṇamārge
haṭṭapathe puṣpāṇi yatra| antareti pāṭhe 'ntare
nagarābhyantare mārgā antaramārgāḥ|| 55||

tasminmuhūrte purasundarīṇāmīśānasaṃdarśanalālasānām|
prāsādamālāsu babhūvuritthaṃ tyaktānyakāryāṇi viceṣṭitāni|| 56||

atha tasminmuhūrte mahārājapraveśasamaye varavilokanasābhilāṣāṇāṃ nagaravanitānāmutsṛṣṭavyāpārāntarāṇi viceṣṭitāni caritāni harmyāvalipṛṣṭheṣvitthamāsannabhūvan|| 56||

kathamityāha---

ālokamārgaṃ sahasā vrajantyā kayācidudveṣṭanavāntamālyaḥ|
bandhuṃ na sambhāvita eva tāvatkareṇa ruddho 'pi na keśahastaḥ|| 57||

sahasānāśaṅkamālokamārgaṃ gavākṣapathaṃ gatayā
kayācinnāgarikayā keśapāśo bandhuṃ grathayituṃ na
sambhāvita eva na niyojita eva tāvat| āstāmetat| kareṇāpi na
ruddho nāvaṣṭabdhaḥ| ataśca yatra kararodhasyaiva
tvarāvaśādakṣaṇatvaṃ tatra bandhanacarcā
dūrāpetaivetyarthaḥ|
udveṣṭanavaśādvāntamālyastyaktāpīḍastasyāntasthatvāt|
mālānāṃ samūho mālyam| pāśādibhyo ya ityanena yaḥ|
hastapakṣapāśāḥ keśeṣu praśaṃsāvācakāḥ|| 57||

prasādhikālambitamagrapādamākṣipya kāciddravarāgameva|
utsṛṣṭalīlāgatirāgavākṣādalaktakāṅkāṃ padavīṃ tatāna|| 58||

anyā kācidaṅganā prasādhikālambitaṃ sairandhrīgṛhītaṃ dravarāgamaśuṣkālaktakaṃ caraṇāgramākṣipya parityaktavilāsagamanā yāvakarasacihnaṃ mārgamāvātāyanamakarot| 
agraṃ cāsau pādo 'grapāda iti guṇaguṇinorabhedādviśeṣaṇasamāsaḥ|
bhedapakṣe tu pādāgrādīnāṃ ṣaṣṭhīsamāsaḥ| 
agre pādo 'grapāda iti saptamīsamāso vā|| 58||

vilocanaṃ dakṣiṇamañjanena sambhāvya tadvañcitavāmanetrā|
tathaiva vātāyanasaṃnikarṣaṃ yayau śalākāmaparā vahantī|| 59||

anyā nārī dakṣiṇamakṣi kajjalena sambhāvya saṃyojya vāme tu tadadattvaiva kareṇa tūlikāṃ dadhānā tathaivotsṛṣṭalīlāgatirgavākṣanikaṭamagamat|
vāto 'yati prasaratyaneneti vātāyanaṃ gavākṣaḥ|| 59||

jālāntarapreṣitadṛṣṭiranyā prasthānabhinnāṃ na babandha nīvīm|
nābhipraviṣṭābharaṇaprabheṇa hastena tasthāvavalambya vāsaḥ|| 60||

aparā vanitā tvarāvaśādgamanatruṭitāṃ nīvīmuccayaṃ gavākṣavivarakṣiptanetratvānna babandha| 
kevalaṃ kareṇa vāso 'mbaramavaṣṭabhya tasthāvāsta|
ataśca nābhipraviṣṭakaṭakakāntitvam|| 60||

ardhācitā satvaramutthitāyāḥ pade pade durnimitaṃ galantī|
kasyāścidāsīdraśanā tadānīmaṅguṣṭhamūlārpitasūtraśeṣā|| 61||

anyasyāśca tvarayotthitāyāstadānīṃ mekhalā pādāṅguṣṭhamūlārpitasūtraśeṣā babhūva|
yato 'rdhamācitombhitā| 
ata eva pratipadaṃ galantī bhraṣṭābharaṇā| 
duṣṭaṃ nimitaṃ nidhānaṃ nikṣepo yatra taddurnimitaṃ galanam| 
ata eva tantuśeṣatvam|| 61||

tāsāṃ mukhairāsavagandhagarbhairvyāptāntarāḥ sāndrakutūhalānām|
vilolanetrabhramarairgavākṣāḥ sahasrapatrābharaṇā ivāsan|| 62||

tatastāsāṃ ghanakautukānāmaṅganānāṃ vaktrairāpūrṇamadhyā gavākṣāḥ kamalālaṃkṛtā ivābhavan|
mukhānāṃ padmanibhatvāt| 
tadeva sāmyamāha---āsavagandhaḥ pānasaurabhaṃ garbhe garbho vā yeṣāṃ taiḥ| 
caṭulāni nayanānyeva ṣaṭpadā yeṣāṃ taiḥ||
62||

tamekadṛśyaṃ nayanaiḥ pibantyo nāryo na jajñurviṣayāntarāṇi|
tadā hi śeṣendriyavṛttirāsāṃ sarvātmanā cakṣuriva praviṣṭā|| 63

nāgarikāstamevamatidarśanīyatvādīkṣaṇaiḥ pibantyaḥ śabdādīni viṣayāntarāṇi na jajñurnācetayanta| 
tadgatamanaskatvāddhi tā nānyatpaśyanti na śṛṇvanti na jighranti na sparśamanubhavanti|
ataścotprekṣyate---nūnaṃ tāsāṃ śravaṇādīnāṃ śeṣāṇāmindriyāṇāṃ vṛttirākarṇanādiko vyāpārastadā sarvātmanā sāmastyena cakṣuriva praviṣṭā netrayoreva gatā|
śeṣasya tvāśrayasya śūnyakalpatvaṃ nyāyyamiti bhāvaḥ|
jajñuriti jānāterliṭ| ekaścāsau dṛśya ekadṛśyaḥ|| 63||

sthāne tapo duścarametadarthamaparṇayā pelavayāpi taptam|
yā dāsyamapyasya labheta nārī sā syātkṛtārthā kimutāṅkaśayyām|| 64||

paraspareṇa spṛhaṇīyarūpaṃ na cedidaṃ dvandvamayojayiṣyat|
asmindvaye rūpavidhānayatnaḥ patyuḥ prajānāṃ vitatho 'bhaviṣyat|| 65||

na nūnamārūḍharuṣā śarīramanena dagdhaṃ kusumāyudhasya|
vrīḍādamuṃ devamudīkṣya manye saṃnyastadehaḥ svayameva kāmaḥ|| 66||

anena sambandhamavāpya diṣṭyā manorathaprāthitamīśvareṇa|
mūrdhānamāli kṣitipālanoccamuccaistarāṃ vakṣyati śailarājaḥ|| 67||

ityoṣadhiprasthavilāsinīnāṃ śṛṇvankathāḥ śrotrasukhāstrinetraḥ|
keyūracūrṇīkṛtalājamuṣṭirhimālayasyālayamāsasāda|| 68||
kulakam||

sa bhagavānadrīndranagaranāyikānāṃ karṇaparitoṣakāriṇīritthaṃ gira ākarṇayañchvaśurasadma prāpa|
keyūrairbhujābharaṇairanyonyasaṃghaṭṭavaśāccūrṇīkṛtāḥ piṣṭā jālamuṣṭayo yasya|
praveśakāle kautukalājamokṣo nārībhiḥ kriyate|
kāstāḥ kathā ityāha---sthāna ityādi| 
aparṇayomayā sukumārayāpi duścaraṃ yattapaścīrṇametatsthāne yuktam|
yato 'sya devasya yā nārī preṣyatvamapi prāptā sā kṛtakṛtyā bhavet|
kimutāṅkasthānam| paraspareṇetyādi|
idaṃ ca dvandvaṃ yugalaṃ vedhā yadi na saṃghaṭayettadasminmithune śobhātiśayanirmāṇaprayāso 'sya vitatho niṣphalo bhavet| 
asadṛśasamāgamāt| kīdṛśaṃ dvandvam|
paraspareṇānyonyaṃ spṛhaṇīyaśobhamatiśayanīyakānti|
eṣo 'pi hīyaṃ ramyeti spṛhayate sāpi bhadro varo 'yamiti| 
kriyātipattyabhāvāllṛṅprayogo 'tra duḥsādhaḥ| na nūnamityādi| 
ārūḍharuṣā kruddhenānena niścitaṃ smarasya vapurna bhasmīkṛtamapi tu rūpātiśayānvitamamumīśvaramālokya lajjayā svayamevāsau kāmaḥ saṃnyastadeha utsṛṣṭakāyaḥ kaṣṭaṃ jito 'hamanena rūpātiśayeneti|
vrīḍāśabdaḥ strīpuṃsayoḥ| aneneti| 
anyā sakhīmāha---he āli vayasye manorājyābhilaṣitamanena devena saha sambandhamavāpya naganāthaḥ pṛthivīrakṣaṇonnatamapi śira idānīmuccaistarāmatyunnataṃ vakṣyati dhārayiṣyati|
sarveśvarajāmātṛkatvaṃ hyatyaunnatyakārakam| 
diṣṭyeti nipāta ānandārthaḥ|
evaṃvidhāḥ kathāḥ śṛṇvaṃstrilocano himālayālayamāsadat|
trinetratrinayanādīnāṃ kṣubhnāditvāṇṇatvābhāvaḥ||
64--68||

tāvatpatākākulamindumauliruttoraṇaṃ rājapathaṃ prapede|
prāsādaśṛṅgāni divāpi kurvañjyotsnābhiṣekadviguṇacchavīni|| 69||

yāvadeva puravanitā itthamavadaṃstāvacchaśiśekharo rājamārgamāsasāda|
saudhaśikharāṇyahanyapi candrikāsnānasitatarāṇi racayan|
kīdṛśaṃ rājapatham| patākākulaṃ vaijayantīsaṃkaṭam|
uccīkṛtāni toraṇāni yatra taduttoraṇam|| 69||

tato 'vatīryācyutadattahastaḥ śaradghanāddīdhitimānivokṣṇaḥ|
krāntāni pūrvaṃ kamalāsanena kakṣyāntarāṇyadripaterviveśa|| 70||

atha śivo hareḥ karamavalambya brahmaṇā pūrvākrāntāḥ saptakakṣyā himavato viveśa| kiṃ kṛtvā|
ukṣṇo vṛṣabhādavaruhya| kuta iva
ka ityāha---sitāccharadabhrāddīdhitimānarko yathāvatarati||
70||

tamanvagindrapramukhāśca devāḥ saptarṣipūrvāḥ paramarṣayaśca|
gaṇāśca giryālayamabhyagacchanyaśasyamārambhamivottamārthāḥ|| 71||

tamanvagbhagavataḥ paścāddevā munayaḥ pārṣadāśca himālayālayamabhyagacchanprāvikṣan|
yaśonimittamārambhaṃ yathottamārthāḥ śreṣṭhavastūnyanusaranti|
bhadraiḥ kila prayuktārthaṃ yaśasyaṃ karma sidhyati| 
anvagiti paścādarthaḥ|| 71||

tatreśvaro viṣṭarabhāgyathāvatsaratnamarghyaṃ madhumacca gavyam|
nave dugūle ca nagopanīte pratyagrahītsarvamamantravandhyam|| 72||

tatra śvaśuragṛhe bhagavānāsanastho 'drināthadattaṃ ratnayutamarghyodakaṃ gavyaṃ ca
madhumanmākṣikānvitam| madhuparkamityarthaḥ|
pratyagraṃ dugūlayugametadakhilamamantravandhyaṃ pratyagrahīdādade|
argho 'rcā| tadarthamudakamarghyam| pādārghābhyāṃ ceti yat|
mantreṇa vandhyaṃ śūnyaṃ mantravandhyam| tato nañsamāsaḥ|
yathāvaditi vidhivadartha upanayanaviśeṣaṇam|
amantravandhyamiti tu pratigrahakriyāyāḥ|| 72||

dugūlavāsāḥ sa vadhūsamīpaṃ ninye vinītairavarodharakṣaiḥ|
velāsakāśaṃ sphuṭaphenarājirnavairudanvāniva candrapādaiḥ|| 73|| 

sa varo dugūlavāsāḥ sitapaṭṭāmbaraḥ savinayairavarodharakṣaiḥ kañcukibhirumāsamīpaṃ ninye nītaḥ| 
yathā pratyagraiḥ śaśikiraṇaiḥ prakaṭaḍiṇḍīrāvaliḥ samudro velāsakāśaṃ nīyate|
tadudaye tasyollāsāt|
harasyābdhirupamānaṃ gauryā velāntaḥpurapatīnāṃ śaśiraśmayo dugūlasya phenapuñjaḥ| ninya iti karmaṇi|| 73||

tayā vivṛddhānanacandrakāntyā praphullacakṣuḥkumudaḥ kumāryā|
prasannacetaḥsalilaḥ śivo 'bhūtsaṃsṛjyamānaḥ śaradeva lokaḥ|| 74||

tayā sphītamukhamṛgāṅkarucā saṃyujyamāno maheśvaraḥ praphullacakṣuḥkumudaḥ prasannacetaḥsalilaścābhavat|
netrāṇāṃ manasi ca vikāso 'syāsīdityarthaḥ|
vivṛddhacandrakāntyā śaricchriyā saṃsṛjyamāno loko jagadyathā nirmalasalilo vikasitakumudaśca bhavati| 
tadā hi toyaṃ prasīdati kairavāṇi ca vikasanti śaśī ca kāntimānbhavati|| 74||


tayoḥ samāpattiṣu kātarāṇi kiṃcidvyavasthāpitasaṃhṛtāni|
hrīyantraṇāṃ tatkṣaṇamanvabhūvannanyonyalolāni vilocanāni|| 75||

tatkṣaṇaṃ saṃyogasamaye tayordevayoḥ parasparasābhilāṣāṇi nayanāni hrīyantraṇāṃ lajjākulatvamanvabhūvannavāpuḥ|
kīdṛśam| samāpattiṣvanyonyasamprāptiṣu kātarāṇyadhīrāṇi draṣṭumaśakyāni|
athaivaṃ kiṃcidvyavasthāpitānyapāṅgakṣiptānyanantaraṃ lajjayā saṃhṛtāni nivartitāni| asyaiva ca hrīyantraṇāmānaśire manojñāmiti pāṭhāntaram| 
ānaśire prāpuḥ|| 75||

tasyāḥ karaṃ śailagurūpanītaṃ jagrāha tāmrāṅgulimaṣṭamūrtiḥ|
umātmanā gūḍhatanoḥ smarasya tacchaṅkinaḥ pūrvamiva praroham|| 76||

tasyā vadhvāḥ pāṇiṃ himavatā melitaṃ lohitakaraśākhaṃ vara ādade| 
tāmratvādutprekṣyate|
umātmanā gaurīrūpeṇa gūḍhatanośchannavapuṣo madanasya pūrvamiva prarohaṃ prathamāṅkuramiva| 
kāmena hi tata utpattavyamiti|
utpatteśca pūrvaṃ tāmrāṅkurodgamo bhavati|| 76||

romodgamaḥ prādurabhūdumāyāḥ svinnāṅguliḥ puṃgavaketurāsīt|
vṛttistayoḥ pāṇisamāgamena samaṃ vibhakteva manobhavasya|| 77||

karasaṃsparśavaśādgauryā romāñca udapādi| 
vṛṣadhvajastu gharmitakaraśākho 'bhūt| 
ataścotprekṣyate---karasaṃyogena manobhavavṛttistayostulyaṃ bhāgīkṛteva|
svedaromāñcādayaḥ kāmavṛttayastadvaśādutpatteḥ|| 77||

prayuktapāṇigrahaṇaṃ yadanyadvadhūvaraṃ puṣyati kāntimagryām|
sāṃnidhyayogādanayostadānīṃ kiṃ kathyatāṃ śrīrubhayasya tasya|| 78||

anyadapi strīkumāraṃ vivāhakāle yadotkṛṣṭāṃ śriyamanayorgaurīśvarayoḥ saṃnidhānātpuṣyati prāpnoti| 
tasya dvayasya śobhā kimiti kavibhirucyatām|
yadanupraveśādanyasya vivāhaśobhā bhavati tatra dvayoḥ svayaṃ kāntiravaśyamevātiśāyinī| 
vadhūvaramiti sarvo dvandvo vibhāṣaikavadbhavati|| 78||

tau dampatī triḥ pariṇīya vahniṃ karāgrasaṃsparśanimīlitākṣau|
sa kārayāmāsa vadhūṃ purodhāstasminsamiddhārciṣi lājamokṣam|| 79||

sa purodhā brahmā tau dampatī vadhūvarau trirvāratrayamanalaṃ pariṇīya pradakṣiṇīkṛtya tataḥ kevalāmeva gaurīṃ sphuracchikhe 'gnau lājakṣepamacīkarat|
karāgrasaṃsparśena sukhānubhāvāllajjayā nimīlitākṣau saṃkucannetrau| dampatī iti karmapadam|
pariṇayaḥ pradakṣiṇīkaraṇam| ṇyarthaścātra boddhavyaḥ|
anyathā bhinnakartṛkatvātktvā durlabho bhavet|| 79||

sā lājadhūmāñjalimiṣṭagandhaṃ gurūpadeśādvadanaṃ nināya|
kapolasaṃsarpiśikhaḥ sa tasyā muhūrtakarṇotpalatāṃ prapede|| 80||

sā vadhūrviriñcājñayā lājadhūmāñjalimādāya mukhamanayat| 
yata iṣṭagandhaṃ saurabhaṃ hi tatra ghreyam| 
sa ca lājadhūmaḥ kapolaprasaracchikhatvātkṣaṇaṃ tasyāḥ śrotrotpalatāṃ bheje|
nīlakuvalayadalanibhatvāt|| 80||

tadīṣadārdrāruṇagaṇḍalekhamucchvāsikālāñjanarāgamakṣṇoḥ|
vadhūmukhaṃ klāntayavāvataṃsamācāradhūmagrahaṇādbabhūva|| 81||

tadumāvadanamācāradhūmagrahaṇādevaṃvidhamabhavat|
kīdṛśam| īṣanmanāgārdre aruṇe gaṇḍalekhe yatra|
akṣṇoścocchvāsī vikāsī kajjalarāgo yatra| 
tathā mlāno yavāṅkuro yatra|
dhūmagrahaṇasyācāratvaṃ lokācārānuṣṭhānāt|| 81||

vadhūṃ dvijaḥ prāha tavaiva vatse vahnirvivāhaṃ prati pūrvasākṣī|
śivena bhartrā saha dharmacaryā kāryā tvayā muktavicārayeti|| 82||

tato gaurīṃ dvijo brahmāvocat| kimityāha---īśvareṇa patyā
saha tvayā tyaktavicārayā niḥsaṃśayaṃ dharmacaraṇaṃ kāryam|
sahadharmacaryā hi sādhvīvratam| atra ca vivāhe
tavāyamagniḥ prathamasākṣī| tena calitumasmādvacanātte na
yujyata iti bhāvaḥ| caraṇaṃ caryā| gadamadeti yat||
82||

ālocanāntaṃ śravaṇe vivṛtya pītaṃ gurostadvacanaṃ bhavānyā|
nidāghakālolbaṇatāpayaiva māhendramambhaḥ prathamaṃ pṛthivyā|| 83||

tadbrahmavacanaṃ netraparyantaṃ karṇau vistārya gauryā
pītaṃ śrutamaṅkīkṛtam| yathā grīṣmasamaye pracaṇḍaravirucā
kṣoṇyā prathamapravṛttaṃ meghajalaṃ pīyata iti
praharṣakathanam|| 83||

dhruveṇa bhartrā dhruvadarśanāya prayujyamānā priyadarśanena|
sā dṛṣṭa ityānanamunnamayya hrīsannakaṇṭhī kathamapyuvāca|| 84||

tataḥ sā dhruveṇa śāśvatena bhartrā dhruvatārādarśanapraśnāya codyamānā mukhamutkṣipya vrīḍāspaṣṭagalā dṛṣṭo 'sāviti kṛcchrājjagāda|
evaṃvidho hyeṣa lokācāraḥ|| 84||

itthaṃ vidhijñena purohitena prayuktapāṇigrahaṇopacārau|
praṇematustau pitarau prajānāṃ padmāsanasthāya pitāmahāya|| 85||

vivāhasamayācāravidā purohitena brahmaṇetthaṃ pūrvoktena vidhinopadiṣṭodvāhavidhānau tāvīśvarāvanantaraṃ nalinaviṣṭaraṃ brahmāṇaṃ vavandāte|
mātā ca pitā ca tau pitarau| 
pitāmahāyeti kriyāgrahaṇātsampradānatvam| dvitīyā tu nyāyyā|| 85||

vadhūrvidhātrā pratinandyate sma kalyāṇi vīraprasavā bhaveti|
vācaspatiḥ sannapi so 'ṣṭamūrtāvāśāsyacintāstamito babhūva|| 86||

tataḥ praṇamitena vedhasā gaurī pratinandyate smāśāsyate sma|
kimityāha---bhadre vīraprasavā bhava vikrāntaputrā bhūyāḥ|
maheśvare tvasau vāgīśvaro 'pi bhavannāśāsye 'bhilaṣaṇīye
cintāniścalo 'bhavat| kimasmāyāśāsmīti|
paripūrṇatvādāśāsanīyasyābhāvāditi bhāvaḥ|| 86||

kḷptopakārāṃ caturantavediṃ tāvetya paścātkanakāsanasthau|
jāyāpatī laukikameṣitavyamārdrākṣatāropaṇamanvabhūtām|| 87||

tatastau vadhūvarau
dattapuṣpaprakarāṃ caturaśrāṃ vediṃ sthalamāgatyārdrākṣatāropaṇamanvabhūtāmapakvayavadānamāsevatuḥ|
yatastallaukikameṣitavyaṃ lokācārānuṣṭheyam|
sampannodvāhayorhi
brāhmaṇaiḥ svajanairavidhavābhiścārdrayāvā deyā iti
lokācāraḥ| paścāttvamatra pāṇipīḍanāpekṣayā|
eṣitavyamiṣṭamavaśyakaraṇīyam|| 87||

patrāntalambairjalabindubandhairākṛṣṭamuktāphalajālaśobham|
tayoruparyāyatanāladaṇḍamādhatta lakṣmīḥ kamalātapatram|| 88||

tayorgaurīśvarayoḥ śirasi sākṣātkamalāsanā
kamalamevātapatraṃ chatramādhatta dadhre| kīdṛśam|
palāśāvalambamānairudakakaṇāvasthānairākṛṣṭā muktāphalajālaśobhā yasya| 
tathāyatanākameva daṇḍaḥ|
chatre hi daṇḍamauktikairbhāvyam|| 88||

dvidhāprayuktena ca vāṅmayena sarasvatī tanmithunaṃ nunāva|
saṃskārapūtena varaṃ vareṇyaṃ vadhūṃ sukhagrāhyanibandhanena|| 89|| 

sarasvatyapi tanmithunaṃ yugalaṃ dvibhedena vāṅmayena
vacanaprabandhena nunāvāstuta| 
atraiva vibhāgamāha---varaṃ pāṇigrahītāraṃ saṃskārapūtena saṃskṛtena| vadhūṃ tu sukhenākleśena
grāhyaṃ bodhyaṃ nibandhanaṃ racanā yasya tena|
prākṛtenetyarthaḥ| taddhi subodhaṃ yuvatinutāvucitam|
vareṇyamutkṛṣṭam| vāco vikāro vāṅmayaṃ gadyapadyam|| 89||

tau saṃdhiṣu vyañjitavṛttibhedaṃ rasāntareṣu pratibaddharāgam|
apaśyatāmapsarasāṃ muhūrtaṃ prayogamādyaṃ lalitāṅgahāram|| 90||

tau dampatī suravadhūprayuktamādyaṃ pradhānaṃ purāṇaṃ vā
prayogamabhinayaṃ nāṭyamapaśyatāmaikṣiṣātām| kīdṛśam|
mukhapratimukhagarbhavimarśanirvahaṇākhyeṣu saṃdhiṣu
vyañjitaḥ prakaṭīkṛto vṛttīnāṃ sāttvikyārabhaṭīkaiśikībhāratīnāṃ viśeṣo yatra|
sandhivibhāgena hi tatra vṛtīnāmavasthānam| tathā rasāntareṣu
śṛṅgārādiṣu rasaviśeṣeṣu
pratibaddho 'vasthito rāgaḥ sarasatvaṃ yatra| rasāntarasaṃcāre
virāgatā na jātetyarthaḥ|
lalitaḥ sukumāro 'ṅgahāro nṛttaṃ yatra| 
komaloddhatabhedena hi dvividhaṃ nṛttam| 

śṛṅgāravīrabībhatsaraudrahāsyabhayānakāḥ|
karuṇādbhutaśāntāśca rasāḥ syurnava bhāvajāḥ||
90||

devāstadante haramūrdhabhāryaṃ kirīṭadaṣṭāñjalayo nipatya|
śāpāvasānapratilabdhamūrteryayācire pañcaśarasya sevām|| 91||

tatastadante nāṭyāvasāne sarve surā bhūmau nipatya kṛtodvāhaṃ bhavamasameṣoḥ sevāṃ yayācire| prārthayante sma|
kirīṭeṣu daṣṭā lagnā añjalayo yeṣāṃ te tathoktāḥ|
kīdṛśasya kāmasya| śāpāvasāne pratilabdhā
mūrtirbhūyaḥśarīraṃ yena tathāvidhasya|
evaṃ hyuktam---pariṇeṣyatipārvatīṃ yadetyādi| 
91||

tasyānumene bhagavānvimanyurvyāpāramātmanyapi sāyakānām|
kāle prayuktā khalu kālavidbhirvijñāpanā bhartṛṣu siddhimeti|| 92||

tato gīrvāṇābhyarthito devo vigatavirodhaḥ kāmasyātmadehe 'pi pṛṣatkānāṃ pātamanumene 'ṅgīcakāre|
yasmātkālavidbhiravasarakṛtā prabhuṣu vijñāpanā sidhyati|
kṛtavivāhatvādasāvavasaraḥ|| 92||

tataḥ paraṃ tatra girīndranātho yathāpradhānaṃ tridiveśvarāṇām|
cakāra ratnaiḥ pṛthagarhaṇāṃ sa menopanītāṃ vidhivatpraṇamya|| 93||

girīndranātho himālayastataḥ paraṃ śakrādīnāṃ devānāṃ yathāpradhānaṃ yo yaḥ pradhānamiti kṛtvā ratnai ratnabhūtairvastuviśeṣairmenayopanītāmarhaṇāṃ pūjāṃ pṛthakpṛthagvidadhe|
vidhivadvidhipūrvakaṃ praṇamya praṇāmāntaramityarthaḥ|
prasādayitveti yāvat|| 93||

atha vibudhagaṇāṃstānindumaulirvisṛjya
kṣitidharapatikanyāmādadhānaḥ kareṇa|
kanakakalaśarakṣābhaktiśobhāsanāthaṃ 
kṣitiviracitaśayyāṃ kautukāgāramāgāt|| 94||

tataḥ śaśiśekharastānnākisaṃghānnijasadma preṣya pāṇinā
nagendrasutāmavalambamānaḥ kautukāgāraṃ maṅgalavāsaveśmāgātprāviśat|
kīdṛśam|
kanakakalaśāḥ suvarṇaghaṭā rakṣā ratnauṣadhikṛtā bhaktayo vicchittayaḥ puṣpaśaṅkhacūrṇaviracanā ābhiryāḥ śobhā dīptayastābhiḥ sanāthaṃ yuktam|
tathā kṣitau bhūmau na tu paryaṅkādau viracitā śayyā yatra|
trirātraṃ saptarātraṃ vādhaḥśāyitvāt|| 94||

navapariṇayalajjābhūṣaṇāṃ tatra gaurīṃ 
vadanamapaharantīṃ tatkṛtotkṣepamīśaḥ|
api śayanasakhībhyo dattavācaṃ kathaṃcit
pramathamukhavikārairhāsayāmāsa gūḍham|| 95||

tatra vāsagṛhe tryakṣaḥ kāntāṃ pramathānāṃ pārṣadānāṃ mukhavikārairgūḍhaprakaṭamahāsayat|
yataḥ śayanaśāyinyo yāḥ sakhyastāsāṃ viśvastānāmapi
kathaṃciddattavācam| ataśca yadāsāvuktāpi lajjayā
giraṃ nāmiśrayattadā
vikṛtarūpāngaṇānsmitāvirbhāvārthaṃ vaktravikṛtīḥ kuruteti
codayitvā tābhirīśvarastāmajīhasadityarthaḥ|
kīdṛśīṃ tām| tena hareṇa kṛta utkṣepa unnamanaṃ yasya
tadvadanamapaharantīmanyataḥkurvatīm|
yato navo yaḥ pariṇayo vivāhastena yā lajjā vrīḍā saiva
bhūṣaṇaṃ yasyāḥ sā tām| atra mālinīvṛttaṃ ślokadvaye 'pi||
95||

ityānandadevātmajavallabhadevaviracitāyāṃ kumārasambhavaṭīkāyāṃ saptamaḥ sargaḥ||

aṣṭamaḥ sargaḥ|

pāṇipīḍanavidheranantaraṃ śailarājaduhiturharaṃ prati|
bhāvasādhvasaparigrahādabhūtkāmadohadasukhaṃ manoharam|| 1||

atha pārvatyāḥ śivaṃ prati karagrahaṇādanantaraṃ kāmadohadena manmathābhilāṣeṇa sukhasya joṣaṃ śarīrasyābhūt(?)| 
kutaḥ|
bhāvasādhvasayoḥ prītibhītyoḥ parigrahādāśrayaṇāt|
svābhāvikaṃ tatra copamānam| navoḍhatvātsādhvasam| 
sarge 'tra rathoddhatā vṛttam|| 1||

vyāhṛtā prativaco na saṃdadhe gantumaicchadavalambitāṃśukā|
sevate sma śayanaṃ parāṅmukhī sā tathāpi rataye pinākinaḥ|| 2||

ālāpamelanārthaṃ sā gaurī caivaṃvidhāpi vyāhṛtoktā
satī prativaco na saṃdadhe na dadhau| avalambitāṃśukā
dhṛtadugūlā gantumaicchadabhilalāṣa| śayanaṃ śayyāṃ ca
parāṅmukhyasaṃmukhī sevate sma siṣeve| tathāpyevamapi
kurvāṇā satī somā pinākinaḥ śivasya rataye 'bhūt|
etādṛśī hi ceṣṭā navavadhūnāṃ śayyānurāgahetuḥ|| 2||

kaitavena śayite kutūhalātpārvatī prati mukhaṃ nipātitam|
cakṣurunmiṣati sasmitaṃ priye vidyuteva vihataṃ nyamīlayat|| 3||

kaitavena vyājena śayite supte sā pārvatī kātyāyanī
kutūhalāddrakṣyāmyenamiti kautukānmukhaṃ prati
tadabhimukhaṃ pātitaṃ nikṣiptaṃ cakṣuḥ| sasmitaṃ hāsaṃ kṛtvā
vidyuteva taḍitā yathā vihataṃ nihatamapahataṃ nyanīlayatsthagitavatī| kadā|
priye sahāsamunmiṣati sati| visphāritanayane
jāgratītyarthaḥ|| 3||

nābhideśanihitaḥ sakampayā śaṅkarasya rurudhe tayā karaḥ|
tannitambamatha cābhavatsvayaṃ dūramucchvasitanīvibandhanam|| 4||

tayā gauryā śivasya karaḥ pāṇirnābhideśe nihito jaghanābhoganikṣipto rurudhe ruddhaḥ|
atha priyatamakarasparśāttannitambaṃ tatkaṭipradeśaḥ svayamātmanaiva
dūramatimātramucchvasitanīvibandhanaṃ śithilitajaghanavasanagranthyabhavadabhūt||
4||

evamāli nigṛhītasādhvasaṃ śaṃkaro rahasi sevyatāmiti|
sā sakhībhirupadiṣṭamākulā nāsmaratpramukhavartini priye|| 5||

he āli sakhi nigṛhītasādhvasaṃ bhayamapahāya rahasi śayane
priyastvayaivamāvarjayitavya iti| evamiti
yastābhirupadiṣṭo vidhiḥ sa boddhavyo 'pi tayā priyasannidhau
na smṛtaḥ|| 5||

apyavastuni kathāpravṛttaye praśnatatparamanaṅgaśāsanam|
vīkṣitena parigṛhya pārvatī mūrdhakampamayamuttaraṃ dadau|| 6||

pṛcchantaṃ priyaṃ pārvatī dṛḍṭyā gṛhītvā
śiraḥkampanenāsyottaraṃ dadau| na tu vacasā| śālīnatvāt|
apyavastunyanupayujyamāne 'pyarthe praśnalampaṭam|
kathāpravṛttaye praśne hyanayā saha me kathā pravartatāmiti|
sā tvabhinayena tamuttarayati sma|| 6||

śūlinaḥ karataladvayena sā saṃnirudhya nayane hṛtāṃśukā|
tasya paśyati lalāṭalocane moghayatnavidhurā rahasyabhūt|| 7||

rahasi hṛtāmbaratvāddharasya priyasya netrayugmaṃ pāṇidvayena
pidhāyāpi moghayatnavidhurā niṣphalodyamākulābhavat|
yatastasya tṛtīye 'kṣṇi paśyati sati| na hi tayā
tanniruddham|| 7||

cumbaneṣvadharapānavarjitaṃ sannahastamadayopagūhane|
kliṣṭamanmathamapi priyaṃ prabhordurlabhapratikṛtaṃ vadhūratam|| 8||

tasyeśvarasya vadhūrataṃ navoḍhānidhuvanaṃ kṛtamapratikṛtatvātkadarthitamanmathamapi priyaṃ na tvajñātam| lajjaikabhūṣaṇatvāt|
tadeva durlabhapratikṛtamāha---cumbaneṣvadharadānahīnaṃ nirdayāliṅgane sannahastamudāsīnakaram| priyakṛte hyadharapāne kaṇṭhāśleṣa āliṅgane ca pratyadharapānādikaṃ kāryaṃ taccāsau navoḍhātvānna cakāra||
8||

yanmukhagrahaṇamakṣatādharaṃ dattamavraṇapadaṃ nakhaṃ ca yat|
yadrataṃ ca sadayaṃ priyasya tatpārvatī viṣahate sma netarat|| 9||

kāntakṛtaṃ vaktrapānaṃ yadakhaṇḍitoṣṭhaṃ yacca kararuhadānamavraṇapadaṃ yaccānyanmuṣṭitāḍanādirahitaṃ sadayaṃ rataṃ tadgaurī sahate sma| 
itarattadviparītaṃ kharam|| 9||

rātrivṛttamanuyoktumudyataṃ sā vibhātasamaye sakhījanam|
nākarodapakutūhalaṃ hriyā śaṃsituṃ ca hṛdayena tatvare|| 10||

sā gaurī pratyūṣakāle niśāvyāpāraṃ pipṛcchiṣumālīnāṃ lokamapakutūhalaṃ niṣkautukaṃ na vyadhāt| 
atha ca cetasā tatkathayituṃ tatvare tvarāṃ cakre|
vaktumiyeṣetyarthaḥ| evaṃvidho hyeṣa navoḍhāsvabhāvaḥ||
10|| 

darpaṇe ca paribhogadarśinī pṛṣṭhataḥ praṇayino niṣeduṣaḥ|
vīkṣya bimbamanubimbamātmanaḥ kāni kāni na cakāra lajjayā|| 11||

sā devī makure 'dharakhaṇḍanādikaṃ priyopabhogaṃ draṣṭuṃ pravṛttā satī pṛṣṭhataḥ paścādbhāge guptaṃ niṣaṇṇasya kāntasya punarātmabimbaṃ nikaṭe darpaṇasaṃkrāntamālokya kāni kāni varṇayitumaśakyāni vastūni hriyā na vyadhāt|
bimbasya samīpamanubimbam|
caḥ pūrvāpekṣayā samuccaye| evamanyatra|| 11||

nīlakaṇṭhaparibhuktayauvanāṃ tāṃ vilokya jananī samāśvasat|
bhartṛvallabhatayā hi mānasīṃ māturasyati śucaṃ vadhūjanaḥ|| 12||

tato menā sutāṃ haropabhuktatāruṇyāmālokya samāśvasatpipriye|
yasmātsuvāsinyo mātṝṇāṃ priyatamahṛdayaṃgamatayā duḥkhamapaharanti|
samāśvasadityaṭ|| 

vāsarāṇi katicitkathaṃcana sthāṇunā padamakāryata priyā|
jñātamanmatharasā śanaiḥ śanaiḥ sā mumoca ratiduḥkhaśīlatām|| 13||

sthāṇunā bhavena katipayāni divasāni gaurī kathaṃcitkleśena padamakāryata sthitimagrāhyata|
visrambhaṃ kāritā|
anantaramanubhūtamanmatharasatvātkrameṇa sā ratau surate duḥkhaśīlatāṃ kaṣṭasvabhāvamatyākṣīt|
kāmasukhānubhāvātsuratamanvabhūdityarthaḥ|
padamiti padasthairye|
akāryateti ṇyantātkarmaṇi|| 13||
duḥkhaśīlatātyāgamāha---

sasvaje priyamuronipīḍitaṃ prārthitaṃ mukhamanena nāharat|
mekhalāpraṇayalolatāṃ gataṃ hastamasya śithilaṃ rurodha ca|| 14||

priyaṃ tamevoronipīḍitaṃ yathā tathā kṛtvā gāḍhamāślikṣat|
tena ca cumbanāya vaktraṃ gṛhīte nāharannānyataścakāra|
mekhalāpraṇaye raśanāprārthane jaghanāmbaraharaṇe caṭulagatiṃ priyapāṇimavāṣṭabhnāt|
pūrvaṃ tu viparītameva| tadā tvevaṃvidhamabhūt|| 14||

hāvasūcitamadṛṣṭavipriyaṃ cāṭumatkṣaṇaviyogakātaram|
kaiścideva divasaistayoḥ sadā prema rūḍhamitaretarāśrayam|| 15||

tataḥ katipatairevāhobhistayordampatayorevaṃvidhaṃ prema rūḍhamaticaṇḍaprītirutpannā|
kīdṛśam| 
hṛdayābhiprāyasūcakaśceṣṭāviśeṣo hāvaḥ|| 15||

taṃ yathātmasadṛśaṃ varaṃ vadhūranvarajyata varastathaiva tām|
sāgarādanapagā hi jāhvanī so 'pi tanmukharasaikanirvṛtiḥ|| 16||

taṃ varaṃ patimātmānurūpaṃ yathā yena prakāreṇānvarajyata tathaiva so 'pi tāṃ jāyāmiti samānurāgakathanam|
etadeva dṛṣṭāntena draḍhayati|
sāgarādanapagā hi jāhvanīti|
samudravarjaṃ gaṅgā na praviśati|
so 'pyabdhistasyā jāhnavyā mukharasena vaktrodakenaikā nirvṛtirullāso yasya sa tathoktaḥ|
na hi gaṅgāto 'nyayā saritāsau pūrayituṃ śaktiḥ|
raktayośca dampatyoranyonyasukhadānaṃ nirvṛtiḥ|
anyatra vānapagatatvamucitam|
anvarajyateti kartari|| 16||

śiṣyatāṃ nidhuvanopadeśinaḥ śaṃkarasya rahasi prapannayā|
śikṣitaṃ yuvatinaipuṇaṃ tayā yattadeva gurudakṣiṇīkṛtam|| 17||

nidhuvanopadeśinaḥ suratavyāpāropadeṣṭurharasya śiṣyatāṃ prāptayā yadyuvatinaipuṇaṃ śikṣitaṃ strīkauśalamabhyastaṃ tadeva gurudakṣiṇīkṛtaṃ harāya pratīpaṃ dattam|
sarvasyaiva tasyaiva prayogāt|
antevāsinā gurave dakṣiṇā deyā|| 

daṣṭamuktamadharoṣṭhamambikā vedanāvidhutahastapallavā|
śītalena niravāpayatkṣaṇaṃ maulicandraśakalena śūlinaḥ|| 18||

priyeṇa pūrvaṃ daṣṭaṃ khaṇḍitamanantaraṃ muktamadhodharaṃ gaurī śītalena śaṃkaraśiraḥśaśiśakalena niravāpayatsamāśvasaditi prauḍhāvyāpārakathanam|
adharadaṃśena yā vyathā tayā vidhūtahastapallavā kampitakarakisalayetyambikāviśeṣaṇam||

cumbanādalakacūrṇadūṣitaṃ śaṃkaro 'pi nayanaṃ lalāṭajam|
ucchvasatkamalagandhaye dadau pārvatīvadanagandhavāhine|| 19

na kevalaṃ gauryoṣṭhaṃ śivaḥ śaśinā niravāpayadyāvatso 'pi cumbanavaśādalakacūrṇena candanādikṣodena pīḍitaṃ tṛtīyamakṣi pārvatyā vadanagandhavāhine mukhamārutāya dadāvarpayat|
mukhaphūtkāreṇākṣṇornīrajaskatvāpatteḥ|
ucchvasato vikasataḥ kamalasyeva gandhaḥ saurabhaṃ yasya tasmai|
upamānācca
itīttvam||

evamindriyasukhasya vartmanaḥ sevanādanugṛhītamanmathaḥ|
śailarājabhavane sahomayā māsamātramavasadvṛṣadhvajaḥ|| 20

evaṃ priyayā saha kāmamīśvaraḥ śvaśuragṛhe māsamātramanvatiṣṭhat|
kīdṛśaḥ|
hṛṣīkāṇāṃ sukhakāri yadvartma mārgo yuvatyādikastatsevanādanugṛhīto manmatho yena||

so 'numānya himavantamātmabhūrātmajāvirahaduḥkhapīḍitam|
tatra tatra vijahāra sampatannaprameyagatinā kakudmatā|| 21

tato bhavo duhitṛviyogaduḥkhitaṃ śvaśuramanumānyānujñāpya samāśvāsya vegavāhinā vṛṣabheṇa vrajaṃsteṣu vakṣyamāṇeṣu divodyāneṣu vijahāra cikrīḍa|
anumānyānujñāṃ dāpayitvetyarthaḥ||

tānyeva vihārasthānānyāha---

merumetya marudāśavāhanaḥ pārvatīstanapuraskṛtaḥ kṛtī|
hemapallavavibhaṅgasaṃstarāmanvabhūtsuratatatparaḥ kṣapām|| 22

tato devo meruparvatametya nidhuvanaikasaktaḥ sanhemapallavavibhaṅgasaṃstarāṃ sauvarṇakisalayaśayanīyāṃ niśāmanvabhūdbubhuje|
marudvadāśuḥ sīghro vāhano vṛṣabho yasya|
pārvatīstanābhyāṃ puraskṛto 'grataḥ kṛtaḥ|
paścāttasyā avasthānāditi yānāvasthitiḥ|
ataśca kṛtī puṇyabhākpriyāpayodharasaṃsparśāt|
saṃstīryata iti saṃstarastalpam||

padmanābhacaraṇāṅkitāśmasu prāptavatsvamṛtavipruṣo navāḥ|
mandarasya kaṭakeṣu cāvasatpārvatīvadanapadmaṣaṭpadaḥ|| 23

kadācidasau priyāmukhasarojacañcarīko mandaragirinitambeṣu tasthau|
kīdṛśeṣu|
pratyagrānpīyūṣabindūnāsāditavatsu|
manthagiritvāt|
ata eva viṣṇucaraṇābhyāmaṅkitāśmasu cihnitopaleṣu|
mañjarīkṛtyaitadbāhuyugmasyopari... tvāt(?)kaṭakāṅkitatvam|| 

rāvaṇadhvanivibhītayā taya akaṇṭhasaktadṛḍhabāhubandhanaḥ|
ekapiṅgalagirau jagadgururnirviveśa viśadāḥ śaśiprabhāḥ|| 24

kadācidasāvekapiṅgalagirau jagadgururnirviveśa bubhuje|
kīdṛśaḥ|
daśamukhagirā vitrastayā gauryā kaṇṭhe saktaṃ ghanaṃ bāhubandhanaṃ bhujapāśo yasya|
rāvaṇena hi pūrvamunmūlanecchayā kailāsaḥ kampito 'bhavat|
tatkāle 'pi ... sambhavaḥ||

tasya jātamalayasthalīraterdhūtacandanalataḥ priyāklamam|
ācacāma salavaṅgakesaraścāṭukāra iva dakṣiṇānilaḥ|| 25

tasyotpannamalayādritaṭīraterdarduraśailamārutaḥ priyākhedaṃ sevaka iva papau|
malayadardurau hyanyonyasambaddhau|
kīdṛgvātaḥ|
dhūtāḥ kampitāścandanalatā yena|
tathā saha lavaṅgakesarairvartate salavaṅgakesara iti saugandhyoktiḥ|
klamo 'tra devyā devasya veti cintyam|| 25

hematāmarasatāḍitapriyā tatkarāmbuvinimīlitekṣaṇā|
khe vyagāhata taraṅgiṇīmumā mīnapaṅktipunaruktamekhalā|| 26

gaurī jalakrīḍārthaṃ khe taraṅgiṇīṃ nabhonadīṃ vyagāhata vyaloḍayat|
kīdṛśī|
hematāmaraiḥ kanakamalaistāḍitaḥ kheditaḥ priyo yayā|
tasya kāntasya karāmbubhiḥ pāṇikṣiptapānīyairmīlitekṣaṇā sthagitākṣī|
mīnapaṅktirmatsyāvalireva punaruktā dvitīyā raśanā yasyāḥ|
śroṇīdeśe parivṛtya sthitatvāt|| 26

tāṃ pulomatanayālakocitaiḥ pārijātakusumaiḥ prasādhayan|
nandane ciramayugmalocanaḥ saspṛhaṃ suravadhūbhirīkṣitaḥ|| 27

tāṃ kāntāṃ śacīkeśapāśayogyaiḥ pārijātapuṣpairalaṃkurvāṇastrinetraḥ sābhilāṣaṃ nākanārībhirindrāṇyādibhiravalokyate sma|
puṇyavatyeṣā yasyāḥ sarveśvaro 'pi cāṭukṛditi|| 27

idānīṃ sūryāstamayādivarṇanaṃ cikīrṣurāha---

ityabhaumamanubhūya śaṃkaraḥ pārthivaṃ ca dayitāsakhaḥ sukham|
lohitāyati kadācidātape gandhamādanagiriṃ nyavartata|| 28

abhaumaṃ divyaṃ pārthivaṃ ca manuṣyalokajaṃ sukhamitthamīśvaro devyā saha saṃsevya kadācidastamayavaśādaruṇāyamāne sūryātape svavasatiṃ gandhamādanagiriṃ nyavartata pratyāyayau|
alohito lohito bhavati lohitāyati pratyāgamanamapi nivṛttiḥ|
yathā 

proṣitāyāṃ vrajatyannaṃ prajā dharmo yaśaḥ sukham|
nivartate nivṛttāyāmaho bandhuḥ kulāṅganā||

tatra kāñcanaśilātalāśrayo netragamyamavalokya bhāskaram|
dakṣiṇetarabhujavyapāśrayāṃ vyājahāra sahadharmacāriṇīm|| 29

tatra kailāsopavane kanakaśailaśilāpṛṣṭhamadhyāsya netragamyaṃ sudarśanamarkamālokya vāmapārśvasthāṃ bhāryāṃ haro vyājahāra jagāda|| 29

kimityāha---

padmakāntimaruṇatribhāgayoḥ saṃkramayya tava netrayoriva|
saṃkṣaye jagadiva prajeśvaraḥ saṃharatyaharasāvaharpatiḥ|| 30

asāvaharpatirdinanātho 'haḥ saṃharati dinaṃ kṣapayati|
kalpānte rudrastribhuvanamiva|
lohitāpāṅgayostavākṣṇoḥ kamalakāntiṃ saṃcāryeva|
padmānāṃ vicchāyatvāttannetrayośca sānurāgatvāditthamūhaḥ|
ahnaḥ patiraharpatiḥ|
ahanśabdasya 
ro 'supi
iti rephaḥ||

śīkaravyatikaraṃ marīcibhirdūrayatyavanate vivasvati|
indracāpapariveśaśūnyatāṃ nirjharāstava puturvrajantyamī|| 31

tava piturhimavato 'mī nirjharāḥ prapātatoyānīndradhanuṣo yaḥ pariveśo 'bhivyāptistena śūnyatāṃ virahaṃ yānti|
kutaḥ|
sūrye 'vanate lambamāne vivasvati mayūkhaiḥ śīkaravyatikaraṃ jalakaṇasaṃparkaṃ dūrayati|
prātipadikāddhātvarthe
iti ṇic||

daṣṭatāmarasakesaratyajoḥ krandatorviparivṛttakaṇṭhayoḥ|
nighnayoḥ sarasi cakravākayoralpamantaramalpatāṃ gatam|| 32

dampatyoścakravākayoḥ sarasyalpamapyantaraṃ vyavadhānamanalpatāṃ gataṃ dūraṃ sampannam|
saṃśleṣasya kartumaśakyatvāt|
yato nighnayorasvavaśayoḥ|
daivavaśāttayorniśi viyogaḥ|
ataśca duḥkhavaśāddaṣṭasya khaṇḍitasya tāmarasasyābjasya kesaraṃ tyaktavayoḥ|
krantadoḥ kūjatoḥ|
tathā parivṛtto visvarīkṛtaḥ kaṇṭho yayoḥ|
viyoge hi tau visvarakaṇṭhau|
virahadīnakaṇṭhayoriti pāṭhāntaram|
śatrughnādivannighnaśabdaḥ|
cakravākayoriti pumānstriyā||

sthānamāhnikamapāsya dantinaḥ sallakīviṭapabhaṅgavāsitam|
āvibhātacaraṇāya gṛhṇate vāri vāriruhabaddhaṣaṭpadam|| 33

ete kariṇa āhnikaṃ divātanaṃ sthānaṃ hitvā vāri gṛhṇate tanmadhyaṃ śrayanti|
āvibhātaṃ rātriparyantaṃ yaccaraṇaṃ bhojanaṃ tadarthaṃ niśi te jalānto vicaranti|
kīdṛśaṃ sthānam|
sallakīnāṃ latāviśeṣāṇāṃ jalajātānāṃ viṭapabhaṅgena pallavakhaṇḍena vāsitaṃ surabhitam|
vāri kīdṛśam|
vāriruheṣvabjeṣu saṃkocavaśādbaddhāḥ ṣaṭpadā bhramarā yatra||

paśya paścimadigantalambinā nirmitaṃ mitakathe vivasvatā|
dīrghayā pratimayā sarombhasāṃ tāpanīyamiva setubandhanam|| 34

he mitakathe svalpabhāṣiṇi vilokaya vāruṇīsthānārkeṇa dīrghayā pratimayāyatena pratibimbena sarasastāpanīyamiva setubandhanaṃ nirmitaṃ sauvarṇasaṃkrama iva racitaḥ|
pratimayā pārāvāravyāpteḥ||

uttaranti vinikīrya palvalaṃ gāḍhapaṅkamativāhitātapāḥ|
daṃṣṭriṇo vanavarāhayūthapā daṣṭabhaṅgurabisāṅkurā iva|| 35

kānanasūkarasaṃghapatayo ghanakardamaṃ veśantaṃ vinikīryāpahāya tāpābhāvāduttaranti sthalamudyanti|
yato 'tivāhitātapāḥ|
ūṣmabhayāddhi varāhamahiṣādayo dinaṃ paṅkamadhye kṣapayanti|
daṃṣṭrā vidyante yeṣāṃ te daṃṣṭriṇaḥ|
ataścotprekṣyate---daṣṭalagnā bhaṅgurā bisāṅkurā yeṣāṃ te tathāvidhā iva|
daṃṣṭrāṇāṃ mṛṇālāṅkuravatsitakuṭilatvam|
avyabhicāre 'pyutprekṣārthaṃ daṃṣṭriṇa iti viśeṣaṇam||

eṣa vṛkṣaśikhare kṛtāspado jātarūparasagauramaṇḍalam|
hīyamānamaharatyayātapaṃ pīvaroru pibatīva barhiṇaḥ|| 36

he mahoru eṣa mayūrastaruprāntāsīno hīyamānaṃ kṣīyamāṇaṃ dināntātapaṃ pibatīva grasatīva|
kīdṛśam|
jātarūparasavatkanakadravavadgauramaṇḍalaṃ tāmracakravālam|
kecittu barhiviśeṣaṇametadāhuḥ|
etaccāsambaddhaṃ tasya gauratvābhāvāt|| 36

pūrvabhāgatimirapravṛttibhirvyaktapaṅkamiva jātamekataḥ|
khaṃ hṛtātapajalaṃ vivasvatābhāti kiṃcidiva śeṣavatsaraḥ|| 37

khaṃ vyoma kiṃcidavaśeṣavatkiṃcicchiṣṭasara ivābhāti pratibhāsate|
yataḥ pūrvbhāge .aindryāmandhakārāvirbhāvairekato vyaktapaṅkamiva jātamityutprekṣā|
sa eṣa vivasvatā hṛtamātapa eva jalaṃ yasya|
ravipītātapasya hi kiṃcicchiṣṭakardamāvirbhāvo bhavati|
śeṣaṃ vidyate tasya taccheṣavat|
ivaśabdo bhinnakramaḥ||

āvasadbhiruṭajāṅgaṇaṃ mṛgairmūlasekasarasaiśca vṛkṣakaiḥ|
āśramāḥ praviśadagnidhenavo bibhrati śriyamudīritāgnayaḥ|| 8.37

eta āśramāḥ śobhāṃ vahanti|
kena|
uṭajāṅgaṇaṃ parṇamaṭhikājiramadhitiṣṭhadbhirmṛgairhariṇaiḥ|
ālavālasekahṛṣitaiḥ saṃdhukṣitaiśca vṛkṣakairbālavṛkṣaiḥ|
agnidhenuśabdaścaturthyathapratipādyāśvaghāsavatṣaṣṭhīsamāsaḥ||

baddhakośamapi tiṣṭhati kṣaṇaṃ sāvaśeṣavivaraṃ kuśeśayam| 8.39ab
ṣaṭpadāya vasatiṃ grahīṣyate prītipūrvamiva dātumantaram|| 8.39cd

etatkuśeśayaṃ rājīvaṃ baddhakośamapi sāvaśeṣavivaraṃ baddhamityarthaḥ| 
...

dūramagnaparimeyaraśminā vāruṇī digaruṇena bhāsvatā| 8.40ab
bhāti kesaravateva maṇḍitā bandhujīvatilakena kanyakā|| 8.40cd

vāruṇī dikpratīcī lohiteva raviṇā rājate bandhujīvakusumacitrakena kumārīva|
dūramatyarthaṃ vruḍitā ata eva parimeyā alpā raśmayo yasyeti bhānuviśeṣaṇam|
tilakenāpi kesaravatā sakiñjalkena|| 40

sāmabhiḥ sahacarāḥ sahasraśaḥ syandanāśvahṛdayaṃgamasvanaiḥ| 8.41ab
bhānumagniparikīrṇatejasaṃ saṃstuvanti kiraṇoṣmapāyinaḥ|| 8.41cd

ete sahacarā vālakhilyāḥ sahasraśo raviṃ sāmabhirnuvanti|
ravirathena saha gamanātteṣāṃ sahacaratvam|
atibahutvātsahasrasaṃkhyātvam|
kīdṛśaiḥ sāmabhiḥ|
syandanāśvānāṃ rathaturagāṇāṃ hṛdayaṃgamo manoharaḥ svanaḥ śabdo yeṣāṃ taiḥ|
bhānuṃ kīdṛśam|
agniparikīrṇatejasamagnau parikīrṇaṃ nikṣiptaṃ tejo yena|
rātrau hyagnau tejo nikṣipya bhānurastaṃ yātīti prasiddhiḥ|
kīdṛśā vālakhilyāḥ|
kiraṇānāmūṣmāṇamauṣṇyaṃ pivantīti te tathoktāḥ||

so 'yamānataśirodharairhayaiḥ karṇacāmaravighaṭṭitekṣaṇaiḥ| 8.42ab
astameti yugabhinnakesaraiḥ saṃnidhāya divasaṃ mahodadhau|| 8.42cd

khaṃ prasuptamiva prasthite ravau tejaso mahata īdṛśī gatiḥ| 8.43ab
tatprakāśayati yāvadudgataṃ mīlanena khalu tāvataścyutam|| 8.43cd

saṃdhyayāpyanugataṃ raveḥ padaṃ vandyamastaśikhare samarpitam| 8.44ab
yena pūrvamudaye puraskṛtā nānuyāsyati kathaṃ tamāpadi|| 8.44cd

raktapītakapiśāḥ payomucāṃ koṭayaḥ kuṭilakeśi bhāntyamūḥ| 8.45ab
drakṣyasi tvamiti sāṃdhyavelayā vartikābhiriva sādhu maṇḍitāḥ|| | 8.45cd

siṃhakesarasaṭāsu bhūbhṛtāṃ pallavaprasaviṣu drumeṣu ca| 8.46ab
paśya dhātuśikhareṣu cātmanā saṃvibhaktamiva sāṃdhyamātapam|| 8.46cd

pārṣṇimuktavasudhāstapasvinaḥ pāvanāmbusarasāñjalikriyāḥ| 8.47ab
brahma gūḍhamabhisaṃdhyamādṛtāḥ śuddhaye vidhivido gṛṇantyamī|| 8.47cd

tanmuhūrtamanumantumarhasi prastutāya niyamāya māmapi| 8.48ab
tvāṃ vinodanipuṇaḥ sakhījano valguvādini vinodayiṣyati|| 8.48cd

nirvibhujya daśanacchadaṃ tato vāci bharturavadhīraṇāparā| 8.49ab
śailarājatanayā samīpagāmalalāpa vijayāmahetukam|| 8.49cd

īśvaro 'pi divasātyayocitaṃ mantrapūrvamanutasthivānvidhim| 8.50ab
pārvatīmavacanāmasūyayā pratyupetya punarāha sasmitam|| 8.50cd

muñca kopamanimittakopane saṃdhyayā praṇamito 'hamanyathā| 8.51ab
kiṃ na vedmi sahadharmacāriṇīṃ cakravākasamavṛttirātmanaḥ|| 8.51cd

nirmiteṣu pitṛṣu svayaṃbhuvā yā tanuḥ sutanu pūrvamujjhitā| 8.52ab
seyamastamudayaṃ ca gāhate tena mānini mamātra gauravam|| 8.52cd

tāmimāṃ timiravṛddhipīḍitāṃ bhūmilagnatamasaṃ vyavasthitām| 8.53ab
ekataṣtaṭatamālamālinīm paśya dhāturasanimnagāmiva|| 8.53cd

sāṃdhyamastamitaśeṣamātapaṃ raktalekhamaparā bibharti dik| 8.54ab
saṃparāyavasudhā saśoṇitaṃ maṇḍalāgramiva tiryagujjhitam|| 8.54cd

yāminīdiasasaṃdhisambhave tejasi vyavahite sumeruṇā| 8.55ab
etadandhatamasaṃ niraṅkuśaṃ dikṣu dhīranayane vijṛmbhate|| 8.55cd

nordhvamīkṣaṇagatirna cāpyadho nābhito na purato na pṛṣṭhataḥ| 8.56ab
loka eṣa timirolbaveṣṭito garbhavāsa iva tiṣṭhate niśi|| 8.56cd

śuddhamābilamavasthitaṃ calaṃ vakramārjavaguṇānvitaṃ ca yat| 8.57ab
sarvameva tamasā samīkṛtaṃ dhiṅmahattvamasatāṃ hatāntaram|| 8.57cd

nūnamunnamati yajvanāṃ patiḥ śārvarasya tamaso nivṛttaye| 8.58ab
puṇḍarīkamukhi diṅmukhaṃ yathā kaitakairiva rajobhirāhatam|| 8.58cd

mandarāntaritamūrtinā niśā lakṣyate śaśabhṛtā satārakā| 8.59ab
tvaṃ mayā priyasakhīsamāgatā śroṣyateva vacanāni pṛṣṭhataḥ|| 8.59cd

ruddhanirgamanamā dinakṣayātpūrvadṛṣṭatanucandrikāsmitam| 8.60ab
etadudgirati rātricoditā digrahasyamiva candramaṇḍalam|| 8.60cd

paśya pkavaphalinīphalatviṣā bimbalāñchitaviyatsarombhasā| 8.61ab
viprakṛṣṭaviṣayaṃ himāṃśunā cakravākamithunaṃ viḍambyate|| 8.61cd

śakyamoṣadhipaternavodayāḥ karṇapūraracanākṛte tava| 8.62ab
apragalbhayavasūcikomalāśchettumagranakhasampuṭaiḥ karāḥ|| 8.62cd

aṅgulībhiriva keśasaṃcayaṃ saṃniyamya timiraṃ marīcibhiḥ| 8.63ab
kuḍmalīkṛtasarojalocanaṃ cumbatīva rajanīmukhaṃ śaśī|| 8.63cd

paśya pārvati navenduraśmibhirbhinnasāndratimiraṃ nabhastalam| 8.64ab
lakṣyate dviradabhogadūṣitaṃ samprasīdadiva mānasaṃ saraḥ|| 8.64cd

raktabhāvamapahāya candramā jāta eṣa pariśuddhamaṇḍalaḥ| 8.65ab
vikriyā na khalu kāladoṣajā nirmalaprakṛtiṣu sthirodayā|| 8.65cd

unnateṣu śaśinaḥ prabhā sthitā nimnasaṃśrayaparaṃ niśātamaḥ| 8.66ab
nūnamātmasadṛśī prakalpitā vedhaseha guṇadoṣayorgatiḥ|| 8.66cd

candrapādajanitapravṛttayaścandrakāntajalabindavo girau| 8.67ab
mekhalātaruṣu nidritānamūnbodhayantyasamaye śikhaṇḍitaḥ| 8.67cd

kalpavṛkṣaśikhareṣu samprati prasphuradbhiravikalpasundari| 8.68ab
hārayaṣṭigaṇanāmivāṃśubhiḥ kartumeti sakutūhalaḥ śaśī|| 8.68cd

unnatāvanatabhāgavattayā candrikā satimirā gireriyam| 8.69ab
bhaktibhirbahuvidhābhirarpitā bhāti bhūtiriva mattadantinaḥ|| 8.69cd

etaducchvasitapītamaindavaṃ soḍhumakṣamamiva prabhārasam| 8.70ab
muktaṣaṭpadavirāvamañasā bhidyate kumudamā nibandhanāt|| 8.70cd

paśya kalpatarulambi śuddhayā jyotsnayā janitarūpasaṃśayam| 8.71ab
mārute calati caṇḍi kevalaṃ vyajyate viparivṛttamaṃśukam|| 8.71cd

śakyamaṅgulibhiruddhatairadhaḥ śākhināṃ patitapuṣpapeśalaiḥ| 8.72ab
patrajarjaraśaśiprabhācayairebhirutkacayituṃ tavālakāḥ|| 8.72cd

eṣa cārumukhi yogatārayā yujyate taralabimbayā śaśī| 8.73ab
sādhvasādupagataprakampayā kanyayeva navadīkṣayā varaḥ|| 8.73cd

pākabhinnaśarakāṇḍagaurayorullasatpratikṛtiprasannayoḥ| 8.74ab
rohatīva tava gaṇḍalekhayoścandrabimbanimitākṣi candrikā| 8.74cd

lohitārkamaṇibhājanārpitaṃ kalpavṛkṣamadhu bibhratī svayam| 8.75ab
tvāmiyaṃ sthitimatī samāgatā gandhamādanavanādhidevatā|| 8.75cd

ārdrakesarasugandhi te mukhaṃ mattamattanayanaṃ svabhāvataḥ| 8.76ab
atra labdhavasatirguṇāntaraṃ kiṃ vilāsini madaḥ kariṣyati|| 8.76cd

mānyabhaktirathavā sakhījanaḥ sevyatāmidamanaṅgadīpanam| 8.77ab
ityudāramabhidhāya śaṅkarastāmapāyayata pānamambikām|| 8.77cd

pārvatī tadupabhogasambhavāṃ vikriyāmapi sakhīṃ manoharām| 8.78ab
apratarkyavidhiyoganirmitāmāmrateva sahakāratāṃ yayau|| 8.78cd

tatkṣaṇaṃ viparivartitahriyorneṣyatoḥ śayanamiddharāgayoḥ| 8.79ab
sā babhūva vaśavartinī dvayoḥ preyasaḥ suvadanā madasya ca|| 8.79cd

ghūrṇamānanayanaṃ skhalatkathaṃ svedabindu madakāraṇasmitam| 8.80ab
ānanena na tu tāvadīśvaraścakṣuṣā ciramumāmukhaṃ papau|| 8.80cd

tāṃ vilambitapanīyamekhalāmudvahajjaghanabhāradurvahām| 8.81ab
dhyānasambhṛtavibhūtigocaraṃ prāviśanmaṇiśilāgṛhaṃ haraḥ|| 8.81cd

tatra haṃsadhavalottacchadaṃ jāhnavīpulinacārudarśanam| 8.82ab
adhyaśeta śayanaṃ priyāsakhaḥ śāradābhramiva rohiṇīpatiḥ|| 8.82cd

kliṣṭakeśamatiluptacandanahṛtpathārpitanakhaṃ samatsaram| 8.83ab
tasya tacchiduramekhalāguṇaṃ pārvatīratamabhūnna tṛptaye|| 8.83cd

kevalaṃ priyatamādayālunā jyotiṣāmavanatāsu paṅktiṣu| 8.84ab
tena tatparigṛhītavakṣasā netramīlanakutūhalaṃ kṛtam|| 8.84cd

sa vyabudhyata budhastavocitaḥ śātakaumbhakamalākaraiḥ saha| 8.85ab
mūrchanāparigṛhītakaiśikaiḥ kiṃnarairuṣasi gītamaṅgalaḥ|| 8.85cd

tau kṣaṇaṃ viśithilopagūhanau dampatī calitamānasormayaḥ| 8.86ab
padmabhedapiśunāḥ siṣevire gandhamādanavanāntamārutāḥ|| 8.86cd

ūrumūlanakhamārgarājibhistatkṣaṇaṃ hṛtavilocano haraḥ| 8.87ab
vāsasaḥ praśithilasya saṃyamaṃ kurvatīṃ priyatamāmavārayat|| 8.87cd

sa prajāgarakaṣāyalocanaṃ gāḍhadantapadatāḍitādharam| 8.88ab
ākulālakamapāstacitrakaṃ vīkṣya tṛptimagamanna tanmukham|| 8.88cd

tena bhinnaviṣamottaracchadaṃ madhyapiṇḍitavisūtramekhalam| 8.89ab
nirmale 'pi śayanaṃ niśātyaye nojjhitaṃ caraṇarāgarañjitam|| 8.89cd

sa priyāmukharasaṃ divāniśaṃ tarṣavṛddhijananaṃ siṣeviṣuḥ| 8.90ab
darśanapraṇayināmadṛśyatāmājagāma vijayānivedanāt|| 8.90cd

samadivasaniśīthaṃ saṅginastatra śambhoḥ 
śatamagamadṛtūnāṃ sāramekā niśeva| 8.91ab
na ca suratasukhebhyaśchinnatṛṣṇo babhūva
jvalana iva samudrāntargatastajjaleṣu|| 8.91cd

iti kumārasambhave 'ṣṭamaḥ sargaḥ| kṛtiḥ śrīmatkālidāsayeti śubham||

